(124, 124, 3, 3, 3, 3, 2, 3, 3, 2, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 'Needs more touches on the ball.', 'Have to be ready before receiving the ball.', 'After receiving ball should be under control.', 'Needs to use outfoot while turning.', 'Better weight on the pass ', 'Needs power an accuracy.', 'Body control with the ball.', 'Should perform skills ', 'Good contact on the ball ', 'Better awareness of the Ball.', 'Have to be brave while tackling.', 'Needs to improve on Agility an coordination.', 'Needs to improve .', 'Needs more training session.'),
