(128, 128, 2, 3, 2, 3, 2, 3, 2, 3, 2, 3, 2, 2, 2, 'Keep the ball close to the feet.', 'Have to work on both ground an Air balls.', 'But after first touch ur dession making.', 'Quick turns.', 'Can do better accuracy.', 'Accuracy an power.', 'Should also scan.', 'Should apply skills.', 'Should work on long range.', 'Should be brave enough.', 'Need to know when to approach.', 'Good energy.', 'Can meet the coaches expections.', 'Can see the development keep up the same to get better.'),
(129, 129, 3, 2, 3, 3, 2, 3, 3, 4, 2, 4, 3, 4, 4, 'He retains the ball well using his strengths ', 'He has improved his aerial ball control ', 'His touch is decent however he can improve with the direction of his touch ', 'He protects the ball well while he turns but he moves slowly ', 'He has good short range passing ', 'He has the power for long passes, his accuracy needs improvement ', 'He is not the quickest but he is learning how to use his body to shield the ball while running ', 'He relies on his size over footwork ', 'He shoots well with good power and decent accuracy ', 'He doesn\'t jump', 'He uses his size & strength well to recover the ball', 'Working on his fitness is recommended to Improve agility, balance, & coordination ', 'He needs to work on his fitness which would translate to improved speed ', 'He has good technical skills however he needs to work on his fitness '),
(130, 130, 3, 2, 3, 3, 2, 3, 3, 4, 2, 4, 3, 4, 4, 'He retains the ball well using his strengths ', 'He has improved his aerial ball control ', 'His touch is decent however he can improve with the direction of his touch ', 'He protects the ball well while he turns but he moves slowly ', 'He has good short range passing ', 'He has the power for long passes, his accuracy needs improvement ', 'He is not the quickest but he is learning how to use his body to shield the ball while running ', 'He relies on his size over footwork ', 'He shoots well with good power and decent accuracy ', 'He doesn\'t jump', 'He uses his size & strength well to recover the ball', 'Working on his fitness is recommended to Improve agility, balance, & coordination ', 'He needs to work on his fitness which would translate to improved speed ', 'He has good technical skills however he needs to work on his fitness '),
