(708, 708, 3, 3, 3, 4, 2, 4, 4, 3, 4, 3, 3, 3, 4, 'He manipulates the ball well however he does it slowly.  He needs to improve on his his speed and quickness with the ball ', 'He receives and controls the ball well with his in foot. He needs to improve improve on judging the flight of the ball to control aerial balls', 'Most of the time he receives the ball with his in foot and his first touch is into space. He has to do it consistently ', 'He turns with the ball slowly giving defenders the time to recover and retrieve the ball ', 'He has good short passing accuracy and power. Passing is one of the strengths of his game ', 'He hasn\'t had much long range passing drills and experience at his age ', 'He keeps the ball close to him while running, however he needs to run with the ball quicker than he does at the moment ', 'He implements skills while dribbling in 1v1 situations. \r\nHe needs to improve his speed while executing his skills. ', 'He shots have good accuracy but he needs to improve on the power of his shots to get the right balance between power and accuracy ', 'He shows bravery by keeping his eyes open while heading the ball despite his limited experience ', 'He recovers the ball well from the opponents while on his feet. The next step is to include sliding tackles into his game ', 'He has good balance and coordination which shows In how he performs Speed, Agility, and Quickness drills. His agility needs improvement. ', 'His speed needs improvement. He performs most tasks well but he does them slowly. An improvement in his speed will take him to the next level ', 'Kaustabh is a delight to coach. He listens to and follows instructions. He just needs to improve on his speed and aggression to become the best player he can be '),
