(710, 710, 3, 3, 4, 4, 3, 3, 4, 3, 3, 3, 3, 4, 4, 'He manipulates the ball well during ball mastery drills. He needs to improve his speed while manipulating the ball ', 'He receives and controls the ball well during drills. He needs to improve on controlling the ball while under pressure from an opponent ', 'He tends to stop the ball in situations he should take his first touch into space ', 'His change of direction with the ball is slow and needs improvement ', 'He has decent passing accuracy over a short range ', 'He has a good passing range and accuracy ', 'He doesn\'t run with the ball into space as fast as he can. He needs to utilize his size and strength taking long strides like he does when dribbling and protecting the ball', 'He instinctively knows how to use his size and strength to drive past opponents with ball mastery skills ', 'He has better shooting power than accuracy. His accuracy will improve with more practice. ', 'He heads the ball bravely keeping his eyes open. His heading will improve as he grows and with more practice ', 'He is good at tackling opponents however he will be better if he understands and utilises the advantages of his height strength in retrieving the ball from opponents ', 'He doesn\'t take Speed Agility and Quickness drills seriously which shows in the lethargic moments of his game  ', 'He should move and play faster with his height and length of his limbs. ', 'Reyansh is a good and coachable player. He needs to work on making the most of his physical attributes and advantages to become the best player he can be'),
