(712, 712, 4, 3, 3, 4, 3, 4, 4, 4, 3, 4, 3, 4, 4, 'He doesn\'t play on his toes and he moves the ball slowly ', 'He has decent ball control for his level ', 'He stops the ball well, however he needs to improve on his first touch into space ', 'He turns with the ball slowly ', 'He has decent passing accuracy that needs improvement ', 'We haven\'t had long range passing drills/situations to assess his ability ', 'He prefers kicking the ball over running with it', 'He prefers kicking the the ball , including during ball mastery ', 'He has good shooting power and accuracy for his age and level ', 'He doesn\'t like heading the ball, however he will improve with more practice ', 'He has decent tackling ability ', 'He needs improvement ', 'He has to improve his fitness and speed ', 'Seojun plays well when the ball is close to him, however he switches off when the game is far away '),
(713, 713, 2, 3, 3, 3, 2, 4, 2, 3, 3, 4, 3, 2, 3, 'He manipulates the ball well. He is one of the best at ball mastery in his center ', 'He receives and controls grounded balls well. He can improve on controlling aerial balls', 'He takes his first touch into space well and keeps the ball close to him when an opponent is close to him ', 'He turns with the ball very well with a quick change of direction ', 'He has a good short passing accuracy with appropriate pace on his passes ', 'He needs to generate more power on his long range passes which will improve with more training and as he grows ', 'He runs with the ball well understanding when he needs to take heavier touches into space and when he needs to take closer touches with opponents around him ', 'He includes ball mastery skills when taking on an opponent. His decision making on which skill to use in certain situations needs improvement ', 'He has good shooting power and accuracy with his dominant foot. Working on his weak foot is recommended ', 'He hasn\'t had much heading practice and he avoids heading the ball while wearing his glasses.  He will improve as he grows with more practice ', 'He presses and wins the ball well as an attacking player. He needs to improve improve on tracking back when the opposition goes past his team\'s high press', 'He is one of the best at executing Speed, Agility and Quickness drills at his center ', 'He is one of the fastest on and off the ball at his age group ', 'Vachan is an exciting prospect with a lot of potential. He needs to focus more and follow instructions during training sessions to reach his great potential '),
(714, 714, 2, 3, 3, 3, 2, 4, 2, 3, 3, 4, 3, 2, 3, 'He manipulates the ball well. He is one of the best at ball mastery in his center ', 'He receives and controls grounded balls well. He can improve on controlling aerial balls', 'He takes his first touch into space well and keeps the ball close to him when an opponent is close to him ', 'He turns with the ball very well with a quick change of direction ', 'He has a good short passing accuracy with appropriate pace on his passes ', 'He needs to generate more power on his long range passes which will improve with more training and as he grows ', 'He runs with the ball well understanding when he needs to take heavier touches into space and when he needs to take closer touches with opponents around him ', 'He includes ball mastery skills when taking on an opponent. His decision making on which skill to use in certain situations needs improvement ', 'He has good shooting power and accuracy with his dominant foot. Working on his weak foot is recommended ', 'He hasn\'t had much heading practice and he avoids heading the ball while wearing his glasses.  He will improve as he grows with more practice ', 'He presses and wins the ball well as an attacking player. He needs to improve improve on tracking back when the opposition goes past his team\'s high press', 'He is one of the best at executing Speed, Agility and Quickness drills at his center ', 'He is one of the fastest on and off the ball at his age group ', 'Vachan is an exciting prospect with a lot of potential. He needs to focus more and follow instructions during training sessions to reach his great potential '),
(715, 715, 4, 3, 4, 3, 3, 4, 4, 4, 3, 4, 2, 3, 3, 'He manipulates the ball well under supervision however he prefers kicking the ball when left to his own devices ', 'He stops grounded/rolling balls well. He needs to improve improve on controlling bouncing/aerial balls by judging the flight of the ball ', 'He needs to improve on taking his first touch into space when he is is free. He tends to stop regardless of if he is free or has an opponent on him', 'He turns with the ball well as he has a good change of direction with his dominant left foot ', 'He has good passing accuracy and power with his dominant foot. He needs to start working on his weaker foot as he has the potential to master both ', 'He hasn\'t had much practice passing long range however he displays potential to master this ability as he grows with more training and practice ', 'He tends to kick the ball and run behind it regardless of if has space or if he is under pressure from an opponent ', 'He performs ball mastery skills well under supervision, however he doesn\'t implement them during drills and games in 1v1 situations ', 'He has good shooting power and accuracy with his dominant foot for his age. He needs to start working on his weak foot', 'He hasn\'t had much heading practice which is expected for his age. His heading ability will improve as he ages with more training and practice ', 'He has very good tacking ability both sliding and on his feet for his age.  He needs to keep developing winning the ball from opponents ', 'He has good agility, balance, and coordination which shows in his performance during Speed, Agility, and Quickness drills ', 'He is one of the fastest in his age group without the ball. He needs to improve his speed with the ball. ', 'Yashas has a lot of potential and he shows it when he gets serious. He needs to take training sessions more seriously than he does at the moment '),
(716, 716, 4, 4, 4, 4, 3, 4, 4, 4, 3, 4, 2, 3, 3, 'He prefers to kick the ball instead of manipulating it even when instructed to ', 'He instinctively kicks the ball when it comes to him most of the time ', 'He alternates between kicking the ball and stopping the ball with his sole regardless of if he is free or under pressure ', 'He doesn\'t make sharp turns well as he tends to kick the ball and runs behind it ', 'He has good short range passing power and accuracy when he has the ball under control ', 'He hasn\'t had much long range passing experience or training which is normal for his age ', 'He tends to kick the ball and run behind it instead of taking controlled touches ', 'He needs to work on his ball mastery skills and implement them during matches in 1v1 situations ', 'He has decent shooting power for his age. He needs to work on combining accuracy with power ', 'He hasn\'t had much heading practice however he shows bravery by not closing his eyes when heading the ball', 'Sid is one of or perhaps the best at tackling in his age group. He goes in for tackles fearlessly regardless of the opponent. He should be encouraged to keep improving this aspect of his game ', 'He agility, balance, and coordination is one of the best in his age group at his center ', 'He is fast without the ball. He needs to improve his speed with the ball ', 'The Great Wall of Siddharth has started as one of the best protectors in his age group. He has the ability and potential to also become one of the best creators and finishers'),
(717, 717, 4, 4, 4, 4, 4, 4, 4, 4, 4, 4, 3, 3, 4, 'He manipulates the ball well with his in and out foot. His ball manipulation with his sole will improve as he grows ', 'He tends to stop grounded/rolling balls with his sole instead of his in foot. He struggles with aerial and bouncing balls ', 'He stops the ball with the sole of his foot regardless of if he has space to take his first touch into ', 'He turns with the ball slowly ', 'He kicks the ball with his toes in most situations.  He has to start using his in foot to pass the ball ', 'He hasn\'t had long range passing practice which is normal for his age ', 'He usually kicks the ball and runs behind it ', 'He instinctively kicks the ball instead of taking closer/softer touches and using ball mastery skills when an opponent is nearby. ', 'He has decent shooting accuracy but he doesn\'t generate enough power yet. This will improve as he grows ', 'He hasn\'t had much heading practice, which is normal for his age group and it will improve as he grows ', 'This is one of his better abilities as he wins the ball well when he puts pressure on opponents. He needs to put more pressure on opponents instead of running back to his goal to stop opponents from scoring ', 'He has good agility, balance and coordination. He will improve by taking his Speed, Agility and Quickness drills more seriously ', 'He has decent speed without the ball, however his speed with the ball needs improvement ', 'Veeranj is one of the most energetic and enthusiastic players which makes him a joy to coach. However he needs to learn when to get serious and when to have fun'),
(718, 718, 4, 4, 4, 4, 3, 4, 3, 4, 3, 4, 3, 3, 4, 'Isaac manipulates the ball well well while under supervision. He needs to do it when no one is watching ', 'He controls rolling/grounded ball well, but he struggles with aerial and bouncing balls ', 'He stops the ball well enough however his first touch into space needs improvement ', 'He turns with the ball slowly ', 'He has good passing power and accuracy at his age ', 'He has been required to pass long range yet. He will improve as he grows with more practice ', 'He tries to take close touches when running with the ball however he runs with the ball slowly ', 'He needs to put in more effort to learn new skills and implement them during 1v1 situations ', 'He has good short range passes accuracy and pace', 'At his age, he hasn\'t had much heading experience or practice. This will improve as he grows ', 'Isaac isn\'t scared of putting his body on the line to win the ball once he gets going. He needs to do it consistently. ', 'He has decent agility, balance, and coordination which will improve as he keeps practicing and growing ', 'His speed on and off the ball needs improvement. ', 'Isaac has all the attributes to be a good player or goalkeeper. However he needs to come to every match or training session ready to play, learn, and improve. '),
