(766, 766, 3, 2, 3, 3, 1, 3, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 2, 3, 'Needs to have a better control on the ball. ', 'Recieves the ball well and keeps it under control ', 'Needs to improve on the quality of his first touch. Improve on the consistency of keeping the ball into space and direction.', 'Can be faster when executing this skill ', 'Good short range passing', 'Needs to improve on the power and accuracy, needs to improve on his aerial ball passing ability ', 'Keeps it well under control ', 'Dribbles the ball well, keeping it under control and can beat his opponent but should improve on his consistency of this action ', 'Can shoot with both foot, left and right. Needs to also use the right more and not always depending on his left foot to shoot, this gives his opponents time to defend ', 'Can excute the heading the ball technique much better ', 'Tackles well, as decent timing of tackling. Decent strength, all this will improve as he trains more ', 'Good body and motor skills, good arm to leg coordination ', 'Can be more explosive with his on and off the ball speed. This tends to slow his game down ', 'Lokshith is in his development phase.\r\nHe needs to be working on his speed , agility & non dominant foot (Right).\r\nHe understands our Style of Play, and have performed tremendously well in the U11 competition recently.\r\nU13 is a transition phase now.\r\nWe have to be patient in his development.'),
