(810, 810, 3, 3, 3, 3, 2, 3, 3, 3, 4, 2, 2, 3, 3, 'He Moves the ball around with different parts of the foot.', 'Without pressure from the opponent, he receives and controls the ball. He faces difficulties in some tight situations.', 'He makes better first touch to keep the ball away from the opponents ', 'He turns and changes direction by using different skills. Need improvements ', 'His passes in the short distance are good ', 'He misses the timing and weight of the pass. He needs to work on it. ', 'He needs to develop positive one-touch to cover the distance quickly. by using appropriate controlling surface', 'His dribbling actions are good however he needs to decide the right time to dribble. ', 'He needs to practice more with his shots. He needs to orientate his body and apply the right foot surfaces to take a shot. ', 'He apply right techniques to head the ball', 'He puts the right pressure and tackles well at the right time ', 'He is agile and changes his direction rapidly, He needs to develop a base of strength that improves his balance and coordinations . ', 'He applies speed depending on the situation of the game. ', 'Prakar comes up with a positive attitude. He has good game sense and is eager to learn new things. however, he needs to develop his game knowledge. He plays well in the given position however he needs to understand his roles and responsibilities. his tecnique like pass and ball controls are good . He needs to improve his speed his decision making . He is showing progress in the practice . He ahs to work hard in his strength and weakness to achive his performance . Best wishes!'),
