(813, 813, 3, 4, 3, 4, 3, 4, 3, 3, 4, 3, 2, 3, 2, 'He handles the ball in different situation of play ', 'He has to orientate the body to receive and control the ball. ', 'When under pressure and off the pressure he loses ball control. He needs to be prepared to handle the game situation ', 'Needs to improve his ball control. which will help him make different skills to overcome the pressure. ', 'He execute the proper pass in short distance ', 'he needs to apply the right foot surface to execute the long passes ', 'He keeps the ball away from the opponents and accelerate the movements in some situation . ', 'Needs to improve his ball control and decide the right time to dribble. ', 'He need to work on his shots', 'He has confidence and helps the clearance while defending ', 'Puts pressure on the opponents at the right time an tackles the ball ', 'he is very agile and needs to improve his balance and coordination. ', 'He is quick in defensive movements and without ball movements. however, he has to react quickly when he has a ball in his leg. ', 'Niranjan is an agile and good learner. He develops his communication with his teammates. He has basic football skills, however he needs to improve his awareness and decision-making. Like when the ball is with his teammates he needs to give a passing line where he receives the ball and plays. He plays when the ball comes to his feet. He is waiting when the ball with the other players. He understands the drills and executes well, we wish him to keep practicing more to develop more football actions, Best wishes!'),
