(820, 820, 2, 3, 2, 3, 2, 3, 2, 3, 2, 3, 2, 3, 2, 'Jai has shown improvement in decision making on receiving the ball, can improve further in adding more skills to beat the defender', 'Receiving passes on the ground level and the ability to approach the ball is good, can improve further on aerial and through passes', 'Close receives of Jai are better and needs improvement in receiving passes away from the defender and receiving on the run ', 'Turning needs more improvements in terms of scanning prior to turning and then deciding the next move', 'Short range of passes are good and controlled with good weight on the passes, there\'s room for improvement on playing wall passes ', 'Jai has good power on the ball, but needs to work more on the direction and power on the ball for long range passes', 'Jai has good speed but needs more work in controlled running in match situations as to keep the ball away from the defenders', 'Jai needs to work on getting away from the defenders with long dribbles and then make decisions about passing or shooting', 'Good accurate shots and on target, can improve on more on generating powerful shots ', 'Jai has good usage of height while heading of the ball, but needs to be more courageous and approach the ball into headers and create chances', 'Good movement towards winning the ball back and tracking the opponets, Jai needs to work on final tackles and when he needs to delay and when to tackle', 'Jai has good agility and coordination, can work more on strong footing in keeping the upperboty strong while attacking and defending accordingly', 'Jai is fast and is good during transitions, can improve further in making overlapping runs ', 'Jai has the ability to learn and apply, he\'s focused and makes a good team player, Jai can further improve on his shot power and use of upperbody more to have strong gameplay '),
(821, 821, 2, 2, 3, 2, 2, 3, 3, 2, 3, 2, 2, 2, 3, 'Neil has good ability to dribble away from the opponents, can further improve on his usage of different skills, quickness and ball shielding', 'Neil is communicative in demanding for the ball and has good idea how to approach the ball, can improve further on ball control as to judging the movement of the ball and aligning in-line with the ball', 'First touch has been improved and needs more work on receiving ahead and away from the opponents', 'Neil is good with the awareness and turning with the ball, can improve in shielding the ball', 'Good ability to pass with the right weight in match situations, can improve further in better and accurate passing gameplay and further support ', 'Neil has good directional ability but needs more work in generating more weight onto the long passes', 'Neil can improve in his quickness with the ball, has decent control ', 'Neil can dribble into free spaces when crowded and has to ability to pass after the dribble, can further improve on adding skills to beat the opponents ', 'Neil has good technique shooting with lace and inner foot, needs to improve in the power and directing the shots ', 'Neil has good and courageous approach to the headers and is strong defensively, can work more on aligning according to the ball movement and win headers ', 'Neil has good reading on the attacker\'s movements and can win tackles, can work on the timing of the final tackles to improve further', 'Neil has good agility and coordination, needs work more on using of shoulders and balancing while quick movements ', 'Neil needs to improve in his speed both with and without the ball ', 'Neil is focused during training sessions and is a good team player who encourages his fellow team mates, he is vocal and focused during matches '),
