(1079, 1079, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 'Anirudh has good skills to get away from the opponents and has improved in his dribbling technique, can improve further in quck change of directions with long dribbles to better the attacking ', 'Good technique to receive the passes and can improve further in thigh and chest control ', 'Good anticipation and approach towars the ball to receive, has good vision the approach the ball and receive away from the opponents, can improve further in unmarking and receiving throw ins and out balls', 'Good ability to shield and turn further into long dribbles, can improve further in using skills to turn away from the opponents ', 'Good vision and technique with short range passes, can improve further in more pass and overlap, also combination passes ', 'Good technique in grounded and aerial long passes, can improve in more aiming to improve accuracy ', 'Improved and good technique in making fast runs with the ball and providing crosses, can improve more in scanning and moving towards teh goal better ', 'Good dribbling tecnique and skills to get away from the opponents, can improve further in using skills to beat the opponents and attack better ', 'Good technique with the lace part, can still work on placing with lace part and finishing on goal ', 'Good approach to head the ball, strong and far headers while defending, can further improve in attacking headers from crosses and corners ', 'Good strong tackles and good use of the body to phyaically challenge opponents, can improve further in timng the tackles according to the attackers movement ', 'Good and improved speed and agility, can improve further in balancing and running in a single direction', 'Good speed with and without the ball, can work more in sprinting for the trackbacks diagonally ', 'Anirudh is a very strong player both technically and physically, has been a focused player in both training and matches, eager to put in efforts for the team and is positive '),
(1080, 1080, 3, 2, 3, 3, 2, 3, 3, 3, 2, 3, 2, 2, 2, 'He manipulates the ball slowly \r\nHe needs practice more ball mastery ', 'He controls grounded and aerial balls well ', 'He tends to stop the ball instead of taking his first touch into space ', 'He changes direction with the ball slowly. He needs more practice ', 'He has good short range passing technique with accuracy ', 'His long range passing technique needs improvement', 'He runs fast but sometimes he doesn\'t have the ball under control while running ', 'He needs to include more skills when dribbling ', 'He has decent shooting technique with power and accuracy ', 'He heads the ball fearlessly but the accuracy needs improvement ', 'He tackles well with good timing ', 'He has good agility, balance, and coordination ', 'He is fast and is always light on his toes ', 'He is very good physically. He needs more practice to improve his technique and skills ');
