(1100, 1100, 2, 2, 3, 2, 2, 3, 3, 2, 3, 2, 2, 2, 3, 'Neil has good ability to dribble away from the opponents, can further improve on his usage of different skills, quickness and ball shielding.', 'Neil is communicative in demanding for the ball and has good idea how to approach the ball, can improve further on ball control as to judging the movement of the ball and aligning in-line with the ball', 'First touch has been improved and needs more work on receiving ahead and away from the opponents', 'Neil is good with the awareness and turning with the ball, can improve in shielding the ball', 'Good ability to pass with the right weight in match situations, can improve further in better and accurate passing gameplay and further support ', 'Neil has good directional ability but needs more work in generating more weight onto the long passes', 'Neil can improve in his quickness with the ball, has decent control ', 'Neil can dribble into free spaces when crowded and has to ability to pass after the dribble, can further improve on adding skills to beat the opponents ', 'Neil has good technique shooting with lace and inner foot, needs to improve in the power and directing the shots ', 'Neil has good and courageous approach to the headers and is strong defensively, can work more on aligning according to the ball movement and win headers ', 'Neil has good reading on the attacker\'s movements and can win tackles, can work on the timing of the final tackles to improve further', 'Neil has good agility and coordination, needs work more on using of shoulders and balancing while quick movements ', 'Neil needs to improve in his speed both with and without the ball ', 'Neil is focused during training sessions and is a good team player who encourages his fellow team mates, he is vocal and focused during matches '),
