(1134, 1134, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 2, 'he is good with his dominant feet, however, he has to use both feet. ', 'Needs improvement on his receiving while under pressure. ', 'his control is good , However, he needs to take a quality first touch to take a ball away from the opponents', 'Need to improve on this', 'good, Need to use both the feet ', 'Need to identify the farthest player to make the long pass. Need an improvement ', 'He is good with his running with the ball ', 'Having good control of the ball however, he loses the ball while dribbling, Need to adjust his technique. ', 'Need to work more on this ', 'Need to read the situation and Need to work more on this ', 'Having good defending technique. ', 'Need to work on his agility and coordinations', 'Need to work on acceleration speed ', 'Agastya is technically strong with his dominant feet and with a good passing range. He needs to use both feet.  However, he needs to improve his dribbling skills and first-touch control. Even under pressure, Agastya can turn out of trouble and make a pass. For all of his technical ability, he plays well in defending. Spend time working on different techniques in and around the field. He needs to develop his decision-making and have to be more creative.'),
