(1141, 1141, 3, 3, 3, 4, 2, 4, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 2, 3, 'Needs more touches on the ball & use different parts of the foot to manipulate the ball under pressure.', 'While receiving use the proper contact part on the ball & leg. Be clever whether to \"turn\" or perform a \"wall pass\" . \r\n', 'Take first touch away from opponent & into free space.', 'Can be more agile while turning and keep close control of the ball.', 'Can improve short range passing with more consistency & accuracy.', 'Must focus on weight of pass and look forward while passing the ball.\r\nLong range passing will improve with age as the player develops more power & accuracy.', 'Judge better when to run with the ball & when to dribble with the ball.', 'Look up while dribbling while keeping close control of the ball.', 'Improve shooting power & accuracy. \r\nPower will usually develop with age . Understand when to use \"lace part\" to shoot & when to use \"side foot\" to shoot.', 'Use forehead & don\'t close eyes while heading the ball . Heading technique will usually improve with age and as player gets more confident to head the ball.', 'Maintain tackling distance & proper body posture while defending.', 'He can improve Hand, Eye and Foot coordination.', 'Speed with & without ball can improve. Speed will naturally improve with age & training. ', 'Overall, the athlete is on the right track of development and he can slowly improve on the aspects which are above mentioned above.'),
