(1152, 1152, 3, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 2, 'Need to improve his touches', 'Good, Need to improve his control under pressure situation ', 'Need to improve his first touch ', 'Doing good with turning ', 'The accuracy is good. Need to check the teammate\'s position before he makes a pass', 'Need to develop his accuracy and Need to check the teammate\'s position before he makes a pass', 'Need to improve ', 'Having good dribbling technique however he needs to improve his decision making ', 'Need to orientate his body and shoot on the target ', 'He needs to develop ', 'He is putting pressure on the right time and tackles well ', 'Need to develop coordination actions ', 'Need to improve his speed ', ''),
(1153, 1153, 2, 3, 2, 3, 2, 3, 3, 2, 2, 3, 2, 3, 3, 'He manipulates the ball well in different situation of the game ', 'He has good ball control. However, needs to improve his ariel ball controls ', 'He is good with his receiving and ball control. ', 'He needs to improve his awareness and check the opponents positions', 'His accuracy and weight of the passes are good ', 'He needs improve his passing in the longer range ', 'he needs to develop his technique while running with the ball ', 'He has a better dribbling technique, Trying to apply innovative skills and actions to overcome the pressure.  ', 'He takes better shots on the targets however he needs to decide the right time to take a shot. ', 'He needs to improve his heading technique', 'He applies defensive principles and puts pressure on the right time. ', 'He is agile however he needs to improve his balance and coordinations. ', 'He has good speed, however apply it on the right time will helps his to gain advantage ', 'Advik has a positive attitude. He respects his teammates and coaches, He has a better game sense however he needs to develop his awareness and decision-making. He his goos with 1 v1  and dribbling. His passes are good, However before passing he needs to understand & check the teammate\'s position and situation. He needs to develop his defensive movements like supporting the team in the defensive zone. He is very creative while playing and training. He needs to improve his physical fitness components like balance and coordination. We are happy with his performance. Best wishes. '),
(1154, 1154, 2, 3, 2, 3, 2, 3, 3, 2, 2, 3, 2, 3, 3, 'He manipulates the ball well in different situation of the game ', 'He has good ball control. However, needs to improve his ariel ball controls ', 'He is good with his receiving and ball control. ', 'He needs to improve his awareness and check the opponents positions', 'His accuracy and weight of the passes are good ', 'He needs improve his passing in the longer range ', 'he needs to develop his technique while running with the ball ', 'He has a better dribbling technique, Trying to apply innovative skills and actions to overcome the pressure.  ', 'He takes better shots on the targets however he needs to decide the right time to take a shot. ', 'He needs to improve', 'He applies defensive principles and puts pressure on the right time. ', 'He is agile however he needs to improve his balance and coordinations. ', 'He has good speed, however apply it on the right time will helps his to gain advantage ', 'Advik has a positive attitude. He respects his teammates and coaches, He has a better game sense however he needs to develop his awareness and decision-making. He his goos with 1 v1  and dribbling. His passes are good, However before passing he needs to understand & check the teammate\'s position and situation. He needs to develop his defensive movements like supporting the team in the defensive zone. He is very creative while playing and training. He needs to improve his physical fitness components like balance and coordination. We are happy with his performance. Best wishes. '),
(1155, 1155, 3, 4, 3, 4, 3, 4, 3, 3, 4, 3, 2, 3, 2, 'He handles the ball in different situation of play ', 'He has to orientate the body to receive and control the ball. ', 'When under pressure and off the pressure he loses ball control. He needs to be prepared to handle the game situation ', 'Needs to improve his ball control. which will help him make different skills to overcome the pressure. ', 'He execute the proper pass in short distance ', 'he needs to apply the right foot surface to execute the long passes ', 'He keeps the ball away from the opponents and accelerate the movements in some situation . ', 'Needs to improve his ball control and decide the right time to dribble. ', 'He need to work on his shots', 'He has confidence and helps the clearance while defending ', 'Puts pressure on the opponents at the right time an tackles the ball ', 'He is very agile and needs to improve his balance and coordination. ', 'He is quick in defensive movements and without ball movements. however, he has to react quickly when he has a ball in his leg. ', 'Niranjan is an agile and good learner. He develops his communication with his teammates. He has basic football skills, however he needs to improve his awareness and decision-making. Like when the ball is with his teammates he needs to give a passing line where he receives the ball and plays. He plays when the ball comes to his feet. He is waiting when the ball with the other players. He understands the drills and executes well, we wish him to keep practicing more to develop more football actions, Best wishes!');
