(1170, 1170, 3, 3, 3, 3, 2, 3, 3, 2, 3, 3, 3, 4, 3, 'Needs more touches on the ball & use different parts of the foot to manipulate the ball under pressure.', 'Can be more agile while turning and keep close control of the ball.\r\nWhile receiving use the proper contact part on the ball & leg. Be clever whether to \"turn\" or perform a \"wall pass\" . ', 'More no of reputations should be done while on training ', 'Must focus on weight of pass and look forward while passing the ball.', 'Long range passing will improve with age as the player develops more power & accuracy.', 'Need power and accuracy,so need to practice with ball', 'Judge better when to run with the ball & when to dribble with the ball.', 'Look up while dribbling while keeping close control of the ball. ', 'Power will usually develop with age . Understand when to use \"lace part\" to shoot & when to use \"side foot\" to shoot.', 'Use forehead & don\'t close eyes while heading the ball . Heading technique will usually improve with age and as player gets more confident to head the ball.', 'Maintain tackling distance & proper body posture while defending.', 'He can improve Hand, Eye and Foot coordination', 'Practice more on speed to improve ball recovery ', 'Overall, the athlete is on the right track of development and he can slowly improve on the aspects which are above mentioned above. He can be more regular in training sessions.\r\n'),
