(1176, 1176, 3, 3, 3, 3, 2, 3, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 3, 2, 'Need to be creative ', 'needs to improve on his ball control. in the free space, he receives the ball well. However, when pressure situation comes he loses the ball. ', 'Applying good technique', 'Need to improve ', 'The accuracy and weight of the passes are good. However, check the teammate\'s position before making a pass. ', 'Need to improve long-range passes', 'Applies good techniques ', 'Need to improve his decision making ', 'Awareness and learn the techniques', 'Need to improve ', 'applies the right principles for defending ', 'Need to work more on his agility and coordination ', 'Having good speed. Apply it in defending and attacking both ', 'Tanash has a positive attitude. He respects his teammates and his coaches. However, he needs to be regular. His techniques are good however he needs to improve his awareness and decision making. He understands his role and responsibilities. He needs to develop advanced techniques like reading the opponent\'s game style and supporting the teams in attacking and defending. He receives the ball and keeps in control when there is no pressure. however, when the pressure situation comes he loses the ball. He has good speed but needs improvement in his agility and coordination. We wish him to work hard and achieve better performance. Best Wishes!'),
(1177, 1177, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 3, 2, 3, 3, 3, 2, 2, 'He applies both the feet , Need to be creative ', 'Good with ball control and receiving , Need to develop the action when under pressure ', 'scan and take a first touch to gain an advantage ', 'He changes directions and applies different techniques. ', 'Good. Check the teammates position before making a pass. ', 'Need to develop on the long range pass.', 'Good with this . ', 'He uses both feet however he needs to improve decision making ', 'Need an improvement ', 'Need to work more on this ', 'His tackling techniques are good, However, he needs to decide and  apply the principles in defending ', 'Need to improve on his agility and balance. ', 'He needs to develop his speed ', 'Mauktik has outstanding technical skills and a quick and precise vision.  He can read the game and anticipate plays, However, he needs to improve his communication. He needs to improve his decision-making skills. He needs to work more on his speed, agility, and balance. His confidence level was good.  However, he needs to be more creative, which helps him to improve his performance. Need to work more on his strengths and weaknesses. Best wishes!'),
(1178, 1178, 2, 2, 3, 3, 3, 2, 3, 2, 3, 3, 2, 3, 3, 'He needs to react quickly based on the game  situation ', 'quality of receiving is good, However, he needs to improve his awareness before and after receiving the ball ', 'Needs to improve his first touch ', 'Needs to improve ', 'the passing quality is good, however, he needs to improve accuarcy. ', 'Needs to improve his accuracy and power in passing ', 'needs to improve his touches and speed ', 'Keeping the ball in control and applying feints. needs to improve his decision making ( Right time to dribble\r\n)', 'Need to improve ', 'Needs to improve ', 'Understanding the situations and tackling at the right time ', 'He needs to work on the physical aspects , needs more practice ', 'He needs to improve his speed ', 'Good understanding of the game. and comes up with a positive attitude towards the session. He has techniques in  1v1 actions and defending.\r\nHis passes are good and he needs to improve his accuracy. He has a better game sence however he needs to improve his decision making . He understand the drills quickly supports his teammates. However He needs to develop his motor skills like  on Speed, strength, and stamina which will perform better and gain confidence in his game. Best wishes!'),
(1179, 1179, 3, 3, 3, 3, 2, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 2, 3, 3, 'Use both the feet and be creative ', 'Good, Need to improve under pressure situation ', 'Need to improve ', 'applies a good technique. However, Needs to improve his awareness ', 'Good in basics , Apply non dominant feet ', 'Need to apply better technique ', 'Need to work more ', 'controls the ball good , However Need to learn  feinting actions ', 'Need to work more on these techniques ', 'Need to improve more ', 'Doing successful tackles,Need to apply patience and force the opponent to play different direction ', 'His coordination is good. Need to be more agile and improve on body balance ', 'Need an improvement ', 'Nevin has a positive attitude and He respects his teammates and coaches. His basic techniques like passing, receiving, Ball Handling, and clearing the ball. However, he needs to position himself better. He needs to learn fundamentals in keeping. He understands the situation however he needs to develop his ball collection and the quality of the first. He needs to identify his teammates and give positions advantageous situations when they are under pressure situation in the defending zone. Need to improve his speed, agility, and balance. '),
(1180, 1180, 3, 3, 3, 3, 2, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 2, 3, 2, 'He handles the ball in different situation of play ', 'He has to orientate the body to receive and control the ball. ', 'When under pressure and off the pressure he loses ball control. He needs to be prepared to handle the game situation ', 'Needs to improve his ball control. which will help him make different skills to overcome the pressure. ', 'He execute the proper pass in short distance ', 'he needs to apply the right foot surface to execute the long passes ', 'He keeps the ball away from the opponents and accelerate the movements in some situation . ', 'Needs to improve his ball control and decide the right time to dribble. ', 'He need to work on his shots', 'He has confidence and helps the clearance while defending ', 'Puts pressure on the opponents at the right time an tackles the ball ', 'he is very agile and needs to improve his balance and coordination. ', 'He is quick in defensive movements and without ball movements. however, he has to react quickly when he has a ball in his leg. ', 'Niranjan is an agile and good learner. He develops his communication with his teammates. He has basic football skills, however he needs to improve his awareness and decision-making. Like when the ball is with his teammates he needs to give a passing line where he receives the ball and plays. He plays when the ball comes to his feet. He is waiting when the ball with the other players. He understands the drills and executes well, we wish him to keep practicing more to develop more football actions, Best wishes!'),
(1181, 1181, 3, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 3, 2, 2, 3, 3, 'Need to improve his touches', 'Good, Need to improve his control under pressure situation ', 'Need to improve his first touch ', 'Doing good with turning ', 'The accuracy is good. Need to check the teammate\'s position before he makes a pass', 'Need to develop his accuracy and Need to check the teammate\'s position before he makes a pass', 'Need to improve ', 'Having good dribbling technique however he needs to improve his decision making ', 'Need to orientate his body and shoot on the target ', 'He needs to develop ', 'he is putting pressure on the right time and tackles well ', 'Need to develop coordination actions ', 'Need to improve his speed ', 'Srikar has good technical skills. He is positive and respects his teammates and his coaches. He understands his role and responsibilities, However, he needs to improve his ball control under pressure situations and work more on 1v1 situations. His defensive techniques are good he clears the ball well he needs to help his teammates in attacking movements. He needs to develop his speed and balance. work more on his strengths and weaknesses to achieve better performance. Best wishes! '),
(1182, 1182, 2, 2, 3, 3, 2, 3, 2, 2, 2, 3, 3, 2, 2, 'he needs to improve in juggling, dribbling and need to involve in push, move and drag the ball to improve ', 'needs to work on meeting the ball and directing into nearby space.', 'he should have a better first touch in open space and have a quick decision to take next move\r\n', 'he needs to improve on taking turn to change the direction and move', 'he has good short range passing ability and can be done more better in upcoming days', 'he needs to be more focused on long range and need to practice and repeat\r\n', 'he needs to stay balanced and run as fast as you can while keeping the ball under control\r\n', 'he need to keep ball under control and move towards the open space', 'he has shooting ability and can be done better and need to have awareness of goalkeeper', 'he will improve his heading technique as he develops and  grows older', 'he need to work on tackling and timing', 'he has good agility, balance and co-ordination', 'he need to work on his speed', 'he has more focused and work on the things'),
(1183, 1183, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 3, 'he needs to improve in juggling, dribbling and need to involve in push, move and drag the ball further', 'needs to work on meeting the ball and directing into nearby space.', 'he should have a better first touch in open space and have a quick decision to take next move', 'he needs to improve on taking turn to change the direction and move', 'he has good sort range passing ability and can be done more better in upcoming days', 'he needs to be more focused on long range and need to practice and repeat', 'he needs to stay balanced and run as fast as you can while keeping the ball under control', 'he need to keep ball under control and move towards the open space', 'he need to improve on contact with the ball and timing and also must have awareness of goal keeper', 'he will improve his heading technique as he deveklops and  grows older ', 'he can improve timing of tackling', 'he has good agility, balance and co-ordination', 'he has good speed according to his age', 'Aryeh shows good interest and commitment to the training program and he is very interested to improve and learn'),
(1184, 1184, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 3, 'Aryeh has shown improvement in ball movements and has good speed with the ball, can further work on close controlled dribbling and change of direction ', 'needs to work on meeting the ball and directing into nearby space.', 'he should have a better first touch in open space and have a quick decision to take next move', 'he needs to improve on taking turn to change the direction and move', 'he has good sort range passing ability and can be done more better in upcoming days', 'he needs to be more focused on long range and need to practice and repeat', 'he needs to stay balanced and run as fast as you can while keeping the ball under control', 'he need to keep ball under control and move towards the open space', 'he need to improve on contact with the ball and timing and also must have awareness of goal keeper', 'he will improve his heading technique as he deveklops and  grows older ', 'he can improve timing of tackling', 'he has good agility, balance and co-ordination', 'he has good speed according to his age', 'Aryeh shows good interest and commitment to the training program and he is very interested to improve and learn'),
(1185, 1185, 2, 2, 3, 2, 2, 3, 2, 2, 3, 3, 3, 2, 3, 'Anirudh has good technique on the ball in terms of driving the ball away from the defender with quick change of direction, can further improve in using more skikks to dribble away effectively ', 'needs to work on meeting the ball and directing into nearby space.', 'he should have a better first touch in open space and have a quick decision to take next move', 'he can be more better to have a quick turns', 'he has good short range passing ability and can be done more better in upcoming days', 'he needs to be more focused on long range and need to practice and repeat', 'he needs to stay balanced and run as fast as you can while keeping the ball under control', 'he has to keep ball under control and move towards the open space', 'he has to improve on contact with the ball and timing and also must take a quick shoot in tight space', 'he will improve his heading technique as he develops and grows older', 'he need to delay a defender and keep patience and timing', 'he has good agility, balance and co-ordination', 'he has to work on his speed with and without football', 'he has good interest in training and he is regular to the traning session'),
(1186, 1186, 3, 3, 3, 4, 2, 4, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 2, 3, 'Narasimha has been very consistent in his dribbling ', 'while receiving use the proper contact part on the ball and be ready for the action', 'focous on the contact part of ball and foot ', 'more agile while turning and close control of the ball', 'short range passing to improve little more on accuracy', 'must focus on weight of pass and look forward while passing', 'work on speed to retain ball,while running ', 'use proper lace part and forward touches ', 'power is not there when shooting and lackimg the target', 'use proper forehead and do not close eyes when doing heading', 'must aware of the distance and the body posture', 'good in slalom moments,bit more on hand and foot co-ordination', 'more on with the ball,which is lacking', 'overall have to improve on the aspects which  are above mentioned points.'),
(1187, 1187, 2, 3, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 3, 2, 'Ronith has improved well in ball manipulation/skills. still, more room to improve in game situations.', 'Needs to receive under pressure better. Take first touch away from opponent & into free space. Ronith can be more consistent in his receiving. \r\n', 'Ronith needs to improve his scanning/shoulder-checks so as to improve his first touch. Overall good for his age.', 'Ronith has good agility in turning with the ball. Be clever whether to \"turn\" or perform a \"wall pass\" . ', 'Ronith has good short passing range.', 'Long range passing will improve with age as the player develops more power & accuracy.', 'Judge better when to run with the ball & when to dribble with the ball depending upon the space available. Overall good for his age.', ' Ronith should improve his \"non-dominant\" foot dribbling.\r\n', 'Ronith needs to improve consistency in finishing.He needs to understand when to use \"lace part\" to shoot & when to use \"side foot\" to shoot.\r\n', 'Use forehead & don\'t close eyes while heading the ball . Heading technique will usually improve with age and as player gets more confident to head the ball.\r\n', 'Ronith is aggressive & wants to get the ball back from opponent. He can be more consistent in his defending stance & tackling distance during defending phase.', 'He can improve Hand, Eye and Foot coordination - He needs to take SAQ activity in the training more seriously with concentration & focus.', 'He has good speed for his age.', 'Ronith is a good player to coach & has potential but needs to have better body language in training. He can be more receptive to information. We are closely monitoring his progress. Overall, Ronith is on the right track of development and he can improve on the aspects which are mentioned above.\r\n'),
(1188, 1188, 2, 3, 2, 3, 2, 3, 2, 3, 2, 3, 2, 3, 2, 'Jai has shown improvement in decision making on receiving the ball, can improve further in adding more skills to beat the defender more effectively ', 'Receiving passes on the ground level and the ability to approach the ball is good, can improve further on aerial and through passes', 'Close receives of Jai are better and needs improvement in receiving passes away from the defender and receiving on the run ', 'Turning needs more improvements in terms of scanning prior to turning and then deciding the next move', 'Short range of passes are good and controlled with good weight on the passes, there\'s room for improvement on playing wall passes ', 'Jai has good power on the ball, but needs to work more on the direction and power on the ball for long range passes', 'Jai has good speed but needs more work in controlled running in match situations as to keep the ball away from the defenders', 'Jai needs to work on getting away from the defenders with long dribbles and then make decisions about passing or shooting', 'Good accurate shots and on target, can improve on more on generating powerful shots ', 'Jai has good usage of height while heading of the ball, but needs to be more courageous and approach the ball into headers and create chances', 'Good movement towards winning the ball back and tracking the opponets, Jai needs to work on final tackles and when he needs to delay and when to tackle', 'Jai has good agility and coordination, can work more on strong footing in keeping the upperboty strong while attacking and defending accordingly', 'Jai is fast and is good during transitions, can improve further in making overlapping runs ', 'Jai has the ability to learn and apply, he\'s focused and makes a good team player, Jai can further improve on his shot power and use of upperbody more to have strong gameplay '),
(1189, 1189, 3, 3, 3, 3, 2, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 2, 2, 3, 'Aarohi has shown good improvement with the ball movements and has good awareness on the ball, can further improve on being quick with the change of direction to beat the opponents ', 'she  needs to work on meeting the ball and directing into nearby space.\r\n', 'she needs to take first touch to open space ', 'she should work on turning withe ball ', 'she has ablity to do short range passing .should work on non dominate foot', 'she needs to work on long range passing ', 'need  to keep the ball under control and run as fast as can with ball', 'can do  more better ', 'need to work on shooting ', 'need to attempt for heading ', 'she has ablity. can do more better ', 'she has good agility ,balance n co-ordination', 'she will develop on her speed ', 'need to work on above skills . good attitude of learning '),
