(1263, 1263, 3, 3, 2, 2, 3, 2, 3, 3, 3, 2, 3, 3, 2, 'more creative and applies both the feet ', 'Good with his techniques, However he needs to improve when his technique whne under pressure ', 'Need scan before taking a touch ', 'He applies different techniques. need to improve his awareness ', 'Good with passing ', 'Needs to read the game better and make a pass to the space or the feet accordingly ', 'Good. Needs to be under control', 'He applies different techniques and feint action while dribbling ', 'Observe and apply right technique and right power to take shot ', 'Needs to improve heading techniques ', 'Needs to improve tackling ', 'Work more on balance ', 'Having good speed. Need to know when to accelerate and when to go slow. ', 'Manvit has outstanding technical skills. His ball Manipulation and control is.   He is good at attacking however he needs to develop his defending actions. He decides and makes decisions quickly. However, he loses position while playing. He needs to develop his awareness while playing. Need more focus on his roles and responsibilities. ');
