(1427, 1427, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 3, 2, 'Good ability to dribble quick, can use more skills to beat the opponent', 'Good receiving technique, needs to work on aerial ball control and first touch ', 'Good first touch away from opponents and create chances at goal, can improve further in scanning', 'Improved turning technique, needs more work in using the non-dominant foot ', 'Improved technique, can improve further in finding quick passing spaces and support play', 'Improved passing, can further improve in aerial passes quality with more power and direction ', 'Good technique, can further improve in quickly changing direction to make faster dribbles ', 'Improved dribbling with quick dribbles, can improve in quick scan and decide the next move ahead', 'Improved shooting, can further improve in more direction of the shots to improve shooting accuracy', 'Good heading, needs more work in developing power to head with more practice ', 'Good tackling stance with strong tackles, can improve further in well timing of the tackles ', 'Improved agility, balance and coordination, can further improve in deceleration to change direction  ', 'Good speed with and without the ball, can work in getting fast in different directions ', 'Prakhar is a player with good focus to learn and is regular for training, he needs to work on the technical aspects mentioned and work on improving the communication to lead the team and be confident, overall has good attitude to learn and we are pleased to see the improvements '),
