(1643, 1643, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 4, 2, 2, 2, 'Chirayu has shown a noticeable improvement in his ability to control the ball. He is starting to feel more confident when handling the ball and is more comfortable under pressure.', 'He has improved his first touch, although at times, it can be slightly heavy. He’s becoming more aware of his surroundings, which allows him to control the ball better.', 'Chirayu’s first touch has become more consistent. With a bit more focus, he can make his touch even smoother and more accurate.', 'His ability to turn with the ball has improved, showing more awareness of space around him. A few more turns with purpose would help him in match situations.', 'Chirayu’s short passing has become sharper. He\'s now making quicker and more accurate passes.', 'He is still working on his long passes but has made great strides in being able to switch the play.', 'Chirayu’s dribbling has become more fluid, and he’s showing confidence when running with the ball, looking for space and options.\r\n', 'He’s becoming more creative with the ball, using both feet and showing improved control. A bit more speed in his dribbling would help.', 'His shooting accuracy has shown noticeable improvement, though he should work on striking the ball with more power.', 'Chirayu has started to get comfortable with heading but can improve his timing and technique when going for the ball in the air.', 'His tackling technique is improving, and he is becoming more effective in 1v1 situations. Focus on timing to ensure it’s more controlled.', 'Chirayu’s agility has definitely improved, making him more responsive on the field.', 'His speed has increased noticeably, making him more effective in fast-paced situations.', 'Chirayu’s confidence on the ball continues to grow, and with more practice, he’ll become even more composed in match situations. Keep pushing yourself!'),
