(1663, 1663, 3, 4, 3, 3, 3, 4, 4, 4, 4, 4, 4, 3, 2, 'Needs to work on the change of direction and quick dribbling away from opponents using skills', 'Improved receiving, needs to improve in first touch and ball controlling techniques', 'Needs to receive away from the opponent and quickly pass to support further', 'Needs more work in protecting the ball while turning and quickly change direction', 'Needs to work in finding spaces to pass and move ahead in the attack', 'Needs more work in power generation for long range passes which will develop overtime', 'Needs more work in developing speed and direction of acceleration with the ball', 'Needs more work in dribbling quickly protecting the ball and carry the attacks', 'Needs more work in power generation with direction, which will develop overtime with practice', 'Needs more work in reading the ball and position in line with the ball and head with accuracy', 'Needs more work in reading the ball and positioning quickly to tackle the ball from the opponents', '\r\nNeeds more work in balance with strong footing and move quickly in different directions\r\n', 'Improved speed, can further improve in speed with the ball in non-dominant foot ', 'aliya is a player who strives to be better and is disciplined, she needs to work on the technical aspects of the game and work on the accuracy of set-pieces which are important elements to create goal scoring chances, she is on the right track of development '),
(1664, 1664, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 'Tanush has made strong progress with his ball manipulation, looking much more comfortable under pressure. He\'s improving in tight situations and showing better control.', 'His first touch is becoming more reliable, which is allowing him to keep possession and link up with teammates effectively.', 'Tanush is improving his first touch, making it smoother and more accurate. He has shown great progress with consistency in this area.', 'His ability to turn with the ball has improved significantly. He’s using his body well to shield the ball and make quick decisions.', 'Tanush’s short passing has been sharp and accurate, and he’s becoming more aware of his teammates\' positions when passing.', 'Long-range passing is steadily improving. Tanush is now making more controlled and precise long passes.', 'His dribbling is becoming more controlled, and he’s looking for spaces to exploit when running with the ball.', 'Tanush is confident in his dribbling, keeping the ball close to his feet and using both feet more effectively. A bit more speed will help him break past defenders.', 'Tanush has shown improvement in his shooting, especially with accuracy. Focus on power will help him be more effective in front of goal.', ' His heading technique is improving, and he’s starting to time his jumps better. More practice will help him gain more consistency.', 'Tanush is becoming more effective in tackles, reading the game well and making clean challenges.', 'His agility has improved, and he’s able to move quickly in tight spaces, which makes him more effective in the game.', 'Tanush has shown noticeable improvement in speed. He’s using it well to beat opponents and cover ground.', 'Tanush has become a more confident and composed player, and with continued effort, he will keep progressing.\r\n'),
(1665, 1665, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 4, 3, 3, 2, 'Rahul\'s ball manipulation has shown great progress, and he is now more comfortable under pressure. He is confident in his ability to keep possession.', 'His first touch has become much more reliable. Rahul now consistently controls the ball with ease, even in challenging situations.', 'Rahul’s first touch is smooth, and he has been more consistent in controlling the ball under pressure.', 'Rahul is doing well when turning with the ball, using his body to shield it and keep possession while scanning for options.', 'His short passing has improved and is now more accurate and quicker, allowing for better build-up play.', 'Rahul is becoming more confident with his long-range passes, making them more precise and effective in creating chances.', 'His dribbling has become more fluid, and he’s showing greater comfort when running with the ball, making him more effective in one-on-one situations.', 'Rahul’s dribbling technique is solid, and he’s improving his ability to change direction quickly while maintaining control.', 'His shooting is improving, especially when it comes to accuracy. More focus on striking with power will make him more dangerous in front of goal.', 'Rahul’s heading is becoming more consistent, with improved timing and positioning when contesting aerial duels.', 'His tackling technique has improved, and he is becoming more assertive in his defensive challenges.', 'Rahul’s balance and agility have improved, making him more agile and responsive during matches.', 'Rahul’s speed has increased, and he is using it well to make surging runs and track back defensively.', ' Rahul has shown significant growth in all areas. His confidence is growing, and with continued hard work, he will continue to improve.'),
(1666, 1666, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 4, 2, 2, 2, 'Rutvik is becoming more confident in manipulating the ball and is showing better composure in tight spaces.', 'His first touch has become much more reliable, allowing him to control the ball better when receiving passes.\r\n', 'Rutvik is now able to control the ball with ease, and his first touch has become smoother and more consistent.', 'He has made good progress in turning with the ball, looking more comfortable when shielding and evading pressure.', 'Rutvik’s short passing has improved and is now quicker and more precise, making it easier for his teammates to play their game.', 'His long-range passing has become more accurate and effective, and he’s starting to make better decisions when switching the play.', 'Rutvik is more comfortable running with the ball and is becoming more confident in dribbling past defenders.', 'His dribbling technique is becoming more effective, using both feet and showing improved ball control.', 'Rutvik has made progress in shooting, showing more accuracy and power. With more practice, he’ll become even more dangerous in front of goal.', 'Rutvik’s heading is improving, especially with his timing and ability to meet the ball at the right moment.', 'He’s becoming more assertive in tackling and is timing his challenges more effectively.', 'Rutvik’s balance and coordination have significantly improved, making him more agile and better at maintaining control during turns.', 'Rutvik’s speed is improving, allowing him to cover more ground during the match.', 'Rutvik has made great strides in all aspects of his game, and with continued effort, he will become a key player on the field.'),
