(1669, 1669, 3, 3, 2, 3, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 1, 2, 3, 'Aaryn has made noticeable progress in ball manipulation, becoming more comfortable under pressure and more confident in tight spaces.', 'His first touch has improved, and he is consistently controlling the ball well, even when the pass is a bit off target.', 'Aaryn’s first touch has become much more reliable, making it easier for him to keep possession and make quicker decisions.', 'His ability to turn with the ball has improved, showing good awareness of defenders and space around him.', 'Aaryn’s short passing has become more accurate and quicker, making him more effective in linking up with teammates.', 'His long-range passing has improved and is becoming more precise, helping him switch play effectively.', 'Aaryn’s dribbling is becoming more controlled, and he’s becoming more confident running with the ball at speed.', 'His dribbling has improved, and he is showing more confidence using both feet and being more creative on the ball.', 'Aaryn has shown progress in his shooting, especially in terms of accuracy. Focus on technique will help him become more consistent.', 'His heading technique has improved, and he’s starting to meet the ball with better timing and positioning.', 'Aaryn is becoming more confident in his tackling, making more effective challenges and reading the game well.', 'Aaryn’s balance and agility have improved significantly, making him more responsive on the field.', 'Aaryn has shown improvements in his speed, which helps him both offensively and defensively.', 'Aaryn is developing well across all areas of his game. With continued hard work, he has the potential to be a key player in the team.\r\n'),
