(1851, 1851, 3, 3, 2, 3, 2, 3, 2, 3, 2, 3, 3, 2, 3, 'Good dribbling technique, needs to work more on quick dribbling keeping the ball close to the feet ', 'Good ball control, needs to improve receiving away from the opponent and aerial ball controlling', 'Improved first touch, needs to work in scanning quickly and distributing the ball further ', 'Improved technique, needs more work in keeping the ball away from the opponents while turning ', 'Improved technique, can improve further in finding quick passing spaces and support play', 'Improved passing, can further improve in direction and power to deliver optimal passes in long range', 'Good technique, can further improve in quickly changing direction to make faster dribbles ', 'Good dribbling, needs more work in quickly moving the ball into free spaces away from opponents', 'Improved shooting, can further improve in more direction of the shots to improve shooting accuracy', 'Needs more work in reading the ball and position in line with the ball and head with accuracy', 'Good ability to tackle, needs more work in reading the ball and timing the tackles ', 'Good coordination and balance, can further improve in deceleration and change of direction  ', 'Needs more work in developing speed with and without the ball which will develop overtime\r\n\r\n', 'Ruchir is a player who displays a positive attitude in training, he needs to work on the technical aspects mentioned and develop quickness with and without the ball since change of direction is vital for keeping the ball in possession and create goal-scoring chances.'),
(1852, 1852, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 'Shreem is still improving on controlling the ball, but he is more comfortable with it than when he started. Continued focus on ball control will help him in tight situations.\r\n', 'He struggles with receiving the ball under pressure but has made progress in handling easy passes more effectively.', 'Shreem is working on his first touch, but he still sometimes struggles to control the ball smoothly. More practice will help him improve this.', 'His turning with the ball needs improvement, and he’s still getting used to using his body to protect the ball when turning.', 'Shreem\'s short passing has shown some improvement, but he needs to work on passing with more precision and control.', 'long-range passing is still an area of growth. With more focus on technique, Shreem can improve his accuracy. Strength will naturally improve as he grows & becomes older.', 'Running with the ball is something Shreem\'s is still learning & constantly improving. Decision making when to run with the ball & when to dribble has to improved.', 'He’s starting to show better ball control and can work on using both feet to improve his dribbling technique.', 'Shreem is still gaining confidence in his shooting, and though he has improved, he can improve the decision making w.r.t using side foot or lace part to shoot. ', 'Shreem is still learning how to head the ball with proper technique. Heading sessions will be introduced further as they grow older & develop.', 'His tackling technique is improving slowly. He can focus more on timing and being more confident when challenging opponents.', 'Shreem\'s balance and coordination have improved over time. He is now more stable in his movements.', 'Speed will improve naturally as he grows older. As of now , alright for his age. ', 'Shreem is starting to develop better awareness on the ball, and with consistent practice, his decision-making and confidence will improve. Great progress so far!'),
(1853, 1853, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 4, 3, 3, 3, 4, 3, 3, 3, 'Shreem is still improving on controlling the ball, but he is more comfortable with it than when he started. Continued focus on ball control will help him in tight situations.\r\n', 'He struggles with receiving the ball under pressure but has made progress in handling easy passes more effectively.', 'Shreem is working on his first touch, but he still sometimes struggles to control the ball smoothly. More practice will help him improve this.', 'His turning with the ball needs improvement, and he’s still getting used to using his body to protect the ball when turning.', 'Shreem\'s short passing has shown some improvement, but he needs to work on passing with more precision and control.', 'long-range passing is still an area of growth. With more focus on technique, Shreem can improve his accuracy. Strength will naturally improve as he grows & becomes older.', 'Running with the ball is something Shreem\'s is still learning & constantly improving. Decision making when to run with the ball & when to dribble has to improved.', 'He’s starting to show better ball control and can work on using both feet to improve his dribbling technique.', 'Shreem is still gaining confidence in his shooting, and though he has improved, he can improve the decision making w.r.t using side foot or lace part to shoot. ', 'Shreem is still learning how to head the ball with proper technique. Heading sessions will be introduced further as they grow older & develop.', 'His tackling technique is improving slowly. He can focus more on timing and being more confident when challenging opponents.', 'Shreem\'s balance and coordination have improved over time. He is now more stable in his movements.', 'Speed will improve naturally as he grows older. As of now , alright for his age. ', 'Shreem is starting to develop better awareness on the ball, and with consistent practice, his decision-making and confidence will improve. Great progress so far!'),
(1854, 1854, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 4, 3, 3, 3, 4, 3, 3, 3, 'Anvith has shown good improvements in his speed compared to the year before, which helps him both offensively and defensively.', '', '', '', '', '', 'Anvith dribbling is becoming more controlled, and he’s becoming more confident running with the ball at speed. This can improve further.', 'His dribbling has improved, and he is showing more confidence compared to last year . He can improve/use his non-dominant foot.', 'Aaryn has shown progress in his shooting, especially in terms of accuracy. Focus on technique will help him become more consistent.', 'His heading technique has improved. More heading sessions will be introduced as they become older. ', 'Anvith is becoming more confident in his tackling, making more effective challenges and reading the game well. He needs to use his body more in 1v1 situations & be not afraid in 50-50 challenges.', 'Anvith\'s balance and agility have improved significantly, making him more responsive on the field.', '', ''),
(1855, 1855, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 4, 4, 3, 3, 4, 3, 3, 3, 'Anvith has made noticeable progress in ball manipulation, becoming more comfortable under pressure and more confident in tight spaces.', 'His first touch has improved, and he is consistently controlling the ball better. He needs to move towards the ball & constantly move more in order to find better receiving angles.', 'Anvith\'s first touch has become much more reliable & better compared to the season before. \r\n', 'His ability to turn with the ball has improved, showing good awareness of space. Ofcourse this can become better & faster.', 'Anvith\'s short passing has become more accurate and quicker, making him more effective in linking up with teammates.', 'Anvith can work to improve his long range passing & switching play. This will improve as he he improves his awareness of his team-mates & also as he improves his strength when he becomes older.', 'Anvith dribbling is becoming more controlled, and he’s becoming more confident running with the ball at speed. This can improve further.', 'His dribbling has improved, and he is showing more confidence compared to last year . He can improve/use his non-dominant foot.', 'Anvith has shown progress in his shooting, especially in terms of accuracy. Focus on technique will help him become more consistent.', 'His heading technique has improved & is less afraid of it than before. More heading sessions will be introduced as they become older. ', 'Anvith is becoming more confident in his tackling, making more effective challenges and reading the game well. He needs to use his body more in 1v1 situations & be not afraid in 50-50 challenges.', 'Anvith\'s balance and agility have improved significantly, making him more responsive on the field.', 'Anvith has shown good improvements in his speed compared to the year before, which helps him both offensively and defensively.', 'Anvith is developing well across all areas of his game. With continued hard work, he has the potential to improve further. Let him enjoy the game & not put pressure on him. We are happy to see his progress.');
