(1859, 1859, 2, 3, 3, 3, 2, 3, 3, 2, 3, 4, 2, 2, 3, 'Shreem is still improving on controlling the ball, but he is more comfortable with it than when he started. Continued focus on ball control will help him in challenging situations.', 'The technique is challenging for Shreem to receive the ball under pressure but has made progress in handling easy passes more effectively.', 'Shreem is working on his first touch, but he still sometimes struggles to control the ball smoothly. More practice will help him improve this.', 'His turning with the ball needs improvement, and he’s still getting used to using his body to protect the ball when turning.', 'Shreem\'s short passing has shown some improvement, but he needs to work on passing with more precision and control.', 'Long-range passing is still an area of growth. With more focus on technique, Shreem can improve his accuracy. Strength will naturally improve as he grows & becomes older.', 'Running with the ball is something Shreem\'s is still learning & constantly improving. Decision making when to run with the ball & when to dribble has to improved.', 'He’s starting to show better ball control and can work on using both feet to improve his dribbling technique.', 'Shreem is still gaining confidence in his shooting, and though he has improved, he can improve the decision making with respect to using side foot or lace part to shoot. ', 'Shreem is still learning how to head the ball with proper technique. Heading sessions will be introduced further as they grow older & develop.', 'His tackling technique is improving slowly. He can focus more on timing and being more confident when challenging opponents.', 'Shreem\'s balance and coordination have improved over time. He is now more stable in his movements.', 'Speed will improve naturally as he grows older. As of now , alright for his age. ', 'Shreem is a player who strives to be better and is disciplined, he needs to work on the technical aspects of the game and work on the accuracy of quick decision making and passes which are important elements to create goal scoring chances which comes with match experiences and practice, he is on the right track of development and is working consistently'),
