(1986, 1986, 2, 2, 3, 2, 2, 3, 2, 3, 2, 3, 3, 2, 2, 'Good use of skills to get away from opponents, can be quick in changing direction when dribbling. ', 'Good receiving technique, needs to work on aerial ball control and first touch.', 'Improved receiving, needs to work on quick passing after receiving and support. ', 'Improved turning technique, needs more work in using the non-dominant foot. ', 'Improved technique, can improve further in finding quick passing spaces and support play. ', 'Good passing in long range, needs more work in aiming the passes in the right direction. ', 'Good ability to run with the ball, can work more in quick change of direction. ', 'Improved dribbling, needs more work on scanning ahead to dribble into free spaces and attack.', 'Improved shooting, can further improve in more direction of the shots to improve shooting accuracy.', 'Improved heading, needs more work in aligning in line with the ball and head it with accuracy.', 'Good ability to tackle, needs more work in reading the ball and timing the tackles. ', 'Good coordination and balance, can further improve in deceleration and change of direction.', 'Improved speed, can further improve in speed with the ball in non-dominant foot. ', 'Ruchir is a player with good potential, he needs to work on the technical aspects mentioned and improve the physical strength which is of equal importance, he is a player with good attitude and is in the developing phase. (Ruchir as been absent since the start of 2026).\r\n');
