(2218, 2218, 2, 3, 3, 3, 2, 3, 3, 2, 2, 3, 2, 2, 3, 'Good ability to dribble quick, can use more skills to beat the opponent efficiently', 'Improved receiving and ball control, can further improve in quick first touch and attacking play', 'Needs to improve receiving away from the opponents protecting the ball', 'Needs more work in protecting the ball while turning and quickly change direction', 'Good short passes, needs more work in quick movement after passing to support further ', 'Needs more work in power generation for long range passes which will develop overtime', 'Needs more work in developing speed and direction of acceleration with the ball', 'Improved dribbling technique, can improve further by using skills to get away from the opponents ', 'Good shooting technique, needs more work in scanning keeper position to shoot with power in long range and place the ball when needed', 'Needs more work in reading the ball and position in line with the ball and head with accuracy', 'Improved technique, can improve in reading the opponent and anticipate the attacks further', 'Improved agility, balance and coordination, can further improve in deceleration to change direction  ', 'Needs more work in developing speed with and without the ball which will develop overtime', 'Pranav is a player with good focus for his age, he needs to work on the technical aspects mentioned and needs to build accuracy in dribbling, passing and shooting which is of much importance, he is in developing phase and will keep progressing with consistent efforts'),
(2219, 2219, 2, 3, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 2, 3, 3, 3, 2, 2, 'Good use of skills to get away from opponents, can be quick in changing direction when dribbling', 'Good ball control, needs to improve receiving away from the opponent and aerial ball controlling', 'Improved first touch, needs to work in scanning quickly and distributing the ball further ', 'Good ability to turn quickly, needs more work in scanning ahead ', 'Good ability to pass in short range, needs to work on scanning and pass quickly ', 'Good passing in long range, needs more work in aiming the passes in the right direction', 'Good technique, can further improve in quickly changing direction to make faster dribbles ', 'Improved dribbling technique, can improve further by using skills to get away from the opponents ', 'Good shooting, needs more work in scanning keeper position to shoot with power in long range', 'Needs more work in reading the ball and position in line with the ball and head with accuracy', 'Good tackling, needs more work in balancing through quick change of directions while defending', 'Good coordination and balance, can further improve in deceleration and change of direction  ', 'Good speed with and without the ball, can work in getting fast in different directions ', 'Arya is a player with positive attitude in training, he needs to work on the technical aspects mentioned and needs to focus on improving with more practice and hard work to reach optimal stages of performance, he is in the development phase and needs to be consistent '),
(2220, 2220, 3, 3, 2, 3, 2, 3, 3, 3, 3, 4, 3, 3, 3, 'Needs to work on the change of direction and quick dribbling away from opponents using skills', 'Good ability to receive, needs to work further in ball control and receiving away from opponents', 'Needs to receive away from the opponent and quickly pass to support further ', 'Needs more work in protecting the ball while turning and quickly change direction', 'Good short passes, needs more work in quick movement after passing to support further ', 'Needs more work in power generation for long range passes which will develop overtime', 'Needs more work in developing speed and direction of acceleration with the ball', 'Improved dribbling, needs more work on scanning ahead to dribble into free spaces and attack', 'Needs more work in power generation with direction, which will develop overtime with practice', 'Needs more work in reading the ball and position in line with the ball and head with accuracy', 'Needs more work in reading the ball and positioning quickly to tackle the ball from the opponents', 'Needs more work in balance with strong footing and move quickly in different directions', 'Needs more work in developing speed with and without the ball which will develop overtime', 'Aditi is a player with good potential, she needs to work on the technical aspects mentioned and needs to work on receiving away from the opponents and decide quickly to distribute the ball further which will dictate the match intensity, he needs to work hard with the coach’s guidance to improve further '),
(2221, 2221, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 2, 2, 'Good use of skills to get away from opponents, can be quick in changing direction when dribbling', 'Good ability to receive at an angle and has good ball control, can improve in aerial ball control', 'Good ability to take first touch, needs to be quick to decide further to pass, dribble or shoot ', 'Good ability to turn quickly, needs more work in scanning ahead ', 'Good ability to pass in short range, needs to work on scanning and pass quickly ', 'Good ability to pass long range, can further improve in aerial pass accuracy', 'Good ability to run with the ball, can work more in quick change of direction ', 'Good ability to dribble quickly and find free spaces, can further improve by using more skills', 'Good shooting technique with strong shots, can further improve in scanning keeper position to finish', 'Improved heading, needs more work in aligning in line with the ball and head it with accuracy', 'Good tackling stance with strong tackles, can improve further in well timing of the tackles ', 'Good coordination and balance, can further improve in deceleration and change of direction  ', 'Good speed with and without the ball, can work in getting fast in different directions ', 'Asavari is a player with good attitude in training and matches, she needs to work on the technical aspects mentioned and needs to work on the physical aspect of the game which is of equal importance in terms of speed and endurance, she is in the developing phase and is improving with consistency'),
(2222, 2222, 3, 2, 3, 2, 2, 3, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 3, 2, 'Improved dribbling, can work more in speed with the ball and quick change of direction with the ball', 'Improved receiving and ball control, can further improve in quick first touch and attacking play', 'Needs to improve receiving away from the opponents protecting the ball', 'Good ability to turn quickly, needs more work in scanning ahead ', 'Good ability to pass in short range, needs to work on scanning and pass quickly ', 'Good passing in long range, needs more work in aiming the passes in the right direction', 'Good ability to run with the ball, can work more in quick change of direction ', 'Good ability to dribble quickly and find free spaces, can further improve by using more skills', 'Good ability to finish, can further improve in power generation to shoot harder away from keeper', 'Improved heading, needs more work in aligning in line with the ball and head it with accuracy', 'Improved tackling with strong tackles with timing, can further improve in quick change of direction ', 'Improved agility and balance, needs more work in reading the movements and changing directions  ', 'Improved speed, can further improve in speed with the ball in non-dominant foot ', 'Advaith is a player with good focus and willing to learn, he needs to work on the technical aspects mentioned and build quickness to match the intensity of faster gameplay which is required for his age, he is hardworking and consistent, we are pleased to see his progress '),
(2223, 2223, 2, 2, 3, 3, 2, 3, 3, 2, 2, 3, 2, 2, 3, 'Improved dribbling technique, can further improve with using skills to get away from opponents', 'Good receiving technique, needs to work on ball control and first touch ', 'Needs to improve receiving away from the opponents protecting the ball', 'Needs more work in protecting the ball while turning and quickly change direction', 'Good passing, needs more work in adding proper weight of the pass to pass quick and accurately', 'Needs more work in power generation for long range passes which will develop overtime', 'Needs more work in developing speed and direction of acceleration with the ball', 'Improved dribbling, needs more work on scanning ahead to dribble into free spaces and attack', 'Good shooting technique, needs more work in scanning keeper position to shoot with power in long range and place the ball when needed', 'Needs more work in reading the ball and position in line with the ball and head with accuracy', 'Good ability to tackle, needs more work in reading the ball and timing the tackles ', 'Improved agility, balance and coordination, can further improve in change direction  ', 'Needs more work in developing speed with and without the ball which will develop overtime', 'Saatyaki is a player with good focus and willing to learn, she needs to work on the technical aspects mentioned and build quickness to match the intensity of faster gameplay which is required for her age, she is hardworking and consistent, we are pleased to see her progress '),
