(2225, 2225, 3, 2, 3, 3, 2, 4, 3, 3, 3, 4, 2, 2, 3, 'Needs to work on the change of direction and quick dribbling away from opponents using skills.', 'Improved receiving and ball control, can further improve in quick first touch and attacking play.', 'Needs to improve receiving away from the opponents protecting the ball.', 'Needs more work in protecting the ball while turning and quickly change direction.', 'Good ability to pass in short range, needs to work on scanning and pass quickly', 'Needs more work in power generation for long range passes which will develop overtime.', 'Improved technique, needs more work in quickness to accelerate on pushing the ball further.', 'Good dribbling, needs more work in quickly moving the ball into free spaces away from opponents.', 'Needs more work in power generation with direction, which will develop overtime with practice', 'Needs more work in reading the ball and position in line with the ball and head with accuracy.', 'Improved technique, can improve in reading the opponent and anticipate the attacks further.', 'Improved agility, balance and coordination, can further improve in deceleration to change direction.', 'Improved speed, needs more work in changing of pace and decelerate to change direction.', 'Varun is a player with a positive attitude in training. He needs to work on the technical aspects mentioned and needs to focus on improving with more practice and hard work to reach optimal stages of performance. He is in the development phase and needs to be consistent.'),
