INSERT INTO `ci_notes_from_coaching` (`id`, `forms_id`, `notes_frm_tech_dir`, `notes_frm_head_coach`) VALUES
(1, 1, 'good', 'good'),
(2, 2, 'best', 'best'),
(3, 3, '4', '4'),
(4, 4, 'test', 'test'),
(5, 5, 'test', 'test'),
(6, 6, 'Doing good', 'Performed well'),
(7, 7, 'doing well', 'doing well'),
(8, 8, 'Doing awesome', 'Doing awesome'),
(9, 9, 'xxxxx', 'xxxxx'),
(10, 10, 'xxx', 'xxxx'),
(11, 11, 'xxx', 'xxxxx'),
(12, 12, 'Yohan, has always been known for his positive attitude, being highly coachable, good discipline &  possess immense creativity in midfield play.He needs to improve on the physical aspects, including 1v1 duels, headers & be confident in his goal scoring abilities in front of the Goal.Overall a great Athlete to work with.', 'Yohan is showing tremendous patience , commitment and work ethics during last 3 months of pre-season. He has very good positive attitude to the training sessions, players and coaches. He is very receptive to feedback and has good self-assessment of his game. He is well mannered with good discipline on & off field.  Yohan is extremely good in tight spaces and able to link up play very well as a no.10 with good creative play along with his midfielders and forwards. He has very good understanding of time & space and his close control of the ball is very very good. In our style of play with high pressing , high tempo , fast paced football with lot of moments requiring players to win/challenge 1v1 duels through 90 minutes of the game. Yohan is currently & consistently unable to fully match this level of high pressing and high tempo required from our midfielders through the entirety of the match. He understands and is willing to improve this aspect which is very important to our style of play and it is through this style of play that we are able to create high goal scoring chances. We are always trying to emphasize this to Yohan in training sessions along with his conversion rates in front of the goal. All the players & coaches have high regard for Yohan for his creative play and we truly appreciate his game with the ball but we need to improve other areas of the game as that is demand of modern football.  \r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.\r\n'),
(13, 13, 'Abhishek is in his early development phase. He is just experiencing 11V11 football. He needs to be improving in his spatial awareness, speed of thought and speed of play. Technical ability is the main foundation at this level.', 'Abhishek is a young player in the U-13 squad and thus has lot to imrpove and learn this year. We are focusing on development through more training time which will help him improve basic football skills. He is not completely prepared for U-13 competitive matches right now, but hopefully will be till the end of this season.\r\n\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(14, 14, 'Shlok is in his development phase as a centre back. He is displaying much promise in his game. His reading of the game and awareness has been improved compared to 11V11 game. He is fearless and passionate defender. He needs to continuously plus patiently keep working as he has a huge potential in his years ahead.', 'Shlok is a yound upcoming player in U-13 category. There is much for him to imrpove and develop this season. He is open to feedback and tries to reflect on it and bring it in the game. His positive attitude is very good for the team. Technically there are many things to improve which we will be working on through out the season.\r\n\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(15, 15, 'Rishaan is a very disclplined, intelligent and a tactically sound player. He is in his developing phase currently but shows lots of promise and attitude during his training sessions. He possesses good tact of scoring goals. He is very observant and a quick learner.', 'Rishaan is a young upcoming player in the U-13 category. There is much to improve on this season when it comes to technical terms, but in general speaking, I am impressed by Rishaan\'s performance until now. He needs to improve on communication with his teammates in and out of possession and develop strength in his lower body to make long passes and take long shots.\r\n\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(16, 16, 'Steve is a very disciplined and coachable player. He needs to improve on his speed, agility, coordination and aggressiveness.', 'Happy with Steve\'s improvement until now. Many aspects of the game are still raw and developing which is a priority for this season. Much competition in the attacking positions in the team, so needs to keep working hard and improving.\r\n\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(17, 17, 'Ansh is a very coachable player. He has to improve on his spatial awareness and aerial duels. He needs to be more aggressive during tackles.', 'Ansh has improved but still a long way to go. Strength to kick the ball long is missing, which physio is working on. He has a lot of competition in his position this season so has to keep his good attitude and hard-work. Shooting at the right moment and in the right way is something which needs improvement.\r\n\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(18, 18, 'Aman has been in his development phase. He has to work on his agility, long range passing ability and has to be confident during sessions.', 'Aman is developing at a good pace. Physically he is finding it a bit challenging at this point. Better ball technique and improvement in physical aspects is what we are focusing on for this season. \r\n\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(19, 19, 'Karthick is an experienced fullback. He is intelligent and possesses sound tactical positioning. He can improve on his 1V1, aerial duels and non-dominant foot.', 'Kartik\'s improvement has been good through the last season which we wish to continue. His strength needs to increase so that he can execute what he thinks. Defensively he needs to improve his heading capabilities and overall presence in the area. Communication with team-mates in matches should imrpove tp help elevate the team\'s performance.\r\n\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(20, 20, 'Ashuthosh is  well executing his role &  responsibilities as a defensive midfielder with the U18  level in the current competetion. His  tremoimmense focus, concentration & tactical understanding in his role as a defensive midfielder.His colossal game sense under pressure & reading of the game, and untiring attitude on the pitch, to make those quick decision, has on pure merit earned him the spot in the current U18 KSFA League.We are happy with his ongoing progress.He needs to communicate to improve further on his leadership qualities.', 'Ashuthosh is performing well and able to cope up with U18 intensity & level as to this date. He is showing immense focus, concentration & tactical understanding in his role as a defensive midfielder. He is making the cut into the squad on the account his hard work in training. He has more than two years in U18 Category. Let us be patient and keep supporting Ashutosh as his love for the game is immense & he is showing that he could maybe cope at higher levels of football.\r\n**0/1 means the player has not attended/ was absent/ injured during testing, N/A means not applicable for the particular age group'),
(21, 21, 'Kenneth is a very passionate, dedicated, hard working & a complete team player.He has a very positive attitude; and shows maturity in training & in matches.His reading of the game & decision making as when to tackle & when to delay, has earned him the spot in the current squad on merit.He can improve on dealing with headers & can be better in his communication among his teammates.Overall a fantastic athlete to work with.', 'Kenneth is improving and an integral part of the squad with ability to play as CB or WB. He can improve his decision making on when to dribble / when to play in 1 or 2 touch w.r.t his position & situation in the game. He can also improve defensive headers for cross-aerial long balls. Kenneth can also take more leadership responsibility . Overall we are satisfied with his progression . Let us keep improving Kenneth & be patient with his development. \r\n**0/1 means the player was absent/injured during testing. N/A means the test does not apply to the age group'),
(22, 22, 'Shaurya currently has been emerging into a key reliable central defender with a good understanding of his role & responsibilities.He is in his developing phase, but an avid learner of the game.He can further improve on his communication &  switch of play (Long balls).Overall a fantastic team player to work with.', 'Shaurya is currently outperforming in the U18 Category becoming one of the key players in the CB position. Let us still be patient and supportive of his game giving room for error and not over-expect as he is still very young in his category. He can still improve consistency in long balls and his leadership qualities. Let us also make sure that he maintains the work ethic, discipline, and commitment shown in the last 2 years. Overall we are thoroughly impressed and keenly observing his game. '),
(23, 23, 'Tharun has recently joined training sessions. He is an experienced and good technical player. He can be more clinical in front of the goal.', 'Tharun is growing as a player. His game is getting better as he is reacting good to the technical and tactical training here at Boca. He needs to improve his communication with his team-mates while in match and training. He is good at set-pieces as well. He will be competing against ood players in the same position this season. I\'m sure this will spurt his growth further.\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(24, 24, 'Darsh was with the U-13 development squad last season. He has gathered a bit of playing time plus experience. He is developing positively during sessions and is a highly coachable player.', 'Darsh has massively improved on his game from last season. He is a vital part of this year\'s U-13 team but at the same time has much competition at his position from his team-mates. Thus I hope to contnue watching him competing, training more frequently and getting better. He needs to be more punctual for training and matches. (10 mins before training starts and 30 mins before matches start). Otherwise, I\'m also happy with his leadership qualities. His long-range shooting is proving very useful for this team.\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(25, 25, 'shyam has been transitioned from u15 to the u18 category. he is being developed as an attacking midfielder but has been niggling with injuries, and the same is impacting his attendance at the training sessions. he has the ability and potential but has to be quick in his decision-making and shooting at goals. needs to communicate more among teammates', 'SHYAM has become one of the most improved player of this season. if we are looking at his technical ability he is a good player. but tactically he needs to improve a lot. He needs to improve, realize when it is crucial to offer close support and when to stay away, and recognize the proper time to execute wall passes, take over, underlap (combination play) in the middle channel. He has the potential to become a good player while moving further.\r\n**0/1 means the player was absent or injured during the test. N/A means not applicable'),
(26, 26, 'he has just been experiencing the u18 category, towards its intensity, speed, and 1 v 1 duels in the game. he has a good crossing ability, being a left-footer, he needs to improve with his defensive headers and positioning. focus on communication skills also.', 'Athul needs to attend one or two sessions at CSE  because he has good football ability to go further level. if he attended the few sessions at CSE he can play in the first eleven of the team. he has the good technical ability and he shows his versatility with his left foot abilities in the left flank. he needs to improve his defensive header and basic strength to develop further.\r\n**0/1 means the player was absent or injured during the trst. N/A means not applicable'),
(27, 27, 'Mirav has been transitioned from U13 to U15 category this season. He has shown a lot of promise , dedication + passion, with high commitment level during training and matches. He is still in his development phase. He can be move lethal by shooting from outside the box.', 'Mirav is a sensible player with good attitude in and out of the pitch, hard working,dedicated player following instruction and a positive mentality,always giving his best for the team and a versatile player who can go for any position. He has to improve his shooting outside of the box.\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(28, 28, '3', '3'),
(29, 29, 'test', 'test'),
(30, 30, 'test', 'test'),
(31, 31, 'gopi currently through his hard work and dedication, has commented on his position as a center back of the team. he is in his development phase and is showing a lot of promise in his roles and responsibilities. he has to further improve on his speed of play and defensive ariel balls situation. his communication has to be improved among his teammates.', 'gopi is a well-disciplined player on my team. because he is always ready to learn his football roles and responsibilities. if he attended weekly one or two sessions at CSE, he can be an extremely dependable center back for the team. he needs to improve his defensive header and long-range clearance with both feet. \r\n**0/1 means the player was absent or injured during the trst. N/A means not applicable'),
(32, 32, 'Nihal is an intillegent midfielder who understands his role + responsibilities. He has good positional sense + tactical behavior under pressure. Technical qualities are been improved. He can be better in his communication among his teammates.', 'Nihal is an intelligent player who can play under pressure and has the ability to penetrate in the final third. Good in both negative and positive transition moments. Discipline on and off the pitch was also good. He has to improve his communication, and shooting from zone 14 also has to be improved.\r\n** 0/1 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(33, 33, 'Srutaan is currently evolving as a center-back. He is experiencing the nuances of the game. He needs to improve on his spatial awareness and communication.He is in his development phase.', 'Srutaan is still learning the role and responsibilities of center-back. He has a good physique for a center-back. He needs to improve on his communication, aggression, understanding of the game, and awareness.  \r\n ** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(34, 34, 'Karan shows a lot of promise in the training sessions. He adds a lot of value to teams attacking play. He is posses good technical abilities. But can improve on negative transition.  ', 'Karan is center-forward who proved himself in the training and matches. He has good technical abilities to beat the defender he is confident. He can improve his body positioning and negative transition. \r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(35, 35, 'Dhruv. C is an experienced defender. Played and won the U14 KSFA league. Since then, his game has been elevated. He is a complete team player, with good technical + tactical qualities. He can improve on his non-dominant(right foot).\r\n', 'Dhruv. C is a left full-back/center left-back who has shown good technical and tactical qualities in training sessions and matches. He has a good positional sense and ability to deliver good crossing and also an understanding of the game. He can improve his non-dominant foot and control his patience.\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(36, 36, 'he is a dedicated and complete team player. his attitude of being positive to play as a GK, being himself as a winger, for the team purpose has earned massive respect from his coaches and teammates. his versatility is a major bonus to the team as a gk.', 'Aedan is a well-disciplined player.  he is a coachable player always ready to learn his roles and responsibilities and continues to show his versatility with his goalkeeping abilities. he needs to improve his off the ball aggression which means how he behaves after losing a ball. if we look at his technical aspects he needs to improve his crossing ability to put the early cross and late crosses. he needs to focus on his running with the ball and running action also. \r\n**0/1 means the player was absent or injured during the trst. N/A means not applicable'),
(37, 37, 'yair is been experiencing as a defender to play under a lot of intensity, and speed, and thathe has to make quick decision-making stances and recovery runs. overall he possesses a positive attitude and is highly coachable.', 'Yair is a hardworking player he has a good fighting mentality to get in the first eleven of the team. if we are looking at his technical aspects he needs to improve his defensive clearances ( headers, clearing with his side foot). tactically he has to understand his roles and responsibilities while the transition to defense (how he behaves in that situation). he has to know when, where, and how to tackle in a 1v1 situation(body posture in defending). \r\n**0/1 means the player was absent or injured during the trst. N/A means not applicable'),
(38, 38, 'gautham has just been transitioned from the u15 to u18 category. he has good technical abilities. he needs to be more vocal and confident in his game. he can improve on his negative transition. moments without the ball and his finishing skills.', 'gautham has good football ability to go further level. he has good technical ability to perform good football action in the match. if he attended weekly one or two sessions at CSE he can easily understand his roles and responsibilities for the match. he needs to improve his defending quality like 1v1 defending, keeping the defensive shape as well. he has to develop his physical strength and speed to perform his football action. he is lacking verbal communication skills with his teammates may be because he training in a different place.'),
(39, 39, 'he is developing as a fullback and shows good aggressiveness as a defender. his timing of tackle and communication skills can be much better.', 'pushkar is a good player he knows his duties well. he has good football ability to go further level. he is now grown into an extremely dependable full-back for the team. his attacking quality is also good (overlapping, crosses quality). he needs to improve his 1v1 defending ability, long-range throwin, and long-distance kicking also. if we look at his tactical aspects he has to develop his off-the-ball aggression which means how he behaves after losing a ball.'),
(40, 40, 'he has not been regular at the training sessions to sync with the team. he has to improve on his decision-making under pressure situations.', 'ethan needs to attend more training sessions. if he attends more sessions he can be part of the first team. he has good football ability to go further level. he needs to improve his technical aspects like passing and running with the ball. if we look at his tactical aspects he needs to improve on his game awareness and he needs to understand his roles and responsibilities. \r\n**0/1 means the player was absent or injured during the trst. N/A means not applicable'),
(41, 41, 'Rishaan is blessed with a good left foot as he is a technically sound player. He can improve on his negative transition movements during the game. Overall a very highly coachable player.', 'Rishaan Subodh is a very coachable player. I\'m happy with his \'open to learning\' attitude. He plays different positions and is technically sound.\r\nHe needs to improve ability of his weaker foot and communication with his team-mates when the game is going on.\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(42, 42, 'Varun last year was with the U-13 squad, has grown a lot on confidence plus technical plus tactical ability, including decision-making with or without the ball is much positive. He can communicate better with his team-mates on the pitch.', 'Varun gaddam is a very smart player who can play in tight spaces. His decision-making has improved since last season along with his dribbling. Communication with his team-mates needs to improve along with few other technical abilities. Nevertheless, Varun is a coachable player and works hard in training and matches.\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(43, 43, 'Abhinav is a very coachble player. He needs to communicate more on the pitch among his team-mates. He needs to be more aggressive in the game. He has to be more regular during training sessions that will lift up his development in the game.', 'Abhinav is growing in confidence and technical ability on the pitch. He has a lot to learn and experiment this season. He is a smart and task-oriented player while being very coachable.\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(44, 44, 'Yathartha shows a lot of dedication during training session. He has to improve on his speed, agility, aggressiveness and to be more clinical in front of the goal. He is in his develpoment phase. Overall a coachable player, he needs to be more confident.', 'Yathaarth is in his development stage and is showing good commitment to improve. He must be more clinical in front of the goal and work on his physical attributes. He must communicate more with the players around him.\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(45, 45, 'Dylan is developing positively as a center-back. He needs to be consistent in attending the training session tp fuette gel among his teammates in defending positions. He can improve on his endurance levels. Overall a great athlete to work with.', 'Dylan as a center-back understand the role and responsible to reading the game and positioning. He needs to be more regular for training session, So he can improve his endurance and communication among his teammates and gel up understand more with teammates.  \r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(46, 46, 'Satvik shows a lot of promise as a winger attacker through his game. He has good technical abilities to posseses better reading of the game. He is still in his development phase. A better adition to squad.', 'Satvik is versatile player who play winger and center-forward. He is player with has a good technical qualities, In negative transition he is always in mentality to win back the ball. He can improve his crossing as he is in development phase.\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(47, 47, 'Aaryamun is  a passionate, shows good dedication & committment in  developing himself in training.Being  an U18 Athlete,  he has to improve in all   the technical , tactical & physical side of the game.. He needs to show composure & be better the in the1v1 duels. (Aerial & groung balls) Overall a highly coachable Athlete.', 'Aaryamun is extremely dedicated & committed in wanting to improve his footballing skills & knowledge. We appreciate his commitment & efforts. For an U18 Athlete , he has long way to improve in all aspects of the game - technical , tactical & physical. He needs to also play without pressure & should showcase strong mentality in 1v1 duels. He needs to able to excute decisions whether technical & tactical in the game under pressure. Aaryamun has our support but we need to patient with his developement.\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.**'),
(48, 48, 'Rayhaan is an ethusiastic & a  dedicated Footballer.He is experiencing the U18 level, and displays slowly & gradually his understanding towards the Boca Philosophy & style of Play.He shows positive attitude & eagerness to learn to compete in the training environment. He needs to focus on his movement in negative & positive transitions, as per the demands of the game. He needs to improve while defending, off the ball movement, spatial awareness &  during attacking; on his  timing of release of the ball. His speed of thought & speed of Play needs to be much better.Overall a highly coachable player.He is still in his development phase.Overall a highly Coachable player', 'Rayhaan is slowly but steadily improving with more sessions. He is able to understand our game philosophy of wanting to play attacking football but he needs to improve during negative transition moments & needing to aggressive without the ball. Technically with the ball he is good but decision making under pressure should be better. He still has tendency to take too many touches on the ball when it is not required. He is extremely well behaved and has good positive attitude towards all of his team-mates & coaches.\r\n**0/1 means the players has not attended/ was absent/ injured during testing,N/A means not applicable for the particular age group**'),
(49, 49, 'Donald is a dedicated, enthusiastic &  displays a very good work ethics  on the pitch.An avid learner, he desires to improve on his shortcomings & develop further ahead.He needs to improve on his decision making with & without the ball under pressure situations.Overall one of the best athletes with good character, discipline & a complete team player.', 'Donald is a very coachable player with good positive attitude. He listens to all the instructions & tries to excute them in best possible way. He still needs to improve in all areas of the game - Technical , Tactical & Physical . He also needs to consistent in winning 1v1 duels and improve decision making under pressure. Donald has our support but we need to be patient with his development. \r\n**0/1 means the players has not attended/ was absent/ injured during testing,N/A means not applicable for the particular age group'),
(50, 50, 'Nathan is evolving into a decent Centre Back, acknowledging the Boca philosophy, as a senior player, considering his role & responsibilities.His work ethics & discipline in training on & off the field is quite impressive.He can be better in defending on the blind side while dealing with crosses.His communication must be improved, as it is mandatory during the game.', 'Nathan has improved tremendously understanding our play of fast paced attacking football combined with high pressing. He also has effectively understood his role during the high press situations as well . He can still improve lot on his communication w.r.t him being more assertive and commanding in the back line guiding his fellow wingbacks & midfielders . He can also still improve his positioning during crosses. Overall Nathan has improved considerably from last season and he is a very good role model for his team-mates & juniors due to his well behaved,responsible behaviour and his consistent routine on & off field.\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category. '),
(51, 51, 'Sean needs to attend more training sessions, so as to observe & assess his  current level in the U18 category.', 'Sean needs to attend more sessions and be more regular in order to assess his game & level in the U18 category.'),
(52, 52, 'Akshar is currently in his developing phase.He is experiencing & learning to compete through the training sessions.He has a lot to inprove on all the components of the game.(physical , technical , tactical)His attitude is very positive on the pitch.', 'Akshar has shown good commitment to the program. He is consistent to the sessions and is coachable. He tries to follow the instructions to best of his abilities. He has to improve in all areas of the game - physical , technical , tactical. He needs to improve decision making under pressure & also improve in 1v1 duels .He has long way to go in order to play competitive matches in U18 Category but his desire & commitment is commendable. \r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.**'),
(53, 53, 'Ahan, being the Team\'s Captain has shouldered the attacking responsibilities either by assisting or by scoring goals for his team\'s adavantage.He is a dedicated & a highly coachable athlete.He fully understands the Boca Philosophy & the demands of the modern game & is a complete team player.His dribbling & shooting abilities, under pressure are his major strengths.He can communicate better, to be a leader on the field.', 'Ahan has stepped up this season and is an important part of the squad. He is also the team captain. He is very coachable , well behaved and consistent on the pitch . He is terrific with the ball and is able to create goal scoring chances  through his dribbling qualities combined with his physical attributes. He should improve his headers. He can also improve his communication/leadership qualities. Overall, Ahan is on the right track and we are happy with his progress & also impressed by his self motivation to achieve this seasons target.\r\n**0/1 means the players has not attended/ was absent/ injured during testing,N/A means not applicable for the particular age group'),
(54, 54, 'Kian\'s  high work ethics, comittment & positive attitude towards the game is highly impressive.He is a complete team player.His quickness in movement or action on the pitch to chase the ball from the opponents along with his endurance capacities is his hallmark.He is still in his development phase & is experiencing  & learning to improve himself to be better from the U18 competition.', 'Kian is a very well behaved , commited & coachable athelete. He has high endurance levels and is able to press the opponents effectively for long durations of the game. His aggressiveness off the ball suits our style of high pressing. He also has a knack of scoring goals inside the box.  We like his eagerness to learn & improve in every session and also consistently give 100% in every game and session . Kian is still very young in U18 Category and has still another 3 years which has to be carefully nurturted and attented to & at the same time he needs to patient with amount of competitive game time as their are lot of other seasoned and senior players playing in forward position from whom Kian should learn from. We like Kian\'s work ethic & commitment and hope to keep improving him as the season goes on.\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.**'),
(55, 55, 'Krsna is a dedicated & a well disciplined athlete.He is in his development phase, and experiencing the nuances & the demands of the modern game.He is eager to learn & improve himself on the Technical & tactical front, which displays through his attitude in training.', 'Krsna is a well behaved athlete with good positive attitude . He has improved vastly from the time he has been consistent in training sessions and it was very visible last season. This season in U18 demands in technical & tactical aspects of the game are much higher and Krsna is taking time to adjust to this pace of the game. He needs improvement in all areas of the game to sustain in U18 Category . He is still very young and let us be patient in his development and support him. \r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.**'),
(56, 56, 'Vibhin is a dedicated footballer, displaying positive attitude & a hunger to learn and improve on his game.He is in his development phase.He needs to improve while defending, on off the ball movement, spatial awareness &  during attacking; on his  timing of release of the ball.Overall a highly coachable player.', 'Vibhin is slowly but steadly improving. He needs to improve his decision making under pressure and tends to take one too many touches in the midfield. Overall we can sense that he has understanding of space and time but execution needs to be faster.  Negative transition without ball should also be more consistent. Overall , Vibhin is commited to the program and understands the demands of the game . He still needs to fine tune his game in all areas to improve further. \r\n**0/1 means the players has not attended/ was absent/ injured during testing,N/A means not applicable for the particular age group'),
(57, 57, 'Tejas is gradually experiencing the intensity, speed, physicality & endurance levels in the U18 category.He is an avid learner of the game.He has the desire & hunger to get better & improve himself that is displayed through his performances in training & in matches.He is still in his development phase and would suggest not to take any pressure to hurry the process instantly. Overall a highly Coachable athlete to work with.', 'Tejas is slowly adapting but steadily improving in the U18 category. He still continues to show good attitude and is extremely coachable. He is willing to play in any position according to the need of the team. This attitude & positive attitude will take Tejas long way in his character development. He is also very honest about his self assesment after games. He is still very young for the U18 category and we need to give him time in training sessions and friendly matches to adapt to the pace of U18. This year ( and likes of all of his teammates from last season) should be purely seen as year of development for him and all competitive game time he gets should be taken positively for him to learn, reduce mistakes and keep getting better. He also should watch his seniors and more seasoned players in the U18 category to get better and learn from them as well. We have seen Tejas\'s qualities and his contributions last season and we hope he keeps improving and surprising us. \r\n**0/1 means the player was absent/injured during testing. N/A means the test does not apply to the age group'),
(58, 58, 'Harsha has always been known for his sincere dedication, respect & utmost passion to lift his game & teammates followed by technical instruction.\r\nHarsha can improve on his negative transition-without the ball, and can maintain  higher concentration levels during these moment of play.His reading of the game can be improved, through better decision making.Harsha has a bright future ahead if he manages to cope up with the same.', 'Harsha is improving and is an important part of the squad. He can still do better decision making with the ball sometimes unnecessarily dribbling when there is no space and time. Overall we are seeing positive changes in game with him getting into better goal scoring positions & at the same time higher work rate without the ball as well. We will keep track of his progress but as of now he looks to be on the right track. \r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(59, 59, 'Dheer is in his development phase, he is experiencing the game played with higher intensity and physicality. he is an intelligent and coachable player, he needs to be consistent in his game by improving his awareness and quick decision making', 'Dheer has a lot to learn about the game and needs to improve his game all round, especially his aggressiveness on and off the ball and long passing ability, needs to be more physical as a defender, all and all he is a well-behaved and a very coachable player\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(60, 60, 'Saketh is experiencing a competitive football environment he needs to believe in his abilities and deliver positively during training sessions his decision-making under pressure is crucial to contribute to the team, he mostly looks depressed and judges himself critically he is in his development phase and needs to improve his communication abilities', 'Saketh is a player with good ability but he is his own obstacle, the moment he breaks out of his shell he will be improving at a faster rate, he needs to believe in himself and enjoy the game. \r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(61, 61, 'Oka is a passionate, enthusiastic  & a dedicated footballer, and most importantly a team player.His contribution this season, by scoring and assisting goals  to his team mates has been positive.His communication can be better.A highly coachable athlete.', 'Oka has wonderful positive attitude and good work ethic. He gives 100 percent in every training session and match. His energy on the pitch with & without ball is very commendable. He is a good role model for other players to observe and learn from. He has a good knack for scoring goals and at the same time has the ability to take players on. He has vastly improved in the preseason and is playing with good confidence so far in the state league scoring some important goals for the team. He can improve his communication with his teammates on the pitch & also his leadership qualities to guide younger players in his team. Overall very good progress so far.\r\n**0/1 means the player has not attended/ was absent/ injured during testing, N/A means not applicable for the particular age group '),
(62, 62, 'Naman has just progressed from u13 to u15 category. He has been in and out, reason being injuries etc. He is passionate and shows lot of interest in training. He needs to work on his technical abilities under pressure, spatial awareness and physicality as the game is more demanding. His endurance levels also has to be better. ', 'Naman has been developing. He needs to be mentally strong, He also needs to work on his technical, communication, awareness, and physical. He needs to come more on team training to gel up with the team to develop his confidence.\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(63, 63, 'Adwaith has always been  known as an ethusiastic,  sharp, intelligent & a fearless attacking minded Footballer.This season being in the U18 category, is a learning experience & preparation to be vastly superior  to match the Intensity, speed,endurance level  & physicality as per the demands of the modern game.I trust Adwaith\'s potential, but have to mention, that he needs to be consistent & regular for the training sessions.Overall a great Athlete to work with.', 'Adwaith is slowly adapting to the U18 Category. We have no doubts in his ability but he needs to be consistent in the training sessions with the team. This year he needs to get all the training and friendly matches in order to be fully ready to challenge consistently for his spot in the team. This year as told to him and others who have come up to the senior batch is that it is a year to get as much exposure to U18 category as possible and also to visually learn from his more seasoned colleagues. Adwaith still has good negative transition and has good vision with the ball. He needs to improve his headers & goal-scoring rates.\r\n**0/1 means the player has not attended/ was absent/ injured during testing, N/A means not applicable for the particular age group'),
(64, 64, 'Rushil has been developing as a footballer he has to be confident in his ability. he understands the dynamics of the game he needs to be more aggressive in 1v1s, aerial balls, and most importantly quicker in negative transitions. his endurance levels need to be better and he has to be regular in training', 'Rushil is a player who tends to understand the game and is curious to learn about it, his questions to me as a coach about the game are of good spirit. a talented individual but is being held back by his own fitness issue, the sport is demanding and Rushils is having a tough time keeping up. once he gets more fit his improvement will be of a much faster pace'),
(65, 65, 'Harrison is been refined as an attacking winger, Through training and matches. He shows lot of character and promise along with passion in his games. He needs to manage his emotions positively during the various situation of the game. He a terrific left footer. he can improve on his negative transition. Overall a good addition to squad. ', 'Harrison is a left-footer. Since He has a great quality of crosses his position was change from stricker to winger to deliver the ball into the box. He needs to control his emotion positively and be patience. He can improve his first touch, heading and negative transition.'),
(66, 66, 'Aayush is a dedicated & a passionate Footballer eager to learn & improve.Aayush currently should step up on his negative transition, moments without the ball.His endurance levels should improve. He has to match to cope up the intensity of U18 matches. Overall a brilliant technical player with good composure levels displayed under pressure.', 'Aayush is improving steadily by slowly. He is still trying to match the level of U18 football with its higher pace and physicality compared to the U14 level he played tremendously well last year. He missed lot of training session in the first two months of pre-season so he is still in a bit of catchup phase w.r.t others in his position. Aayush needs to play the game at a higher tempo in the midfield, need to stop taking too many touches in the midfield. Aayush is still terrific in dead ball situations. Let us be patient with Aayush this year as he ( as well as others who have come up from U14s to U18s) needs to grasp the pace of U18 level of football by training as much as possible along with as much friendly matches with his more experienced & seasoned colleagues. Any Competitive game time he gets should be taken as an opportunity to learn , reduce mistakes and become better.'),
(67, 67, 'Aryan has been a dedicated & a passionate footballer to the game.His contribution to the team has been very positive in attack & in defense.He is very talented & displayed great adroitness & proficiency through  his game.He has good vision & goal scoring abilities which gives him an edge over his opponents.He can improve on his communication skills on the pitch to guide his players.', 'Aryan is quickly adapting well in the U18 category scoring important goals as well showing versitality by playing in multiple positions with ease and confidence. He missed majority of our pre-season in June & July but showing his qualities by adpating to higher level of football much faster. Let us support Aryan in his efforts to improve him further.'),
(68, 68, 'Divyaj this season has shown a lot of comittment in his training, and has synced with the teams philosophy \r\n& mentality on the field.His  towering presence in the goal & top notch ability of goal kicks are positively benefitting the team.He must continuw with the same zeal & passion to take his team in a good position.', 'Divyaj is playing with good confidence and contributing to team\'s good results on the field. He has good presence in the goal and his goal kicks are creating problems for good opponents as well. Let us keep improving Divyaj while keeping his level of confidence high at same time keeping him grounded so that he does not get carried away. Overall impressed with his on field performance in the last 4 months.'),
(69, 69, 'Sanat is in his development phase. Last season he has experienced 11V11 football which should help his confidence to the game. He needs to be more aggressive as a defender during tackles, spatial awareness plus agility can be improved,', 'Sanat has improved a lot from last season. He is in his developing stage and needs to polish few basics and tactical understanding of the game. I\'m happy with his current performances considering his improvement. He is a natural leader on the pitch but a bit shy when speaking to a group or other team-mates.\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(70, 70, 'Ryan is in his early development phase. He is currently in the U-11 Alchemy squad. He is learning and experiencing form his senior U-13 player the nature of 11V11 football.', 'Ryan is in his development stage and a young player in U-13 category. He need more work on his basics as he is new to the 11-a-side game. Happy with his committment and willingess to improve his game. He is a great team-mate and gives his all whenever given a chance to play. He\'s enjoying his game time with more focus on development this season.\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(71, 71, 'Soham is in his developing phase. He is experiencing 11 V 11 Football in training and right now with U-11 team & he has to improve his technical and tactical ability, he is a beginner,  so let\'s give him time to experience and learn. He has to improve on his defending ability and spatial awareness. He is missing a lot of training sessions. Overall a very coachable player', 'Sohum has potential to be a good footballer. He has decent technical ability with a good eye for goal, he can be a finisher inside the penalty area. He needs to build on his physical side of the game and believe in himself, be confident that he can improve his ability. He needs to be regular for sessions and face the challenge to improve '),
(72, 72, 'Gourav is in his development phase. He is gradually improving as a technical player. More emphasis he should lay on the same, as without technical quality, tactical superiority is difficult. He has the vision to play under pressure but has to be more consistent. It should be coming by attending more training session and experiencing which will boost his confidence level. Overall a very coachable player. He has ability in years ahead, potentially to evolve as a better footballer.', 'Gourav is in his development stage currently. He needs to polish basic techniques in football. He is getting good exposure by playing and training alongside good players. His willing to learn and positive attitude is second to none.\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(73, 73, 'Adithya has recently joined training sessions. He has the football brain to make quick decisions in the game to help his team. He has to more committed in defence play with his endurance level, negative transition. Overall he is a brilliant technical footballer.', 'Adithya has gained massive experience from last season which is visible when he trains and plays matches. His is gifted with creativity when he plays and is a joy to watch him. Decision-making while having the ball can improve. There are few physical aspects like agility and quickness which will improve with more consistent training.'),
(74, 74, 'he is his development player, he is a dedicated and highly coachable player. he has to improve his spatial awareness and agility under pressure to make better and faster decisions. currently, he is playing in the center-back position and experiencing his roles and responsibilities under the playing system', 'kevin is a hardworking player. he has good physical attributes if we are comparing him with other u18 players. he has to improve his confidence level, mentally he needs to be strong. if we look at his technical ability also he needs to improve on his inside foot clearance, long-range kick and dribbling as well. tactically he wanted to focus on his positioning and decision-making skills also.\r\n\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(75, 75, 'aditya is a highly dedicated footballer and shows a lot of passion to improve himself on the pitch. however, during match situations, he tends to put himself under a lot of pressure and loses focus and concentration during defending, his speed of thoughts and speed of play must improve along with his tackling abilities under pressure', 'aditya is a hardworking player. always he is a hunger to learn and shows a good attitude during training sessions. he is not a born talented player but his hardworking mentality may make him a good player when he moves to a further level. technically he needs to improve more especially in defensive heading, 1v1 defending, and passing accuracy also. tactically he has to improve off-the-ball aggression and execute his proper roles and responsibilities.');
INSERT INTO `ci_notes_from_coaching` (`id`, `forms_id`, `notes_frm_tech_dir`, `notes_frm_head_coach`) VALUES
(76, 76, 'he is a very passionate and dedicated footballer. he needs to believe in his ability and focus on his game. as an attacker he needs to be more clinical in front of the goal. his attitude in negative transition is quite good.', 'rakshit is a technically sound player. he is good in 1v1 dribbling, he can easily dribble the opponent players. if we look at his technical ability he lacks shooting techniques inside the box and outside the box so he has to improve his shooting techniques. tactically he needs to improve aggression on the ball and off the ball, and decision-making to execute proper football action. he needs to improve his physical attributes also strength and speed as well.\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(77, 77, 'manith is a dedicated footballer and highly coachable. he has to improve on his defensive header and speed agility for his recovery runs.', 'Manith has good physical attributes to be a football player. He has to work more on his technical aspects like defensive headers, long-range clearance with his side foot, and passing accuracy. if we look at his tactical aspects he has to improve positioning and decision making where to pass and when to pass. he needs to improve his speed and agility.\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(78, 78, 'karan is a dedicated footballer, always committed to training. he mostly overworks on burs out post-training, due to gym addiction without notice of the coaches. his concentration levels must improve, so as the decision-making under pressure', 'Karan is a hardworking player. He has become a regular player attending most of the sessions. if he can focus on his nondominant foot he can be a good center forward for the team. he needs to improve on finishing with his non-dominant foot and shooting from outside the box. if we look at his tactical aspects he has to improve on tackling and decision-making when he gets good pressure from opponents.\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(79, 79, 'Suchir needs to attend regular team training session to amalgamate with his team.He has been developing as a defensive mid-fielder.He can improve on his spatial awareness and shooting on goal. Overall a highly coachable player.', 'Suchir is developing in mid-fielder. He needs to come regular for team training session to gel up with his team mate and talk more understand with his team mate. He can improve his awareness communication and shooting on goal from zone 14.\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(80, 80, 'Aarush is a highly coachable player. He is in his development phase. He has to improve on his dicision making, With his speed of thought and speed of play. Overall He needs to compete for his position in the squad. He can be better in his communication skills among his team mate.', 'Aarush is developing in fullback. He needs to be positive and fight for his position in the team. Overall he needs to be mentally strong ,work hard and be patience. He can improve his awareness , decision making and communication.'),
(81, 81, 'Akshay is developing positively as a center-back.His positional sense and tactical awareness are improved. He needs to be attending more session to gel up with his teammates. He can improve his endurance levels. overall a highly coachable player.', 'Akshay greatly developed in center-back. He understand the instruction and quick learner. His positional sense, reading the game and tactical awareness is highly better. He has good attitude on and off the pitch, with and withou the ball . He can improve his communication and endurance. '),
(82, 82, 'Arjun has been one of the talented winger in the team. His speed and finishing skills are his hallmark. He can work on the negative transition moments in his team. He needs to be more regular for the team training session to elevate his game.', 'Arjun is attacking winger. He has good pace and finishing skills. He can work on more crossing , He can improve his  awareness and negative transition and He needs more training session to gel up with his teammate.'),
(83, 83, 'Sacha is a very dedicated and a passionate player. He needs to communicate more , Show confidence and lead the attack. He can improve more on the negative transition moments of the game. He can use his height to his advantage to win the aerial duels. Overall a highly coachable player.', 'Sacha is developing as a winger. A coachable player who follows the instruction, He is technically good and brave. He can improve his communication, crossing and finishing.'),
(84, 84, 'Aiden has shown improvement since his joining at BOCA. He has ability to score goals in game situations. He is currently deployed as a centre-back or sometimes as winger. He is in his development phase.', 'Aiden is in his developement phase as a winger , full-back and center-back. He has the ability to driblle crosses and finishing on the goal. He can improve his awareness, body position and communication.  '),
(85, 85, 'Chemi has been on of the most experienced player in the team. He is a versatile footballer can play in various attacking or defending position to the requirement of the team. He is a leader and has the ability to change the outcome of the match.', 'Chemi\'s is a versatile player who can play any position on the requirement of team. He has good speed and good technical abilities. He can improve his decision-making in the finishing third.\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is injured during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(86, 86, 'Wanshanbok is transition from u13 team to u15 category. He is hardworking , Brave and emerging into a fine center-back. He has a good ability to read the game and timing of his tackle along with heading.', 'Wanshanbok is a young brave and outstanding player, He is a center-back who can play any position in the needs of the team. He takes any challenge like tackle, heading, and body to body. He can improve on his listening to follow instructions and finishing.\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is injured during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(87, 87, 'Henlenmang is developing into a promising mid-fielder. He has the attributes of a professional footballer. His speed of thought and speed of play under pressure is quite impressive. He can improve on his positioning during negative transition.', 'Henlenmang is a mid-fielder developing highly. He has the ability to recieve the ball under pressure and has the neck of penetrating passes and also shoots in the goal requirement of the situation. He can improve his positional awareness depending on the situation.\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is injured during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(88, 88, 'Washim has been effectively developing as a center-back. His timing of tackle and heading abilities; Along with aggression to win the ball has cemented his position . He can improve on his spatial awareness.', 'Washim is developing as a center-back. He has physical, tackle, heading and aggresive to play as a center-back. He can improve on his awareness reading the game and communication with his teammate.\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is injured during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(89, 89, 'Digbijoy is one of the most talented player. His reading of the game and tactical understanding under pressure , makes him one of the most prominent player in the squad. He also has a knack of scoring long range goal.', 'Digbijoy is a mid-fielder and he is top player of the team. He has the quality of dealing with under pressure and long range shooting at the goal. He also has a good technical and tactical qualities, reading the game and winning the ball in a negative transition. He can improve his awareness. \r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is injured during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(90, 90, 'Nicky is a highly passionate, dedicated and one of the most hard working GK\'s .His eagerness to learn and attitude in training has been one of the hallmark of his development phase. He can improve on his gripping and his dealing with aeriel ball.', 'Nicky is a hard working GK\'s, He is fully dedicated, passoinate and he is always eager to learn to prove himself. he highly developed his distribution during the match.I believe He can become a great GK\'s training under BOCA with his mentality. he can improve his gripping, dicision making and aeriel ball.'),
(91, 91, 'Lokshith is in his developing phase. He is experiencing the game of 11 V 11 right now with U-11 team. He is improving on his 1V1, positioning and shooting  abilities. We\'re working on his basics overall a coachable footballer.He has good potential ahead He can improve on his non dominant R foot.\r\n\r\n', 'Lokshith is improving in a good and steady pace, this is his first competitive season where he\'s challenging and he has handled it well, his work rate and ethic is increasing from game to game and so is his technical ability. But still a lot of room for improvement. He needs to  add and work on his physical ability and decision making on the ball. Otherwise he has made good progress '),
(92, 92, 'he mostly is injured during training sessions, and due to rehab, has to sync with the team. he has to improve on his spatial awareness and decision-making under pressure.', 'Shanen is a hardworking player. if he was not injured he may the part of the first team, but because of his injury, he missed some of the sessions. he needs to improve on his defending 1v1, speed, and agility also. if we look at his tactical aspects he needs to focus on the execution of his roles and responsibilities during a match. \r\n** 0/1 means the player has not attended/is absent / injured during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(93, 93, 'he is a very dedicated and as enthusiastic footballer. his positive attitude displayed on and off the pitch is admirable. his urgency to learn and improve himself every session will take him a long way ', 'mahimana\'s commitment level is good off the field and on the field. he is practicing with the u18 team the level of football in the u18 category is advanced level and more physicality needs to show, so for him to play in the first eleven is very difficult because of his physical attributes. he has two more years in the same category so maybe next year I hope he can play in the first eleven. he needs to improve on his off-the-ball. aggression and on-the-ball aggression. he has to improve his strength and speed also.\r\n**0/1 means the players has not attended/ was absent/ injured during testing,N/A means not applicable for the particular age group'),
(94, 94, 'he is one of the dedicated and highly coachable footballers, his strength is his dribbling ability in tight space. however, he needs to step up in finishing at goal as a midfielder. also, his communication has to be improved', 'sudeve is a technically sound player, he has good dribbling skills if we are comparing other players. if we look at his technical aspects he needs to improve on his long-range shooting and finishing inside the box (accuracy). tactical aspects he has to know when he wanted to release the ball and when he wanted to penetrate the defense line (decision making). physical attributes he has to gain the strength and speed to play in the u18 category.\r\n**0/1 means the players has not attended/ was absent/ injured during testing,N/A means not applicable for the particular age group'),
(95, 95, 'veer is evolving as a center back, where he is experiencing, 11 v 11 football with intensity, physicality speed, and decision making under pressure. In this category, technical quality and tactical brilliance played a major role, especially in dealing with headers under various match situations. overall a brilliant footballer always eager to learn and improve himself', 'veer\'s commitment and hard work have become a clear example to others in the squad. he is an extremely dependable center back of the team. if we look at his technical aspects he needs to improve on his defensive headers and 1 v 1 defending. tactically he needs to improve on his decision-making skills according to the situations. he needs to develop strength and agility to develop further.\r\n**0/1 means the players has not attended/ was absent/ injured during testing,N/A means not applicable for the particular age group'),
(96, 96, 'he has been gradually improving as a winger. he needs to be better in his spatial awareness and negative transition. he can be more aggressive in aerial duels and improve on his communication among his teammates. he has the potential to be an elite professional football. overall a highly coachable player and an intelligent player.', 'ishaan is one of the extremely dependable left winger for the first team. after his injury he recovered quickly and he joins with the team. he is a technically sound player. he needs to improve on his nondominant foot ability while crossing from the left flank. tactically off-the-ball aggression he needs to improve which means how he behaves after losing a ball. he needs to develop his strength to develop further and for injury prevention.\r\n**0/1 means the players has not attended/ was absent/ injured during testing,N/A means not applicable for the particular age group'),
(97, 97, 'marzin is a passionate and dedicated footballer, he after gets injured, and he misses a lot of team training. during injuries, when he lets his confidence down and be depressed, he needs to think positively and work on the development of his game.', 'marzin misses some of the sessions because of his injury. if he was able to attend those sessions he can be a part of the team. his commitment and hardworking mentality are good. technically he needs to improve more especially 1 v 1 dribbling, running with the ball and shooting. if we look at his tactical ability he has to improve on his off-the-ball aggression and on-the-ball aggression. decision making of when, where, and how to pass in the match situation.\r\n**0/1 means the players has not attended/ was absent/ injured during testing,N/A means not applicable for the particular age group\r\n'),
(98, 98, 'he is one of the key winger, on the side, mainly his teammates to score. he can be developed better as an elite footballer but needs to manage his injuries. overall a big asset to the team.', 'nabhi has become one of the top quality player on the team. he has good technical ability to perform 1v1 dribbling. he has become an extremely dependable right winger for the team. he needs to develop the strength to prevent injury. he wanted to maintain the same performance level till the season ends. he needs to improve his techniques when crossing from the right flank.\r\n**0/1 means the players has not attended/ was absent/ injured during testing,N/A means not applicable for the particular age group'),
(99, 99, 'Vedanth is a dedicated footballer with a positive attitude in training. he is developing as an attacker, where he can contribute more as a midfielder. he can be consistent with his moment with and without the ball. His communication can be improved on the pitch.', 'vedanth is a technically sound player. his hardworking mentality is good. because of injury, he missed some of the sessions. if he attends all sessions he can be part of the first team. he needs to improve on his shooting and finishing inside the 18 yards box. if we look at his tactical ability he needs to take a quick decision to make a pass ( where, when, and how to pass). He has to develop his strength to prevent his injury.\r\n**0/1 means the player has not attended/ was absent/ injured during testing, N/A means not applicable for the particular age group'),
(100, 100, 'Ryan is in his development phase. he is still in transition from Academy football to 11 a side football, he can still do better especially with his communication and aggression on and off the ball', 'Ryan is player with potential but needs to commit more to his improvement, good player with a good personality but needs to show it more on the field. a coachable  player who understands instructions very easily, hopefully, he can improve his communication on the field\r\n\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(101, 101, 'At late vibulan is slowly stepping up the ladder through his hard work and effort at training sessions. he has to continue to master the basics of the game. he has been showing a hunger to learn and will improve further', 'Vibulan lately has shown a great improvement in training but needs to apply the same in the matches, I\'m sure he will apply it if he keeps pushing as he has been so far. needs to be more aggressive on and off the ball and improve his communication aspect of the game.\r\n\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is injured during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.\r\nI\'m looking forward to see how much Vibulan will grow as a player'),
(102, 102, '', ''),
(103, 103, 'Kayan as a midfielder is in his development phase. he is intelligent to understand the coaching instructions but needs to deliver more output in his awareness scanning and quick decision making. he needs to be aggressive in aerial = ground 1v1 duels and since he has missed training sessions for a while his endurance level has to be increased to fulfill his duty as a midfielder. overall a highly coachable player', 'Kayan is a smart player who is good with the ball but needs to improve a lot on his off-the-ball work rate and commitment to win the ball aggressively. fitness needs to be worked on and the negative transition, he is curious to learn about the game and he is self-confident. he has a lot more to learn and should be committed to the team\r\n** 0 means the player has not attended/is absent during testing and N/A means not applicable for the age category.'),
(104, 104, 'he has been growing in confidence playing as a striker. he needs to believe in himself more in his ability, and be more patient rather than frustrated with his goal-scoring tendencies. he has knowledge of the game but needs to be quicker in decision making and lead the team in the attack by shouldering the responsibilities. his work rate of the ball must be better', 'Nishcal is great boy whos capable of finishing in and out of the penalty box but needs to convert his chances more. his negative transition needs to improve and his left foot needs to be worked on more. overall he\'s a well-mannered player with a good football IQ but needs to put in more work as I have high expectations of him.\r\n\r\n*Nischal was not present during the assessment.'),
(105, 105, 'he has been developing as one of the key defenders of the team, displaying tremendous aggression and physicality and decent set-piece abilities. nonetheless, he needs to be aware of the moments of the game and be proactive. when to tackle when to delay, overall a great asset to the team', 'Ujjwal\'s tenacity is second to none in Boca. his persistence in trying to get the ball away from the opponent is something I admire. very good long-range shots and physicality. puts his heart out in each and every game but he needs to know when where and how\'s of football. his greatest ability is his greatest weakness, his intensity is always high and sometimes he needs to calm down and delay to help the team rather than jump into tackles. all in all, a great player and regular in training.'),
(106, 106, 'Ashok has been transitioned from the u13 to the u15 category. Ashok is dedicated, passionate, and a team player. Ashok has improved since the last session but now has a new challenge in his game, experiencing the speed of play, aerial, and defending on transition play. Ashok\'s commitment is highly appreciated.', 'Ashok has been improving at a steady pace, his Eagerness to learn is good to see as his coach. he needs to increase his pace and be more aggressive on and off the ball, work on his composure on the ball and increase ball manipulation skills. all in all he\'s a good player with a great attitude towards the sport.'),
(107, 107, 'Abhijay is been shaping up as a Defender CB/LB. he has been transitioning from u13 to u15. he can improve on his non-dominant foot (R) and spatial awareness and quick decision-making under pressure. a good disciplined and a highly coachable player', 'Abhijay is a good Defender capable of playing CB and LB, physically gifted, and has an eagerness to learn. he needs to work on understanding his role in both these positions and differentiate between then. work on his speed and decision making and aerial threat\r\nall in all a good player who\'s highly coachable'),
(108, 108, 'Adesh has developed as a defender since last season. U15 category is highly demanding and the expectations of the speed of thought and speed of play are of paramount importance. he can improve on his non-dominant foot, communication, and awareness', 'Adesh has been developing as a defender very well, he has good long passing range and ability, and he should improve on his composure, defensive awareness, and running posture. he needs to communicate to his team on and off the field too. adesh is still in his developing phase hopefully he can be more consistent in training and reach his potential'),
(109, 109, 'he needs to work on his football basics and be regular in training. Ishaan is in his development phase', 'Ishaan needs to get his basics right and needs to improve on his all-round game, and turn up in training more regularly.'),
(110, 110, '', ''),
(111, 111, 'he is gradually developing as an attacker. his reading of the game and decision-making under pressure can be much better. he needs to communicate more on the pitch. overall a highly coachable player.', 'muthanna is a well-disciplined player on the team. his technical ability is good. but if we look at his tactical ability, he needs to improve on his verbal communication with his teammates inside the pitch and off-the-ball aggression which means how he behaves after losing a ball also needs to improve.\r\n**0/1 means the player has not attended/ was absent/ injured during testing,N/A means not applicable for the particular age group'),
(112, 112, 'he is developing as a left fullback, he needs to be effective in ariel duels and his recovery runs in defense. he has to be more aggressive on the field most importantly be confident in his game and communicate effectively.', 'deepak is one of the most talented left footer and left fullback on the team. if we look at his technical aspects he needs to improve on his defensive headers and crosses with his left foot. and tactically he needs to improve on his off-the-ball aggression which means how he behaves after losing a ball. also, he has to improve on his leadership attitude and communication with his teammates.\r\n**0/1 means the player was absent or injured during the trst. N/A means not applicable'),
(113, 113, 'he is one of the key player on the team. his ability to dribble, pass and shoot under pressure is his strength. he needs to focus more and be clinical in a shoot at the goal.', 'nibo is a key player on the team he has good technical ability and he creates a lot of individual moments during a match. he has to improve on his communication with his teammates . and work on his accuracy in shooting at the goal.'),
(114, 114, 'he is experiencing learning to cope up to the u18 level intensity and speed of play. his attitude is positive and displays an urgency to improve.', 'apoorv is a hardworking player always ready to learn his roles and responsibilities. but he needs time to adapt to U18 intensity and level of standard. he needs to improve on his technical aspects of dribbling, 1v1 duels, shooting and defending also. he is a highly coachable player and may become a good talent for next season.\r\n**0/1 means the players has not attended/ was absent/ injured during testing,N/A means not applicable for the particular age group'),
(115, 115, 'he is developing as a  good defensive midfielder. he has to communicate better and improve on his shooting abilities.', 'he is a good player and doing a key role in the team as a defensive midfielder. his aggression is also good in off the ball. he needs to improve on his shooting with both feet. decision-making also needs to improve.'),
(116, 116, 'he is dedicated, passionate and the leader of the team. his versatility is the hallmark. his decision-making under pressure is quite remarkable. he plays as a centre-back and attacking midfielder. he can improve his communication skills. overall a big asset to the team.', 'zaula is one of the main walls of the team. his technical ability is good. he has become a leader of the team and has a key role in the team. he needs to improve on his decision-making skill while the transition to attack. he can be an elite footballer when he moves further level. he needs to control his emotions while playing a match. overall perfect fit for the team and Boca environment.'),
(117, 117, 'Phonlang is a promising Footballer  &  now he is experiencing  the U18 competition. He observes the situation, is a quick learner & adapts well to the situation by contributing positively through his assists & goals for his team.He has the Senior & experieced Strikers along side, like Ahan, Jomon & Oka where he is learning, interacting & improving himself to be the best in his position.He can focus & show more concentration, comparatively to last season. He can be better with his communication skills.Overall a talented & a highly coachable athlete to work with.', 'Phonlang is adapting well to U18 category. He is very coachable & well behaved with good attitude. He is showing lot of promise and has traits to make it professional in the game if he shows more concentration & focus off the ground. He also needs to improve his communication skills.'),
(118, 118, '', ''),
(119, 119, 'Anish is a very good technical player & has in a short time synced within the team.His passing quality are highly impressive.But he can work more to improve on his spatial awareness & moments without the ball', 'Anish has come during the middle of pre-season and adjusted very well in short amount of time becoming an important player in the midfield. He has good vision with good technical ability. He needs to improve his scanning and needs to release the ball quicker in certain occasion.'),
(120, 120, 'Jomon is a hardworking, intelligent and a brilliant striker.His ability through his  lightning fast speed, quality ball control under pressure & quick decision making rates him one of the lethal striker in the team. His positive attitude to learn & excel sets him apart from the others.He has a bright professional Football career ahead of him.He can improve on his communication skills & also  cope up better with his injuries.', 'Jomon is a very versatile player capable of playing in multiple position. He is most effective playing no.9 with his clinical finishing & ability to even take two players with his dribbling qualities. He has very good attitude , able to mingle well with all his teammates. He has all the traits to become a professional footballer in future if he is able to manage his injuries better. '),
(121, 121, 'Rohen is a speedy winger & has the attributes of a modern winger in Footballer.His knack to find spaces, through his agility & goal scoring prowess makes him effective & gives him a big advantage in the team.He can improve on his vision & communication', 'Rohen is extremely quick and has traits to play winger in the future . He has good attitude to work hard , train well and give everything for the team. He needs to improve his communication & combination play with his team-mates.'),
(122, 122, 'Kristopher is a passionate, hardworking and has been developing  to be steadfast as a defender & a winger(Whenever team requires)His commitment to the team has been highly impressive.He can improve to be quicker to release the ball when in possession.', 'Kristopher has improved vastly and has ability to play both a Wingback & Centerback with ease. He can also play as a winger when required. He is a good role model with his work ethics and leadership qualities. He is very dependable and a complete team player. He can improve his decision making with ball to give more consistency to his game. '),
(123, 123, 'Sam is a hardworking & one of the most versatile players in the squad.His speed, physicality & long range shooting ability are his hallmark.However he can improve on his speed of thought, through reading of the game & make better decision making to upgrade his level.Overall a big asset to the team.', 'Sam has improved vastly and can play multiple position making him a complete team player. He can play CB,WB,Winger or striker and can be really effective in all these positions. He needs to improve his decision making in front of the goal. He is also a good role model for the players around him. '),
(124, 124, 'Gerrard is one of the most technically & tactically sound & a crafty attacking minded left footed player in the squad.He has to cope up with his injuries & also  positional awareness during negative transition.Overall a talented & a coachable player in the squad.', 'Gerrard has already established himself as very gifted midfielder with his ability to get out of pressure consistently and release the ball forward for his team-mates. He can still improve his decision making as well manage his injuries better.'),
(125, 125, 'Balram is in his development stage, he\'s currently experiencing high intensity and speed of play. needs to be quick in decision making and aerial duels, balram needs to be stronger as its what the game demands. a great learner and a disciplined player', 'Balram has a lot to learn and needs to play football with courage, confidence, and intent.  needs to work on his communication and gel with his teammates. he\'s a disciplined boy and understands his instructions well.\r\n\r\n*Balram was not present during the assessment.'),
(126, 126, 'Manwanth is in his development phase. he needs to be regular in training sessions to compete with the squad and sync with the team. u15 level the speed of play, intensity, and decision-making under pressure is all vital elements of the game and he needs to improve on that along with his fitness', 'Manwanth has more to develop as he is still getting used to the u15 level and he needs to improve his fitness, and his overall game and take the sport a bit more seriously if he needs to improve on it. all and all he\'s a good player with an ability to understand coaching instructions'),
(127, 127, 'Dhruv is in his transitional phase from u13 to the u15 category. he has the technical ability and tactical brilliance but has to adapt to the intensity and the speed of play along with his physicality in this category. overall a brilliant athlete to work with', 'Dhruv is a player with great potential. he needs to be more patient with himself and get his confidence back to the best. work on his right foot and play more passes into space. his negative transition has improved. overall he\'s a great player with a good eagerness to learn and improve and a great attitude'),
(128, 128, 'yatharth is in his development phase and is transitioning from u13 to the u15 category. he needs to be more consistent in attending team training sessions. he has the ability and potential as an attacker. the u15 match intensity speed of play and endurance is high he needs to match up to it', 'Yatharth is in his transitional phase from u13 to u15, he is a good dribbler and very good at winning back the ball with high tenacity, he can improve his game a lot more albeit if he turns up in training, he needs to work on his decision making and the understanding of the game. looking forward to see him more in training'),
(129, 129, 'Pradyun shows a lot of promise in training sessions. he is aggressive and committed to the game. he has an ability to find the player in space through his intelligent sense of passing. he needs to communicate and improve his shooting outside the box', 'Pradyun is a very smart player with a keen sense of passing, his through balls are of great quality, pradyun needs to work on his shooting outside the box and communicate more on the field. all in all, he\'s a good player with a great attitude, and more is yet to come from him. highly coachable player'),
(130, 130, 'Ashrith needs to be more regular in team training. he has a decent speed of play, he needs to be more communicative and be more clinical around the goal, and he tends to arrive in goal-scoring opportunities as a midfielder. ', 'Ashrith has a great progressive play style with good dribbling skills, he needs to work on his long-shot ability and be more aggressive off the ball. he needs to be regular in training, overall a highly coachable player who understands the instructions given to him'),
(131, 131, 'Siddharth is dedicated and shows a lot of discipline as a CB. he is in his development phase, experiencing and learning the tactical side and positioning of the game. he can be better in his decision-making. overall a fantastic player to work with', 'Siddharth is a committed player who is adamant to improve and prove himself, has a good long ball passing ability and range, keeps the defense line in check and is vital to the team. he can improve on his decision-making and understanding of the way the team plays and attacking headers.'),
(132, 132, 'ameen is in his development phase, he has to master the basics and the reading of the game. his verbal and non-verbal communication has to be improved. he seems new to 11v11 football. he needs to learn to play under this pressure and intensity and challenging endurance', 'Ameen needs to get his basics right. he still has allot to learn. he needs to have positive body language and communicate well with the coaches and players and be focused while training'),
(133, 133, 'He has the potential to be a promising footballer. he needs to be more focused and communicate among teammates and coaches and take ownership. he has a knack for surprising opponents with crucial goals and assists. good with both feet and a good athlete to work with', 'Gouguun is a talented footballer able to surprise opponents and coaches. but he needs to focus more on training and do the basics right, work on his scanning, and on his communication on and off the field. very good with both his feet and a crafty player. overall a great player capable of way more'),
(134, 134, 'Ram, Since he transitional from U13 to U15 category. He has the technical and tactical ability. He has to be more physical dominant in duels. Overall he is a highly coachable player.he is currently experiencing and learning to deal the naunces of the game under pressure situation.', 'Ram has good technical and tactical . He is a coachable player . He need to improve to deal with under pressure and negative transition. '),
(135, 135, 'Vishwajit is a young player, who is currently in his developing phase. More work is needed on his technique which will improve with more and more practice through out this season. He needs to be more aggressive without the ball.', 'Vishwajit has good potential but needs to work hard ti bring that potential to surface. Basic techniques like first touch, long passing, headers, dribbling, etc needs to improve. He is new for 11-a-side, thus with time and more training session will slowly get used to it.'),
(136, 136, 'Danial has improved a lot comparatively to last season in his defending abilities.His confidence level has stepped high this season.Through playing competitive matches, he can develop better ahead. Daniel can work more on his releasing of exit passes, spatial awareness and communication.Overall one of the most disciplined and a hardworking Athlete.', 'Danial is extremely hard working and a complete team player. He is improving and he has our full support. He is good defensively in all positions. He can improve his non-dominant foot , finishing.'),
(137, 137, 'Humayd has missed a lot of team training sessions. He is an experienced defender, though compulsory to improve and sinc with the team philosophy, attendance is a must for his development ', 'Humayd has a good ability to play at the future level. And he has the good technical ability also. He needs to attend more sessions then only he can improve his tactical ability.'),
(138, 138, 'He is a passionate and complete team player. His positive attitude and sporting spirit have to be appreciated. due to the injury, he has shifted position to a striker from the GK position. he is showing good commitment in his game. his endurance level must be improved', 'His hard work and commitment helped him to start many friendly matches as a striker. Due to the injury, he started playing as a center forward his versatility with his goalkeeper and center forwrd abilities are always appreciated. he needs to recover from his injury and needs to continue as a goalkeeper only because his physical ability makes him play further level. his on the ball and off-the-ball aggression are too good. he needs to maintain his endurance level also.'),
(139, 139, 'Hope has a positive attitude and loves the game a lot. he has good speed as a winger & full back and also with good endurance level. he needs to be more consistent in his abilities to combine play and create goal-scoring opportunities as a winger. he needs to improve on his communication skills.', 'hope has good technical abilities especially his running with the ball are too good. he has to improve his tactical abilities also, he needs to understand what is coach expecting from his role. As a winger, he needs to do more crosses (early, late crosses) from the flank. his communication and decision-making skills while playing need to improve. '),
(140, 140, '', ''),
(141, 141, 'Vishwak is in his development stage, he needs to work on his weak foot and shot power in front of the goal and be more physical. overall a highly coachable player', 'Vishwaak is in his development stage, has been improving slowly and needs to pick up his pace, he\'s good at dribbling and crossing. Needs to be more physical and communication should be improved. He\'s a well mannered and a coachable player '),
(142, 142, 'Amaan needs to work on his negative transition and switch of play, work rate needs to be higher, and read the game much better. he has a good left foot which can be used to his advantage, overall a very enthusiastic and highly coachable player', 'Amaan is a player with good potential, and a brilliant left foot but needs to work on his weaker foot and be more aggressive off the ball, he needs to be more consistent and work on his speed and agility, a highly coachable player who understands instructions easily. '),
(143, 143, 'Yohan, has been developing with confidence, which displayed his ability in the U21 KSFA competition.His forte is his brilliant technical ability in tight spaces.He needs to be more communicative on the pitch among his teammates & also physical during 1v1 duels in the match.', 'Yohan has improved marginally from the first assessment. He made good contribution in the U21 category and helped team to win games. He has had not the most successful season in terms of his adaptability to style of football we played this season but nevertheless he has been very focussed & a very good team player. His calm game with ball, unpredictability & ability to play in very tight spaces are his strong points.  His off the ball desire to win the ball back quickly , aggressiveness off the ball & defensive 1v1 duels still needs lots of improvement.\r\n\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(144, 144, 'He has been very instrumental and played a pivotal role for the success of the  Alchemy team to be champions. His role and responsibilities as a defensive midfielder, majorly assisted and boosted the team\'s performance during transitional play. He has a very sound knowledge of game understanding and what are the expectations from his coaches. He needs to be more aggressive , physical and more communicative & Vocal with his teammates during training sessions and competitive matches. Overall a fantastic athlete well disciplined, excellent attitude on and off the pitch and is being a role model to all young & developing Footballers. We are proud of the way he is shaping & developing.\r\n', 'Ashuthosh had major contribution in our U18 KSFA competition delivering his role as DM perfectly. He is among a few from the 2007 born group who have managed to create impact this season very effectively. Ashuthosh\'s positioning and work in the midfield has helped the team to keep clean sheets and opponents away from our box in many occasions and helped the team progress the ball in transitions resulting in goals. We are happy to see his improvement and progress. He needs to improve his non dominant foot along with his creativity in midfield. He also needs to manage physicality and not get pushed off by bigger players. Hope he keeps the same commitment and focus going forward.\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(145, 145, 'Shaurya Rastogi-he is playing as a centre back with a lot of confidence, guiding teammates, taking responsibility, his attitude in training and in matches is exemplary. He is one of the the most reliable defender in the squad.He can be better in dealing with the recovery runs , work more on agility & aggressiveness. Shourya has a winning mentality & has proved  time and again; also has a big potential to be a professional footballer. We are there to work on him, for achieving his objectives.\r\n', 'Shaurya has had an incredible year with major contributions in the U18 championship & hero youth cup . He has adapted extremely well in the U18 category becoming the key player in defence. He is among the few 2007 born players who adapted well to the intensity of the U18 category. He can still improve his non-dominant foot. We will continue to improve Shaurya and we expect the same focus & commitment shown by Shaurya which has resulted in massive improvements and becoming a key player & leader in defence.'),
(146, 146, 'He is one of the most technical players in the squad. He is brilliant with his first touch, quality of receiving under pressure and outstanding with his both feet, example- Set pieces during ksfa league matches. He needs to step up to assist his team by tirelessly, dominating in midfield and especially during negative transitions.He also needs to be more communicative among his teammates during matches. Overall, a brilliant athlete to work along. \r\n', 'Aayush has shown consistent effort and focus in the last few months w.r.t attending training and we have seen steady improvement from the time of the first assessment & now. He still needs to be discplined in his positioning in the midfield and should not \'switch-off\' w.r.t his duties with & without the ball during the game. He still needs that extra aggression without the ball . He needs to chase the ball back quickly. He needs to show the hunger & quickness off the ball in order to sustain the U18 Category. His technical quality with ball & ability to play with both right & left leg are still top notch. He has had a good season having some stellar performances in the ksfa league and we are very happy with his contribution to the team. We want Aayush to really step up further in the coming season.\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(147, 147, 'Nathan is one of the important pillars in the defensive squad. He is a highly dedicated ,displays responsibility, posess Champions mentality & a leader in the team. His work ethics are an example to the entire squad & Alchemy. young athletes. He has improved a lot through his defensive stance, headers, dealing with the duels, and effective communication. However, he can be better in decision-making with the recovery runs and assess the situation in advance. Overall a brilliant athlete to work along.\r\n', 'Nathan has had a very successful year. He has shown exemplary character on & off the field and is a very good role model for the ENTIRE Alchemy Players. His Contributions in the KSFA league are very well noted and we are proud of the way he has managed to show leadership in defence and guided the team in both good & tough moments during the season. He has improved in all areas in the last 10 months technically, tactically, physically and now developed into a very reliable CB & key player for the team.\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(148, 148, 'Harshavardhan- has been one of the most hard-working, influential and a complete team player with a fighting mentality (Doesn’t Quit). He developed immensely since the last season, he understands his role and responsibility and, besides playing as a midfielder and displaying versatility by  also playing as a full back and dominating the game through his ability and brilliant reading of the game. He can focus to improve on spatial awareness, composure & timing of tackling. Overall, a fantastic team player to work along.\r\n', 'Harsha has improved very well and has been a key player in our successes this season. His versatility to play multiple positions has been a major positive. He has a team first attitude and this attitude has been very important for the success of the team . His decision making can be more consistent as well as improving his non-dominant foot. He has had terrific individual performances in knockout stages and has helped the team to lift the champions trophy.\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(149, 149, 'Ahan\'s positive attitude, dedication, perseverance & performance together that displayed during the crunch KSFA Knock out matches has a lasting impact on the entire team. He inhabits a winning mentality & fully understands & is aware of his role & responsibilities as an Individual & for the team.His ball contol, dribbling ability under pressure & vision makes him unpredictable to his opponents.Through battling with injuries he was relentless in the attacking third through his game. Once fully recoverd he can improve in aerial duels  offensively  &  defensively. A  great athlete to work with.', 'Ahan\'s has been a very good role model for the players, especially showing his dedication & focus to train and play with pain & being on medication. His love for the game & commitment to team while maintaining extreme calm in tough situations are all hallmark of a very good player who can go a long way in football. He can still improve in aerial duels defensively & offensively. He should be very proud of his contribution to the team and we will keep trying to improve Ahan going forward.\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(150, 150, 'Oka has been very instrumental with the team\'s success and knows his role and responsibilities extremely well. He has been a very good attacker and gained the advantage through his speed, dribbling skills through which he majorly assisted and scored some crucial goals in the competition. He can be better with his speed of thought and speed of play to elevate his game and more communicative among his teammates.\r\n', 'Oka has had very successful year with him adapting very well to our style of play. He has been very focussed , calm , dedicated through the season. He played a major role in team\'s success this year with him scoring goals or assisting some crucial goals helping the team gain momentum and send them on a winning run. He can still be more consistent with his decision making during games especially with the ball. He works tirelessly and is a complete team player. He is a very good role model for younger players & also for his brother Nibo. Oka can still improve his communication with his team-mates &  show leadership. \r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)');
INSERT INTO `ci_notes_from_coaching` (`id`, `forms_id`, `notes_frm_tech_dir`, `notes_frm_head_coach`) VALUES
(151, 151, 'Vibhin comparatively to his last assessment, he  has been improved, technically with the ball and further getting an idea about his role and responsibilities in the team.He also needs to improve in dealing with aerial duels & in 1v1 situations. He has to understand what are the expectations from the coaches to reach his objectives. He can be more communicative among his teammates.', 'Vibhin has improved and understands more of our style of play. He still need to be more consistent in attending training sessions as well try and manage his injuries so that he is not missing training sessions. He has improved marginally in all areas and is on the right track. He still needs lot of work on his speed , agility & quickness with & without the ball. He also needs to improve in aerial duels & in 1v1 situations. He is calm,focussed during sessions & is a good team player.'),
(152, 152, 'He has been exposed to TAL and ksfa U 21 competitive matches to give him adequate playing time. We believe & understand that the experience gained will be very vital for his growth .He can hopefully transfer it to  his U18 team, to further elevate his performance, through training & matches. We believe in advaith ’s ability and potential. He has been missing training sessions. Let us be patient in his development.\r\n', 'Adwaith has had a difficult season in terms of competitive match time in KSFA but as expected the category jump from U15 TO U18 was going to take time and going to be difficult. Taking into consideration the above, he has been a regular starter in TAL squad playing against senior players and in longer run it will help to deal well with physicality as well slowly but steadily help him to improve with game time. He needs to consistent in attending training sessions as he is still irregular. We all believe in Adwaith\'s potential but patience is the key for his development.\r\n\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(153, 153, 'Aryan is one of the most technical gifted and a sound tactical Player. He has a good potential to develop into a non-amateur footballer. His contributions  has been very positive to the success of the team(Hattrick in KSFA competetion). He is a versatile footballer. He needs to communicate more among his teammates and can work more on his non-dominant foot to gain a major advantage among his opponents. Overall a highly coachable athlete. \r\n\r\n', 'Aryan has had a good season and played important part in the team\'s success this year. He scored some important goals for the team and also contributed defensively playing WB position and helping team in tough moments during the season. He still remains an important player for us with lots of potential for future. We congratulate Aryan on winning Hat-tricks in State Championships having major contributions towards the team in all three seasons consistently. \r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(154, 154, 'Vibulan shows a lot of interest in training & a hunger to improve.This U15 DPDL  league gave him a good exposure to showcase on his ability that he has been working on his basics, like passing, quality of First touch, Dribbling under pressure & 1v1 duels.', 'Vibulan has improved well since his jump from the academy to an 11-a-side football atmosphere, nevertheless, if he needs to be able to be playing at the starting 11 he has to work on his basics more, he has a great dribbling ability and a great player to work with due to his attitude\r\n\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(155, 155, 'Likewise mentioned earlier, Abhishek is in his early development phase getting exposure at the U13 DPDL matches. Delighted to see him in contribute goals to his team & he seems understanding  what are the coach & his team expectations.\r\nWe are working on his Technical ability as it is of paramount importance. Lets be patient with his  Football development.', 'Abhishek is developing at a decent pace. He\'s coachble and has an eye for goal. He needs to improve on his agility and accelration.\r\n\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable to the age group/ it is not done for the athletes. 0 indicates the athlete was not present during the assessment)'),
(156, 156, 'Shlok as in his  development phase as a Centre back, is high on confidence, which is a positive sign for the team.\r\nHis decision making &  scanning around has been improved . He has been a good team communicator on the pitch. As mentioned earlier, he needs to patiently keep working on his defensive principles & both feet ; as he has a huge potential  ahead. ', 'Shlok had improved throughout this season at a good pace. He\'s very coachble and a team player. One of his best quality is to understand instructions. He can improve on his consistency while clearances and maintaining technical qualities under pressure situations.\r\n\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable to the age group/ it is not done for the athletes. 0 indicates the athlete was not present during the assessment)'),
(157, 157, 'Rishaan is a highly disclplined, crafty (Effective inside the box) & an improved player since his last assessment.  He is in his developing phase.  He is very focussed & understands his role as an attacker.He can improve on his passing ability on  delivering long balls. Overall a brilliant player, possesing strong Football mentality to have in the squad.', 'Rishaan is developing at a good pace. I\'m happy with his performance through out the season. He\'s coachable and a team player. He\'s attitude towards learning will take him a long way. He can improve on agility and acceleration.\r\n\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(158, 158, 'Vishwajit is currently in his developing phase. Since his first assessment there are positive signs in his development.He understands what is his role & expectations within his team & is working towards it.He needs to be more communicative among his teammates on the pitch  & aggessive during 1v1 duels. He needs to be improving on his shooting abilities & defensive stance.', 'Vishwajit is developing at a decent rate. He is a coachable player and always easy to learn. Things he can improve on are consistency in performance, handling pressure from opponents and better technical execution.\r\n\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable to the age group/ it is not done for the athletes. 0 indicates the athlete was not present during the assessment)'),
(159, 159, 'Kabir is in his development phase.Just training from Power play academy sessions &  further transitioning  into DPDL U13 league  competetive matches has been a good exposure & a  learning experience. He needs to improve on his spatial awareness, passing under pressure & defending stance.Overall a good disciplined player.', 'Kabir is a good physical player and has developed through the DPDL season. His shots are accurate and powerful. He can improve on heading (deensive and offensive), communication with his teammates, dribblings and agility to name a few. He\'s a very coachable player.'),
(160, 160, 'Steve is a very disciplined and a highly coachable player. As mentioned earlier, He is working to improve on his speed, agility, coordination. He is been contributing well in the U13 DPDL League with some of the good performances.He has to maintain the consistency in 11v11 format of the game.', 'Steve has improved at a good pace throughout the season. He\'s very coachable and a team player. He can improve on his balance and technical qualities when under pressure from opponents.\r\n\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable for the age group/ not conducted. 0 means the athlete was absent during the particular test)'),
(161, 161, 'Ansh is a highly coachable player & is very receptive to technical instructions. He needs to improve on passing, especially long ball under pressure.Ansh displays a lot of positive attitude & always striving to deliver his best for his team.', 'Ansh has improved at a decent pace throughout the season. He\'s coachable and versatile player. He should have more consistency and clinical in his performances.\r\n\r\n**(N/A means the test is not applicable to the age group/ the test is not done for the athletes. 0 means the athelete was absent during the assessment)'),
(162, 162, 'Aman is in his currently in his development phase. Since his last assessment, Aman has gained a lot of confidence, which displays in his his matches at the DPDL U13 League.His attitude to learn & executed has been one of the highlights.His spatial awareness to make those tight passess under pressure has been his hallmark.He can improve on his long passing ability & communication ahead.', 'Aman has improved at a decent pace through out this season. He\'s a team player and good technical player. He can improve on his strength and vision of the field.\r\n\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable to the age group/ it is not done for the athletes. 0 indicates the athlete was not present during the assessment)'),
(163, 163, 'Karthik he is in is developing phase. He has better reading of the game. He is effective in 1v1 duels.He possess excellent decision making & need to communicate more. He can be better effective with communication among his team mates and also on deal between defensive headers. He is in his transition phase to U15 category.\r\n', 'Karthick has improved at a good pace throughout the season. He\'s a very versatile player and creative player with good technical skills. He can improve on his physical strength and consistency in performances.\r\n\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable for the age group/ not conducted. 0 means the athlete was absent during the particular test)'),
(164, 164, 'Nihal  has been developing in a very positive manner. His individual brilliance, Positional sense, tactical brilliance and immense confidence displayed has been a major influence on the success as champions of the U 15 KSFA league. He has been a role model to all the youngsters at alchemy He can work on his shortcomings like switching play-Long ball etc, as he shall be transitioning to the U18 category.\r\n', 'Nihal is a proper midfielder , he has a neck of penetrating passes into the tide space and quick in defensive transition. He is good in finishing in the box and out the box finishing he can do more better.\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable to the age group/ it is not done for the athletes. 0 indicates the athlete was not present during the assessment)'),
(165, 165, 'Srutaan  -since last few months, he has been developing immensely with lot of confidence.He has been shaping as a potential centre back displaying traits of an emerging professional footballer. He influenced his team through his defensive abilities for winning the U 15 KSFA league. He needs to be more communicative amongst teammates, be aggressive, and also can be better at his defensive stance, overall a great athlete to work with.\r\n', 'Srutaan improved alot after the first assessment in his role and position as a center back ,he shows strong mentality on training as well as in the game and he understand and follow instruction  which was given to him.he is a great person to work with as a player.\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(166, 166, 'Karan Chetal- is developing as a footballer being more confident, and is showing glimpses of what his role and responsibilities, during matches. He displays a lot of positive attitude towards his teammates & is hungry to learn and upgrade his level in the game. Overall a brilliant athlete to work with. He needs to be more communicative during trainings and matches and can be more working on his spatial awareness.\r\n', 'Karan is playing in a forward position, he has a good technical ability to dribble score a goal,he needs to work on his concentration and focus  on all times sometimes he is casual loss his focus and confidence also need to improve his negative transition to defence quick anticipation and awareness.\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(167, 167, 'Dhruv Chezian-he is emerging as a good technical and tactical full back. He is a complete team player. He has been outstanding with his composure while tackling in defense, dealing under pressure. Being a left-footed Footballer, he needs to be improving on his non-dominant foot for his advantage. He can focus on developing his recovery runs  & aerial duels. He will be transitioning to the U18 category.He has a champion mentality & needs to continue on the same.\r\n', 'Dhruv C is Captian of u15 hattick winner of ksfa youth league, he is cool and calm player with sound technical and tactical player who understand his role. He needs improvement in recovry run , concentration and body language in the training session be an example for everyone as a captain of the team and work on his non-dominant foot..\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(168, 168, 'Dylan -he is one of the instrumental defenders /midfielders in the team. His contribution has been positive and his ability to deal against opponents under pressure  situations are noteworthy. The more he attends training sessions, the more confidence, he gains the better he performs.He is  an asset to the squad.\r\n', 'Dylan is versatile player with good technical and tactical understanding player. He is a sergio busquets of the team who controls the game cool and calm strong mentality in any situations.he can improve his shooting out of the box and be more regular for training .\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(169, 169, 'Satvik  is one of the most influential attackers in the squad. His vision, running with the ball , dribbling (360 turn- skill to beat the opponent ) & Crossing abilities  are a nightmare for the opponents. He has demonstarted the same during the KSFA competition. He can be more communicative during matches. He will be transitioning to U18 category we must be patient with his development.\r\n', 'Satvik is a versatile forward player good technical and tactical player also have the understanding of the game plan , he has a trademark of 360 turn to beat the opponent and quick player helping the team in quick attack at the same time in defending as well.he needs to work on his communication. \r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(170, 170, 'Yatharth displays comittment during training session. He has to improve further on his speed, agility, aggressiveness as mentioned in the last assessment.He has been experiencing & learning through the match exposure at the DPDL U13 on going competition. He has to use his height to its advantage during the matches. He is in his development phase. Overall a  highly coachable player, he needs to believe in his ability & show consistency in scoring goals.  \r\n', 'Yathaarth has improved at a decent pace throughout the season.\r\nHe\'s good at shooting and improved a lot at dribbling.\r\nCan improve acceleration and awareness of situations all along the game.\r\n\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable for the age group/ not conducted. 0 means the athlete was absent during the particular test)'),
(171, 171, 'Advik is in his early development phase.He is gradually learning his role & responsibilities, through his match exposure in the DPDL League.He needs to focus on his speed of thought & speed of play under pressure, 1v1 duels,  awareness of spaces around and can be better with his communication on the pitch.We need to be patient in his development. Overall a good athlete to work with.', 'Advik has surprised all of us with his performance in DPDL. He\'s a very crafty player with good flare with the ball. He needs to improve his strength and stamina. Defensively he can contribute more for the team.'),
(172, 172, 'Darsh displays a good attitude & hunger to learn to improve on his positioning  &  game. He needs to be regular at the training sessions, to gel among the team, & can showcase  the best out of him during matches. He displays a good attitude to learn. He can improve on his scanning awareness, defensive stance, 1v1 & aerial duels.He is in his transition phase to U15 category.\r\n', 'Darsh has improved at a decent pace throughout the season. He\'s a good physical and versatile player. He can work on his quality of technical execution while out under pressure by opponents.\r\n\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable to the age group/ it is not done for the athletes. 0 indicates the athlete was not present during the assessment)'),
(173, 173, 'Rishan, since his last assessment has been developing a lot very positively & has contributed effectively during the DPDL U 13.He  has been so far effective playing different positions as demanded by the coach, was good at  1v1 dribbbles ,Tactical positioning, assist and scoring goals. The more sessions he trains, the more better he can be. Overall a very enthusiastic & a Positive athlete. He needs to improve to work on his, defensive heading & his usage of his non-dominant foot. He is in his transition phase to U15 category.\r\n', 'Rishan has improved at a good pace throughout the season. He\'s a very coachable player and understands instructions. He can improve on his acceleration and aggression while with the ball\r\n\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable to the age group/ it is not done for the athletes. 0 indicates the athlete was not present during the assessment)'),
(174, 174, 'Compared to the previous assessment, Abhinav has been developing positively. He has played in the KSFA competition & also in the ongoing DPDL U13 league. He has the knack to score goals in crucial situations. He has to be consistent with that approach. He has the ability; he needs to improve on his communication skills among teammates during the game. Also Physicality during 1v1 duels & aggressiveness is required. Overall a very positive athlete to work with.\r\n', 'Abhinav has improved at a good pace throughout the season.\r\nHe\'s a team player and very coachable.\r\nHe can improve on his first touch under pressure and also being more physical while  playing\r\n\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable to the age group/ it is not done for the athletes. 0 indicates the athlete was not present during the assessment)'),
(175, 175, 'Sanath is in his  development phase, as he has been experiencing 11v11 football and also playing in the ongoing DPDL U13 league. He is understanding his role as a centre Back &  as a full back and further needs to be more aggressive, communicative and possess good spatial awareness to elevate his level of the game. He loves to contribute to his team positively and shows good signs of improvement compared to the last assessment. He shall have a transition phase  to  U15 category; where it is more demanded for the next season. We are there patiently, to guide Sanath to develop further & achieve his objectives.\r\n', 'Sanat has improved at a good pace throughout the season.\r\nHe\'s a very coachable player and sensible defender.\r\nHe can improve on being more aggressive while defending and being more decisive.\r\n\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable to the age group/ it is not done for the athletes. 0 indicates the athlete was not present during the assessment)'),
(176, 176, 'Ryan is in his early  development phase. Post-injury Ryan is building on confidence and  and playing competitive matches, he has to be more communicative among his Teammates. He can improve on his 1v1 defensive/Attacking duels, Spatial awareness, Perception toweards decision making & finishing in front of the goal. Overall, a very positive athlete to work along. We need to be patient in his development.\r\n', 'Good to see Ryan\'stechnical and self confidence in the game is improving. His greatest strength is his shooting ability and we need to see him taking shot. Overall he is has moved a level up and ready for the next phase in his football **(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(177, 177, 'Gaurav-  is in his development phase. He is experiencing the competitive football matches which is further helping him in his development. He understands what are the expectations from him in the team, his role and responsibility and has to work on his agility, 1v1 duels and shooting as to achieve those ahead. As a young player he has the potential,  the more training sessions he attend the better he can achieve his objectives .Overall a highly coachable player. \r\n', 'Gaurav has improved at a good pace throughout the season.\r\nHe\'s a hardworking player and always open to learning.\r\nHe can improve on dealing with pressure from opponents and master skills & control on the ball.\r\n\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(178, 178, 'Dheer-he has been experiencing a lot of complete football in training as well as in the matches. He needs to be more aggressive as mentioned earlier in good physical duels, 1V1 attacking and defending, be communicative among his teammates and have a better understanding of tactical positioning. Overall, Dheer  displays a very positive attitude in training and is coachable.\r\n', '**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)\r\n\r\nDheer is a well-behaved player with a great attitude, He needs to work on his communication and be more aggressive in his game,  better decision-making, and dominant body language. he has improved in his negative transition and speed. but so much more to improve which will happen over training and patience\r\n'),
(179, 179, 'Saketh is in his development phase. He needs to believe in his ability and be more positive &  Confident. As coaches and technical team are  available for his support in his development. He needs to be communicating well among his teammates, as it is a  team sport &  also can improve to be more aggressive during 1V1  duels during the game.\r\n', 'Saketh is in his development phase. He needs to be more confident and positive. He needs to communicate louder and clearer to his teammates.  As football is a physical game and a team game he need to gel with the team in and out the pitch . Understand more in handling physical pressure and be more aggressive during the training and matches.\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(180, 180, 'Since, he was younger in the U15 category, he developed immensely showing lot of promise in training sessions & also the competitive matches. Coaches believed in him , we have to be patient, in development, as next season he had to lead the team gaining all this experience, and guide his teammates to achieve the team\'s objective.\r\n', ''),
(181, 181, 'Rushil has been battling with injuries in & out .He is a very enthusiastic & a dedicated footballer. Currently he needs to focus & work upon his fitness  mainly agility, endurance levels to play or adapt under  Climatic (heat ) conditions. He needs to be more aggressive in the duel.and He has a good left foot &  with the more number of training sessions, he can be develop better.\r\n', 'Rushil has had a slow start to the season due to his injuries,  Currently, he needs to focus & work on his fitness  mainly agility, and endurance levels to play or adapt under  Climatic (heat ) conditions as it was already something he had to work on prior to the injury, he\'s keen to understand the game and always receptive to the information given by the coach, hopefully by more training and work rate he can develop more\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(182, 182, 'He has been developing positively this season. His contributions in a defender’s role has been much more effective. He seems more confident tackling , dealing in 1V1’s etc as a defender .He can use his height to his advantage and can also explore midfield positions; he can improve on his spatial awareness and communication skills amongst his teammates. He will be transitioning to U18 category.\r\n', 'Suchir has been developing and showing himself as a versatile player. His role as a defender was much more effective and comfortable in dealing with air ball, 1v1 situations . He can improve his awareness, communication to help himself and his teammates.'),
(183, 183, 'Kayan is  a very passionate and dedicate football mostly regular in training sessions. He has decent ball control abilities, and must protect it under presssure situations. He can focus to improve more on his awareness of spaces, defensive stance and dealing in negative transitions during play. Overall he can use his height to its maximum advantage on the field of play .Overall a highly coachable Athlete. He will be transitioning to U18 category.\r\n', 'Kayan highly committed to the sport and to himself on improving in football, always asking questions on how he can improve and trying to work on it day to day, he still has much to learn. mostly the finer details of the game as well as few of the basics such as the weight of the pass, and playing the ball under pressure, decision making and basics like heading , shooting out of the box and negative transition during the match has improved. he needs to increase his speed to be able to use his physique to the maximum, by time with effort and training he\'ll achieve all of it'),
(184, 184, 'He is currently been featuring in the DPDL competitive matches. He is being familiar with understanding his role and responsibilities in the team. As a full back, he needs to focus to improve on his vision awareness and dealing with 1v1 during defensive duels.(When to delay & When to tackle ). He will be transitioning to U 18 category. Overall a good athlete to work with\r\n', 'Aarush is a player with a high work rate, an attacking full-back who is confident to go up and support the attack. He needs to work on his running form and his decision in a 1v1 situation, dealing with aerial balls, and work on his weaker foot and first touch, all in all, he\'s a player whos interested in learning and always giving his 100 whenever he plays '),
(185, 185, 'Nischal has been steady improving , since  attending training sessions on Tuesdays, he has been playing competitive matches and where he has contributed positively with a few good performances. He need to be more aggressive during 1v1 duels, more communicative amongst teammates. He has to maintain composure during finishing on goal. overall a brilliant athlete to work with. He will be transitioning to U 18 category.\r\n', 'Nischal has improved well due to his increased commitment to the team and training, He\'s a very hardworking forward who has no problem Dropping deep to help the defense, but he needs to improve in his Long range shots and taking decisions quickly and staying in the right position to receive the pass and control his emotion during and after the match. apart from that he\'s a player who wants to learn and puts in the work to learn, a coachable player'),
(186, 186, 'Ujjwal has been developing positively, as a centre back since last season. He has to be more focused during matches;by reading the game situation.He can improve on his Spatial awareness, temperament &  better decision making to elevate his level. He is a very strong in a aerial balls as well on ground. He been an integral part of the team, He will be transitioning to U18 category.\r\n', 'Ujjwal has improved from the start of the season, he\'s really committed to the sport never misses a session, he has a good range of passing and very tough to dribble past and a wall at the defence, but he needs to know how to be calm in training and be focused on whats been expected of him and not play according how he wants but according to how the team plays, needs to improve his left foot and defensive composure'),
(187, 187, 'Akshay has been evolving as one of the most reliable centre backs in the team. His contribution decision has been immense for the team winning the KSFA you 15 champions category. His reading of the game, Passing ability and defensive & offensive heading has been his major strengths. He has to be more consistent in his defensive recovery runs as he will be transitioning to the U 18 category. Overall a brilliant athlete to work along.\r\n', 'Akshay is a center back . He is the most consistent center back in u15 helping the team to reached KSFA finals.He also had a good height which is the advantage as a center back .he is a intelligent defender. Good at reading the game understanding his role and good dicision making in passing . He can improve his recovery runs and non dominant foot'),
(188, 188, 'Balram shows a lot of passion and dedication. As earlier mentioned he needs to be more aggressive in 1V1 defensive and offensive towards his opponents.His strength are his quality of first touch ball, controlled receiving.He needs to focus to work on his speed under pressure situations. Overall a positive & an  enthusiastic athlete to walk along.\r\n', 'Balram is in his development phase still, he needs to be more aggressive in 1V1 defensive and offensive towards his opponents, and communicate with players, i expect Balram to ask more questions to show curiosity towards the game to improve his football IQ, he\'s quick in his decision making and patient for his chances to play matches, good short passes too. overall a disciplined player '),
(189, 189, 'Ashok has a very positive attitude in training & displays lot of dedication, positivity and effort during training and matches. He needs to be more aggressive. As mentioned earlier, especially in the 1V1  duels with aerial headers and recovery runs. He is in his development phase and experiencing physical football during competitions. Overall a brilliant athlete to work along.\r\n', 'Ashok has improved well player-wise and personality-wise, his dedication and commitment are unparalleled. He needs to be much faster as a player though he copes it up with his understanding of the game, needs to have better composure, and has a lot to work on his basics still like long passes, long shots, crosses etc. he\'s a highly coachable player and i expect even more from him'),
(190, 190, 'Dhruv due to his injury, he has missed a lot of training sessions lately. He is one of the most talented, left footed technical and tactical players in the squad.He can focus to improve on his aerial duels and negative transitions during play. He can also work on his endurance levels. Overall a brilliant athlete to work along.\r\n', 'Dhruv, regardless of his injury, is still having the potential to be one of the best in the squad and im sure through hard work and commitment he can achieve it, I believe in him. he can improve his mental fortitude, football IQ, his positioning and shot power. Injury has slowed down his development, but its part of the game. I\'m sure Dhruv will learn from it and get back to his best'),
(191, 191, 'He is very dedicated footballer.  As mentioned earlier he needs to work on his non-dominant foot as a defender which is of paramount importance. while dealing with 1v1, the duels. he also can improve on his defensive stance, & heading abilities under pressure. Most vitally,  the recovery runs. overall a  positive athlete  to work with.\r\n', 'Adesh is a committed player who rarely misses any session, he needs to work on his awareness in relation to the ball and know how to anticipate the game, he can also improve on his defensive heading and he needs to communicate more on and off the pitch. he has a good long passing and a natural left footer'),
(192, 192, 'Harry has been very instrumental with his performance in the team this season. He has an excellent  left foot ability to deal against opponents, under pressure, extremely good with long shooting and long passing abilities. He\'s a good team player. He needs to be patient and composed, when he misses the target or loses ball possession.Overall he posesses a Champions mentality & has a huge potential to make it to the professional Football.\r\n', 'Harry is a hard working player and a versatile forward. He is a left sharp shooter and set piece taker of u15 .helping his teammates to score in corners etc. He also has the ability to  take a shoot on the goal. He is also a physical dominant player. He need to understand how to keep himself calm and patient. He needs to improve his first touch . Good to see him starting to use more of his non dominant foot to shoot on the goals.'),
(193, 193, 'He is one of the most effective and influential players on the pitch. He is a brilliant attacker &  shoulders the team responsibilities to score goals under pressure situations. He is good in negative transitions and been a role model for his recent contribution to  elevate his  team performances in the competition.\r\n', 'Arjun Nori is a top player who can change the match scoreline by himself on his best day. but, As his coach im aware of to what extent he can grow and I expect more from him. a player of Arjuns Quality shouldn\'t be happy scoring just 1 or 2 goals when he is capable of scoring even more than that week in and week out. Standards should be always higher and higher\r\nHe can improve on his game understanding, his decision-making and headers. Overall a top player with a great attitude and leadership qualities naturally'),
(194, 194, 'Ishaan needs to work on his foundation levels as mentioned to him on his basic Ballmastery, passing receiving ,scanning Vision and in attacking 1v1 and defending situations. He is a very dedicated footballer, always eager to learn and improve himself  in the U15 category.\r\n', ''),
(195, 195, 'He has been growing in confidence. He has been given a lot of match exposure through the TAL competitive matches. He has been learning through these experiences. He can focus to develop on his agility, speed, recovery runs, 1v1 duels and most effectively communication among his teammates. Overall  a good athlete to work along.', 'Kevin is a hard-working player. he has good physical attributes to play in the center-back and defensive midfielder positions. he has to improve his aggression on the ball and off the ball. tactically he needs to understand his roles and responsibilities. during competitive matches, he needs more confidence and self-motivated'),
(196, 196, 'He is a very dedicated and passionate Football wants to learn and improve shows a lot of hunger to elevate his game. He\'s given a lot of exposure during the TAL tournament to improve upon his game. He has to focus on his composure , Spatial awareness, decision making to execute under pressure and believe in himself. Overall a good athlete to work along.\r\n', 'Aditya is a hardworking player. always hungry to learn and shows a good attitude during training sessions. he improved a lot in his technical aspects. but still, he needs to work on his 1v1 defending and first touch. his decision-making during the match has to improve where to pass? and when to pass. how many touches do I need to take? all these questions he has to ask himself\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(197, 197, 'Rakshith has been given the match exposure at Tal competition. He has been explained and understood his role and responsibilities within the team. He needs more to believe in his abilities. He has good pace and game knowledge but needs to be consistent in his performance. Overall a good athlete to work along.\r\n', 'Rakshit is a technically sound player. especially 1v1 in tight space. And he has improved well since the last assessment in all areas of the game.in technical aspects, he has to improve on his finishing and shooting execution. he needs to improve on his communication verbal and nonverbal during the game.'),
(198, 198, 'He is a dedicated Football. He has been given exposure to the TAL competition. He needs to learn from those experiences and reflect upon it. As a centre Back, he needs to further improve on his agility, defensive recovery runs, defensive headers, 1V1 Duels.  \r\n', 'Manith is a hardworking player. he improved a lot since the last assessment in all areas of the game. Manith has to do more repetition of the defensive header technique. he has to improve positioning and understand the roles and responsibilities during competitive matches. physical aspects he should work on his agility part.'),
(199, 199, 'He is one of the most dedicated and a passionate Footballer. He loves to train a lot and improve himself his game. Give an exposure to the TAL competition, he can experience , learn and reflect on his game. We coaches, are always available for his development. He needs to believe in his ability & be confident.He needs to to improve on his awareness, vision around to find spaces, teammates etc and be more clinical in front of the goal. Overall a brilliant personality and good athlete to work along.\r\n', 'Karan is a hard-working player. in the last assessment, I told him to improve his non-dominant foot ability to shoot on the goal, and now I can see the transformation of his left foot. And he needs to work on his positional awareness and he needs to play like a complete team player, which means trying to pass to his teammates if he has a passing option. he needs to on minimum touches to pass or shoot on the target'),
(200, 200, 'Shanen  has been battling with small injuries in a note has been given exposure to TAL competition matches. Yeah he can experience learn and reflect on his game. He has to be developing on his Spatial awareness,  Speed of thought & speed of play, also to be more communicative among his team mates, be more confident , be patient and believe in his abilities, We coaches are there to help him to achieve his objectives.\r\n', 'Shanen has improved well since the last assessment in all areas of the game. he still lacks consistency in his decision-making with the ball. he needs to be more aggressive with the ball, especially during back-four pressing and transition. he is still very coachable, with a good and positive attitude and character on and off the field. he needs to take care of his injuries. try to do proper rehab with our physio.'),
(201, 201, 'He a very positive and enthusiastic athlete. He\'s getting experience in the TAL competition. He is open to instructions and need to improve on the speed of thought and speed of play to progress as an attacker in the game.\r\n', 'Mahimna has had a very productive season, Mahimna always had self-confidence and a good attitude during the match. he works very hard in the defensive phases and needs to composure to his game in the attacking phase. he has wonderful team spirit  and a good attitude to learn and improve'),
(202, 202, 'Veer has been improving since his last assessment he has been exposed to lot of matches in competition. He\'s open to instructions and understands what he needs to focus on. Especially his defensive positioning, Spatial awareness & his recovery runs and timing of headers. He is a very positive and enthusiastic and highly coachable athlete.\r\n', 'first of all, we have to appreciate veer\'s commitment and hard work for the team. if we are comparing with the last assessment veer has improved his defensive header. he has to focus more on his decision-making skills according to the situation. try to implement his roles and responsibilities during a competitive match.'),
(203, 203, 'He has been improving since his last assessment. He has to be confident and believe in his abilities. He can focus on negative transitions play with more aggression, be more comfortable with his non-dominant foot and more communicative among his teammates. Overall, a fantastic player has good knowledge of the game and will observe him further.\r\n', 'Ishaan is a hard-working player. and he has improved well since the last assessment. his 1 v 1 dribbling and running with the ball from the wide areas have become better. he needs to take proper decisions according to the situation during the match. he needs to take care of his injuries and do proper rehab consulting with physio\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(204, 204, 'Marzin, most of the time he was battling with niggles and injuries during training sessions been on and off the pitch. He is a very passionate footballer. He needs to communicate and talk among his teammates on the field of play. He needs to be more agile and improve  on 1v1 duels, aggresiveness a lot on his speed of thought and speed of play during transitions.\r\n', 'Marzin is a hardworking player with a good and positive attitude toward the training session.his commitment level is also appreciated. because of his injury, he misses a couple of matches and training sessions. he has to focus more on his technical ability like shooting on the target, 1 v 1 dribbling, and first touch. he needs more consistency in scoring goals. he is still coachable. he needs to do proper consulting with the physio '),
(205, 205, 'Nabhi has been shaping well as an attacking winger. He needs to be more aggressive during the duels. He need to manage  to prevent injuries. He has good speed and agility. He needs to be more communicative among his teammates and be more confident in himself. Overall a fantastic athlete to work with.\r\n', 'nabhi is a highly dependable player with a good and positive attitude and a hardworking mentality. he has improved well since the last assessment in all aspects of the game. now he needs to fine-tune his football ability to go further level. he needs to manage his injury because of that he misses a couple of training sessions. so consult our physio and do proper rehab and strengthening '),
(206, 206, 'Donald is a very positive  Footballer. He\'s open to learn and improve himself in between, he was on leave for more than a month and missed a lot of  training sessions. He has improved since the last assessment but has to be consistent in his game on improving his Spatial awareness &  1v1 duels.He has to be more communicative among his teammates, and have a clear understanding of his role and responsibilities while attacking and defending.\r\n', 'Donald has missed lot of sessions in the latter part of the season and has been inconsistent in his training regime. He still needs to improve in all areas and unless he is consistent in his training regime his development will remain stagnant. We hope Donald is consistent in his training and develops his game going further.\r\n\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(207, 207, 'Vedant is a very positive and enthusiastic athlete. He\'s always open to instruction from the coach is to improve himself. He is technically very sound and need to be consistent tactically during the attacking and defending moments of the game. He has the potential & ability to reach beyond his current level and excel, as an attacker.He needs to also communicate effectively among his teammates during training & matches.\r\n', 'Vedanth has been a dedicated and passionate footballer in the game. he has improved well since the last assessment in all aspects of the game. especially shooting on the target but still, he needs to play more matches, then only he can understand roles and responsibilities during a competitive match. I hope he can start in the first eleven teams for upcoming tournaments. he needs to take care of injuries and need to do adequate strengthening\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(208, 208, 'He has been improving on his technical ability and decision-making. He needs to be more aggressive during 1V1 duels. During the training or matches, he needs to be consistent during transitions of the game. He also has to focus on to communicate effectively among his teammates during training & matches. Overall a very disciplined and a dedicated footballer.\r\n', 'Muthanna is a well-disciplined player on the team. if we compare his last assessment there is lots of improvement. but he needs to improve his receiving and first touch, and passing technique. because of the exam, he misses a couple of morning sessions. if he wants to go further level he has to attend more number of session and he needs to take care of his injury part and consult with our physio and do proper rehab. if we look at his tactical ability he needs to work more on his off-the-ball aggression and positional awareness. he needs to communicate verbally with his teammates. '),
(209, 209, 'Uzair since he had the  finger injury, he was ruled out to play as a goalkeeper. We have been working on him as an attacker; & as a centre forward to give him opportunity to focus on his development in training or in competitive matches. He has also managed to score goals during competition. We pray for his speedy recovery, so he can train back as a goalkeeper, which has been his forte and his specific position.\r\n', 'Uzair has a good commitment level and a hardworking mentality, he is always eager to learn new things. he was scored a couple of goals in competitive matches which shows his attitude toward the game. in post recovery from his hand injury, he needs to continue as a goalkeeper because his physical ability makes him play the further level as a goalkeeper.'),
(210, 210, 'Tejas  is a very dedicated passionate & a  coachable athlete. He is also been developing as an versatile footballer; he\'s been exposed to the competitions, whereas and coaches have  discussed with him regarding his goals and objectives that are to be achieved in the upcoming season. He can be better working on his endurance levels, especially during transitions of play 1V1 duels. He has been developing effectively as an attacker by delivering some good crossing abilities. He needs to be more communicative among his teammates and believes in his own abilities. Likewise mentioned earlier; Tejas is still in his development phase &  would suggest not to soak in any sort of pressure to hurry the process instantly.', 'Tejas playing in multiple positions this season & has given versatility to the team and was very crucial in the championship run. He still remains very coachable, an excellent team player and willing to learn & contribute fully to the team needs. He still needs to improve his consistency of crossing/cutbacks & consistency in 1v1 duels offensively & defensively in order to sustain the demands of this age category.\r\n\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(211, 211, 'Kenneth  is one of the most dedicated and a highly coachable athlete. He has been exposed to U18  & the U21 KSFA competitive matches. He\'s been in his development phase as a defender. The areas he can focus on are defending aerial balls under pressure, Spatial awareness, recovery runs, speed and can be consistent with his communication among his teammates. Overall, a fantastic footballer plays with a lot of confidence and had the team achieve, through his valuable contribution, as the objective was to be the U18 KSFA champions.\r\n', 'Kenneth played a very important role in our championship run. He has got good exposure in the Hero Youth Cup, U21 category as well. We are happy to his continued & consistent dedication,progression through this season. He still needs to improve his physical attributes and it is the way through which his game will see major & visible improvement in his speed, agility & winning more 1v1 duels.Technical & Tactical understanding of the game is very good & very adaptable .\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)');
INSERT INTO `ci_notes_from_coaching` (`id`, `forms_id`, `notes_frm_tech_dir`, `notes_frm_head_coach`) VALUES
(212, 212, 'Humayd  has a lot of dedication and love for the game. He needs to be physically fit, agile , speed and back in shape.Tactically he can improve too. He\'s an intelligent, footballer & highly coachable. He Understands the instructions from coaches, and can add a lot of value to the team through his experience like the  the previous seasons but he primarily has to focus on his objectives to achieve the goal.\r\n', 'humayd is a hardworking and positive attitude player. he is a technically sounded player especially in 1v 1 in tight space. he has to improve his crossing ability and 1v 1 defending and he needs to take appropriate decisions during the match. Does he have to know when to pass? where to pass, and how many touches he needs to take. (attacking phase). he needs to attend more sessions\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(213, 213, 'Shyam, has been battling with injuries on and off this pitch and also on study leave during exams. He has been provided a lot of match exposure, including the  U21 KSFA league. We believe in his abilities and potential to add value to the U18 team for the upcoming season. He needs to be more aggressive, more communicative and believe in his abilities. Overall a brilliant technical player. \r\n', 'Shyam has great technique, especially playing with both feet, but needs to work more on his quickness with the ball in both phases of the game, too slow in transitions, be more aggressive with the ball, should be more quicker in decision making to fasten up his play, and has to work more on his shooting skil'),
(214, 214, 'He has been developing since his last assessment as mentioned to him earlier ; he has to focus on his Spatial awareness, non-dominant foot to be more aggressive during duels. He has to be more communicative among his teammates  & can be better in decision-making.  \r\n', ''),
(215, 215, 'Ethan has not been regular at the training sessions as to sync with the team combinations.\r\n', ''),
(216, 216, 'Gopi  has been provided much exposure in the U18 KSFA matches. He needs to be more aggressive also communicative among his teammates. He can focus more on his decision making during transitions ,and  also his timing of his tackles, Spatial awareness, dealing with the headers under presurre and positioning in the game. Overall, he is a highly coachable and a discipline athlete.', 'Gopi played most of the matches in the U18 youth league, this shows his hardworking mentality. he needs to work more on his defensive header and defensive clearances with feet. tactically he is doing his role but he has to understand the responsibilities of his position. his communication during the match verbally he needs to focus more. he needs to improve his off-the-ball aggression also. he is a coachable player because of his positive attitude toward the game.\r\n\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(217, 217, 'Krsna is a very dedicated and reserved athlete. He has been developing tremendously since last season. There is a lot of improvement in his technical and tactical ability. As of now he needs to be more communicative and demanding during the game. He also has to be aggressive and use his height to his advantage during 1V1 duels.\r\n', 'Krsna continues to improve but needs to be more consistent in attending training session in order for his game to improve gradually. He needs to communicate , take charge of his position and become an effective player in his position for his team. He is still in developing phase and we need to be patient in his overall football development. He still remains very coachable with good attitude on & off the field.\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(218, 218, 'Deepak  has been developing since his last assessment. As mentioned to him earlier, he has to focus on his Spatial awareness, non-dominant foot to be more aggressive. During duels has to be more communicative among his teammates  & can be better in decision-making.  \r\n', 'Deepak. Is a modern day full back who loves to move up with the ball after winning it, Deepak can be a delight to watch during offensive moment. He needs to work more on his physical side and his stamina to enable him be able to play with the same intensity throughout 90mins. Due to his smallish structure, he’s physically weak in defending moment but has big brain with his tackling skills.'),
(219, 219, 'Aedan is a  very passionate dedicated and enthusiast footballer. He has a brilliant, positive attitude through his behaviour in training and in matches. He needs to focus on his endurance levels & on speed agility. He can also be better with his Spatial awareness, decision making & positioniong without the ball.\r\n', 'Aedan. Has a fantastic game sense but lack of self awareness and confidence slows down his play, must learn to take responsibilities around him in his department, improve his organisational skills and build up play, should work more in 1v1 situation and tackles.'),
(220, 220, 'He has a very positive attitude and a good team mentality. He has to work on his aerial headers, 1V1 duels, spatial awareness, positioning along with focus on his non-dominant foot for defensive clearances & Offensive passing. Overall, he is a very coachable Footballer. There has been an improvement in his game since his last assessment.\r\n', 'first of all, appreciated his good attitude and good mentality. if we compare it with his last assessment there is a lot of improvement. if we look at his technical ability he has to improve his non-dominant foot ability and 1 v 1 defending, defensive headers. tactically he needs to work on his decision-making skills during the match. if he continues with the same mentality he can go further level'),
(221, 221, 'Kian is very passionate, dedicated and an enthusiastic athlete. His strength is his speed ,chasing the ball of opponents while pressing. He has positively contributed towards his team sucess, through some brilliant assist, scoring goals and decent work rate.He is in his development phase, and  should work on his spatial awareness, composure, fitness & rehab by treating his injuries (Hamstring etc), and shoulder the teams attacking responsibility, for the upcoming season.\r\n', 'Kian has had a very productive season with him playing an important role in team\'s success this season. He has got good game time on merit in the Hero Youth Cup as well. He still needs to improve his conversion rate in front of the goal as well become better in Aerial duels. He works very hard in the defensive phase but needs to add composure to his game in the attacking phase. He has got a very good attitude , wonderful team spirit and good attitude to learn & improve.\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(222, 222, 'Gautham - Besides the U18 KSFA competition, he has been given match exposure to the U21 KSFA league too. He has decent, technical ability, and has improved since last assessment of attempt to shoot on goal.He is in his development phase. He needs to focus on spatial awareness , & also in transitioning play from attack to defence and in 1v1 aerial duels.He needs to be communicative on the pitch.Overall, a highly Coachable & a determined Footballer.\r\n', 'Gautham is an intelligent lad, but lack stamina/endurance to complete the minutes. Can be a joy to watch on his good day. Needs to improve on his pace, be more explosive in transition moments, understands his roles and responsibilities in the team and try to cover spaces during defensive phase'),
(223, 223, 'Akshar is a dedicated and a coachable player. He is presently in his development phase. He is surrounded with players who are technically and technically sound ,and has been playing with each other for more than three seasons. He has to understand his role and responsibilities and coach expectations ,towards the same .He is a very positive & always wants to try & put effort to give his best on the pitch. We have to be patient in his development and we are there to support him.\r\n', 'Akshar has shown good improvement when we compare him 3 to 4 months back and now. He has improved his technical ability as well being aggressive w/o the ball which is needed in 1v1 duels. He still has a lot to improve in all areas and still developing. He is very coachable, very disciplined & a team player. '),
(224, 224, 'Pushkar-after the KSFA you 18 competition, has been irregular in training sessions. The more he trains the better he becomes. He needs to focus on his Spatial awareness, and also his decision making under pressure so the Football action is executed well. He also has to focus on this communication among teammates during matches.\r\n', ''),
(225, 225, 'Aaryaman is a very dedicated and a passionate footballer. He wants to learn and improve himself in training and also in matches. He has a very positive attitude and is highly coachable. He needs to be more aggressive in 1v1 duels, work on his technique & running with the ball. His football actions need to be quicker along with the speed of thought and Spatial awareness during games he needs to communicate more on the pitch.\r\n', 'Aaryamun has improved marginally from the time of first assessment but still needs to improve in all areas of the game in order to progress further. He is coachable, has got good positive attitude, asks lots of good questions and has lot of hunger to improve his game. He still needs lot of work in 1v1 situations. His decision making only starts after the ball is at his feet and this needs to change.\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(226, 226, 'He has been developed very positively since his last assessment. He understands the style of play and demands of the game. He has performed well and contributed in the KSFA U 15 as champions. This season he needs to be more communicative believe in himself and play with confidence, he can work on his Spatial awareness, timing of tackles overall a highly coachable athlete to work with. He will be transitioning to the U18 category.\r\n', 'Aiden is developing highly after first assessment. He understands his role in the team depending on the match.he also had a good crossing ability.  He can improve his  tackling and awareness overall coachable player to work with.'),
(227, 227, 'Chemi  is one of the most versatile player in the squad. He is the most experienced and a  hard-working player team player. His work rate is very effective in transitions. He need to be focused more in front of the goal and need not be casual & switched off sometimes.He has good ability to develop into a non-amateur footballer.\r\n', 'Chemi is a versatile player. He is quick and fast in transition. He need to be more composure in final third. Not to be casual and switch off on the pitch needs to be more focus. '),
(228, 228, 'Wanshanbok  is developing into one of the most reliable defenders in the squad. He plays with a lot of passion, hard work and he is a complete team player. His strengths are  his tackles, 1v1 duels, Headers etc. He  is very resilient but  till the end he needs to be focused on Spatial  awareness,  quick decision making during build up play, cultivate concentration, patience while tackling inside the box. Overall a very good athlete to work with.\r\n', 'Wanshanbok is defender who give his all energy for the team. Hard working ,dedicated to football . His concentration and focus till the end of the game needs to be improved.he also need to be patience and know when and where to go for tackle and delay . '),
(229, 229, 'Henlengmang has been one of the most instrumental players as a defensive midfielder, this season through his individual brilliance and good football actions with his valuable contribution he was the U15 KSFA champion. He has one more season in U15 to elevate his game ; be more confident and dominate the midfield. He can improve on his Spatial  awareness and striking more goals from outside the box, Overall a fantastic athlete to work with.\r\n', 'Henlenmang is a hardworking midfielder. Who understands his role and responsibilities in team. He has 1 more years in U15 . He can improve on his long ball ,awareness and shooting outside the box.'),
(230, 230, 'Washim has been developing well since his last assessment he is playing in the DPDL  U15 league and understands our style of play and his role and responsibilities. He is a versatile footballer can play in defence as well as in midfield needs to focus on the speed of thought and speed of play when to dribble when to pass under pressure. He needs to be more communicative among his teammates he can use his height to the advantage.\r\n', 'Washim is doing better and had more understanding our style of play. He need to improve or focus more on when to play quick in the situation demands and when to hold or dribble . He need to improve his communication with teammates and use the advantage of his height and strength. '),
(231, 231, 'Nicky  has been a massive  with his progress as a goalkeeper. Since last assessment, he understands his role and responsibilities much better. He is experiencing more game time in the DPDL competition. He can focus more on effective communication among his teammates and assess the 1V1 situation and  positioning.He displays top attitude in training.\r\n', ''),
(232, 232, 'Digbijoy  is one of the most influential player this season and through his valuable contribution, the team has been champions, his strengths are his technique, vision , awareness, composure under pressure along with accurate shooting outside the box & headers. He can work more on his endurance levels as he will be transitioning to the U18 category next season.', 'Digbijoy is one of the most important function of the team his technical and shooting accuracy and header help the team so much. He can work more on transition to defense and endurance level as he is going to u18 next season. Overall a brilliant player.'),
(233, 233, 'Nibo is  a very dedicated, passionate and hard-working footballer, comparatively to his last assessment he has improved his football actions in 1V1 duels &  agility & Speed was his hallmark. We need to focus on his objectives of he being more consistent, also dealing with injuries. Be effective communicator and be more clinical in front of the goal.\r\n', 'nibho is a hardworking and good mentality player. we have seen steady improvement from the time of the first assessment & to now. He still needs to be disciplined in his positioning in the midfield and should not \'switch off. he needs to improve his duties with & without the ball during the game. He still needs that extra aggression without the ball. He needs to chase the ball back quickly. He needs to show hunger & quickness off the ball to sustain the U18 Category. His technical quality with the ball & ability to play with both his right & left leg is still top-notch. He has had a good season having some stellar performances in the ksfa league and we are very happy with his contribution to the team. We want Nibo to step up further in the coming season.\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(234, 234, 'Apoorv  shows a lot of dedication and interest in the game. He wants to improve himself and he is an avid learner. He is in his development phase. He needs to be working on his football actions. Also Spatial  awareness, need to be more aggressive in 1V1 duels, also  in aerial ball and in tackling. He needs to be more vocal ,communicative among his teammates overall, a highly coachable athlete to work with.\r\n', 'apoorv is a hardworking player he has a good and positive attitude during training sessions and matches. he needs to work more on his technical ability like first touch, 1 v 1 dribbling, and passing accuracy. tactically he needs to understand his responsibilities during the match. He still needs that extra aggression without the ball. He needs to chase the ball back quickly. He needs to show hunger & quickness off the ball to sustain the U18 Category. he is a highly coachable player\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(235, 235, 'Sean is a very dedicated footballer. He has been \r\nirregular in training sessions. The more he trains the better he can improve on his Football actions.\r\n', ''),
(236, 236, 'Themngam is a very passionate and hard-working midfielder being a left footed. He needs to also work on his non-dominant foot to gain an advantage he can improve on his Spatial awareness went to dribble & when to pass and most importantly to communicate effectively among his teammates.\r\n', 'themngam has improved and had a very good season in KSFA YPL. He needs to manage his injury and not miss too many sessions. He can still improve his speed, and Decision making. He still is a wonderful team player & good positive player with a good attitude. He needs to work on his non-dominant foot. his verbal communication during the match needs to improve. '),
(237, 237, 'Rayhaan Jamil- since his last assessment he has improved in his football actions, he understands his role and responsibilities. He has been given exposure to TAL competition. He can focus on his spatial awareness, in 1V1 duels, headers, and positioning during transition play. Overall a fantastic athlete to work with.\r\n', 'Rayhaan has improved well since his last assessment in all areas of the game. He has got good game time in TAL and that experience has helped him to improve his overall game. He still lacks consistency in his decision making with ball , he needs to be more aggressive without the ball especially during team pressing phase/transitions. He needs to explore playing in different positions as now he tends to only play on the left wing. He is still very coachable with good positive attitude & character on & off the field.\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(238, 238, 'Pradyun Mahesh-Since his last assessment, he has been developing very positively. He is a very intelligent and a hard-working footballer. He has good potential as a midfielder. He can focus on his special awareness, switch off, play and being more clinical in long-range shooting consistently,  though he has a huge potential. He needs to be more confident and believe in his ability. Most importantly, he needs to communicate among his teammates.\r\n', 'Pradyun has improved very well since his last assessment, He\'s a very Personality to work with being one of the calmest player on the ground, He can be an even better midfielder by time and effort, he needs to work on switching of play, his negative transition isn\'t still upto mark and needs to be more aggressive on the field and communicate with his players well, he can improve his long shot even more and long passes, overall a hardworking player who never misses any sessions'),
(239, 239, 'Aashrith, the more training session he attends, his development has been positive. he has been shaping as a midfielder  & has shown a good work rate. he needs to be more communicative among teammates. he can work on his endurance levels , shooting & transitional play, especially his positioning. overall a fantastic player to work with.\r\n', 'Aashrith is steadily improving as a player, his mental fortitude is at a good level, always calm and composed. He has good energy as he gives 110% every single game, good short passes and reading of the game is fantastic but id want him to develop as a person more, he needs to lead the team more not just with actions but with words, improve his long passes and heading ability, overall one of my favorite players to work with '),
(240, 240, 'Ameen is currently in his development face. He has been improving on his technique and running with the ball compared to his last assessment. He is understanding his role and responsibilities. As per the demands of the game. He needs to be regular in attending training sessions. He also needs to focus on his communication among his teammates.\r\n', ''),
(241, 241, 'Sai Siddharth,  being in his development phase,. is currently playing in the DPDLU 15 league has been slowly understanding what is expected from him and his role and responsibilities as a left full back. He needs to be more communicative among teammates, be aggressive in 1v1 duels , recovery runs, timing of tackles, headers and also focus on his spatial awareness, vision and his non-dominant foot.\r\n', 'Sai Siddharth has been developing a few areas very well. his dribbling, understanding of his position, crosses, and the timing of his runs but he still has a lot to improve on his weak foot, body positioning on a 1v1, headers, spatial awareness, and close control. overall a great athlete to work with who\'s always open to learning new information.'),
(242, 242, 'Aditya Vinodh- is a very passionate, hard-working and an intelligent footballer. He\'s been one of the most outstanding players, possessing decent technique, in the squad. He is versatile to play different positions, as per the demand of the team. He has excellent ball control, dribbling, and shooting abilities. You need to be more communicative, work on his endurance levels, his combination plays. Overall a fantastic athlete to work with\r\n', 'Aditya has improved immensely throughout this season.\r\nVery skilful and intelligent technical player.\r\nCan improve on his acceleration and better vision of the field.\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(243, 243, 'Phonlang Khai- for past two seasons, has been one of the outstanding and the most hard-working players in the squad. The team always relies & believes in his abilities & every time he steps up to the occasion.This season, has been an ups &  downs for him considering his goal scoring, but nevertheless, we all coaches support him, trust in him and positively will work on him to make him to achieve his goal scoring objectives.\r\n', 'Phonlang has had another productive year but his usual form has been slightly dipping in the latter part of the season. We all know his quality & impact on games he can have . He has all the support from coaches & management. He needs to communicate more progressing forward in his career\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(244, 244, 'Gerrard  is one of the most talented, crafty and technically gifted footballer. His vision, decision making under pressure along with composure has been outstanding. He can dictate the match at any moment & have the ability to change the entire scenario of the match in his teams favour to surprise the opponent. Due to his valuable contribution in midfield, the team were declared  U18 champions in the KSFA League. He need to deal with injury prevention & can be better with aerial duels and also communication among teammates.\r\n', 'Gerrard is by far one of the most improved player this season in U18 category with terrific consistency in his game. He made major contribution in Hero Youth Cup and U18 Championship run. He needs to remain injury free and keep training.\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(245, 245, 'Samprangshai  is one of the dedicated and passionate footballer, mainly  known for his immense physical presence during 1v1 duels, and long range shooting on the field. Due to his performance, he had been selected for the U 17. National camp where is confidence level was boosted. He\'s a very hard-working player but needs to maintain his concentration and composure. During tackles. He needs to be also tactically disciplined in negative transitions and can be better in positioning himself to being at the right moment at the right time. Over all a fantastic team player.\r\n', 'Sam has shown big improvements in latter part of the season with more consistent performances with & without ball. He still needs to continue to show the same levels going forward. He can also play multiple positions giving the team extra dimension in attack & defence. He needs to show more discipline in his game if he needs to sustain in U18 category.\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(246, 246, 'Kristopher is one of the most disciplined, dedicated and a passionate Footballer. He\'s been a hard worker and he\'s attitude in training and matches has been outstanding. He has shaped up into a positive centre back, full back or a winger as per the demands of the game and proved his versatility time and again.His valuable contribution also help the team to be champions in the U18 category. He can focus to improve on his vision, awareness,  timing of tackles, though he is extremely good at it, but has to make right decisions. when he is the second last defender. Overall a fantastic athlete to work with. He possess an excellent work rate & committment.\r\n', 'Kristopher continues to show terrific consistency in his game irrespective of the opponent. He is very focussed and can play multiple positions effectively and contributes heavily in team\'s performance. He can still work on his composure under pressure & can better his communication.\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)\r\n'),
(247, 247, 'Rohen singh  is the most dedicated, passionate, hard-working and a versatile Footballer. His major strengths being his quickness, Speed and agility ,fast pace under pressure beating opponents during the 1v1 duels. He can further improve on his communication, skill and combination play to elevate his game to the next level. His contribution has been very positive to the team for lifting the U18 championship and has been rightly rewarded, by selecting for the U 17 national camp, and he has huge potential to make it to the professional level.\r\n', 'Rohen is having a terrific end to the season contributing heavily in team\'s winning performance in KSFA U18 championship run as well as shining as a top midfielder in Hero Youth Cup. He needs to improve his communication, goal conversion rate and that can really help his game to improve.\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(248, 248, 'Anish has been one of the most influential players in midfield that contributed the success, as  U18 KSFA championship for the team. His strengths are his physicality and long passing ability along with shooting. He needs to focus on his speed of thought speed of play decision making and execution to elevate his performance he needs to be more communicative among his teammates during matches.\r\n', ''),
(249, 249, 'Jomon is a highly Passionate, skillfull, technically gifted & a brave Footballer. His valuable contributions through his goals, scoring abilities and assists have made the team U18 KSFA champions. His quality of first touch under pressure, body feints, hoodwinking defenders and goalscoring prowess  had been a major threat to the opponents. The beginning of the season,We extremely believed in his potential as a  big match player & can surprise any opponent or team on a given day. He proved us right and scored a brace in the finals of the competition. He is a very shy and reserved person but needs to be more communicative. He needs to work on his rehabilitation, so he gain optimum fitness. He has a very bright future to make it to the professional football.\r\n', ''),
(250, 250, 'Ngamgouguun, compared to his last assessment, he has been shaping positively and have been an integral part of the team. He can be better in transition of play offensive & defensive. He needs to be expressive , vocal  & communicate among his teammates. He always get himself in good scoring positions, and needs to be more consistent  & clinical in front of the goal. Overall, he is a brilliant athlete to work with.\r\n', 'Gouguun has improved positively, he is capable of so much more but he isn\'t aware of it yet. he needs to improve his pressing, be vocal and speak more to his teammates, heading, and decision making. he\'s comfortable with both his foot and he has excellent shot power with him. overall a good player and a well mannered child'),
(251, 251, 'Ram is a very passionate, dedicated and and intelligent footballer.He tries to give his best in training and in matches the focus is to work on his strength training, which will help him to deal with 1v1 duels. We all coaches are there to support him and develop him to meet his objectives. We have to be patient in his development.\r\n', 'Ram is a dedicated player and a intelligent player. His contribution to his teammates was so positive. He need to focus on his strength a long passes and shooting.we have to be patient  with him. '),
(252, 252, 'Hope  is a dedicated and passionate footballer. He seems very reserved in training. He needs to focus on his vision, awareness and composure to be clinical in front of the goal. He needs to be communicative among teammates and believe in his abilities. Overall a very hard-working  team player.\r\n', 'Hope. Lack defensive awareness and communication, hope must understand where/when/how and why of the every situation, must learn to cut inside rather than move on the line when the fullback is wide, needs to improve his ball deliveries, goal conversion and support play'),
(253, 253, 'Vishwak  is currently in his development phase and have experienced the U15 competitive matches. He has been learning regarding his role and responsibilities, during offensive and defensive transition play. He can be better with his crossing abilities and passing but needs to be more clinical in front of the goal. He needs to focus on his endurance levels in humid conditions, Spatial awareness, defending & Communication among his teammates. Overall a brilliant athlete to work with.\r\n', 'Vishwak has been developing steadily so far this season, especially in DPDL. his dribbling and crossing have improved, and slowly he\'s understanding his role and the responsibilities of his position too. he needs to be even more clinical in front of the goal, build endurance, defend in 1v1, and have spatial awareness. hes a good player to work with and really disciplined'),
(254, 254, 'Amaan Jamil is currently in his development phase. He has been displaying  positive attitude and commitment. During matches, he has  improved immensely on his technique, quality of first touch, shielding etc. He is also scoring goals through set pieces, especially free, kicks and penalty kicks for the team.He need to be more aggressive in 1v1 duels, aerial Balls, Spatial awareness and communication.\r\n', 'Amaan has been Developing Steadily, his attitude when things are working well for him is great but seems to lose his emotional control when situations go against him. He has improved well in his set pieces and dribbling, and can do even better with his finishing outside the box. he needs to understand how to defend aggressively without committing fouls, improve on aerial duels, spatial awareness, and work on his mental fortitude. overall a good leader on and off the pitch and a well mannered player'),
(255, 255, 'Jonah  is currently in his development phase. He\'s been given exposure to DPDLU 13 competition and has displayed a positive improvement.He can be more aggressive  in 1v1 duels, and focus on his communication among teammates during matches.\r\n', 'Jonah has been developing a lot in the DPDL season. He is a quick learner and a very coachable player. His defensive abilities are good. He can work on being more aggressive and winning aerial duels.'),
(256, 256, 'Daniel is a very disciplined and a hard-working footballer. He has improved drastically compared to the last two seasons and displays a lot of  confidence as a defender. He has been given a lot of exposure in TAL tournament. He can focus on spatial awareness, speed of thought and speed of play and communication among his teammates, overall a fantastic athlete to work with\r\n', 'Danial has improved and had a very good season in Hero Youth Cup & TAL. He needs to manage his injury and not miss too many sessions. He can still improve his speed , Decision making. He still is wonderful team player & good positive player with good attitude. \r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)'),
(257, 257, 'Ansh has Improved from his last assessment with experiencing competitive ksfa matches. He\'s is highly coachable versatile player. He can improve on his awareness, communication. He has one more year in U15 which will help him level up his performance overall good athlete to work with. ', 'Ansh has improved throughout the season. He\'s coachable and versatile player. He should have more consistency in his performances. He can improve his movements with and without the ball, communication among his teammates,  overall good athlete to work with. \r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable to the age group/ it is not done for the athletes. 0 indicates the athlete was not present during the assessment)'),
(258, 258, 'Rishan has improved from his last assessment. He has a good experience in ksfa youth league competition matches with U15. The advantage He has is he will be in U15 one more year. He can improve on his communication, Spatial awareness, shooting at the goal and aggressive with the opponent. He will be better player if he train more with the team.good player to work with.', 'Rishan has improved throughout the season. He can improve on his spatial awareness, shooting at the goal and aggression with the ball. He will be better if he train more with the team. Overall good athlete to work with. \r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable to the age group/ it is not done for the athletes. 0 indicates the athlete was not present during the assessment)'),
(259, 259, 'Yatharth Malik.\r\nHe is a passionate &  a  dedicated Athletes.He needs to focus on his, Agility, Decision making under pressure and Spatial awareness.He has been improving, but needs to maintain consistenc. He also needs to be communicating among his teammates during training and matches.Overall a fantastic, Coachable Athlete to work with.', 'Yatharth has improved at a good pace throughout this season.\r\nHe\'s a team player and works hard.\r\nCan improve on his speed and agility.\r\n\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable to the age group/ it is not done for the athletes. 0 indicates the athlete was not present during the assessment)'),
(260, 260, 'Sarthak\r\nHe is currently enjoying his role in the team and displays a lot of dedication to the game.He needs to focus on his fitness level, Agility and Spatial awareness.He also can improve on his non dominant foot.He needs to be communicating among his teammates during training and matches.Overall a fantastic, Coachable Athlete to work with.', 'Sarthakk has improved at a good pace throughout the season.\r\nHe\'s a very coachable player and strong defender as well as a target striker.\r\nHe can improve on his speed and acceleration.\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable/not done for the age group. 0 indicates the athlete was absent  during the particular assessment)\r\n\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable to the age group/ it is not done for the athletes. 0 indicates the athlete was not present during the assessment)'),
(261, 261, '', ''),
(262, 262, '', ''),
(263, 263, '', 'Tae su is humble and hardworking player who plays and developing as a defender.his attitude as a defender and fighting spirit for the team was good. He needs to improve on his first touch , communication and confidence in with the ball. We have To be patient as he was in his development phase.'),
(264, 264, '', 'Keshav is in his development phase. We have to be patient with him, he need to improve the basics of football receive ,passing communication, awareness turning.'),
(265, 265, 'Arav is in his development phase. He has shown a lot of positive attitude to learn and improve. Presently he has to focus and work on his technique, positional sense and the understanding of the game. Let us be patient in his development. Overall, a good coachable player.', 'Arav is in his early developing stage. We are working on his basic technical and improving his motor skills. He is very coachable and a team player. Tried hard to follow instructions and has flare at moments. The exposure he is getting in DPDL is at a good level which will helf him pace of improvement.'),
(266, 266, '', ''),
(267, 267, 'Yathaarth is in his development phase, he needs to work on his speed, and be more aggressive off the ball, speed of thought on the ball. he has been improving well so far', 'Yathaarth has been improving well, he needs to work on his quickness and agility on and off the ball, work on his headers, and his speed of thought on the ball. he\'s a very coachable and disciplined player'),
(268, 268, 'Ansh is in his developing phase. He can improve on his Spatial awareness, movement after releasing the ball and attain more regular for the session.', 'Ansh is in his development phase. Who just transit to u15 ,he have to be more regular for the session for his improvement , he can improve on his negative transition and awareness '),
(269, 269, 'Dheer has developed as a defender looking back to last session where he was his improvement in defender was exceptional, he can improve on his clearance, dicision making when pressure and take leadership in the team, overall a good athlete to work with.', 'Dheer is developing as a defender, he has improved and understands his role when to use his physical and becoming tough . He can improve his accuracy ,clearance and dicision making under pressure '),
(270, 270, '', ''),
(271, 271, 'Steve is in his development phase, he needs to work on his body co-ordination and defensive stance, he has good speed. he has allot to improve but is a very coachable player.', 'Steve needs to work on his defensive heading and body coordination, he needs to learn to control his emotions on and off the field too, he\'s a highly enthusiastic player with a keen interest in learning football as well as playing, all in all, a good player to work with'),
(272, 272, 'Karthik is in his development phase, he needs to work on his weak foot and defensive header he is higly committed to the team with a very good attitude on field. a highly coachable player who will improve over time', 'Karthik is very technical player, with a good sense of the game. he needs to work on his weaker foot and be more agressive in defending aerial balls. he has a very good attitude on and off the field. '),
(273, 273, 'Keshav is in his development phase. He needs to work on his Spatial awareness, to improve his technique of his kick, first touch should not bounce and passing accuracy we have to be patience in his development.', 'Keshav is in his development phase, he needs to improve his longball, first touch, awareness and passing accuracy. '),
(274, 274, 'Ashok is in his development phase, he has improved well. he still needs to work on his defensive heading, speed, and quick decision-making. he is a very committed and disciplined player and very receptive to instructions', 'Ashok has grown into a better person and a player, but he still needs to learn to make decisions for himself at times rather than be a textbook player. he needs to work on his heading and agility, his long balls has improved but there needs to be more consistency, all in all a great player to work with'),
(275, 275, 'Pradyun has been developing very positively and also play some matches u17 ksfa which will gain his confidence. He is a very intelligent and a hard-working. He has a potential as a midfielder. He can focus on his Spatial awareness, switch off play and being more clinical in long-range shooting consistently. Most importantly, he needs to communicate among his teammates.overall good athlete to work with.', 'Pradyun is a developing player , who has the ability, good potential as a midfielder. He can focus on his special awareness, switch off play  He needs to be more confident and believe in his ability. Most importantly, he needs to communicate among his teammates.\r\n to keep the ball or play the ball safe , he can improve his movements without the ball , awareness , communication.'),
(276, 276, 'Vishwak is in his development phase. He is a versatile player. He has improved after experiencing U15 KSFA league and DPDL last season. He can improve on his communication among his teammates and blind side defending. Overall good athlete to work with. ', 'Vishwak has improved alot . He is also versatile player from winger as a defender. He is winning alots of interception dealing 1v1,and understanding the instructions. He can improve on his communication ,Take more long range shoots on the goals  and blind side defending. Overall he is a good player and has good discipline good player to work with.'),
(277, 277, 'Arav is in his development phase, he needs to work on the basics and he needs to communicate more, improve his control over the ball, and work on his weak foot and headering. he\'s a very hardworking player and highly disciplined on and off the field.', 'Arav has improved as a player but there\'s a long way to go for him. he needs to work on his communication on field and be more calm on the ball. he needs to improve his heading and shooting too. he\'s a very hardworking player.'),
(278, 278, '', ''),
(279, 279, '', ''),
(280, 280, 'Rishan is in his developing phase, a versatile left footer, he can improve on his first touch under pressure, awareness and non-dominent foot . He is a good athlete to work with. ', 'Rishan is a left footer and versatile player who can play as a striker, winger and attacking midfielder. He can improve his first touch, non-dominent foot which his right foot and awareness .'),
(281, 281, 'Abhinav is in development phase who transition from u13 to u15 , he needs to work on his first touch, communication , longball and awareness. He has the mentality to try new position which will elevate his football intelligence.', 'Abhinav is a player who has a mentality to play in any position which is good for him as he is in development phase, he can improve his first touch, communication and awareness '),
(282, 282, 'Rancho is in his development phase, he\'s still transitioning to U15 category and we need to be patient with him, he can work on his first touch and quick decision making and be more aggressive off the ball', 'Rancho is still adjusting to the speed of play in U15, he needs to make quick decisions with the ball and take better first touches followed by more shots on goal. he has a good ability to play quality through balls and a good long-passing ability. he also needs to understand and focus on the coach\'s instruction. all in all a well-behaved player with good emotional control'),
(283, 283, 'Wanshanbok  is developing into one of the most reliable defenders who can also play forward in the squad. He plays with a lot of passion, hard work and he is a complete team player. His strengths are  his tackles, 1v1 duels, Headers ,pressing when he plays forwards. He can be focused on Spatial  awareness,  quick decision making during build up play, cultivate concentration, patience while tackling inside the box. Overall a very good athlete to work with.', 'Wanshanbok is a versatile player,hard working and he is a team player. He is good at tackles, 1v1 duels, Headers etc. He needs to be focused all time on Spatial  awareness,  quick decision making during build up play, cultivate concentration, patience while tackling inside the box, he can improve on his dicision making.\r\n'),
(284, 284, 'Henlengmang has been one of the most important function players in the midfield, with his valuable contribution he was the U15 KSFA champion and DPDL champion last season.He needs be more confident take leadership in the team with his experience of last season and dominate the midfield. He can improve on his Spatial  awareness,patience in tackling in his own half and striking more goals from outside the box, Overall a fantastic athlete to work with.', 'Henlenmang is a midfielder who is always ready to learn new position besides midfield, he is a complete team player he was the U15 KSFA & U15 DPDL champion of 2022-2023. He needs to be more confident and dominate the midfield. He can improve on his Spatial  awareness ,timing of the pass, weight of passing and shoot more goals from outside the box, Overall a good player to work with.'),
(285, 285, 'Dhruv kaloo is in his development phase who has already experienced last year in u15 ksfa, he can improve on his long ball ,non dominant foot,negative transition and awareness,  overall a good athlete to work with', 'He is a good technical player who can play in a tight space also he is a versatile player, he can improve on his long ball ,awareness and negative transition.'),
(286, 286, 'Ram is an intelligent footballer and passionate. He is U15 KSFA champion of last season. He has to focus to work on his strength training, which will help him to deal with 1v1 duels and positioning in negative transition. We have to be patience in his development.', 'Ram is a highly good technical player , good communicatio,dedicated player and a intelligent player. His contribution to his teammates was so positive. we have to be patience with him. He is calm with the ball. He can improve on his negative transition where to cover(positioning)'),
(287, 287, 'Kavin currently is in his development phase where the basic techniques and simple tactics needs to be practised. He needs to practices more on his awareness and first touch under pressure. Also the decision making needs to become quicker. Has a good attitude in the training and listens to the coaches instruction. Should be more commited to improve his techniques and understand the demands of the game. ', 'Need to work on basic techniques and develop game intelligence. Must work very hard to be able to play in matches. Should be more committed to the training and matches. Attitude to learning and developing is good. '),
(288, 288, 'Nischal is dedicated footballer and wants to perform his best every match. He is a good team player and works hard in the matches to help the team in attack and defense. He has a good sense for the game, sometimes can take better decision during the matches. Crossing technique is his strength and delivers good corner kicks in the match. Should work on speed on and off the ball and shooting from long range. Should keep working on his technique and speed to perform his best.', 'Good attitude to develop as he always asks for feedback on his performance. Has good technique and 1v1 quality. Can perform better if he works on his physical aspect of speed and stamina. Shooting and crossing technique is good. Should work on his defensive side of the game.'),
(289, 289, 'Tae su is developing as strong defender and leader in the team. He has a good training mentality and works hard during the training. Should work on his Long passes and Defendsive Heading. Off the ball needs to improve his speed and understanding of the game. He has good tackling ablility while defending and 1v1 situations. On the ball should improve pass selection and timing of the pass. Overall developing well in defense and can play any position in the back four. Keep working on the technique and speed to improve.', 'Brilliant attitude in the training and in matches. Passing and dribbling techniques are good, can improve decision making. Combination play is good. Crossing and cutbacks are well timed and accurate. Should keep working on his long passes. Tactically understands the game well and defensive actions like tackling, heading and blocking are good. Should improve speed and agility.');
INSERT INTO `ci_notes_from_coaching` (`id`, `forms_id`, `notes_frm_tech_dir`, `notes_frm_head_coach`) VALUES
(290, 290, 'Aashvik is currently at an intermediate level and needs to develop his Technical, Physical , tactical and Psychosocial aspects of the game. At U17 level the level of competition and opponent is high and Aashvik needs to work hard to match the level. Aashvik has a good understanding of the game and good crossing ability. Should work on his attitude in the training and in the matches to give his 100 percent. ', 'Has good crossing technique. Should improve 1v1 in attacking phase. Should put more effort in the match after losing the ball. Can understand the instructions well and has good understanding of the game. Should take more shots on target. Should improve decision making of when to pass and when to dribble.'),
(291, 291, 'Mahimna is an enthusiastic and positive player. Good attitude during the training and puts his full effort. Communicates well on and off the pitch with all his teammates. Shows good leadership qualiites. Should work on his finishing outside the box and playing under pressure. Quick learner and takes the coaches points well. Keep up the enthusiasm and keep working hard on the pitch ', 'Good attitude in the training and has a winning mentality. Works hard during the training. Short passing and through pass techniques are good. Should improve shooting and finishing. Communication is good and motivates his teammates well. Shows positive attitude and enthusiasm in training and matches. Keep working on your technique and physical aspect of speed and strength.'),
(292, 292, 'Manu is in his development phase and learning the requirements to play in Center back position. Makes lot of mistakes in the match situation as he is under pressure, more match experiences will help him be more calm during the pressure situations. Should work on his Long passes and clearance technique. Can develop into a good Center back as he has good tackling ability. Should work more on his technical aspect. ', 'Currently in his development phase. Need to work a lot on his basic techniques and his coordination (Body Movements and With Ball). Attitude during traing and match is good. Should improve communication on the pitch and be more serious. While playing makes lot of mistakes which should be avoided. And should listen to coaches and use the correct technique while clearing the ball or passing the ball.'),
(293, 293, 'Hope is a good player on the ball, can take on players with his skill and speed. In wide areas can play good crosses and with space can be very effective during the positive transitions. During training should improve focus. During the match should work on decsion making and especially need to improve behaviour after losing the ball. Can be very effective player if focuses on negative transitions. Listens to the coach and plays well with teammates. ', 'Has good speed and can be very dangerous when he lot of space on the ball. Good stamina and works hard on the pitch. Need to improve decision making on and off the ball. Listens well to the coach and shows good team work. '),
(294, 294, 'Gouguun has a good attitude and listens well to the coaches. Should be more regular to the training and matches. Has good ability to play long passes and crosses. Under pressure can improve his touch and passing. Shows good aggression to win the ball and in challenges. Should be more vocal and communicate on the pitch. Has a good potential and needs to be regular to the training to improve his game.', 'Good strength and speed. In the matches can play in various positions.  Good in playing long passes and winning the air ball. And in set pieces can deliver good balls. Corner also can play good ball. Valubale player to the team should be more regular to the training and matches. '),
(295, 295, 'Kabir is in his development phase, he\'s been transitioning from academy football to 11-side football. he needs to work on his close control of the ball , communication and the basics of football. he\'s a very disciplined player', 'Kabir has shown an upward trajectory over his development, but he still has allot to improve on the basics. he needs to work on his control over the ball and crossing, and he has to break away from his shell to not communicate and be okay with communicating even if it\'s uncomfortable for him. he\'s a very disciplined player and very keen to play the sport'),
(296, 296, 'David is currently in the development phase as a midfielder. Although he possesses intelligence with the ball, he needs to improve his spatial awareness, scanning, and quick decision-making abilities to increase his output. Furthermore, he needs to be more aggressive in both aerial and ground 1v1 duels in the U19 category. Despite these areas for improvement, David is a highly coachable player and is showing positive progress.', 'David is a skilled player with impressive ball control abilities. However, he needs to work on improving his work rate off the ball and his commitment to aggressively winning the ball. Additionally, he needs to work on his fitness level, especially in situations where the team is transitioning from defense to attack. Despite these areas for improvement, David is eager to learn and has a self-confident attitude. He has a more to learn, but if he remains dedicated to the team, he can continue to grow and develop as a player.'),
(297, 297, 'Trinabh is in his development phase.  He is promoted from academy center to excellence program. He is a hard working and dedicated player. He can improve on his first touch under pressure ,Spatial awareness and communication. Overall good athlete to work with. ', 'Trinabh is a developing from academy center , He understand his role as a fullback or winger , he has a ability to defend and go up and put a crossing,  he can improve on his awareness, communication and dicision making .'),
(298, 298, 'Praneeth is in his development phase.He has shown a good promise in the preseason & has been consistent with his performances.He can improve on his recovery runs, headers & communication. Overall a brilliant athlete to work with.', 'Praneeth has progressed well in the last two months with good mature performances for the team . He has shown good character on & off the ground taking responsibility for himself & the team. We needs to work on recovery runs , aerial duel . Overall good technical ability, tactical understanding and has lot of potential for the future. \r\n*Note - Praneeth was not in the training during the Physical Assessment Tests*'),
(299, 299, 'Dhruv is in his development phase.Extremely delighted to monitor his progress, since last competitive seasons.He has a huge potential to emerge as a professional Football with his current technical & tactical abilities.He needs to be consistent, focussed &  committed to his  Team\'s role & responsibilities.A brilliant Athlete to work with.', 'Dhruv is improving steadily and is often delivering very consistent performances for the team. He has shown good maturity in defending without the ball. With the ball, he has shown good ability in his crosses and passing range. Dhruv needs to make sure that his performances are consistent, irrespective of the opponent\'s quality, and comes to training and games with a positive mindset to improve himself and the team. He has shown a lot of promise for the future with his technical ability and tactical understanding, and he is one of our exciting homegrown talent to watch out for as long as he stays grounded and humble.'),
(300, 300, 'He is in his development phase.He is improving in his goal scoring abilities & combination play.He sometimes tends to be over anxious during the matches, which perhaps surrounds him taking all the team pressure on himself that impacts on his scoring abilities.Overall a good athlete to work with.', 'Karan is a good athlete with positive attitude to learn & improve. He has positively shown us in glimpses w.r.t his finishing & dribbling ability what he can offer to the team. His next step is to give consistent performances for the team without over-thinking about his performances.He can still improve his decision making in front of the goal. '),
(301, 301, 'Vedant is in his development phase.He has astounded the technical staff through his significant progress in the game & earned on merit the Captains Arm band for his stupendous performances; being multifaceted playing various positions as per the demands of the team in matches.He can be more communicative & recovery runs.', 'Vedant has shown tremendous improvement in the last 4-6 months. He has picked up information from the coaches and tried to execute it to best of his ability. He has shown tremendous versatility in his game and can play in 3 different position with ease. He also has shown good finishing ability from outside the box. He can still improve his communication, agility, recovery runs & leadership skills.'),
(302, 302, 'Sumair is in his development phase.He has been adept & can assimilate coaches instructions efficiently.He has shown a positive progress in training & in matches.He can improve on his communication during matches & heading technique.\r\nThe more training sessions he attends, the higher chances to get better.', 'Sumair is a good athlete with good behaviour on & off the field. He works very hard and tries to improve in every session. He is also able to take information from the coaches & execute it to best of his ability. He has also shown good maturity  in his game w.r.t his decision making. He can still improve on his finishing & heading. For Sumair , the next step would to be consistent in his attendance for training so that he can improve further.\r\n *Note - Sumair was not in the training during the Physical Assessment Tests*'),
(303, 303, 'Vaibhav is in his development phase.He has been displaying positive attitude in training & matches, post recovering from a injury.He is highly receptive to coaches information &  strives to execute it during games.He has to improve on his communication skills among teammates for better combination play or during transitions.He is determined in his role as an attacker within the team.', 'Vaibhav is a good athlete with positive attitude to learn & improve. He has good 1v1 ability but he still can improve further on this aspect. He can also improve his communication & has to demand the ball from his team-mates trusting his ability. He also needs to adapt to playing on both the wings to add versatility to his game. He can improve his shooting from outside the box as well. Overall a very good athlete to work with because of his commitment and hunger to improve. We are monitoring his progress closely. Needs to manage his injury concerns so that he is consistently training.'),
(304, 304, 'He is in his development phase.He is displaying good maturity in his role as a Centre back & add a lot of value to the team.He needs to be more vocal guiding his teammates during moments of the game.', 'Aryan has shown lot of potential & maturity in his performances this season . He also has been very keen to learn & progress further in his development. He can still improve his communication , leadership qualities , recovery runs. Overall superb athlete to work with and a good team player.  We are closely monitoring his progress and we are happy to say that he is on the right path in his development. \r\n*Note - Aryan was not in the training during the Arrowhead Agility Test*'),
(305, 305, 'He is in his development phase.He plays a pivotal role; in marshalling the defense & often proven lethan in attacking setpieces especially corners.He needs to improve on his recovery runs & long ball.', 'Shaurya is continuing to improve this season and he is trying hard to make up for the time he lost in the pre-season. We are happy with his progress this season and he continues to lead our defensive line with maturity. He can improve his long balls & his non-dominant foot to further strengthen his game for the future.\r\n*Note - Shaurya was not in the training during the Physical Assessment Tests*'),
(306, 306, 'Adbul is in his development phase.He was given exposure earlier in the U21 KSFA League, which gradually helped his confidence level.He has good ball control, dribbling skills in  tight spaces, whereas the goal scoring abilities must be consistent.Communication among teammates during matches & Hydration, Nutrition intake is of paramount importance for his positive growth ahead.', 'Adbul is a good athlete to work with. He is showing lot of interest to improve & learn. Adbul has good dribbling abilities but he can further improve his decision making on whether he has to dribble or release the ball . He also needs to add consistency to his game. Overall he is doing well but should improve further with his decision making with ball in order to make consistent impact in the games. He can improve his communication & leadership skills.'),
(307, 307, 'He is in his development phase.His brilliant work rate &  adaptabilty to play multi positions for the team, has been his hallmark. Satvik is an excellent team player, and we are elated to see his progress within the team.He can be more vocal on the pitch.', 'Satvik is a good athlete to work with due to his commitment to improve and learn . He has shown very good versatility, 1v1 ability , good crossing range and good defensive work-rate. He is a very good example of team-player. He is always positive and happy to help his team-mates. He can still improve his communication with his team-mates . He can improve on his outside the box finishing. Overall we are happy to see his progress from a very young age and he continues to improve year-by-year.'),
(308, 308, 'Arjun  is in his development phase.Though he has not regained full fitness, his contribution in goal scoring for his team has been remarkable.His knack for dribbling past opponents on the flanks & scoring stunning goals, has been his trademark.We wish him a speedy recovery.', 'Arjun has shown tremendous improvement in the last 4-5 months . He has played & scored in important games helping his team in offensive situations. Arjun\'s dribbling & finishing are his strengths . He needs to work on improving his consistency along with improving his defensive work-rate. He also needs to adapt playing on the other wing to add versatility to his game.Overall very positive athlete to work with due to his desire to improve. We are monitoring his progress closely. We wish him best to recover from his injury. \r\n*Note - Arjun was not in the training during the Physical Assessment Tests*'),
(309, 309, 'Akshay is in his development phase.He has been battling with his hamstring injuries for months,but his enthusiasm & team spirit for his colleagues during the matches has been outstanding.He is a definite potential in defense, and we look up to his positive contribution to the team.We wish him a speedy recovery; so as he can work on all the technical,  tactical, physical components of the game. Overall a brilliant Athlete to work with.', 'Akshay has shown very good commitment this season. He has been very positive & supportive for his team even as he has been trying hard to recover from his hamstring injury. We are monitoring his progress closely and we are sure he will be a big asset to the team once he starts his regular training. Overall for Akshay - Good defender and has very good potential in the future provided he trains regularly , improves his non-dominant foot, speed & recovery runs. On & Off field character has been very good and is a very good example for his team-mates.'),
(310, 310, 'Ashuthosh  is currently in his development  phase & battling with injury.His decisionmaking with & without the ball has been highly commendable.He can improve on his communication skills. A big asset to the squad.', 'Ashuthosh needs to recover from his injury & train regularly with the team. Ashuthosh looks in good form whenever he has come for training & matches providing team with much needed defensive work & tactical awareness. He is still a very valuable player for the team and we wish for his speedy recovery so that he can improve further individually & also his team-mates.'),
(311, 311, '', 'Aayush needs to train regularly in order to improve. Whenever he came for training & matches he has looked good and he has been playing with ease. We wish he continues to train because he has good potential & very good technical ability to make impact in big games.'),
(312, 312, 'Digbijoy is in his development phase.He is one of the outstanding midfielders displaying huge technical ability & composure on the ball. He has the knack for long range shooting on goal.He has to be better in defensive transition moments. He can guuide this team better , but has to communicative effectively.He can make it big into Pro Football.', 'Digbijoy is a fantastic player due to his ability to make impact in games with his passing & shooting ability. Very clever on the ball and has good mature performances in training/matches. He can still improve his defensive positioning & work-rate without the ball further. He can still improve his leadership skills in order to help other players in his team.  He needs to stay grounded and has big potential for the future.'),
(313, 313, 'Stephen is in his development phase.His Character on & off the field is commendable.He is a team player with a lot of work rate contributed in the matches.He has to be consistent with his long range shooting & also improve on his communication skills.', 'Stephen is a very good athlete in terms of his behaviour on & off the field. He has shown superb quality in certain games with his ability on the ball & work-rate without the ball. He needs to add consistency to his game and that would be his next step for his development. Overall a very good team player and has good potential to develop further for the future.\r\n*Note - Stephen was not in the training during the Physical Assessment Tests*'),
(314, 314, 'Dhanraj is in his development phase.Though being a good technical left footed talented player he has to be consistent with his game performance.He can improve to be better on his right foot & Aerial duels.He has to be more communicative among teammates.', 'Dhanraj is a good athlete to work and good team-player. He works very hard in training and wants to help the team. He needs to add consistency his performances as sometimes what he does in very well training does not match with his performances in games. Overall good player to work with and can improve further. He needs to also improve his non-dominant foot & shooting ability. \r\n*Note - Dhanraj was not in the training during the Physical Assessment Tests*'),
(315, 315, 'Raymarks is in his development phase. He has displayed brilliant versatility to feature in various positions   as FB or a RW as per the demands of the team.He has good composure & shows good physicality in duels to outbeat his opponent.He can be more clinical in the final third.', 'Raymarks is a very positive player with good character on & off the field. He has versatility to play in many positions and hence adds lot of value to the team. He can improve his finishing & outside box shooting. Overall important team player and has potential to do well in future. \r\n*Note - Raymarks was not in the training during the Physical Assessment Tests*'),
(316, 316, 'Rohen is in his development phase.Due to his effort he represented in the Indian U17 team.His electrifying & fiery Speed & swiftness to cover the ground has been his hallmark.He can be much effective He can improve on his Communication skills.His major contribution to the teams final success will be the expectation from the technical staff.', 'Rohen is a good athlete to work with and a good team player due to his explosive acceleration and defensive work in transition. He can still improve his finishing & improve to make his first touch consistent. He has good versatility with ability to play in different positions. He can improve his leadership qualities & Communication skills.'),
(317, 317, 'Aiden is in the developing phase and shows a lot of promise in the training sessions. He adds a lot of value to the team training. He possesses good technical abilities. But can improve on defensive header to long distance.  ', 'Aiden is a hardworking player and always shows a good attitude in training. he is versatile in defender and winger positions also helps him to go further level. he needs to improve on his defensive header.'),
(318, 318, 'Srthan has been developing positively this season. His contributions in a defender’s role have been much more effective, he seems more confident tackling, dealing in 1V1’s, etc. as a defender. he needs to improve on non-dominant foot ability & communication ', 'Sruthan has been developing and showing himself as a defender. His role as a defender was much more effective and comfortable in dealing with air ball, 1v1 situations. He can improve his awareness, and communication to help himself and his teammates. he needs to give more focus on improving his nondominant foot ability.\r\n'),
(319, 319, 'suchir is in the developing phase and he is a highly coachable player he shows a good attitude in games. he needs to improve  his verbal communication with his teammates and give more focus on his non-dominant foot ability', 'suchir is a hardworking player who shows a positive attitude in training and games. he is versatile enough to play in the midfielder, fullback, and winger positions, sure it will help him to go further level. he needs to work on his nondominant foot ability and communication (verbal) with his teammates.'),
(320, 320, 'Kayan is in his development phase. he is a hardworking player and highly coachable player. he is good with the ball but needs to improve a lot on his off-the-ball movement especially recovery run speed,  and commitment to win the ball aggressively. need to show more physicality during the game.', 'Kayan is a midfielder who always shows a good attitude during training. he is intelligent enough to understand the coaching instructions. he needs to be aggressive on the ball and off the ball and needs to make quick decisions during the game about where to pass and when to pass.'),
(321, 321, 'Krsna is a dedicated footballer, who has shown a lot of improvement in the last few months. Keep working on the techniques and speed to improve the effectiveness during the game.', 'Krsna has good passing and dribbling skills, should work on decision making of when and where to dribble. Should improve awareness while playing in the midfield so that he does not lose the ball. Has good height and can be more dominating in winning the air ball. Should work more during the transitions to help the team. Need to improve speed and stamina. '),
(322, 322, 'Anuj is a dedicated footballer who is in his development phase. Requires lot of match experience and training to develop his game. Has good left foot. Need to improve his speed and accuracy.', 'Anuj has good work ethic and dedication to improve. Concentration and listining ability is good. Currently Anuj needs to train more as he is in his development phase. Techniacally need to improve his speed and accuracy. Physically should improve hi agility. Should improve his game awareness and can do this by watching more games and observing the player\'s movement. Long way to develop for Anuj, has good attitude to grow.'),
(323, 323, 'Rayaan is good team player and has got verstality to help team by playing different positions. Rayaan has positive attitude and works hard during the training. Should come for the training regularly and show more commitement for the team.', 'Rayaan has good attitude in Training and in matches. Techniques like Long passing, Short Passing, dribbling are good. Heading and Shooting technique needs to be practices and refined. Understands the game well and can play in multiple positions. Good communication and litens to coach well. Should work on leadership qualitites like being a positive role model to his team and motivate teammates during the game.'),
(324, 324, 'Animesh is a dedicated footballer who is currently in development phase. This season in U17 the demands od the game is high. Should improve his body body language and confidence. Has a long way to go, must be regular to training and matches to improve. ', 'Animesh has good attitude. Take feedback positively. Should improve his first touch under pressure and long passes. Animesh has good defending skills and should be more confident during the matches. Often get injured should do more injury prevention exercises. Understands the game well but sometimes should take better decisions when to dribble and pass. More match experience and training can help him improve. '),
(325, 325, 'Chinmai should be more disciplined and regular to the training sessions. He should also have a positive attitude. Needs to work hard and put Lot of technical and physical work needs to be put by Chinmai to show improvement. ', 'Chinmai is currently in his development phase. Should improve his attitude during the training and matches. Shows good skill and finishing skills occasionally but should be more consistant with his performance. Easily gets injured as he is not warming up and doing the injury prevention exercises. Should not miss session frequently. '),
(326, 326, 'Manit is currently in his development phase as a football player. He has a great work ethic and displays a positive attitude during training sessions. However, he still needs to improve a lot in various areas, including basic technical abilities, tactical awareness, and decision-making skills, especially considering his age group. As a defender, he should focus on improving his non-dominant foot ability and his communication skills, both verbal and nonverbal', 'Although Manit has shown some improvement, he still needs to work on several aspects of his game, including attacking, defending, basic technical abilities, tactical awareness, and decision making, especially for his age group. However, we are pleased to see that he is highly committed to improving his skills, and he displays good behavior and discipline both on and off the field. We fully support his efforts to enhance his performance, and we will do everything possible from our end to help him achieve his goals'),
(327, 327, 'Donald is absent maximum times during his training session. He is his development phase and need to focus to improve on his decision-making on and off the ball movement. He can be better in his communication skills among his teammates & recovery runs during transition play.', 'Donald has joined late for the preseason and also in between not regular for sessions. He needs to be consistent. We encourage his interest to be better. His on field behaviour is good and positive and he tries hard to improve in practice sessions. He shows desire to improve. He still needs to improve in all areas of the game  (technical, tactical, physical, mental ) for his age group. '),
(328, 328, 'Apoorv is currently in a developmental phase as a football player, and he displays a high level of dedication and passion for improving his skills on the pitch. However, he needs to work on improving the quality of his first touch, as well as his decision-making both on and off the ball. Additionally, he could focus on improving his communication skills with his teammates during games.', 'Apoorv is a well behaved athlete but unfortunately he has missed majority of the on field sessions due to injury. We need to see him recover and train consistently.'),
(329, 329, 'Aedan is currently in his developmental phase and has been displaying immense character, team spirit, and promise as a centre-back who marshalls the defense for his team. During games, he displays great aggression and physicality, which are essential qualities for a defender. However, he needs to improve his 1v1 defending skills, particularly knowing when to tackle and when to delay and deal with long balls & recovery Runs. Despite this, he remains a great asset to the team.', 'Aedan is showing vast improvements in game in all areas. He is also displaying very good leadership abilities . He has still  to improve as a defender, but he is on the right track taking information from the coaches and executing to best of his abilities. He can improve his consistency in dealing with long balls in his passing quality and 50-50 duels. We are happy with his progress and his desire to not only improve himself and but also his desire to improve his teammates.'),
(330, 330, 'Themngam is in his development phase And he is technically proficient, but needs to improve his finishing on the target.', 'Themngam is doing well and improving his overall game. He is technically proficient and able in tight spaces. He needs to improve his finishing / shooting to improve his game further'),
(331, 331, 'Nibo is in his development phase and his attitude is positive, on and off the field, but could improve composure during finishing and need to develop his communication and leadership skills.', 'Nibo is doing well. He is disciplined on and off the field. He can improve his composure during finishing / shooting actions. He can also improve his communication and leadership skills.'),
(332, 332, '', 'Oka is doing well and recovering well from his injury. He missed good amount of preseason but he is quickly picking up . He is showing more maturity in decision making and he is on the right track in his development. '),
(333, 333, 'Aarush is in his development phase and  He has to improve his decision-making on the ball and off the ball. He can be better in his communication skills among his teammates.. overall a highly coachable player', 'Aarush is a hardworking player. He needs to be positive and need to give more commitment to the team. Overall he can be better in his communication skills with his teammates. He needs to improve his awareness, decision-making, and 1 v 1 attacking. \r\n'),
(334, 334, 'Kenneth is currently in the development phase. He is a hardworking player with good off-the-ball aggression. However, he needs to further improve his speed of play, long passing with accuracy, under pressure and needs to work on his endurance too. Overall a brilliant Athlete to work with.', 'Kenneth is doing well and improving. He is showing good leadership qualities and commitment to the program. He still can improve his physical / fitness qualities to further improve his speed , endurance and fitness. Overall performing well .'),
(335, 335, 'Daniel is currently in the development phase. He is a hardworking player. However, he needs to improve his speed of play, accuracy in long passing, and ability to perform under pressure. Additionally, he could work on improving his endurance. Overall, Daniel is a brilliant athlete to work with.', 'Daniel is still in developing phase and needs to improve in all areas of the game. Daniel is extremely well behaved, disciplined and shows very good behaviour on&off field. He works hard and tries to improve in every session. He has improved from the time he has joined with us but has to still improve in his technical qualities and decision making. Overall good athlete to work with.'),
(336, 336, 'Ujjwal is in his developing phase and he is one of the good defenders of the team, displaying aggression and physicality during games. nonetheless, he has to improve on his long-range defensive clearances and 1 v 1 defending (when to tackle ) overall a great asset to the team', 'Ujjwal is a great asset to the team, his hardworking mentality and match behavior in the u17 category are remarkable. His defending ability, especially his off-the-ball aggression during the game always makes him a fearless defender. he has to improve on his long-range defensive clearances 1 v 1 defending and long-range headers.\r\n*Note - Ujjwal was not in the training during the Physical Assessment Tests*\r\n'),
(337, 337, 'aditya is in his developing phase and he is a highly dedicated footballer and shows a lot of passion to improve himself on the pitch. He has to improve on his decision-making on the ball and off the ball. He can be better at his communication skills with his teammates.\r\n', 'aditya is a hardworking player. always he is hunger to learn and shows a good attitude during training sessions. he is not a born talented player but his hardworking mentality may make him a good player when he moves to a further level. He has to improve on his decision-making on the ball and off the ball. He can be better at his communication skills with his teammates.'),
(338, 338, 'Adwaith as a midfielder is in his development phase. he is intelligent enough to understand the coaching instructions but needs to deliver more output in his awareness scanning and quick decision-making. he needs to be aggressive in aerial = ground 1v1 duels. overall, he is a highly coachable player', 'Adwaith is a smart player who is good with the ball but needs to improve a lot on his off-the-ball work rate and commitment to win the ball aggressively. fitness needs to be worked on and the negative transition, he is curious to learn about the game and he is self-confident. he has a lot more to learn and should be committed to the team.\r\n'),
(339, 339, 'Tejas shows a lot of promise in the training sessions. He adds a lot of value to teams attacking play. He possesses good technical abilities. But can improve on negative transition.  ', 'Tejas is a winger who proved himself in the training and matches. He has good technical abilities to beat the defender in 1v 1 duels he is confident. He can improve his positional awareness and negative transition. '),
(340, 340, 'gopi is in his development phase and is showing a lot of promise in his roles and responsibilities. he has to further improve on his speed of play and defensive Ariel balls situation. his communication has to be improved among his teammates.', 'gopi is in his developing phase and he is a highly dedicated footballer and shows a lot of passion to improve himself on the pitch. he needs to improve on dealing with Ariel\'s ball in a defensive situation and 1v1 defending. after all his communication with his teammates has to be improved.'),
(341, 341, 'Kian is in his developing phase and always shows a good attitude during training sessions. He is one of the highly dependable player playing an important role in the team\'s success this season.  He still needs to improve his conversion rate in front of the goal and needs to work on his nondominant foot.', ' Kian has a very good attitude, wonderful team spirit, and a good attitude to learning & improving himself. he is one of the examples of hardworking player on the team. He has high endurance levels and can press the opponents effectively for long durations of the game. he still needs to improve his consistency in finishing and needs to work on both feet.\r\n\r\n'),
(342, 342, 'Sai Siddharth is in his development phase. He is a hardworking and highly coachable player but He needs to be more communicative among teammates, and be aggressive in 1v1 duels, and his non-dominant foot ability needs to improve', 'Sai Siddharth is overall a great athlete to work with who\'s always open to learning new information. good attitude on the field and off the field. He needs to improve his nondominant foot ability and communication with his teammates'),
(343, 343, 'Dallalmoun is a  highly coachable player. who plays in midfielder. He had great vision to play penetrating passing or shooting at the goals. He can improve on his communication among his teammates, awareness and positioning moments of losing the ball. Overall a great athlete to work with. ', 'Dallalmoun is a midfielder, he is highly technical player with great vision, he can improve his communication and transition to defence.'),
(344, 344, 'Amaan is developing and shows much promise in the training sessions. He adds a lot of value to teams attacking play. He needs to work on his non-dominant foot and be more aggressive off the ball.', 'Amaan is a highly dedicated footballer who is passionate about improving himself on the pitch. He has to improve his decision-making on and off the ball.  He needs to work on his nondominant foot and He can be better in his communication skills with his teammates.\r\n'),
(345, 345, 'Gopi is in his development phase &  displays a lot of promise in his roles and responsibilities. He has to further improve on his speed of thought and speed of play and running with the ball. He has to focus more on his decision-making on and off the ball. He  \r\n has to be more effective in non verbal communication among his teammates.\r\n', 'Gopi is a hardworking player who shows positive athlete mentality during training and matches. He is a highly coachable player but needs to improve on his running-with-the-ball ability. he can be better with his communication with his teammates. He should focus more on his decision-making on & off  the ball.'),
(346, 346, 'krishna is in his development phase and shows a hardworking mentality during sessions. as a student of the game, he has to improve a lot on his technical ability that is long distance passes, 1 v 1 dribbling, and shooting on the target. he needs to focus more on his communication with his teammates.', 'krishna is a hardworking player always ready to learn his roles and responsibilities He needs to improve on his long-range passes and 1 v 1 dribbling. he has to improve his off-the-ball aggression also. he has to focus more on his communication verbal and nonverbal during matches and training.'),
(347, 347, 'kush is in his development phase he is a highly dedicated footballer and shows a lot of passion to improve himself on the pitch. He has to improve on defending 1v1 and defensive headers and decision-making on the ball and off the ball. He can be better at his communication skills with his teammates.', 'kush is a hardworking player always ready to learn about his roles and responsibilities. he is feeling the intensity of the u17 category and got good match time in ksfa youth league. he needs to improve on his defending techniques when tackling the ball and defensive headers. He can be better at his communication skills with his teammates'),
(348, 348, 'During his development phase, Gad has shown promise as a player with good physicality, but he needs to improve his football game insight. Unfortunately, his football basics are poor for his age. He should focus on improving his fundamentals in every aspect of the game. ', 'Gad is a player with good physicality but need to improve on his football game insight. His football basic are  very poor for his age. He should work more on his football basic in every aspect of the game. As a forward player he should work on his finishing as well'),
(349, 349, 'Sanat is in his development phase, he needs to work on his fitness, speed and communication with his team mates. he has lost touch with the ball after having a long break from the sport', 'Sanat is a well disciplined player but needs to be more aggressive on the field, he needs to work on his speed and fitness, he has good sense of the game but his body slows him down. the break from the sport has hampered his development, hopefully over time and practice he\'ll get back to his best'),
(350, 350, 'Deepak is currently in a phase of development. He is a hardworking and coachable player, but he needs to become more confident when defending and communicate more effectively with his teammates. It is recommended that he becomes more aggressive in 1v1 aerial and ground duels. Additionally, he needs to work on improving his ability to use his non-dominant foot', 'Deepak should work more on his defending and off the ball positioning. He should work more on his football basic and game insight, He should also improve his non-dominant foot. As a defender he should work more on his communication skill,1 v 1 defending and his attacking skill as well.'),
(351, 351, 'Adithya is currently in his developmental phase and is a highly dedicated footballer. He displays a lot of passion to improve himself on the pitch but needs to work on certain areas. Specifically, he needs to improve his defending 1v1, defensive headers, decision-making on and off the ball, and his communication skills with his teammates.', 'Adithya has improved but he still has to improve a lot in all areas of the game ( attacking , defending , basic technical abilities, tactical awareness & decision making ) for his age group. He is showing good commitment to improve with good on field and off field behaviour/ discipline. We encourage his interest to improve and we will try our best from our side to improve his game.'),
(352, 352, 'Adithya vinodh is in his development phase, he needs to be more consistent to training as he\'s missed too many sessions. he has good control over the ball and is very disciplined on the ground. he can work on making decisions quickly', 'Adithya Vinodh is a good player and can be better is he\'s more consistent in coming to the training sessions. he can work on his heading and take lesser touch\'s before playing the pass. a highly coachable player nevertheless'),
(353, 353, 'Tushar is in his development phase, he needs to work on his basics more and work harder to improve more as a player. he needs to be more aggressive on and off the ball and communicate more with his teammates. all in all he is a very obedient player', 'Tushar needs to work on his basics more, work more on his football IQ, and be more eager to learn the sport. his a well-mannered and obedient player. over time and effort we hope to see  more from him'),
(354, 354, 'Ayush has been  in his development phase.He has not been consistent with the training sessions.Ayush as mentioned earlier, has a good potential, provided he is committed to the game.His strength is his technical, Tactical abilities among possessing a good skill in executing Set pieces.', ''),
(355, 355, 'Gerrard is in his development phase.He is perhaps, one of the marvellous left footed midfielders with adding abundant source of creativity to the team.He has been more stronger compared to last season physically better with duels & posess a huge threat to opponents through his set piece abilities.He can work on his communication & endurance levels along with managing his injuries efficiently.A big potential to become a Pro Footballer.', ''),
(356, 356, 'Sam is in his development phase.He is known especially for his physicality in duels & long range powerful shooting on goal.He has to be tactically efficient in transitions & positional play & not lose focus during matches.He has been battling with injuries. Overall a positive athlete to work with.', 'Sam is a diligent player who is highly regarded for his physicality in duels and his powerful long-range shooting on goal. He needs to maintain tactical efficiency during transitions and positional play, as well as stay focused during matches. Despite battling injuries, he is an overall positive athlete to work with.'),
(357, 357, 'Daniel is in his development phase.He has trememdouslynimproved since the last season as a Centre back/Full back.He has to be highly focussed & concentrated during his role & nunnecessary not lose ball possession.He has to communicate effectively & work on the blind side runs preventing opponents to take advantage of the situation. Overall A great Athlete to work with', ''),
(358, 358, 'Kris is in his development phase.He is one of the experienced defenders developed through the years & also versatile as a winger in matches.His dedication & attitude to learn & progress is his hallmark.', 'Kris displays good technical skills, but needs to improve defensive heading, 1v1 defending, and communication with teammates for better teamwork.'),
(359, 359, 'Arav is in his development phase, he needs to work on his weaker foot and be calmer in matches, he needs to improve on his crossing and long passes too. he\'s a hardworking player with keen interest in learning the game', 'Arav needs to learn to control his emotions during matches, he needs to work on his long balls and weaker foot. he is very obedient and always willing to put in the extra work in training and matches, his receiving of the ball is exemplary and he\'s highly coachable player  '),
(360, 360, 'Pratyush is his development phase, he needs to come back swiftly from his injury so he can progress as we expect. he needs to focus more in training and work on his game sense and decision making', 'Pratyush is a player with good potential but needs to work on his concentration levels while training, he has good long-ball and shooting abilities but needs to know how to make the right decisions, he can work on his game IQ too. all in all a very obedient player'),
(361, 361, 'Shashank is in his development phase. He has to work more on his physicality. His long range passing should be improve and need to work more on off the ball positioning and winning the ball back in the mid-field zone.\r\n', 'Shashank is a good player with positive attitude and willing to learn each and everyday. His work ethic inside the ground is good and should move on with it. He should developed more on his long passing and creativity as a mid field player and should be calm and composed in underpressure. He should developed his long range shooting as well and perform more consistently. He is developing well and he should keep on moving with the same attitude.'),
(362, 362, '', ''),
(363, 363, '', ''),
(364, 364, 'Shiven is in his development phase. He is a hardworking and highly coachable player but He needs to be more communicative among teammates, be aggressive in 1v1 duels  in the attacking third, need to work more on his finishing and his non-dominant foot ability needs to improve', 'Shiven is a hardworking player and is a highly dedicated footballer and shows a lot of passion to improve himself on the pitch. He has to improve his decision-making on and off the ball.  He needs to work on his nondominant foot and He can be better in his communication skills with his teammates. need to work more on his finishing technique.'),
(365, 365, 'Nivaan is in his development phase. He should work on his attacking ability. His 1 v 1 defending should also be improved and defending positioning off the ball need to be better and work on it. He should also improved more on his basic defending. His communication are aslo things he should work on as a defender.', 'Nivaan is a player with positive attitude. He is a player who should work more on his defending as well as attacking, He should aslo focus more on his defending positioning and communication. His attacking ability is poor and should focus on it. His work ethic is good but to developed more he should work more on it and concentrate more in training and matches.He should also improved more on off the ball positioning.'),
(366, 366, 'Pranay is in his development phase. He should work on his basic football skills. He has to improve on his defending as well. He should come regular to practice session to improve more on his football skills and pay more concentration in practice session.', 'Pranay has a good physical and strength for his age. He should work more on his defending,defensive heading and long passes. He should be more calm and composed in the defence line. He has the ability to be a good  defender for his age if he work hard and keep pushing himself in training ground. His communication skills should also developed and try to lead the team from behind. He is doing good and will improve more if he concentrate and keep working hard'),
(367, 367, 'Abhishek is in his development phase. He should work more on his physicality and sprint. As a forward player he should also focus on his off the ball movement and find more space to attack and create goal scoring changes. ', 'Abhishek is a player who has the football sense. His ability to finish on the goal is good, but should work more on his strength and long range shooting. His defending transition are also very weak and should improve more on defending once the team lose the ball. His work rate is good but he should focus to improve more on it. As a striker he should also focus more on his ability to find the space and create goal scoring opportunity, and developed more on his sprinting.'),
(368, 368, 'Vishwa is in his development phase. He should work more on his defending communication, 1v1 defending, and defensive heading. He should also work more on his communication. He should also improved on his sprinting and long range passing. ', 'Vishwajit is a a good player with the right attitude in the team. His ability to read the game is very helpfull for the team. He should work more on his defending  communication and acceleration. His defensive clearence should also be improve with his non-dominant foot. He should also had the leadership quality to lead the team from behind. He should also focus  more on his defensive cleareance and long range passing. '),
(369, 369, '', ''),
(370, 370, 'Anuj is currently in his development phase. Good attitude in learning and putting the effort to improve. Need to work on the speed and agility more. Has good left foot and can play in the defense well. Need to work on 1v1 and defending against quick players. ', 'Need to improve his speed on and off the ball. Attitude is brillaint and ready to work hard to improve and perform his best. Should improve decision making and understanding the game. '),
(371, 371, '', '');
INSERT INTO `ci_notes_from_coaching` (`id`, `forms_id`, `notes_frm_tech_dir`, `notes_frm_head_coach`) VALUES
(372, 372, 'sriman is in his development phase and is showing a lot of promise in his roles and responsibilities. he has to further improve on his speed of play and running with the ball in 1 v 1 attacking. he needs to focus more on his decision-making on the ball and off the ball. his communication has to be improved among his teammates.', 'sriman is a hardworking player and shows a good athletic mentality towards the training sessions. he has to improve especially in running with the ball, 1v1 attacking, and passing accuracy also. tactically he has to improve his off-the-ball aggression and execute his proper roles and responsibilities. his communication with his teammates needs to Improve. '),
(373, 373, 'joy is in his development phase. he is a complete team player and has good technical ability. but he needs to improve on his defensive header, and tackling timing, and needs to communicate with teammates during training and matches', 'joy is a hardworking player technically he shows good but he needs to improve more, especially in defensive heading, and 1v1 defending, he has to communicate with his teammates for the team\'s interpersonal relationship.'),
(374, 374, ' gougun is currently emerging into a key reliable central defensive midfielder with a good understanding of his role & responsibilities. He is in his developing phase He can further improve on his communication &  switch of play (Long balls). Overall a fantastic team player to work with', 'gougun is a hardworking player and always shows a good attitude in training. he is versatile in all midfield and defending positions also helps him to go further level. he needs to improve on his switch of play . need to communicate with the teammates'),
(375, 375, 'Aiden is in the developing phase and shows a lot of promise in the training sessions. He adds a lot of value to the team training. He possesses good technical abilities. But can improve on defensive header to long distance.  ', 'Aiden is a hardworking player and always shows a good attitude in training. he is versatile in defender and winger positions also helps him to go further level. he needs to improve on his defensive header.'),
(376, 376, 'Krsna is currently in his development phase. Need to be regular to the training session and work hard in the training session. He has good height should use his advantage to win the air ball. Need to improve his stamina in order to compete with teams in the League matches. ', 'Krsna has the ability to become a good defensive midfielder.  Need to improve his attitude to train and must give more effort. He is a bit relaxed and lacks the intensity and aggressiveness in his hame off the ball. On the ball need to develop his passing accuracy. Off the ball while the team is defending need to cover the spaces in the wide area and use his height to win the air ball. Need to be regular to the training session and improve his stamina.'),
(377, 377, '', ''),
(378, 378, '', ''),
(379, 379, 'Yohan is in his development phase, developing as a center back and highly coachable player, we have to be patience in his development as he has one more year in U-15, He has to improve his communication with his teammates, clearance and dicision making. Taking leadership and responsibility. Overall good athlete to work with. ', 'Yohan is a center back , he is a highly coachable player, he needs to be patience as he was developing,  he has work on his clearance, communication and dicision making under pressure.  Overall good athlete to work. '),
(380, 380, 'Nityam is in his development phase. He is a coachable player who plays as a defender or a winger. He has to improve on his crossing, shooting outside the box, aerier dual etc. ', 'Nityam is a developing as a fullback and winger. He is a hardworking and passionate players, He has the ability to go up and put the crossing and finish. winning 1v1 in defense line .he can improve on his aerier header, awareness, crossing and dicision making. '),
(381, 381, 'Tushya is in his development phase. We have to be patient in his development. He needs to work on his first touch , clearance longball and passing (accuracy and more weight of passes) etc ', 'Tushya is developing as a defender. He has to be more confidence when he has the ball, and work on his longball etc. We have to patient as he is in the process of getting better.'),
(382, 382, 'Gurudev is in his development phase,  playing as midfielder he is a technical sound player, he needs to know when to pass when to dribble and he should also take more shoots on the goal . He needs to improve on his logball ,Spatial awareness, positioning and communication.  Overall good athlete to work with. ', 'Gurudev is developing as a midfielder, he has dribbling skill, good technical ability he has to improve on his positioning awareness, communication, Take more shoots at the goal, knowing when to dribble and when to pass and be more tough .overall good athlete to work with. '),
(383, 383, '', ''),
(384, 384, 'Tharun is versatile winger who can also play striker , he is highly coachable player.he has a potential and we trust in his ability. He has to work on his negative transition , awareness and taking more shoots on the goal. Overall good athlete to work with. ', 'Tharun is a highly coachable player and versatile lefty who play as a striker and winger. He has potential, good skill and technically sound . He has to improve on his negative transition, taking more shoots in and around the box and his awareness.'),
(385, 385, '', ''),
(386, 386, 'Smyan is in his development phase, He is a left footed developing as a left back , he needs to be more confident with the ball and he can work on his first touch, Spatial awareness, long ball and non-dominant foot.', 'Smyan is a left footed as he is in his development phase we have to be patience in his development, He can improve on his Spatial awareness,non dominant foot, first touch and a long ball.'),
(387, 387, '', ''),
(388, 388, '', ''),
(389, 389, '', ''),
(390, 390, 'Very good improvement in the last few months. Learning quickly all the tactical aspects of the game. Should keep working on Speed, Quick Turning and Agility. And under pressure need to play more calm. Good improvement in long passing and clearnaces. Developing into a strong Centerback.', 'Brilliant understanding of the game. Good tackling and 1v1 defending. Long passes are accurate can improve the speed of techniques. Clearance technique is perfect, keep improving. Showed brilliant performances for the U17 IFEP team and played aganinst tough opponents. Good training attitude and match temparement. Keep working on Speed, strength and stamina. '),
(391, 391, '', ''),
(392, 392, '', ''),
(393, 393, 'Kabeer is in his development phase, He has shown a lot of promise in his roles and responsibilities. However, he needs to work on improving his speed of thought and play, as well as his 1 v 1 Defending. Additionally, he should focus more on his decision-making both on and off the ball. Lastly, he needs to be more effective in nonverbal communication with his teammates', 'Kabeer is a hardworking athlete with a positive attitude towards training and competitions. He is always open to learning and improving his skills, and is a quick learner. However, he needs to work on his 1 v 1 Defending technique to become even better. Moreover, he could enhance his team\'s performance by improving his communication skills with his teammates. Lastly, he should make better decisions both on and off the field to reach his full potential as a player'),
(394, 394, 'Dhanvin, has been consistent in the games hes been playing so far. he can work on his first touch and game sense.', 'Dhanvin has been doing well so far, he can work on his game sense and in game communication. his long ball and fitness has improved'),
(395, 395, 'Shlok is having a good development process; he is a strong and confident player with a lot of attributes that we can see developing over time. He has a very strong mentality with leadership qualities which will keep driving him.', 'Shlok is in a good developing stage; he has the potential to become much better than he is with a lot of room for improvement. He has a good understanding of the game which is his main attribute and it\'s also developing. His decision-making and distribution should improve with time. He is a fearless and determined player.'),
(396, 396, 'Rishaan always has an attitude to learn and keep improving, he has a strong mentality and desire to win. He is a leader on and off the pitch. he is determined and is in a good development process.', 'Rishaan has always been a good player from his earliest stage, he’s in a good development process and works very hard on and off the pitch to keep developing his football ability and football brain. He needs the proper guidance to keep developing at his pace and expect him to be an outstanding player with time.'),
(397, 397, 'Siddhartha is coming up the age group to a new format, size, and way of playing football, He is in his development stage and is adjusting, getting back to training, and he should understand he has to focus on his technical side of football. He needs to focus on his diet too and be in good physical strength to play football.', 'Siddhartha needs to be more consistent in training, although he has gone through a lot of injuries, but needs to be fearless and have an attitude and hunger to improve his potential football abilities. He needs to focus on his diet to be more fit and physical, as it\'s needed as he goes up the age group. He should be focused on just training and playing hard and physically. His confidence levels need to improve.'),
(398, 398, 'Lokshith is in a development process in his new age group, he is a confident player and should develop at his own pace, he should work on his strength training to become a more physical player that is needed in his new age group.', 'Lokshith is a good player and is in a development phase and process in his new age group, pitch size, and playing way and style, He is in his integration process, he needs to improve the physical part of his game and play more aggressively. He has the ability to be a better player but still has yet to display his best.'),
(399, 399, 'Ojas is in his development process and has been developing well as signs of improvement have been noticed. he needs to keep training well and being focused on improving his technical abilities and football understanding.', 'Ojas development process is going well, he\'s has improved from when he joined and works hard in training and matches, Ojas has to be hardworking all the time to get better in his footballing abilities as that\'s his main attribute. He is versatile and has a good understanding of the game with a lot of room for improvement.'),
(400, 400, 'Devarsh is in his development phase; he has a good understanding of the game and is confident and focused in sessions and matches. He is a versatile player with a lot of football potential and attributes and should develop at his pace under the right guidance.', 'Devarsh is in a good development phase and process, he has a good attitude a good understanding of the game, and work ethic. His main ability is his defensive ability, positioning, intercepting, and distribution. With the proper guidance he should improve and become a much better player, can improve on his communication and use of non-dominant foot!'),
(401, 401, 'Soham is improving and is in his development process, he has a good attitude and works hard in the sessions and training. He should remain focused and keep working hard in training.', 'Soham has a good game understanding and can be a good point man (striker) in the team, he needs to improve on his finishing and movement inside the penalty area, he has a good understanding of the game and is versatile in many roles. He has potential and should have more self-belief and be very courageous.'),
(402, 402, 'Ishan is in his developing phase, he has progressed up the age group with a different format, pitch size, and style of play and is in his integration phase. He is developing at a good pace and should keep developing and experiencing in the upcoming season.', 'Ishan is a good player with versatile abilities. His game and tactical understanding in relation to his position is improving as he is in the development phase. He is dedicated to the game and his team; he is a team player. He is improving on his defensive positioning which will help him become a better defender and versatile player.'),
(403, 403, 'Jayant is in his development phase. He should work on his basic football skills. His defending should also be improved. His positioning on and off the ball should be things he should work on it. His awareness (opponent, space, time, and teammate) should be improved.  ', 'Jayant is an obidient kid with a good attitude. He should work more on his football aspect of the game. His basic football skills should also be developed. As a defender he should work on his defending skills like 1 v 1, maintaining the defending shape, communication skills, defensive clearance, defensive heading clearance. His sprinting should also be developed as well as his body cordination. He is a versatile player and developing well with the training and matches.\r\n'),
(404, 404, 'Dhanin is in his development phase. He should work on his passing accuracy  from the back ( long & short ). He should work more on his communication,defensive organisation and defensive heading. ', 'Dhanin is a very good player with good ability. As a defender he should work more on his passing ability from the back underpressure ( long & short passes ). His defensive heading should also be developed better. He should improved more on his defensive organisation as well and take more responsibities on organising the defence line off the ball. His leadership quality should be better and be more vocal in the game and communicate better. He should be more calm and composed in defending and should not get beaten easily.'),
(405, 405, 'Renaud is in his development phase. His negative transition should be improved and work on it. His 1 v 1 on the flank should be improved better. He should also work more on his vision and play more positive ( attacking ) in the match.', 'Renaud is a good player with a good attitude. He has too work on his defending transition. His ability to take 1v1 on the flank need to improve better. He should work more on his agility and sprint. His passing ( long ) should be improved better. His vision on the pitch should be developed and awareness of  the space, teammate, and opponent should be improved and work on it.'),
(406, 406, 'Rayaan is a versatile player with good technical base. He has a brillaint attitude towards the team and is the back bone of his team. Quick learner and gives his 100% on the pitch every game. Rayaan is good role model for the younger players. Keep working on his speed and stamina as he gets a bit tired during the end of the games. Regular training is a must. Rayaan has a good potential to achieve in football.', 'Brillaint attitude and team player. Open to play in different positions and is a huge asset to the team. Can play long balls, can shoot and dribble past opponents. Need to increase the speed and accuracy of the techniques. Improved his heading defensively and in the attacking third. Should work on improving his stamina to play the entire match without fatigue.'),
(407, 407, 'Akshar is in his developing phase and he is improving as a defender in the U19 team. He is a highly dedicated footballer and shows a lot of passion to improve himself on the pitch. He has to improve on his long-range defensive clearances and 1 v 1 defending, as how & when to tackle.', 'Akshar is a hardworking player show a good mentality in training and match. But technically he needs to improve more, especially in defensive heading, 1v1 defending, and passing accuracy. Tactically he has to improve off-the-ball aggression and execute his proper roles and responsibilities.\r\n'),
(408, 408, '', 'Aditya is a transition phase from academy to the excellence program and also to a new playing format. There is a lot of room for improvement for Aditya but he needs to be more regular in training and matches as this will only help him develop overtime. He enjoys football and with regular training and experience from matches we should see his development process improve '),
(409, 409, 'Vihaan is in his development phase. His attacking 1 v 1  should be improved and need to work on it. His football basic and his body cordination are the things he should work on it. ', 'Vihaan is a hard working player. He should work on his 1 v 1 attacking and play more forward. He should learn to use his sprinting ability to beat the defender easily. He should focus on his position off the ball while defending. He should also improved on his body cordination. His passing ( long & short ) and receiving is still weak and should work more on it. '),
(410, 410, '', ''),
(411, 411, 'varun Gaddam is a a good player with the positive attitude in the team. His ability to\r\nread the game is very helpful for the team. He should work more on his defending communication and\r\nacceleration. His defensive clearances should also be improved with his non-dominant foot. He though\r\nhaving potential should exhibit leadership quality to lead the team from behind. He should also work\r\n\r\nmore on his defensive clearances and long range passing.', 'Varun Gaddam is a hardworking player. He should focus more on improving his finishing and\r\ncrossing techniques, especially with aerial balls. Although he has good technical abilities to beat\r\ndefenders in 1v1 duels, he needs to work on his decision-making skills regarding when to distribution the ball\r\nand when to take on defenders. Additionally, he should focus on improving his negative transition. We\r\nare happy with his progress &amp; look forward to see his further development in the coming months.'),
(412, 412, '', ''),
(413, 413, '', ''),
(414, 414, 'Rahul is a winger . He is technically sound player, He is a winner of U15 KSFA champion and U13 DPDL champion last season. He can improve on his Spatial awareness, communication among his teammates and take more crossing and take more shooting from outside the box.  Overall he is good athlete to work with. ', 'Rahul has a good technical ability to use his both feet play as a winger,he has a potential/accuracy to take a shoot from the arc of the 18 yard box which show in the training session which he should do more on the match day.he can improve on his communication, be more confident on 1v1 situations in the final third and awareness. '),
(415, 415, '', ''),
(416, 416, '', ''),
(417, 417, 'Aaryamun  is currently in development and has shown a lot of potential during training sessions. He needs to work on using his non-dominant foot more effectively and being more proactive with his off-ball movements. Additionally, he should work on faster transition movements and improving his decision-making abilities under high-pressure situations. Overall he is a highly coachable player.', 'Aaryamun is a passionate and hardworking footballer who is constantly striving to improve his skills on the field. However, he needs to focus on improving his decision-making abilities both on and off the ball. Additionally, he should work on developing his non-dominant foot, which will make him a more versatile player. Moreover, enhancing on his communication skills with his teammates, that will help him become a better team player overall.'),
(418, 418, 'Dhanvin is in his development phase, he needs to work on his weaker foot and dribbling. well-disciplined player with a good aerial threat toward goal, all in an all  a highly coachable player', 'Dhanvin is getting better as he\'s giving his 100 in every training, he needs to work on his weak foot and man-marking skills. he has good long passing range and long shots. he is a leader on and off the pitch.'),
(419, 419, 'Aryan nair is in his development phase, he needs to work on his Strength and endurance, long pass and long shots.\r\nhe\'s technically gifted player who can improve if he puts in the work', 'Aryan needs to work on his fitness and strength, he needs to be more physical while playing the sport and be more vocal while playing. he needs to work on his long pass and shooting ability too. his short and forward passes are very good as well as finishing in the box. with more time and effort he can improve'),
(420, 420, 'Varun is in his development phase, he needs to work on his spatial awareness and release the ball quicker rather than invite tackles. he is a very smart player with a good understanding of the game', 'Varun is a highly committed player, but he needs to speak positively to himself so he can go on to play better and better on a day-to-day basis, his attitude in the match and training is different, as he gains more confidence in himself and be positive his game will surely improve at a faster rate. his short passes and through passes are top-class, he can do better in releasing the ball quickly.'),
(421, 421, 'Saarthakk is in his development phase, he is a very disciplined player, and he can work on his defensive header and communication, he needs to work on his fitness too. he has good long pass ability. a highly coachable player nevertheless', 'Saarthakk needs to be more confident in himself and believe in his capabilities, he is a very disciplined player who is eager to learn. but he needs to be more positive and deal with mistakes in a more positive manner. he needs to cut down on his weight too to be faster in defense. he has good passing ability and slide tackles are very good. a coachable player who has good room for improvement'),
(422, 422, 'Tanay is in his Development phase, he needs to work more on his fitness and the basics of football and be more confident in himself. with right mindset and effort he can do better', 'Tanay needs to show the fight in him more to improve, there seems to be a lack of motivation in his effort to train. he wants to get better but needs to push himself more, he also needs to get his fitness better. a very obedient player nevertheless'),
(423, 423, 'Aabo is currently in the development phase of his career. He is a hardworking and highly coachable player who is skilled with the ball. However, there is still room for improvement in his off-the-ball movement, particularly in his recovery runs, speed, and commitment to aggressively win 1v1 aerial and ground balls.', 'Aabo is a midfielder who consistently demonstrates a positive attitude during training. He has the intelligence to comprehend coaching instructions and is encouraged to be more aggressive both on and off the ball. During matches, he is advised to make quick decisions regarding when and where to pass the ball.'),
(424, 424, 'Surya is currently in the developing phase of his football career and he is a highly dedicated player who shows a lot of passion for improving his skills on the pitch. In order to enhance his performance, he needs to work on improving the quality of his first touch and decision-making abilities both on and off the ball. Additionally, Surya can benefit from improving his communication skills with his teammates during games.', 'Surya is a hardworking player who displays a strong desire to learn and exhibits a positive attitude during training sessions. Although he may not possess natural talent, his diligent work ethic may enable him to become a good player as he progresses to higher levels. However, he needs to work on his decision-making both on and off the ball. Additionally, he could improve his communication skills with his teammates.'),
(425, 425, 'Raj is currently in the development phase of his game, and he displays a highly coachable attitude during sessions. However, he needs to work on improving his spatial awareness, verbal communication with his teammates, and focus on using his non-dominant foot more effectively. Despite these areas of improvement, Raj has made a positive contribution to the matches he has played in.', 'Raj is a diligent player who demonstrates a can-do attitude in both training and games. He possesses the adaptability to perform in various positions, including fullback and winger, which will help him progress to greater heights. Nevertheless, he should concentrate on enhancing his capacity to utilize his non-dominant foot and communicate more efficiently with his teammates.'),
(426, 426, 'Abhijoy is currently in the development phase and displays a hardworking mentality during training sessions. As a student of the game, he has room for improvement in his technical ability, including headers, long-distance passing, 1 v 1 dribbling, and shooting accuracy. Additionally, he needs to focus more on improving his communication skills with his teammates.on improving his communication skills with his teammates.', 'Abhijoy is a diligent player who is constantly willing to learn and take on his assigned tasks. However, he could benefit from practicing his long-range passes and 1 v 1 dribbling skills. Furthermore, he should work on being more assertive off the ball, and pay closer attention to his verbal and nonverbal communication during both matches and training sessions.'),
(427, 427, '', ''),
(428, 428, '', ''),
(429, 429, 'Surya is currently in the developing phase of his football career and he is a highly dedicated player who shows a lot of passion for improving his skills on the pitch. In order to enhance his performance, he needs to work on improving the quality of his first touch and decision-making abilities both on and off the ball. Additionally, Surya can benefit from improving his communication skills with his teammates during games.', 'Surya is a hardworking player who displays a strong desire to learn and exhibits a positive attitude during training sessions. Although he may not possess natural talent, his diligent work ethic may enable him to become a good player as he progresses to higher levels. However, he needs to work on his decision-making both on and off the ball. Additionally, he could improve his communication skills with his teammates.'),
(430, 430, 'Ayush was improving well until his injury, he needs to be more consistent in training as he has been missing it for many weeks now. he\'s a good dribbler but needs to know when to release the ball as he dribbles, quick decision making. he\'s a highly coachable player', 'Ayush has missed a lot of training, he\'s a good dribbler and has a high work rate. but he needs to start turning up for training to improve more'),
(431, 431, 'Kanishk is in his development phase, and he is slowly improving into a potent winger. he needs to work on his weak foot and heading towards the goal, he\'s a highly coachable player who shows keen interest in learning', 'Kanishk is doing well so far, he needs to work on his weak foot and finishing outside the box, he needs to communicate more with his teammates too. he\'s a very obedient and calm player on and off the ground. '),
(432, 432, 'Sourav is in his development Phase, he\'s improved well since his first day at Alchemy. he needs to work on his side foot finishing and being more composed on the ball, he also needs to be more fit physically. he\'s an obedient player who is willing to put in the work to improve', 'Sourav has improved well so far, but he needs to be more composed on the ball and improve his heading, he needs to cut down his weight too to get faster in running. he is a highly coachable player '),
(433, 433, 'Samarth is in his development phase, he needs to improve his speed of thought and decision-making skills on the ball, he can work on his heading and finishing outside the box too. all n all a good player to work with', 'Samarth is a player with good potential, he needs to cut down his body weight to be faster, his running form, and his heading. he has good crossing ability but tends to take a lot of time before making any decision. he is very obedient player who is keen to learn more'),
(434, 434, 'Vishnu is in his development stage, though he has stepped up he still has a lot to improve on the basics of football. he needs to put more time in training and by time and effort he will improve more as a player', 'Vishnu is still in the early stages of being a football player. he needs to work a lot on the basics like passing finishing heading long passing. he needs to turn in training more so can achieve his targets. he is a very disciplined player and very receptive to coaches instructions'),
(435, 435, 'Shriyan is in his development phase. he needs to work on speed and strength and the basics of football. over effort and training sessions he can improve more. looking forward to seeing more from him', 'Shriyan is in his development phase. he needs to work on cutting down his weight and improve his strength and work the basics of football. he needs to be more confident in himself to be able to be a better player. negative thoughts are always there in his mind which he needs to eradicate. all in all he\'s a very obedient player'),
(436, 436, 'Saptharshi is in his development phase, he has a good sense of the game as his tackles are very proactive. he needs to cut down on his weight to be faster in the game and work on his long-ball accuracy more. he is a highly coachable player', 'Saptharshi is a strong Center back who is also capable of playing left-back. he is a smart player who can read the game very well, but he needs to cut down on his weight to be faster in the game and work on his heading towards the goal. a very obedient player and very easy to coach'),
(437, 437, 'Ranjiv is in his development phase, he can work on his weak foot, strength, and speed. he is a very focused and obedient player and  a very good dribbler', 'Ranjiv is a talented player with good potential, he\'s a good dribbler but needs to improve on his weaker foot and strength a lot more to be able to keep up with the level of football played here. he\'s a very coachable player nevertheless'),
(438, 438, 'Jonah is in his development Phase, he needs to work on his basics more and be more aggressive with and without the ball', 'Jonah is a smart player but needs more technical ability to back himself up. he works hard in training but needs to improve overall and be more vocal in training'),
(439, 439, 'Mukund has improved a lot in these few months. Keep working on improving techniques as he is in his development phase. Should improve playing under pressure and need to cope up with the intensity of the game. ', 'Need to improve his stamina. Has decent speed but agility needs to be improved. Should watch more games in order to improve understanding of the game. Slowly improving his decision making. '),
(440, 440, 'Aryan nair is in his development phase, he needs to work on his Strength and endurance, long pass and long shots.\r\nhe\'s technically gifted player who can improve if he puts in the work.', 'Aryan needs to work on his fitness and strength, he needs to be more physical while playing the sport and be more vocal while playing. he needs to work on his long pass and shooting ability too. his short and forward passes are very good as well as finishing in the box. with more time and effort he can improve'),
(441, 441, 'Samarth is in his development phase, he needs to improve his speed of thought and decision-making skills on the ball, he can work on his heading and finishing outside the box too. all n all a good player to work with', 'Samarth is a player with good potential, he needs to cut down his body weight to be faster, his running form, and his heading. he has good crossing ability but tends to take a lot of time before making any decision. he is very obedient player who is keen to learn more'),
(442, 442, 'Aaron is a sensible midfielder and understanding the coach instructions , he can elevate his game by improving his Spatial awareness , communication and negative transition overall good athlete to work with. ', 'Aaron is a midfielder and has a good technical ability to control a game and create chances and score a goal. He can improve on his Spatial awareness and negative transition overall good athlete to work with. '),
(443, 443, 'Mehul is in his development phase, he is a academy center player who got promoted to u15 team and his highly coachable player who understands the coach instruction and a hard working player. He can improve on his Spatial awareness,  communication with his teammates and shooting around the box. Overall good athlete to work with. ', 'Mehul is in his development phase, he is highly coachable player who got promoted to the team from academy center. He can improve on his communication, awareness, long range shooting , overall good athlete to work with. '),
(444, 444, '', 'Jai is fast and is a good finisher in the box, however he seems uninterested sometimes leading to inconsistent performances. '),
(445, 445, '', 'Yuvaan defends and tackles very well, he needs to improve on his concentration and decision making '),
(446, 446, '', 'Vrushank needs more self confidence to try things without the fear of making mistakes '),
(447, 447, '', 'Jayprateek has good reflexes and good distribution, he needs to improve on his positioning in 1v1 situations'),
(448, 448, '', 'Reuben performs drills well but defers to other players during matches. He needs more self confidence '),
(449, 449, '', 'Nathan is a well rounded player with good technical and physical attributes. He needs to learn to control his temper during heated situations'),
(450, 450, '', 'Ishan is a player with good outfield and goalkeeping potential. He needs to learn how to focus and concentrate when instructions are being given '),
(451, 451, 'Pranay is in his development phase. He should work on his basic football skills. He should be comfortable with the ball on his both feet and calm in tight spaces. Awareness is one important thing he should work on.', 'Pranay has improved alot, but he still need to work more on his awareness of surronding before and after receving the ball. His long range passing and shooting should be improved. As a mid field player he should learn to read the game and play more attacking passes. He should be more composed when he have the ball and control the game. He should work more on the ball with both the feet to get better control of the ball during the game.'),
(452, 452, 'Shashank is in his development phase. He has to work more on his physicality. His long range passing should be improve and need to work more on off the ball positioning and winning the ball back in the mid-field zone. He should work more on his non dominant foot.\r\n', 'Shashank is a very talented player. The thing he should work on is his strenght and non dominant foot. He should be more confident on the ball. He should also work on his 1v1 attacking. His crossing and shooting is also things he should work on. He should be more physical and brave to face stronger opponent and get rid of his shyness and communicate more with the teammate.'),
(453, 453, 'Jayant is in his development phase. He should work on his basic football skills. His defending should also be improved. His positioning on and off the ball should be things he should work on. He is not agile and body mobility is weak. He should work on body strength and body co-ordination.', 'Jayant is in his development phase and he has lot of things to work on. He should work on his strength and mobility. He should also focus to work more with the ball as he is not comfortable with the ball yet. His body co-ordination and sprinting is also weak and put more effort to improve himself. '),
(454, 454, 'Dhanin is in his development phase. He should work on his passing accuracy  from the back ( long & short ). He should work more on his communication,defensive organisation and defensive heading. His decision making should be better and be more calm and composed on the ball.', 'Dhanin is a good player with good physique. His first touch should be improve. His decision making in defending should also be things to work on. He should also work on his defending position and shape and should communicate more with the teammate. '),
(455, 455, '', 'Viren is a promising talented  player.  He needs to focus during training more instead of joking around '),
(456, 456, '', 'Bhairav has good passing and shooting technique. He needs to improve his agility and fitness '),
(457, 457, '', 'Ishaan needs to gain confidence to try things during matches. He also needs to improve his agility and fitness '),
(458, 458, '', 'Aditya\'s ball control, defensive interceptions and tackles have improved. He needs to be more confident on the ball '),
(459, 459, '', 'Manik is very talented and he follows instructions. He decision making needs to improve which will come with more practice '),
(460, 460, '', 'Param is very intelligent and picks up information quickly. He needs to  take training seriously and attend sessions regularly '),
(461, 461, '', 'Mukul has quick feet and he receives new information well. He needs to improve physically'),
(462, 462, '', 'Sohan has decent technique and is a good team player. He needs to improve physically. '),
(463, 463, '', 'Shashank needs to take practice seriously. He also needs to improve on his speed agility and quickness '),
(464, 464, '', 'Tilak is a decent individual player but he needs to improve as a team player because he tries to do too much by himself '),
(465, 465, '', 'Taisuke alternates between goalkeeping and defending. The versatility is good however he might improve more if he focuses on one position '),
(466, 466, '', 'Masato is technically gifted and he learns new skills quickly. He needs more self confidence and to improve in his physicality '),
(467, 467, '', 'Rivaan has quick feet with good shooting and passing technique. He needs more self confidence and desire to play without fear during matches '),
(468, 468, '', 'Rivaan has quick feet with good shooting and passing technique. He needs more self confidence/desire to play without fear during matches '),
(469, 469, '', 'Aritro is a well rounded left footed player. Working on his weak foot and decision making will help him improve. '),
(470, 470, '', 'Veer has quick feet and good technical ability however He needs to focus and follow instructions better '),
(471, 471, '', 'Zach has decent reflexes and strong hands. He needs to improve work on his agility and fitness to improve as a goalkeeper '),
(472, 472, '', 'Anirudh has good positioning and his technical ability is improving. He needs to focus during ball mastery drills '),
(473, 473, '', 'Advaith has quick feet and good dribbling skills however he needs to improve his decision making '),
(474, 474, '', 'Vihaan is a good team player that distributes the ball well. He needs to improve his finishing during matches '),
(475, 475, '', 'Mihit is a well rounded player that can attack and defend at a good level. He needs to improve his decision making in matches '),
(476, 476, '', 'Anirudh dribbles and runs with the ball very well to put in good crosses   He needs to add more versatility to his game'),
(477, 477, '', ''),
(478, 478, '', ''),
(479, 479, '', ''),
(480, 480, 'Abhishek is in his development phase. He should work more on his physicality and sprint. As a forward player he should also focus on his off the ball movement and find more space to attack and create goal scoring changes. ', 'Abhishek has alot to improved in the game. He is still in his development phase, his physical ability is one important thing he should work on. All the football action drops due to his physical weakness. He should also work on his non dominant foot as a forward player so that he can be more lethal in front of the goal. He should be more quicker off the ball and find space quickly so that he can be more in scoring changes.'),
(481, 481, 'Vishwa is in his development phase. He should work more on his defending communication, 1v1 defending, and defensive heading. His footwork is slow and his body strength is also weak so he should work more on to get faster and stronger.', 'Vishwa is an obedient kid who follow instruction. He should work more on his physical aspect. He has the ability to play better game if his physical is in good shape. He should work more on his sprinting as well. As a defender he should improve on defensive heading, defending 1v1 and ball clearence. His non dominant foot is one thing he should work on.\r\n'),
(482, 482, 'Vihaan is in his development phase. His attacking 1 v 1  should be improved and need to work on it. His football basic and his body cordination are the things he should work on it. His first touch should be improved.', 'Vihaan is a talented player with lot of potential. He is fast but his body co-ordination is weak. He should work more with the ball to be more comfortable with the ball. His sprinting is good but he should know how to use his speed to beat the defender. His decision making in the game is weak and should work on it. His shooting and finishing should also be things he should work on it.'),
(483, 483, 'Nivaan is in his development phase. He should work on his attacking ability. His 1 v 1 defending should also be improved and defending positioning off the ball need to be better and work on it. He should also improved more on his basic defending. His communication are aslo things he should work on as a defender.', 'Nivaan is a player with good IQ. He is intelligent but the execution is weak due to his weak physical strength. He has to improve on his strength and sprinting. His defending should be better and work more on defensive heading and clearance as well. He should be more brave and confident to play the game and not afraid to make mistakes. His decision making should be the one important thing he should work on.'),
(484, 484, 'Aditya is in his development phase. His football basic should be improved and body co-ordination should be things he should focus on.', 'Aditya is a hard working player, but he has lot of things to improve with the aspect of the game. He physical ability also need to improve. His football basic should be things he should work on to be able to play the game confidently. His body co-ordination is also weak and should work on it. He should be more regular to session so that the coaches can help him to improve.'),
(485, 485, 'Abhinav has improved from his last assessment.  He has a very positive attitude and a coachable player who understands the instructions. He has one more year in U-15 . He can improve on his  endurance more physical and dealing airer ball. He is good player to work with', 'Abhinav has improved and compare from last assessment. He\'s a team player , a coachable and very positive attitude . He can improve on dealing air ball and also being more physical while  playing. He will be in U15 one more year . We also have to be patience in his development. \r\n\r\n**(N/A indicates the particular test is not applicable to the age group/ it is not done for the athletes. 0 indicates the athlete was not present during the assessment)'),
(486, 486, 'During his development phase, Sruthan had a great season to showcase his skills. His advantage is that he has already experienced the intensity of U17 KSFA League, which will help him in the upcoming season. However, he needs to focus more on improving his non-dominant foot ability and communication skills', 'Sruthan had a decent season in the KSFA league as a defender. Due to the Karnataka player rule, he didn\'t play many matches. However, whenever he got the chance, he played well. He needs to focus more on his decision-making during the game, improve his ability to use his non-dominant foot and work on his verbal communication during matches'),
(487, 487, 'Suchir is currently in the developing phase and he has had a good season so far. He shows a positive attitude during games and has experienced the intensity of the U17 KSFA league, which will help him perform well in the upcoming season. However, he needs to work on improving his verbal communication with his teammates and focus on developing his non-dominant foot ability', 'Suchir is a hardworking player who displays a positive attitude both in training and during games. He has proven to be versatile enough to play in the midfielder, fullback, and winger positions in the KSFA U17 league. This versatility is sure to help him progress further in his career. Although he had a decent season in the league, he needs to work on improving his ability to use his non-dominant foot and communicate more effectively with his teammates.\"'),
(488, 488, 'Ujjwal is currently in his developmental phase, and he is proving to be one of the most promising defenders of the KSFA U17 league team. He displays excellent aggression and physicality during games and had a great season. One of his advantages is that he has already experienced the intensity of the KSFA U17 league, which should help him to perform even better in the next season. However, he needs to work on creating confidence in his long-range defensive clearances and 1 v 1 defending, especially knowing when to tackle. Overall, Ujjwal is a great asset to the team.', 'Ujjwal is a valuable member of the team, and his hardworking attitude and performance in the U17 category are admirable. He has experienced the intensity of the U17 KSFA league, and this will help him maintain his performance in the next season as well. Ujjwal is a fearless defender, and his off-the-ball aggression during the game is particularly noteworthy. However, he needs to work on improving his long-range defensive clearances, 1v1 defending, and long-range headers.'),
(489, 489, 'Adwaith is currently in his development phase as a midfielder. He has had a decent season so far in the KSFA U17 youth league. Adwaith is a highly coachable player, however, he needs to work on delivering more output in his on-the-ball movements and quick decision-making. He needs to be more aggressive in 1v1 duels and make recovery runs after losing possession of the ball.', 'Adwaith is a talented player who had a successful season in the KSFA U17 youth league. He consistently displayed impressive performances during matches. However, he needs to work on improving his on-the-ball work rate and commitment to aggressively win the ball. Adwaith should also maintain fitness throughout the match. Despite this, he is highly curious to learn about the game and is self-confident. Overall, he is a great athlete to train.'),
(490, 490, 'Aditya is currently in the development phase of his football career, and has not had many opportunities to play competitive matches due to some documental issues. However, if he can showcase his abilities during training sessions, he will have a chance to be in the playing eleven of DPDL and get more playing time. Aditya needs to listen to his coaches and put in more hard work to advance to the next level. To further improve, Aditya needs to work on his decision-making on and off the ball, as well as his communication skills with his teammates during matches.', 'Aditya is a hardworking player, who is a part of the DPDL squad. Whenever he gets the opportunity to start in the eleven or get playing time in a DPDL match, it is important for him to show his roles and responsibilities as a defensive player. He needs to work on improving his decision-making both on and off the ball, as well as his defensive clearances, especially his side-foot clearances and headers.'),
(491, 491, 'Tejas is currently in a developing phase in his football career. He had a great season and got to play a lot of competitive matches in the KSFA U17 league. There are more upcoming matches in the DPDL, which will give him even more valuable match experience. Tejas needs to work on improving his negative transition and finishing technique to become an even better player.', 'Tejas is a hardworking winger who has demonstrated his individual skills in the KSFA U17 league matches. He needs to be prepared to showcase his abilities in the upcoming DPDL matches as well. Tejas should focus more on improving his finishing and crossing techniques, especially with aerial balls. Although he has good technical abilities to beat defenders in 1v1 duels, he needs to work on his decision-making skills regarding when to cross the ball and when to take on defenders. Additionally, he should focus on improving his negative transition.'),
(492, 492, 'Gopi is a hardworking player who is currently in the development phase of his career. He had a decent season and played numerous competitive matches in the KSFA U17 youth league. However, there is still room for improvement in his ability to handle aerial balls in defensive situations, as well as his 1v1 defending. Moreover, he needs to work on improving his communication with his teammates during matches', 'Gopi has had a good season so far in the KSFA U17 league, where he has played many matches. He is currently in the development phase of his career and is showing a lot of promise in his roles and responsibilities. However, he still needs to work on improving his decision-making skills during matches. Technically, there is still room for improvement in his ability to handle defensive aerial balls. Additionally, he needs to improve his communication with his teammates during matches.');
INSERT INTO `ci_notes_from_coaching` (`id`, `forms_id`, `notes_frm_tech_dir`, `notes_frm_head_coach`) VALUES
(493, 493, 'Kian has had a good season so far. He has played many competitive matches in the KSFA U17 league, where he has shown a one-man show. He is one of the highly dependable players and has played an important role in the team\'s success this season. However, there is still room for improvement in his conversion rate in front of the goal, and he needs to work on his non-dominant foot.', 'Kian has had a wonderful season so far, showcasing his individual abilities and proving himself to be a highly dependable player for the team\'s success in the KSFA U17 league. He has a very positive attitude and is a great example of a hardworking player on the team. He has already demonstrated his endurance levels by effectively pressing opponents for long durations of the game. However, there is still room for improvement in terms of his consistency in finishing, as well as working on using both feet.'),
(494, 494, 'Aiden is currently in the development phase and has been showing a lot of promise during his training sessions. He has played many competitive matches in the KSFA U17 league, which has helped him gain confidence for the upcoming season. However, there is still room for improvement in his defensive heading and long-distance clearance.', 'Aiden had a good season in the KSFA U17 league. He played more matches and felt the intensity of the U17 category, which will help him showcase his skills in the next season. He is versatile and can play as a defender and a winger. This ability will take him to the next level. However, he needs to work on his defensive headers and clearances using both his side foot and lace part.'),
(495, 495, 'Sai Siddharth is currently in the development phase of his football career. He had a decent season playing in the KSFA U17 Youth League and gained valuable experience playing in competitive matches. Although he is a hardworking and highly coachable player, he needs to work on his communication skills during matches and improve his aggression in 1v1 duels and decision making when he has the ball. Additionally, he needs to focus on improving his ability to use his non-dominant foot.', 'Sai Siddharth had a successful season in the KSFA U17 league. He played several matches and experienced the high-intensity level of the U17 category, which will undoubtedly assist him in displaying his skills in the upcoming season. However, he needs to enhance his ability to use his nondominant foot and communication with his teammates during matches. '),
(496, 496, 'Amaan has displayed good performance every time he has gotten playing time in the KSFA U17 league. He has also experienced the high intensity of the U17 category league. As he is currently in his developing phase, he needs to focus on improving his non-dominant foot and being more aggressive in his off-the-ball movements.', 'Amaan is a highly dedicated footballer who is passionate about improving his skills on the pitch. He had a decent season in the KSFA U17 league where he showed his roles and responsibilities. He felt the intensity of the U17 category league which will help him showcase his abilities in the upcoming season. However, he needs to work on his decision-making both on and off the ball. Additionally, he needs to focus on improving his nondominant foot and communication skills with his teammates during matches.'),
(497, 497, 'Gopi is currently in the development phase of his career. He needs to work on his communication skills during matches, as well as improve his aggression in 1v1 duels and decision-making when he has the ball. Additionally, he needs to focus on improving his ability to use his non-dominant foot. Despite these areas for improvement, Gopi is a great athlete with a lot of potential for growth and success with proper training.', 'During training and matches, Gopi displayed a positive attitude and a great athlete mentality. However, he needs to work on improving his ability to run with the ball and his aggressiveness in 1v1 duels, as well as his decision-making skills when he has the ball. Additionally, he could benefit from enhancing his communication with his teammates during matches. '),
(498, 498, 'Krishna is still in his development phase and shows great athletic ability during training sessions. While he is a student of the game, he still needs to work a lot on his technical ability, especially his first touch while receiving and passing, as well as the accuracy and weight of his passes. Additionally, he needs to focus more on improving his communication with his teammates.', 'Krishna is a highly coachable player who is always eager to learn his roles and responsibilities. He needs to work on his first touch while receiving the ball and also needs to demonstrate more off-the-ball aggression. There is also a scope for improvement in his verbal and nonverbal communication during matches and training. He has to focus more on his decision-making both on and off the ball.'),
(499, 499, 'Kush performed well in the KSFA U17 league, showcasing his individual ability. He has upcoming matches in the DPDL where he can demonstrate his roles and responsibilities. However, there is room for improvement in his defensive headers. Additionally, he could improve his communication skills with his teammates during matches.', 'Kush has demonstrated his exceptional skills whenever he has had the opportunity to play in the KSFA U17 Youth League matches. He has also experienced the high level of competition in the U17 category. Kush is a highly driven footballer who exhibits a lot of passion to enhance his performance on the field. However, there is a need for improvement in his defensive headers, decision-making both on and off the ball, and communication with his teammates during matches.'),
(500, 500, 'Shiven is currently in the development phase of his athletic career. He is a good athlete to train and always shows a hardworking mentality. However, he needs to improve his communication with his teammates during matches. This is an area he needs to focus on frequently. Additionally, he needs to improve his finishing techniques, specifically which part of his feet he needs to use and focus on accuracy.', 'Shiven consistently demonstrates a positive attitude during training and is responsible for fulfilling his role as a forward player. He exhibits a strong desire to improve his skills on the field, but needs to work on his decision-making both on and off the ball. Additionally, he should focus on developing his nondominant foot and improving his communication with his teammates. Shiven\'s finishing technique requires more attention and he is advised to attend the Thursday morning individual session for personalized attention and increased repetition.'),
(501, 501, 'Mahimna is a very positive player and has a brillant attitude towards training and matches. Mahimna struggles under pressure situations during matches and finds it difficult to impose his game. Need to work much harder to be able to meet the demands of the game as it is more intense at U17 level. Also Mahimna should improve his speed and stamina to last the entire match. Continue to put more effort in training and matches to improve.', 'Mahimna has shown lot of improvement in matches. Makes good choices while passing and plays for the team. Every training and practise game Mahimna puts 100 percent effort. Continue to keep pushing to excel. Has good attitude and positive with coaches and teammates. Should work in improving  heading, long passes, shooting and finishing technique. Tactically needs to me more aware during the transitions. '),
(502, 502, 'Gouguun is a technically strong player and physically has good strength. But lacks stamina to last the entire game. Gouguun should be more regular to the training and matches. Need to take more responsibility on and off the pitch to develop. Has good potential but if doesn\'t develop good training and match attitude will not help realise his potential. Gouguun needs to correct his food habits especially before training so he is able to give 100% during the training.', 'Missed a lot of weeks due to injury after Gouguun met with an accident last year. In KSFA did a good job by playing multiple positions and being very strong in the defense. His technique of long passes and heading has improved. And while defending has a very good tackling ability and won possession many times during the games. Gouguun has good game but his training and match preparation habits are poor. Should be more focused in developing good training habits to have long lasting football player journey.  Also his decision making needs to improve a lot as most of the time he misses to find the best possible solution on the pitch.'),
(503, 503, 'Nischal has good technical base. 1v1 can be much better. Attitude during the matches are positive and plays well with his team mates. Also shows leadership attittude by motivating and encouraging his team mates during the matches. Keep it up. Should work on his finishing technique to improve his accuracy. And need to devlop stamina to last the entire game.', 'Nischal had a good experience in Ksfa matches. Played in attack and created many chances for the team. Also had many goal scoring  oppurtunities. Should improve heading at goal technique and finishing technique. Need to be regular to the training to improve his finishing skills and understand the team principles better. Should work more hard to develop.'),
(504, 504, 'Anuj has developed a lot from where he started. Got lot good match experience in Ksfa. Anuj has a good training attitude and positive with all his team mates. Need to improve technique under pressure and on the ball has to be quick in decision making.  More way to go to Anuj to develop and meet the demands of the game.', 'Anuj has a good training attitude and always gives 100%. Understands the roles and responsibility of his position. Good improvement overall and got lot of match experinence in Ksfa matches. Should be working hard in training to develop training under pressure. '),
(505, 505, 'Krsna got good match experience with Ksfa and developed a lot through this match experience. Against tough teams stuggles to keep the possession and win the ball in the midfield. Should be regular to training inorder to be consistant with tough opponents. Attitude in training and matches is good. Keep it up.', 'Shown good improvement through Ksfa matches. Started making more tackles and winning header duels. Krsna needs to improve his fitness as he gets injured frequently and finds difficult to keep up the intensity during the game throughout. Should be more regular to the training to develop his fitness and must follow injury prevention exercises to stay fit.'),
(506, 506, 'Rayaan is a good team player and has a versatility which is a mark of quality players. Should focus on regular training and improve his finishing skills. Rayaan has good leadership qualities and has good relationship with all his team mates. Keep it up. ', 'Rayaan played well in all the games in Ksfa. Rayaan has brilliant attitude on the pitch and always motivating his teammates. Keep continuing that. His long passes are good now must focus on accuracy and speed. Has good defending qualities now has to improve attacking qualities also as he will be playing in different postions. '),
(507, 507, 'Played few games in Ksfa before injury. Combined well with teammates while attacking. While defending should give 100 % in every tackle. Decision making while defending needs to improve.', 'Missed many months due to injury. Should slowly recover and start training. '),
(508, 508, 'Dheer has improved alot from his last assessment. He\'s coachable player and understands the instructions.  He\'s has to improve his technique i.e first touch.  He can focus on his Spatial awareness(blindside) and defending in dealing with airer ball. Good athlete to work with. ', 'Dheer has improved positively compare to his last assessment. He is coachable player understanding the instructions. He have to improved his blind side defending and airer ball.'),
(509, 509, 'Dhruv has improved a lot from his last assessment.  His versatility makes him level up his performance. He can improve on his crossing ,endurance and strength also he can do better on his positioning with and without the ball. Good player to work with.', 'Dhruv has improved a lot compared to his last assessment . He\'s a versatile lefty who can play in different positions and has good discipline. He can improve on his crossing and positioning on and off the ball.'),
(510, 510, '', 'Dhruv has improved alot compare from his last assessment . He\'s a versatile lefty who can play in different positions and good discipline. He can improve on his crossing and positioning on and of the ball.'),
(511, 511, 'Pradyun has improved from his last assessment. He\'s developing positively through the season , scoring and shooting from outside the box and is a highly coachable player. He can improve on his switch off play and be more tough and more aggressive during the match. He is a good athlete to work with. ', 'Pradyun has improved compared to his last assessment. He\'s very positive and scored goals from outside the box in ksfa matches . He can improve on his switch of play and more aggressive during the game. Overall he is a highly coachable player.'),
(512, 512, '', 'Pradyun has improved compare from his last assessment. He\'s very positive and score goal from outside the box in ksfa matches . He can improve on his switch of play and more aggressive during the game. Overall he is highly coachable player.'),
(513, 513, 'Vishwak has improved alot from his last assessment. He has boosted his confidence in keeping the ball under pressure and his dribbling and crossing and shooting at the goal are also much better, he needs to focus on his endurance, has to be more aggressive and more physically ready to progress to U17. Overall highly coachable player and good player to work with.', 'Vishwak has improved from his last assessment. his dribbling and crossing are also better. He needs to build his endurance, defend in 1v1, more aggressive and physical. overall he\'s a good player to work with and really disciplined player.'),
(514, 514, 'Adi nair has improved from his last assessment. As he\'s in development phase we have to patience in his development, He also play some matches in ksfa youth league that will help hime elevate his performance and confidence he can improve on his Spatial awareness, communication, positioning and how to deal with air ball and crossing.  He is a good player to work with. ', 'Aadi nair has been in his development phase. We have to be patience in his development,  He has a good ksfa youth league competition experience to boost his confidence. He can improve on his Spatial awareness , positioning , dealing with air ball and crossing. He\'s a good player to work with.'),
(515, 515, 'Trinab has improved alot compare from his last assessment. He\'s a very hard working player and highly coachable player,  he can improve his endurance, 1v1 defending how to be patience and crossing the ball and dealing with airer ball(defending header) overall good athlete to work with. ', 'Trinabh have improved alot more from his last assessment. He is highly coachable and hard working disciplined player. He can improve on his endurance,  1v1 defending , crossing and dealing with air ball.'),
(516, 516, 'Gurudev has improved from his last assessment, he\'s technically sound but needs to know when to pass and dribble the ball and he needs to work on his awareness, build his endurance and we have to be patience with his development overall good athlete to work with. ', 'Gurudev have improved from his last assessment , He needs to know when to pass and dribble the ball and build is endurance overall good player to work with.'),
(517, 517, 'Tushya have improved from his last assessment, he has improved his games sense, better communication and improved alot of his technique , with all his competition matches hlep him level up his performance, he can work on his endurance, dealing 1v1 defending and dicision making. Have to be patience on his development overall good players to work with. ', 'Tushya have improved from his last assessment. He has a better game sense ,better communication and techniques,  he also has experience competitive ksfa matches with help him level up his performance. He can work on his endurance, dealing airer ball, 1v1 defending and quick dicision making. Overall good player to work with. '),
(518, 518, 'Tharun have improved from his last assessment, with the ksfa matches experience he had to be confidence and mentally ready to improve his negative transition. He has 1 more year in U-15 which will help him to be more confidence with the experience he had over this season. He good player to work with ', 'Tharun have improved from his last assessment, He has experienced competitive ksfa youth league matches, \r\nwe have to patience on his development. he need to be mentality ready to improved his behavior in transition to help his teammates, overall good athlete to work with.  '),
(519, 519, 'Aryan have improved from his last assessment. His experience in ksfa matches helped him build his confidence, he is a good midfielder, he can improve his positioning, endurance and finishing outside the box. Overall good athlete to work with. ', 'Aryan have improved from his last assessment, He can work on his endurance, movement with and without the ball and communication. Overall he is a good athlete to work with. '),
(520, 520, 'Yohan have improved alot compare to his last assessment, he can work on awareness(blindside defending) , accuracy passing short and long ball and his endurance. He has one more year in U-15. He is a good athlete to work with. ', 'Yohan have improved alot from last assessment. He also improved his tactical awareness alot, he has experienced alot of ksfa youth league competition and though friendly match, He can work on his longball , short passing accuracy and endurance. Over good player to work with. '),
(521, 521, 'Smyan have improved from his last assessment. He needs to make himself aware of what position and responsibilities he needs as a defender. He needs to work on his 1v1 defending, dealing with airer ball/crossing. He  has one more year In U-15. We are always there to help him to get better and overall good athlete to work with. ', 'Smyan have improved from his last assessment. He needs to have better understand of his role and responsibility in the training. He can focus in dealing with airer ball, 1v1 defending, build his endurance. Overall good athlete to work with. '),
(522, 522, 'Samarth have improved from his experience in competitive ksfa matches. He needs to do more crossing during the match and more shooting from in and outside the box weather in training or match. He needs to have better dicision making under pressure and positioning without the ball and work on his heading on the goal. Overall he is a good athlete to work with. ', 'Samarth have improved from his last assessment , he have experienced ksfa youth league matches which help him level up his performance. he needs to improve his decision-making with and withouttheball, he can work on his heading and finishing outside the box. Overall good athlete to work with. '),
(523, 523, 'Aaron have improved form his last assessment, he is highly technical player and important midfielder for the team, he is a complete team player,  he can focus on his communication, going for air ball and build his endurance to sustain for the game and also needs to be mentally strong and physical also can do better in negative transition. He is good athlete to work with. ', 'Aaron have improved alot from his last assessment, he has alot of potential and skills,  he also shown his confidence during the ksfa matches, he\'s a proper team player, he can focus on his endurance,  dealing with air ball and needs to have the mentality to be more physical and more better in negative transition.  Overall good player to work with. '),
(524, 524, 'Mehul is in his development phase and he has improved alot, he is an academy center player who got promoted to u15 team experiencing ksfa youth league matches which help him level up his game sense and he is highly coachable player who understands the coach instruction and a hard working player. He can improve on his Spatial awareness,  communication with his teammates, crossing and shooting around the box. Overall good athlete to work with. ', 'Mehul have improved alot and he is in his development phase. He\'s very intelligent player. He have experienced competitive matches which boost his confidence. He can improve his communication, dealing with air ball, 1v1 and he needs to do more crossing.  He is a good player to work with. '),
(525, 525, 'Shlok is progressively positively, he\'s getting more comfortable with the ball and exposure to different positions that will help him understand the game more.', 'Shlok is getting more comfortable on the ball and we can see his progress, he needs to focus on his diet to become a better athlete and also keep focusing and concentrating on his improving is technical ability and game understanding. '),
(526, 526, 'Rishaan has always been a standout player and this season we\'ve seen him play better and improve in the right direction. He\'ll keep developing  and his game will keep getting better in his development phase. ', 'Rishaan is a player any coach will want in the team, he is committed to the team and works hard in the training which shows directly in the match. He is a born leader'),
(527, 527, 'Siddhartha is in his development phase and we can see the signs of his improvement. ', 'Siddhartha is improving since the first cycle and now and with more sessions he should improve. He needs to focus a lot on his diet to get the strength and weight to compete and bring his best football abilities. '),
(528, 528, 'Lokshith is developing well and is a confident boy,  he needs to eat more and have a better diet to have the energy needed to train and also play matches. ', 'Lokshith is a good player and has good ability. If he puts in more effort in training, he can become a much better player. He should focus on his diet and do a lot of strength training '),
(529, 529, '', 'Good understanding of the game. Good with tackling and 1v1 defending. He has a better passing quality however he needs to improve \r\nLong passes. In Defending his clearance technique is perfect and understands the situations of the game. He Showed effective performance in the match situations. However, he loses his hope. He needs to gain his confidence and learn from his mistakes. \r\nopponents. Good training attitude and respects the coaches and his teammates. He needs to work on physical actions like  Speed, strength, and stamina. He is improving with his skills.  We are happy with his performance. Best wishes!'),
(530, 530, 'Sriman is currently in his development phase and is displaying a positive attitude in both training and matches. He is a hardworking player, however, he needs to improve his ability to run with the ball and make crosses from wide areas. Furthermore, he should work on improving his communication with his teammates.', 'Sriman is a hardworking player who needs to maintain consistency in his performance level and avoid dropping to an average level. As a winger, he should show variation in crosses from wide areas and focus more on running with the ball, 1v1 attacking, and passing accuracy. Tactically, he needs to improve his off-the-ball aggression and execute his proper roles and responsibilities. Additionally, he should work on improving his communication with his teammates.'),
(531, 531, 'Ojas has been developing well, he needs to be regular to sessions and keep training to improve his abilities.', 'Ojas has improved positively so far in the season. He needs to keep training hard to improve his technical abilities, ball mastery and reading of the game. He needs to have a better diet to have the energy and strength needed to play in a competitive environment. \r\n**The player was absent during 20-40m  testing. '),
(532, 532, 'Tushar has improved very well but as more to come. he needs to take care of his health more as he seems to have some or the other sickness every 2 weeks, he can improve on communication and his overall development', 'Tushar from where he was has improved significantly, needs to improve a lot more nevertheless. all the basics needs to be worked on but he has been putting al lot of effort to reach where he is now.'),
(533, 533, 'Arav is a player with good potential, he needs to be more calmer while playing matches, his weak foot has improved. should still work on long shots and long passes', 'Arav is a disciplined child but a very short tempered player. needs to be more calm when things dont work his way though he has improved on it significantly,  he needs work on long shots and long passes. his game IQ has improved. a very hardworking player'),
(534, 534, 'Pratyush is developing slowly, but needs to work on his fitness and shooting ability to keep it on target', 'Pratyush is a player with good physique and power but he needs to learn how to use it, needs to work on the weight of the pass and shot. he really needs to work on his fitness and endurance as well.'),
(535, 535, '', ''),
(536, 536, 'Steve has improved from the last assesment very well, his long ball ability has gotten better and decision making too. needs to improve his strength and flexibility', 'Steve has gotten better past few months, he\'s been emotionally more mature this time but still has a lot more to improve on that. crossing has become much better as well as speed on the ball. he needs to get better in crossing at speed and flexibility.'),
(537, 537, 'Ram is very positive player and a intelligent midfielder, he\'s also technically sound,  his contribution and efforts to encourage the team is highly appreciated. He\'s 2 times champion of U-15 KSFA Youth league. Coaches also have lots of faith in his brilliant football , he can focus on his strength and long passing,  all Coaches are there to help him to achieve his goals and he\'s a good player to work with.', 'Ram is a intelligent midfielder and very good  technically and positive attitude.He\'s a 2 times Ksfa youth league champion which will help him built his  confidence and He give his best in training and in matches, He has to focus on strength and longball , We all coaches are there to support him and develop him to meet his objectives. He is a brilliant player to work with.'),
(538, 538, 'Karthick has improved from his previous assesment, he needs to improve on his strength and endurance more in coming seasons to be able to cope up to the demand of the game', 'Karthick is steadily improving, he needs to get his decision making more quick in the defensive third on the ball and improve the timing when tackling the player. he needs to improve on his strength too. all in all a good player with a good potential'),
(539, 539, 'Ashok has been developing steadily, he needs to improve on his fitness still and playing more short passes. his long ball has improved well.', 'Ashok has improved a lot from his previous assessment but only in a few areas. in other areas, he needs to improve allot more. mainly short passing in the defensive third, his long balls have improved a lot but he needs to play more calmly in the defensive third to be a better CB. his communication has improved and his confidence as a player and as a person has become better too.'),
(540, 540, 'Arav is in his development phase, he has good freekick ability and short passes. needs to work on his fitness and communication', 'Arav has been improving well but has a long way to go. nevertheless he has improved in his defensive third calmness and short passing ability. needs to communicate more and be more vigilant in spacial awareness.'),
(541, 541, 'Saarthak is in his development phase, he has to put more effort into cutting down his weight so he can be faster and quicker. his long balls are inconsistent but he has been giving his maximum in matches and is a well-disciplined player', 'Saarthak is a good player but he needs to learn to be more ferocious in the game and communicate more. he needs to work on his weight loss and be more committed to training'),
(542, 542, 'Yathaarth has been consistent in training and that has developed him to be a better player, he has become more aggressive off the ball but needs to work on his spatial awareness , shoulder checking while defending to know whom to mark and where', 'Yathaarth has been consistent in the matches as well as training. he needs more game IQ and learn to check the surroundings while defending rather than be fixated on the ball. he\'s a very aggressive player on the ball who likes to overlap a lot. he can work on his agility and speed  too.'),
(543, 543, 'Tanay is in his development phase, he needs to work on almost all aspects of the game but he has improved from where he was', 'Tanay has improved but has a long way to go. he needs to work on his fitness on the days he has break from training. he needs to communicate more in training and matches too.'),
(544, 544, 'Sanat is in his development phase still, he needs to be more regular in training to achieve the improvement we want from him. he needs to improve in his speed and fitness and be more vocal in training and match', 'Sanat has more to improve overall, he needs to be consistent in training to be able reach his potential. he needs to improve his physicality overall. though there has been a good improvement, we are expecting to see more from him.'),
(545, 545, 'Leo has improved and highly coachable player, he needs to understand his strengths in the game like shooting from outside the box , crossing the ball and needs to understand with his speed he can take opponent defense in 1v1 .', 'Leo will be in U15 one more year, he\'s a highly coachable player, he needs to understand the situation when to pass or dribble. He can take more shoots from outside the box. Good player to work with. '),
(546, 546, '', 'He has a passion to play. Eager to learn different actions in football. However, he is constant in one position of play. He Needs to understand his role and responsibilities and help the team in various scenarios. Needs to be more creative. Need to improve his speed and balance. work hard and gain confidence. '),
(547, 547, '', 'Vivaan has a postive attitude. He understands the drills and strategies. However, He needs to improve his speed and agility. He has better ball control, His techniques in passing and receiving are good. However, during the pressure time, he loses ball control when he needs to develop his reaction ability. He needs to work on his strengths and weaknesses to improve his performance. Best wishes!'),
(548, 548, '', 'Prajwal comes with positivity to the session. He communicates and understands the team and respects his coaches. His fundamentals in football are good, However, he has to build his confidence during the practice. His dribbling and passing actions are good but when he is under pressure he loses the ball control there he has to be aware and make decisions quickly. He has good game sense. However, he needs to understand his role and responsibility in the game. Best wishes!'),
(549, 549, '', 'Dhruv has outstanding technical skills, He has good completion and precision in passes. his game style in recent performances is good. However, he needs to improve his decision-making and his confidence in the game. Work on his strengths and weaknesses more to gain a better performance. Best wishes!'),
(550, 550, '', 'Ishaan is technically strong with his right foot.  with good passing range off of with right foot. Even under pressure, However, he needs to use his non-dominant feet as well. Ishaan can turn out of trouble and make a pass. He has a good dribbling action. For all of his technical ability, Ishaan should score goals. He respects and understands the teams and the coaches. Keep encouraging him.  Best wishes!\r\nmore goals. Spend time working on different techniques in and around the other techniques. '),
(551, 551, '', 'Anirudh has a good technical skills. His technique, including skills such as dribbles, ball control, and shots is good. However,  needs to improve his ability to read the game, and his quick and peripheral vision and decision-making. Comparing with other players of the same position he determines the similarities and differences in his style of play. '),
(552, 552, '', 'Anirudh has a basic fundamenntals skills. He respects the coaches and his teammates . Anirudh needs to use his non dominant foot more . He faces difficulty when he is under pressure situation in the game, to avoid that he needs to develop his Decision making . However he understands the drills and instructions . He needs to develop his speed ,agility to improve his performance over the game '),
(553, 553, '', 'Vir can read the game and anticipate plays. However, he needs to improve his attitude and work ethic. He understands the drills and style of play. His passes and dribbling skills are good. He has a good finishing technique. However, he needs to understand his role in play.  However, he needs to improve his decision making like when to dribble and when to pass, etc. He needs to develop his concentration and self-confidence during practice and in the match. He needs to work more on his strengths and weaknesses to improve his performance. '),
(554, 554, '', 'Shivansh regularity is good, he has a basic technique like passing and dribbling,  However, he needs to improve his ball control and his decision-making. He needs to be more quick. sometimes he loses focus on the session. Needs to work more on both feet and have to be creative. need more confidence. '),
(555, 555, '', 'Mauktik has outstanding technical skills and a quick and precise vision.  He can read the game and anticipate plays, However, he needs to improve his communication. He needs to improve his decision-making skills. He needs to work more on his speed, agility, and balance. His confidence level was good.  However, he needs to be more creative, which helps him to improve his performance. Need to work more on his strengths and weaknesses. Best wishes!'),
(556, 556, '', 'Joe has outstanding technical skills, He understands the instructions during the match and practices. However, he needs to improve his decision-making and creativity. His passes and dribbling skills are good however he loses the ball when he is under pressure, where he needs to be more creative and to know how to handle the situation. He needs to improve his awareness. He needs to work more on his speed and agility. He has a good finish technique to maintain it. However, he needs to understand his role and responsibility he needs more tactical awareness and reading the game. Best wishes!'),
(557, 557, '', 'John has good technical skills. He respects his teammates and his coaches. He putting effort into learning different football actions. He needs to be creative. His ball control is up to the mark however he loses the ball control when he gets pressure. Where he needs to improve his decision-making. In some situations, he loses position and asks for the ball behind the defender. Which is not helping him to receive and support the team. However, he needs to improve his awareness there. He needs to work more on his strengths and weaknesses. '),
(558, 558, '', 'Manak has good technical skills. His passes and control were good. However, he needs to improve his dribbling skills. He understands the instructions during the game and practice. He needs to develop his decision-making speed, agility, and balance. His attitude and work ethic are good however he needs to be regular in the sessions. He needs to work more on his strengths and weaknesses to gain better performance. Best wishes!'),
(559, 559, '', 'Nihal has a basic technique. He understands the instructions. He puts effort into the practice to learn new football action. However, he needs to develop self-confidence which will help him to better in all actions. His decision-making needs to be better. he needs to work more on with and without ball actions to gain better performance. '),
(560, 560, '', 'Suhas individual technique, including skills such as dribbles, ball control, and passes is good. However, he needs to develop his decision making like when to dribble and when to pass, etc. He understands to read the game well however he needs to understand his role and responsibilities. He needs to improve his speed and balance. His recent performance are good however he needs to put more time to practice on his strength and weakness to achieve better performance. Best wishes!'),
(561, 561, '', 'Reyansh has Good completion and precision in passes. However, he needs to improve his long-distance passes. As a keeper, he can read the game and anticipate plays. However, he needs to develop his decision-making and creativity. example when 1v 1 situation he needs to decide the right time to press or tackle the ball or to delay the opponent\'s scoring opportunities. His work rate is good.  He needs to maintain it to gain better performance.  '),
(562, 562, '', ''),
(563, 563, 'Kavin is in development phase and is learning the technical and tactical aspects of the game. Kavin has a good training attitude and is regular to every training session. This has helped him improve his technical skills. Must improve speed and agility to be good in 1v1 situations while attacking. Keep working on improving techniques and speed.', 'Kavin has improved a lot in recent months. He is regular and works hard in the training. Still has to improve his ball control in tight areas and decision making during the game situations. Good attitude in training and listens to coach. Keep working hard to develop technical and tactical aspects of the game. Physically has improved his speed and agility. Should develop strength and stamina.'),
(564, 564, 'Tae Su is currently in his development phase. He is improving his decision making and techniques. Defending skills like blocking, tackling and clearning are good. Attacking skills need to improve a lot. Tae Su must focus on improving his Speed and Stamina.  Tae Su has good attitude and is a good teammate. More regular he has to be in order to improve technical and physical aspects of the game.', 'Tae Su has good defending skills and wins lots of 1v1 tackles and makes many interceptions. Should work on his technical skills while attacking. He must improve his passing accuracy and ball manipulation skills to be more effective when team is attacking. Attitude and effort in training is good. Need to be more consistant in games and performance needs to be better when opponents are tough.'),
(565, 565, 'Soham as shown good signs of development over the past months. He has good technical abilities and a good understanding of the game. ', 'Soham as been developing well in the tournaments, he needs to be more calm on the ball in the attacking third and infront of goal. He needs needs to keep training and focus on building his strength to be more physical on and off the ball. \r\nXX- player was absent during the repeated testing during the season '),
(566, 566, '', 'Vivaan has a outstanding technical skills . He understands the instructions well. He needs to work more on his speed and balance. Vivaan is proactive throughout the game but could take more initiative in trying to dictate the tempo of the game. He is technically strong with his left leg. However, he needs to use his nondominant foot.  Spend time working on different techniques in and around the field. '),
(567, 567, '', 'Shikar\'s technique, including skills such as dribbles, ball control, and passing is good. However, he needs to improve his awareness during the game and the practice. In some situations, he is waiting for the ball to come onto his feet. He needs to be aware to create a space and ask for the ball. He needs to focus more on his defending movements . He is confident with his favorite feet however he needs to be strong in his nondominant feet as well. Need to improve his speed agility and balance to perform better. '),
(568, 568, '', 'Juan comes up with a positive mindset towards the game and practice. He has good technique in football. His speed is good. However, he needs tactical football knowledge. He is good with 1 v 1 actions in the game. In some situations under pressure from the opponent, his reaction moments are a little slow. He needs to improve his decision-making.  However, he needs to understand his role and responsibility. His attitude and work rate is good. However, He needs to develop his agility and endurance to perform long duration on the pitch. '),
(569, 569, '', 'Aaryan attitude and work rate are good. He has a better technique and understands the situation of the game. However, he needs to improve his decision-making and needs to develop his creativity in the game. He has good speed and agility. However, he needs to improve his balance and endurance. He needs to work more on his strengths and weaknesses to achieve better performance. '),
(570, 570, '', 'Tanash is agile and speedy. his passes and dribbling are good. However, he needs to practice more with his first touch and ball control. He needs to be regular in the session. he reads the games well and understands the situations however he needs better decision-making and creativity. His attitude is good he needs to work more on his strengths and weaknesses to achieve better performance .'),
(571, 571, '', 'Snehin Sinha has better technical skills. He has a positive attitude however he needs to be regular to the sessions. He handles the pressure in the game and the practice sessions however he needs to improve his speed and agility to gain the performance. He reads and understands the situation of the game. however, he needs to understand his role and responsibility. he loses his position quickly which is not helping the team when under pressure. He needs to work more on his practice. '),
(572, 572, '', 'Ayush bhan basic techniques are good. He comes up with a positive attitude and respects his teammates. However, he needs to develop his communication with his teammates which will help him to gain confidence. Need improvement on his ball control. He needs to improve on his speed, agility, and body balance. '),
(573, 573, '', 'Amogh has basic technical skills. He is regular and has a positive attitude. His passes and in the shortest range are good. However, he needs to improve his long-range passing. He needs to improve his shooting and dribbling technique. He understands the game and instructions however he needs to improve his roles and responsibility during the game. Need more improvement in speed and agility, '),
(574, 574, '', 'Ivan is showing progression in his Basic technical skills. He is quick and agile however he loses his body balance. His passes in the short range are good. He needs to improve in awareness of the game. He needs improvement in his decision-making. He understands the game instructions which is helping him to gain a better performance. Work more on his strengths and weaknesses to achieve better performance. '),
(575, 575, '', 'Omm has a good basic technique.  He plays well in goalkeeping. His saves on the Ariel balls are good however he needs to improve his ball collections. He is winning 1 v1 situations and tackling good. However, he needs to improve his awareness and needs improvements in his first touch which will help him to make a decision. Need improvement in his fitness like speed and agility. Need to work more on his strengths and weaknesses to perform better. '),
(576, 576, '', 'Sujay\' s Passing techniques are good. However, he needs to improve his dribbling and ball manipulation.  He receives the ball well when he is free. In the pressure situation, he loses the ball to the opponent. Where he needs to develop his first touch and decision-making. He plays well in defending. Need to apply playing with both feet. Need more improvement on his speed and agility. '),
(577, 577, '', 'Vinayak has a positive attitude. His passes in the short range are good. Plays well as a defending role. however, he needs to improve his first touch and ball control.  He understands the instructions however he needs to develop his decision-making and creativity.  Need improvements in his physical actions like body balance and agility. Overall he is progressing but needs to work more on his strengths and weakness.'),
(578, 578, '', 'Manvit has outstanding technical skills. His ball Manipulation and control is.   He is good at attacking however he needs to develop his defending actions. He decides and makes decisions quickly. However, he loses position while playing. He needs to develop his awareness while playing. Need more focus on his roles and responsibilities. '),
(579, 579, '', 'Shreeansh has better ball manipulations. His passes in the short and long rages are good. However, he needs to develop his dribbling and decision-making. His defending movements are impressive he tackles well and wins Ariel balls. however, during the transition from defense to attack, he loses quickly because of the pressure. There he needs to improve his awareness to overcome the pressure to give advantages to his teammates. Need to work more on his strengths and weaknesses to improve his performance. '),
(580, 580, '', 'Ayaan is quick and agile. He understands the instructions and respects his teammates. His passing technique is good. However, he needs to improve his dribbling and ball control. He needs to use both feet. '),
(581, 581, '', 'His passes and ball control are good. However, he needs to improve his dribbling. He receives and handles the ball when he doesn\'t have pressure. He loses ball control when he gets pressure. He needs to develop his awareness to be away from the pressure. Like, dribble the ball to the free space or receive the ball in the free space. Need to work on his technique while taking shots. Need to work on speed and agility.'),
(582, 582, '', 'Aadhya has a positive attitude and respects his teammates and coaches .  having a basic technique in passing and ball control. She needs to learn the ball mastering and creativity. Need to use both feet while playing. '),
(583, 583, '', 'Dhruv is agile and active. His fundamentals are good however he need to apply both the feet to perform. '),
(584, 584, '', 'Ean has outstanding technical skills. He has a positive attitude and respects his teammates and coaches. Comparing him with other players of the same position he determine the similarities and he shows  differences in his style of play. However, he needs to work more on his finishing technique and 1 v1 situations  He needs to put more effort into working on his strengths and weaknesses.  '),
(585, 585, '', 'Aryeh has good technical skills. Need to focus more on ball control. Good completion and precision in dribbling however he needs to improve his decision making like when to dribble and when to pass. Need to develop his awareness. like, finding a free space to give one passing line to the teammate. '),
(586, 586, '', 'Arth is technically strong with the right feet. He can turn out of pressure and make a pass. However, he needs to use non-dominant feet as well. He understands the instructions and gaining confidence during practice. Which helps him to deliver better performance. However, he needs to put effort and work more on his strengths and weaknesses.'),
(587, 587, '', 'Aarohi has outstanding technical skills. she comes up with a positive attitude to the session. However, she needs to develop communication skills. Good completion and precision in passes. However, she needs to improve her dribbling skills. She can read the game and anticipate plays. Spend time working on different techniques to gain better performance. '),
(588, 588, '', 'Ameet has a good technical skills. He orientates his body and makes different actions on the field. however, he needs to develop his ball control and decision-making. he needs to understand the right time to go for a dribble or pass. He needs to work more on his nondominant feet. However, he understands the instructions and shows a positive attitude in the sessions.'),
(589, 589, '', 'Hitansh\'s basics are good. His dribbling skills are good. However, he needs to improve his passing technique. Need to work on non-dominant feet. Need an improvement in his decision-making and creativity in his skills. '),
(590, 590, '', 'Outstanding technical skills and tactical knowledge are better. Need to improve his decision-making. He needs to develop his shooting technique. In transitions, Sahanya needs to be quick to recover and drop into position. He helps direct others to keep their shape and apply pressure when it\'s needed. After winning the ball Sahanya has more time than he realizes. Get your head up and look to choose\r\nthe right option based on the situation.  '),
(591, 591, '', 'Basics technical skills are good. Need to use both feet.  She needs to improve her first touch and dribbling techniques . '),
(592, 592, '', 'Ritwin is punctual and shows a positive attitude towards the session. His passing technique is good, However before passing the ball he needs to check his teammate\'s position. He needs to improve his ball mastery and dribbling. He plays well as a defender and Goalkeeper. however, he needs to improve and apply the principles of the game. Work on both feet. '),
(593, 593, '', 'Kriv is young and enthusiastic. He understands the drills and techniques and improving day by day. spent more time to learn the new things in football. ');
INSERT INTO `ci_notes_from_coaching` (`id`, `forms_id`, `notes_frm_tech_dir`, `notes_frm_head_coach`) VALUES
(594, 594, '', 'Kabir has good technical skills. However, he needs to develop his ball control and dribbling technique. He understands the instructions however he loses focus. He needs to learn to use both feet while playing. '),
(595, 595, '', 'Chitransh has a strong understanding of positional sense going forward but often makes the wrong choices with\r\nhis runs when a teammate is in an advanced position. His defending skills are good, however he needs to understand his role and responsibilities. Need improvement in his dribbling and decision-making.  When the ball is won back, often Chitransh has more time than he realizes. Get your head up and look to choose the right option based on the situation. Need to work hard. '),
(596, 596, '', 'Anvith has outstanding technical skills. he is positive and respects his teammates and coaches. He should continue to exploit the open space that can drag defenders with him, freeing up space for others. He needs to improve his decision-making and needs to develop his creativity. He takes better shots on the target however before making a shot he needs to observe the situation rather than going blind shots. Need to work more on his strengths and weaknesses. '),
(597, 597, '', 'Ganesh has a positive attitude and respects his teammates. He Is improving with his football techniques. his tacklings are good.  putting pressure on the right time to win the ball. However, he needs to improve his passing and dribbling techniques. His decision-making has to be better. Plays well as a defender however when the ball is in the opponent\'s half he needs to move forward and give support .'),
(598, 598, '', 'Dhruv has good game knowledge. Dhruv is good in 1v1 situations but doesn\'t take the lead in dragging players out of position. Dhruv should look\r\nfurther ahead. Could take more initiative in trying to dictate the tempo of the Game. Need to improve his speed and agility . '),
(599, 599, '', 'Omer has a strong understanding of positional sense going forward but often makes the wrong choices with\r\nhis runs when a teammate is in an advanced position. Omer should continue to exploit the open space that\r\ncan drag defenders with him, freeing up space for others. Need improvements in his decision-making and creativity. he plays well in defending however he needs to develop his attacking principles. '),
(600, 600, '', 'Nathan has a positive attitude and understands the instructions. He needs to improve his communication with the team. His techniques are good however he needs to read the game better.  His defending moments like tackling and clearing are good. However, he loses his position very quickly. He needs to improve his awareness and decision-making. he is showing positivity on the session we wish him to work hard in his strength and weakness to achieve better performance'),
(601, 601, '', 'Samarth has outstanding technical skills. Quick and precise vision and decision-making. However, He needs to understand his role and responsibilities. In some situations, he loses his position which is not favoring his teammates. He attracts the opponents which gives an advantage situation to his team however, holding the ball for a longer period will push him disadvantage and create pressure. Need to work more on his weaknesses. '),
(602, 602, '', 'Prakhar  has a strong understanding of positional sense.Prakhar  should continue to exploit the open space that can drag defenders with him, freeing up space for others. In transitions he is quick to recover and drop into position . When the ball is won back, often Prakhar has to be quick . Get your head up and look to choose right position based on the situation. Needs to work more on his speed and balance.  '),
(603, 603, '', 'Dhruv has good technical skills. Plays well as a defender. He tackles the ball harder and clears the ball well. However, he needs to focus more on the Ariel ball situations. His passing and dribbling skills are good. He makes better passes and identifies the teammates to pass. However, he dribbles when he is surrounded by the opponent. In that situation, he needs to make a better decision to handle the situation. Need more improvement in communication, speed, and agility. '),
(604, 604, '', 'Agastya is technically strong with his dominant feet and with a good passing range. He needs to use both feet.  However, he needs to improve his dribbling skills and first-touch control. Even under pressure, Agastya can turn out of trouble and make a pass. For all of his technical ability, he plays well in defending. Spend time working on different techniques in and around the field. He needs to develop his decision-making and have to be more creative.'),
(605, 605, '', 'Sanath is technically strong with his dominant feet. Even under pressure, Sanath can turn out of trouble and make a pass. His dribbling skills are good but he needs to decide the right time to dribble. His tacklings are good however he needs to understand his roles and responsibilities. In some situations, he overlaps and loses his position. there he needs to understand and read the situation to support the team. For all of his technical ability, Spend time working on different techniques in and around the field. '),
(606, 606, '', 'Aarav has good technical skills. His passing techniques are good however he needs to improve his ball control and dribbling technique.  having a positive attitude but needs to improve his communication skills with his teammates. Need more focus on the session. '),
(607, 607, '', 'Rajveer is very punctual and has a positive attitude. He respects his teammates and his coaches. He is improvising with his techniques. He understands the instructions and follows the game style. He is taking the initiative to play in different positions. However he needs to spend more time with the ball to develop his ball mastery and different techniques. '),
(608, 608, '', 'Arnav position ball passing techniques are good. He has a better diving sense. His distribution during the game is good. However, he needs to develop his kicks. Improve his ball collection which is very important for the keeper. He needs to change his position according to the ball and game situations. He needs more agility and speed. '),
(609, 609, '', 'Guransh has good technical skills. He reads the game and performs based on his position. He tackles well and denies the score opportunities for the opponents. He is more confident with his position and his dominant leg. However, he faces difficulty under pressure and with the non-dominant side. He lacks with his communication part. He needs improvement in his decision-making and self-confidence. '),
(610, 610, '', 'Pranav shows a positive attitude to the session. He understands the session and responds as per the instructions given. His basic technique like pass and control is good. However, he needs to develop his dribbling. He receives the ball and releases it immediately to his team members. In some situations like this when he has free space he needs to be creative. Like he has to decide to go for a dribble or create a different move. He needs improvement in speed, agility, and self-confidence. '),
(611, 611, '', 'Pratham has good technical skills. His passes are accurate and he creates different possible moves for his teammates. He tries to dribble the ball to the free space and attracts the opponents to create an advantageous situation for his teammates. However, he loses the ball when under pressure. He needs to develop his decision making like when to pass and when to dribble. His communication needs to be better. He needs to improve his balance and speed. Work more on his strengths and weaknesses.  '),
(612, 612, 'Henlengmang has been improved and he is one of the most instrumental players as a defensive midfielder. He should be more confident and dominate the midfield with individual brilliance and good football actions . He can improve on his Spatial  awareness, switch off play and striking more goals from outside the box . Overall a fantastic athlete to work with.\r\n', 'Henlenmang has improve from his last assessment, he\'s also the spine of the defensive balance and instrumental player in the middle third of the pitch. He can dominate the games if he could improve his Spatial awareness, switch off play and final passes. Overall good athlete to work with. '),
(613, 613, 'Adithya has shown promise in his development, he has been more consistent in training and that has helped him to be the player he is. he needs to improve on taking more shots outside the box and be more vocal on the pitch', 'Adithya has good potential and can improve more as he progress. hes been more consistent in training and we hope the trend goes on this way. he can be more vocal on the pitch and be a little selfish when it comes to scoring goals, take more shots and work on 1 touch passes. all in all a good player to work with'),
(614, 614, 'Dallalmoun is a team player and intelligent midfielder, he will be in U15 one more year . He will be better if he can work more on his negative transition, finishing on the goal and decision making in the final third. He very good player to work with.', 'Dallalmoun is highly intelligent midfielder. He has one more year in U-15,  He is a proper team player , he can focus on his finishing and can be better in negative transition and decision making in final third. \r\n'),
(615, 615, 'Kabir is in his development phase,  he needs to work on his close control of the ball , communication and the basics of football.  Attitude and discpilne of Kabir is very good, keep it up. Need to work on his speed and stamina.', 'Kabir has shown lot of improvement in his performance and was able to match up with the U17 players. Should be more open to commincate with his peers. Has a good training attitude and listens to the coach. Technically should improve his ball control and 1v1 skills. Physically should improve his speed on and off the ball. Should improve his decision making. '),
(616, 616, 'Varun has been developing slowly, he puts maximum effort in matches and has very good football brain. needs to work on his endurance and defensive heading', 'Varun puts his maximum effort every game and his negative transition is top notch. his decision making has improved too. he needs to work on his endurance and communication in game'),
(617, 617, 'Sourav has good ability to play but needs to apply his mind more in the sport. he needs to improve his decision making and side foot finishing', 'Sourav is robust player blessed with good physique. he needs to work on his side foot finishing and game IQ, he needs to be more focused on the instructions given by his coaches.'),
(618, 618, 'Kanishk is developing well, he needs to work on his finishing and take lesser touches where needed', 'Kanishk works tirelessly in matches and training. he needs to release the ball quickly sometimes rather than dribble. he needs to work on long shots too. his fitness has gotten better and dribbling too with sublime first touch'),
(619, 619, 'Jonah is in his development phase, he stil needs to improve a lot more on his basics and communication. he has good determination to play and is very brave child', 'Jonah though he has improved, there\'s more he needs to pick up on. he is a sensible player who isnt scared of the occasion, he needs improve all round and mainly being communicative with his teammates on and off the field. '),
(620, 620, '', ''),
(621, 621, 'Devarsh is in a good progression phase. He has shown his ability and coped up playing in the U15 category. He is versatile on the ball and can improve more on his positioning and awareness ', 'Devarsh is a versatile player, he is progressing very positively throughout the season, he can improve on his agility, positioning without the ball and awareness of blind side. Overall he is a good athlete to work with.\r\nXX- player absent for 20-40m testing '),
(622, 622, 'Ranjiv has improved well so far but has more to go, he needs to work on his weak foot and long shooting ability, his dribbling has improved very well', 'Ranjiv has become a better player over the course of these few months. he needs to work on his emotional control and be more calm in game and training, he\'s a player with good potential but needs work his weak foot and long passes with long shots. all in all a good player to coach'),
(623, 623, '', 'Aryan has a strong understanding of the game and good technical skills.  His passes are accurate and help the teams to play with an advantage. However, he needs to develop his dribbling. While attacking he applies the principles like playing the ball quickly and accelerating his actions. While defending he applies pressure and gives his best. However, he needs to tackle at the right time. He needs to develop his decision-making and creativity. He needs more improvement in speed and agility. '),
(624, 624, '', 'Nevin has a positive attitude and He respects his teammates and coaches. His basic techniques like passing, receiving, Ball Handling, and clearing the ball. However, he needs to position himself better. He needs to learn fundamentals in keeping. He understands the situation however he needs to develop his ball collection and the quality of the first. He needs to identify his teammates and give positions advantageous situations when they are under pressure situation in the defending zone. Need to improve his speed, agility, and balance. '),
(625, 625, 'Manu is in his development phase. Has to improve his skills to meet the demands in U17. Manu has developed his defending skills but need to improve his attacking techniques such as First touch, Passing, Ball control and running with the ball. More time he has to spend improving his techniques to be able to play under pressure.', 'Manu has show a lot of improvement in his defending abilities. His tackling, headers and clearnces have improved. Slowly becoming a reliable defender. Manu has to improve his technical ablities more. He struggles to play under pressure and makes mistakes when under pressure. Should improve long passes and short passes. Manu has to work more on his decision making.'),
(626, 626, 'Chinmay needs to be regular to the training sessions and work a lot on his fitness. Chinmay is having good technical skills and must make them his strength so he can in games be adding more value to his team. Defensively more effort is required and has to work together with his teammates.', 'Chinmay was very irregular to the training session and often had one excuse or the other to miss training sessions. Often was getting injured and in game and in practise did not give his 100%. Chinmay has to take more responsibility and attend all training sessions to see improvement.'),
(627, 627, 'Mukund is in his development phase and needs a lot of time to develop his techniques. Keep working hard to improve and be regular to the training.', 'Mukunda is very hard working player. Has a lot potential. Need to work more on his ball control and finishing skills.'),
(628, 628, 'Hope is brilliant winger and puts good crosses in attack. Keep doing it and improve quality of the crosses. In defense can be better in 1v1 situation. Should be more regular to training and committed with the team. Must improve his decision making in transition phase of the game.', 'Hope has to come regularly to the sessions. He has good speed and can be very effective when has lot of space. Need to improve his decision making in tight spaces. Crossing technique is good, can improve his shooting technique outside the box. Attitude in training and match is good, keep it up.'),
(629, 629, 'Akshay is in his developing phase, and he is one of the big positives for us in the second half of the season, displaying tactical awareness, good leadership, aggression, physicality & good decision-making in defensive moments of the game. We expect Akshay to fully lead the defensive line next season in the U17 category and become a dominant player overall for the team. We are extremely happy with his recovery and mental strength to overcome the injuries that were hampering the first half of the season.', 'Akshay has been a tremendous asset for the team after his recovery from injuries. He has given a big boost to the defensive line in all the games he has played by bringing calmness & authority to the defensive line . We are extremely happy with his progress. He is extremely coachable :- he takes critical tactical information from the coaches and executes it very well in the game. He also has improved his leadership qualities - But it can still be better and be more impactful in games. Furthermore, he also has shown very good composure to score from set pieces. Akshay can still improve his speed and recovery runs - we are sure he will improve them if he shows the same commitment & mental strength that we have seen from him this entire season. ***NOTE :Akshay has missed few of the tests we had conducted on multiple dates - Those parts of the reports will be Blank or N/A or Zero ***'),
(630, 630, '', ''),
(631, 631, '', ''),
(632, 632, '', ''),
(633, 633, '', ''),
(634, 634, '', ''),
(635, 635, 'Aryan\'s has vastly improved in the second half of the season. His versatility to now play both in defense & midfield has given him an edge & is one of the strengths of his game. He is very coachable, positive and a team player. He is still developing  and we hope for his continued development in the upcoming season. Furthermore, he has played over 40+ competitive matches this season in different competitions. This will help him in the upcoming season, where we expect him to be one of the leaders of our U17 team.', 'Aryan has continued to show maturity in his performances this season. In the second half of the season, he has been able to get a grip on playing in the midfield position (as a no. 6) and has started to excel in that role, doing an excellent job with & without the ball. Overall this season, He has played a crucial role for the team, playing over 40+ competitive matches and playing both as CB & DM effectively. His performances have shown a good upward curve, adapting well to the opposition\'s strengths & weaknesses. We hope all these experiences will help him lead the U17 team next season and in turn, we hope to improve his performances even more.'),
(636, 636, '', ''),
(637, 637, 'Vedant is in his development phase. He has progressed well this season, showing good composure on the ball, but also being willing to do the defending part for the team with all his possible efforts. Tactically, he is very aware and mature in understanding the demands of the game. He is a key player for us in the squad and played a big part  in the team\'s U17 championship run. He needs to improve in 1v1 duels & needs to improve in defensive duels. Overall, very impressed with his versatility, commitment, discipline and willingness to improve. ', 'Vedant is a key player for us due to his tactical understanding of the game and his versatility to play multiple positions with a good understanding of the role/responsibility. He is very coachable, disciplined and wants to improve. Key areas for him to improve are his physicality in 1v1 duels, speed in recovery runs, and his leadership style. He also needs to be more imposing and should be able to convince his fellow teammates more. He can be show more self-confidence when things are not going well in his own individual performances/team\'s performances are not up to the mark and lift his/team\'s morale. Overall, we are happy to see his improvement throughout the season in all areas. He has very good potential for the future.'),
(638, 638, '', ''),
(639, 639, '', ''),
(640, 640, 'Dhruv is in his developing phase, and he is one of the good defenders on the team, displaying calmness combined with good technical ability on the ball. We expect him to be one of the leaders on the pitch in the upcoming season because of all the experience he gained playing 40+ competitive matches this season. He needs to remain grounded & focused, irrespective of the opponent he is playing against.', 'Dhruv has matured a lot, having played around 40–45 competitive matches this season. He does not show any panic or take any pressure during big games, and this is a good trait to have. He still needs to show more character and mental calmness during tough periods of the game. Furthermore, he can improve his speed & show more eagerness during defensive transitions to help the team. Overall, a very good player to have for the team, showing very good technical abilities and tactical maturity to win games. He has shown versatility by being able to play multiple positions, though he has been mostly playing left-back. We want Dhruv to step up more to try and lead the U17 group next season. He has a tendency of \"casual\" play creeping into his game, and he needs to avoid it at any cost in order for Dhruv to progress smoothly into the senior category.'),
(641, 641, 'Jay is currently in his development phase and has to improve his techniques to be able to play under pressure. Training attitude is good, keep it up. Must be regular to the training sessions. ', 'Jay needs to come to training regularly to improve. He has a good attitude towards coaches and peers. Always listens to the coaches and plays together as a team. Need to improve his technique under pressure.  Has good speed but lacks stamina. '),
(642, 642, 'Saptarishi is a hardworking player who enjoys playing the game. Has good defending abilities. Should keep working on Speed, Quick Turning and Agility. And under pressure need to play calmer. Good improvement in long passing and clearnaces. Developing into a strong Centerback. Very good improvement in the last few months. Learning quickly all the tactical aspects of the game. ', 'Brilliant understanding of the game. Good tackling and 1v1 defending. Long passes are accurate can improve the speed of techniques. Clearance technique is perfect, keep improving. Showed brilliant performances for the U17 IFEP team and played aganinst tough opponents. Good training attitude and match temperament. Keep working on Speed, strength and stamina.'),
(643, 643, 'Shriyan is still in his development phase, he needs to work on his fitness and strength and the basics of footbal. he has imporved but has a long way to go', 'Shriyan has improved but has so much more to catch up, he needs to work on his fitness and game sense. needs more time in training to achieve that and needs to put less pressure on himself in matches.'),
(644, 644, 'Renaud is a good player who is in his development phase. He should work more on finishing and 1v1. He should be more creative in the attacking third and create more changes. His long range shooting should be improved so that he is more vital in attaking third.', 'Menon is a good player with good attitude. His 1v1 is good but should be better and work more on it. His long range shooting and decision making in attacking third are the things he should work on it. He should be more creative when he has the ball in attacking third. '),
(645, 645, 'Ishan is still in a development phase. He needs to be regular to training to keep improving. He\'s an intelligent and confident player. ', 'Ishan has good technical abilities and needs to keep training to sharpen this abilities. He has a good understanding of the game and should be regulars to sessions to develop this attributes. '),
(646, 646, 'Apoorv needs to be more consistent with his training and self-motivated. He should also be more aware of his fitness to prevent injuries.', 'Apoorv has potential as a coachable player, but he needs to maintain his fitness level to avoid injuries during training. He should also work on improving the quality of his first touch and decision-making both on and off the ball. Furthermore, he could benefit from focusing on improving his communication skills with his teammates during games.'),
(647, 647, 'Abhijoy displays a hardworking mentality during training sessions. He has to work on his technical aspects such as quality of pass,\r\n 1 v 1 dribbling, and shooting accuracy. Additionally, he needs to focus more on his decision making skills', 'Abhijoy is a hardworking player.  He need to do more practicing his long-range passes and 1 v 1 dribbling skills. He should maintain his fitness level to prevent injuries  Furthermore, he should focus on  his verbal and nonverbal communication during both matches and training sessions.'),
(648, 648, 'He is a player who works hard and is open to coaching, but his defending stance and defensive clearances need improvement. It is recommended that he becomes more aggressive in both aerial and ground duels when facing opponents one-on-one. Additionally, he needs to work on using his non-dominant foot more effectively.', 'Deepak is a committed player, but to enhance his skills, he should concentrate on improving his defensive tactics, and his positioning when he doesn\'t have the ball. He also needs to work on using his non-dominant foot and developing his ability to defend one-on-one. Additionally, he should focus on managing injuries and maintaining his fitness level.'),
(649, 649, 'Adithya is demonstrating strong commitment to improve, both on and off the field. He needs to focus on improving his technical skills and 1v1 defending while also maintaining his fitness to prevent injuries.', 'Adithya is a passionate footballer who is eager to improve his skills on the pitch. However, there are certain areas that require more attention, such as his ability to defend 1v1 and his defensive headers. He also needs to work on his decision-making as well as his technical aspects, such as long-range passing and the quality of his passes. By working on these areas, Adithya can become an even better player.'),
(650, 650, 'Nibo is a diligent player who maintains a positive attitude both on and off the field. However, he could work on improving his composure during finishing and developing his communication and leadership skills. It is also important for him to maintain consistency in his performance during matches.', 'Deepak maintains discipline both on and off the field, but needs to focus on his fitness to avoid injuries during training and matches. Additionally, he can work on improving his composure during finishing and shooting actions, and should focus on enhancing his communication skills.'),
(651, 651, 'He possesses the capability to understand coaching instructions and is motivated to be more assertive both while in possession and without the ball, and to concentrate on his 1 v 1 duels. In game situations, he is advised to make prompt decisions about when and where to pass the ball.', 'Aabo is a hardworking and coachable player who is skilled with the ball. However, there is still room for improvement in his technical ability, off-the-ball movement, and 1v1 duels. We wish him all the best for his future'),
(652, 652, 'Nityam is currently in his development phase. He has already experienced the intensity of the U17 category, which will help him in the upcoming season. During matches, he needs to focus on communicating effectively with his teammates, as well as improving his defensive headers and long-range defensive clearances.', 'Nityam is a hardworking player who displays a positive attitude during training. However, if we analyze his technical abilities, he needs to improve his skills on his non-dominant foot, defensive headers, and passing accuracy on long-range passes. Despite these areas for improvement, he is progressing well, and I can see his growth during competitive matches.'),
(653, 653, 'Shaurya has excelled well this year, and we are elated with his progress. He has turned into a very reliable & experienced Center-back who leads the defensive line &  at the same time scoring important goals for the team during set-pieces. He is showing good leadership qualities too. Furthermore, he still can improve further his recovery runs, non-dominant foot.', 'Shaurya is having a very productive year and one of his best so far in the last 4 years. He has played over 40-50 competitive matches this year in various competitions. He has turned into a very reliable Centre back with good leadership qualities. We are extremely happy with his progress in all areas of the game. He is also scoring crucial goals during set-pieces as well.  He is extremely coachable :- he takes critical tactical information from the coaches and executes it very well in the game. Furthermore, he can still further refine/fine-tune all areas of the game so that in a year or so time he is very much ready to move out of youth football.  ***Note - Shaurya was not in the training/injured during the Physical Assessment Tests - Those parts of the test will show Zero or N/A or Blank***'),
(654, 654, 'Akshar is currently developing his skills as a defender in the U19 team. He is a highly dedicated football player and exhibits a lot of passion to enhance his abilities on the field. However, he needs to work on improving his 1 vs 1 defending skills and aerial ball clearances', '\r\nAkshar is a hardworking player who displays a positive mentality in both training and matches. However, he needs to improve his technical skills, particularly in terms of the quality of his passing and his defensive heading. He also needs to work on his 1v1 defending and maintain his fitness level to reduce the risk of injuries.\r\n'),
(655, 655, '', ''),
(656, 656, 'Kenneth is an industrious player with excellent off-the-ball aggression. He needs to focus on improving his 1v1 defending and defensive clearances while further enhancing his speed of play. Overall, he is a brilliant athlete to work with.', 'Kenneth is a hardworking player who shows excellent leadership qualities and commitment to the program. In order to avoid injuries, he needs to maintain his fitness level. He should focus more on his non-dominant foot and technical aspects such as the quality of his passes, 1 v 1 defending, and long-range passes.'),
(657, 657, 'Vaibhav is in his development phase. He has been displaying a positive attitude in training & matches, and he has steadily improved his game during the second half of the season. He is very coachable & well-disciplined. Furthermore, he shows good commitment & energy in the session. He still has not reached the potential we see in him w.r.t. his final finishing / final pass. We hope to see his continued improvement in the upcoming U17 season with fewer injury breaks. We applaud his mental strength to come back strong during the latter part of the season, giving some important performances to take the team to the U17 championship this season.', 'Vaibhav has shown good improvements in his game during the second half of the season. We are glad he has been able to train without injuries in the last few months. This consistency has given him the confidence to show his talent in some big games and help the team win the championship. He needs to still improve his finishing / decision-making : If he does do it , he would be a terrific winger & match winner for the team regularly . He has good speed and skills in the wide area to take players 1v1. Furthermore, he still needs to improve his defensive workrate , finishing via headers. Overall positive season for Vaibhav but we are expecting even a better season in 2024-25.'),
(658, 658, '', ''),
(659, 659, '', ''),
(660, 660, '', ''),
(661, 661, '', ''),
(662, 662, 'Kayan is currently in the development phase, but due to his academic commitments, he has missed some training sessions. However, he has recently returned with decent fitness and is performing well during the training sessions. I wish him all the best for the upcoming DPDL matches, but he needs to display more physicality during the game.', 'He recently joined the team with decent fitness and shows a positive attitude towards training. He needs to play upcoming DPDL matches to gain more experience and prepare for next season.'),
(663, 663, 'Ishan is developing well. He has very good abilities and should be more regular for training. ', 'Ishan is a good player. Well-behaved and fights for team. He is versatile and can play different positions well. He has to be regular for training. \r\nXX- absent during the repeated testing during the season '),
(664, 664, 'Daniel is a hardworking player who needs to improve his technical skills, such as passing and shooting, as well as performing better under pressure. Additionally, he should maintain his fitness to prevent injuries.', 'Daniel consistently displays excellent behavior both on and off the field. He is a disciplined athlete who need to focus on his shooting ability and 1 v 1 duels. Some improvement is needed in terms of staying injury-free. Overall, he is a great athlete to work with.'),
(665, 665, 'David is a talented player with impressive ball control skills. He has an enthusiastic attitude towards learning and is self-confident. However, he needs to work on his one-on-one duels, including when to dribble, how to create space, and time himself better. And we wish him all the best for his future', 'David is a well-disciplined boy who currently plays as a midfielder. He has good technical abilities, but he needs to work on improving his spatial awareness, scanning, and quick decision-making to increase his output on the field. Additionally, he should focus on being more aggressive in 1v1 duels. We wish him all the best for his future.'),
(666, 666, 'Raj shows a positive attitude towards receiving feedback and making improvements. However, he needs to work on enhancing his spatial awareness, improving his verbal communication with his teammates, and focusing on using his non-dominant foot more efficiently. It is essential for him to maintain his fitness level to prevent possible injuries.', 'Raj is a versatile player who can perform well in different positions like fullback and winger, which makes him a valuable asset to his team. However, he needs to work on improving his ability to use his non-dominant foot and communicate more effectively with his teammates. These improvements will help him reach even greater heights in his performance.'),
(667, 667, 'Aaryamun had a decent football season so far. He needs to work on using his 1 v 1 duels both attacking and defending and give more focus on non-dominant foot more effectively. Overall, he is a highly coachable player.', 'Aaryamun is a dedicated football player who always aims to enhance his performance on the field. However, he needs to concentrate on improving his technical skills such as pass accuracy, shooting proficiency, and winning 1 v 1 battles. He should also focus on developing his non-dominant foot to become a more versatile player. Additionally, maintaining his fitness level is crucial to prevent injuries.'),
(668, 668, 'Kabeer has demonstrated a great deal of potential in his assigned duties. However, he needs to focus on enhancing his 1 v 1 Defending and defensive headers. It is important for him to improve his decision-making abilities both on and off the ball. Additionally, he should maintain his fitness to prevent injuries.', 'He is always eager to learn and improve his skills and is a fast learner. However, he needs to work on his consistency in training and deal with his injuries to stay motivated. Moreover, he should focus on enhancing his 1 v 1 Defending technique to become a better player. Defensively, he needs to show more consistency. Lastly, he should make better decisions both on and off the field to realize his full potential as a player'),
(669, 669, '', ''),
(670, 670, 'Aedan is an exceptional centre-back who exhibits strong character, remarkable team spirit, and great promise. He consistently puts forth his best effort for the team and leads by example. However, he could benefit from improving his 1v1 defending skills, aerial ball clearances, and defensive headers. Despite these areas for improvement, he remains a valuable asset to the team.', 'Aedan is displaying very good leadership abilities. However, he needs to work on his consistency in dealing with long balls, passing quality, and 1 v 1 duels. Additionally, he should improve his defensive headers. It is recommended that he maintains his fitness level to avoid injuries. Overall, Aedan is doing great'),
(671, 671, 'Surya is a highly dedicated player who displays an immense passion for enhancing his skills on the pitch. To elevate his performance, he needs to focus on improving the quality of his passes, his abilities in 1 v 1 duels, and his first touch and decision-making skills both on and off the ball.', 'Surya is a dedicated player who puts in a lot of effort. However, he should focus on improving the quality of his passes, receiving technique, and first touch. Additionally, he needs to work on his decision-making skills both on and off the ball. Lastly, to prevent injuries, he should prioritize maintaining his fitness'),
(672, 672, 'Satvik is an excellent team player with good versatility. He still needs to improve his communication. Satvik is in his development phase and is showing a lot of promise in his roles and responsibilities. He can further improve on his final decision-making. He needs to be self-motivated & improve his final cross/shot. We are looking for Satvik to lead the front line next season, and we are hopeful he can show all the talent he has in him.', 'Satvik has developed & improved well this season. His stumbling block this season has been his injuries, due to which he has been on and off the pitch throughout the season. He needs to remain more focused and be more self-motivated, especially when he is missing his initial chances in the game. It should not affect his game for the remaining time. His strengths are his versatility, superb defensive work rate and team-first attitude. We wish all his talent would come out in the upcoming season with the U17 team. \r\n***NOTE :Satvik has missed few of the tests we had conducted on multiple dates - Those parts of the reports will be Blank or Zero ***'),
(673, 673, 'Sumair is in his development phase. He is very coachable, disciplined & grounded. He has the ability to improve further in his finishing, crossing and heading. Overall, we are very happy with his progress this season, where he has made a good contribution to the team & also to his overall football development. He has shown positive progress in training & in matches. He can further improve once he is more regular for the training sessions.', 'Sumair has shown a lot of good progress in the second half, playing tough games & scoring some important goals. He can still improve his final finishing by being a bit more composed. We are happy to see his development while still remaining coachable, grounded and hardworking. He can still improve his attendance percentage for the session in order to improve & excel better.  \r\n ***NOTE : Sumair has missed a few of the tests we conducted on multiple dates - Those parts of the reports will be Blank or N/A or Zero ***'),
(674, 674, 'Karthick displays good attitude. He should work more on his football aspect of the game. His football skills should also be developed.\r\nAs a defender he should work on his defending skills like 1 v 1, Scanning ,maintaining the defending shape, communication skills, defensive clearances, defensive heading clearance. His sprinting should also be developed as well as his body coordination.\r\n', 'Karthick is a  good player with the positive attitude in the team. His ability to read the game is very helpful for the team. He should work more on his defending communication and dealing with aerial long balls. His defensive clearances should also be improved with his non-dominant foot. He though having potential should exhibit leadership quality to lead the team from behind. He should also work more on his defensive clearances and long range crosses.'),
(675, 675, 'Kanishk is a good player with a good attitude. He has to work on his defending transition. His ability to take 1v1 on the flank need to improve better. He should work more on his agility and sprinting. His passing ( long ) should be improved better. His vision on the pitch should be developed and awareness of the space, teammate, and opponent should be improved.', 'Kanishk is a hardworking & very positive attitude player. He should focus more on improving his finishing and crossing techniques, especially with aerial balls. Although he has good technical abilities to beat defenders in 1v1 duels, he needs to work on his decision-making skills regarding when to cross the ball and when to take on defenders. Additionally, he should focus on improving his negative transition. We are happy with his progress & look forward to see his further development in the coming months.'),
(676, 676, 'Yohann displays good attitude. He should work more on his football aspect of the game. His further football skills should also be developed.\r\nAs a defender he should work on his defending skills like 1 v 1, Scanning ,maintaining the defending shape, defensive clearances, defensive heading clearance. His sprinting should also be developed as well as his body coordination. He adds lot of value to the team in transitions.\r\nHe has huge potential to contribute more towards his team.\r\n', 'Yohann is a good athlete with good behaviour on & off the field. He works very hard and tries to improve in every session. He is also able to take information from the coaches & execute it to best of his ability. He has also shown good maturity in his games with very productive communication. He can still improve on his defending under pressure & dealing aerial balls. Yohann needs to make sure that his performances are consistent, irrespective of the opponent\'s quality, We are happy with his progress & look forward to see his further development in the coming months.'),
(677, 677, 'Dheer is still in the development phase and learning to match the intensity of U17 football. He is younger in this age category, giving him time to improve further. He is hard-working and disciplined but needs to refine the technical components of his game and deliver more consistent performances.', 'Dheer is still in the development phase in the U17 age category. He shows a positive attitude toward learning in training and is hard-working. He needs to improve his speed for better recovery runs, enhance his 1v1 defending, and work on his clearances. So far, we have seen improvement, and he is also able to understand tactical instructions well. Overall, we are happy with his progress but expect consistent performances in the coming months.'),
(678, 678, 'Srutaan exhibits versatility, capable of playing both as a right back and a center back. He demonstrates strong leadership qualities within the team and is still in the developmental stage of his career, showing great potential to become a very good player. His heading ability is commendable; however, he should focus on improving the quality of his passing, particularly during buildup plays through the thirds.', 'Srutaan demonstrates solid basic skills but lacks consistency in performance, making him an average player currently. He shows potential for development with the right guidance and commitment to improve his tactical awareness and decision-making. With focused training, he can elevate his overall game and become a more reliable asset to the team.'),
(679, 679, 'Dhruv is a very coachable player with good attitude on & off the field . He has very good technical ability & tactical understanding for his age. He has good composure on & off the ball and his ability to compete in tough games. He needs to keep training & keep working hard during this crucial season for him & his team. He can still improve his speed/scanning as well as his concentration span for the entire match.\r\n', 'Dhruv is a key player for us due to his tactical understanding of the game and his versatility to play multiple positions with a good understanding of the role/responsibility. Key areas for him to improve are his physicality in 1v1 duels, speed in recovery runs, and his leadership style. He can show more self-confidence when things are not going well in his own individual performances/team\'s performances are not up to the mark and lift his/team\'s morale. Overall, we are happy to see his improvement as winger / midfielder but we expect more consistency in his game in these positions with & without ball.'),
(680, 680, 'Akshay is a very coachable player with good attitude on & off the field . He has very good technical ability & tactical understanding for his age. He has good composure on & off the ball and his ability to compete in tough games both as a player & as a captain. He needs to keep training & keep working hard during this crucial season for him & his team. He can still improve his speed.', 'Akshay  has been a tremendous asset for the team. He has given a big boost to the defensive line in all the games he has played by bringing calmness & authority to the defensive line. He played a big role in the DPDL Super Cup Championship . We are extremely happy with his progress. He is extremely coachable :- he takes critical tactical information from the coaches and executes it very well in the game. He also has improved his leadership qualities. Furthermore, he can still improve his goal scoring from set-pieces. He can still improve his speed and recovery runs.'),
(681, 681, 'We are very pleased to see Arjun back with the team and training well. He has displayed a strong mentality. We are closely monitoring his progress, although we hope to see him more regularly in training in the coming months to help him gel with his new teammates. It’s clear that he is enjoying his time on the field and is working hard to improve. He can still enhance the quality of his crossing and consistency in finishing. Additionally, he has shown a positive attitude in negative transition and defending during the recently concluded DPDL Super Cup.', 'Arjun has shown tremendous mental strength and has worked hard off the field to recover from a major injury. We are very pleased with his progress. He still needs to regain his old speed and improve the consistency of his game to reach his previous level. He can also enhance the consistency of his crossing and finishing. He is demonstrating strong teamwork attributes and is enjoying the camaraderie of playing with his teammates again. He is very coachable. We look forward to seeing further improvement in the coming months with regular training.'),
(682, 682, 'mahimna is in his development phase. He has to develop the basic football skills. His defending should also be improved. His positioning on and off the ball should be the areas he should work on. He should also focus on his Speed agility and Sprints', 'Mahimna is a passionate and hardworking player who is constantly striving to improve his skills on the field. He needs to focus on improving his decision-making abilities both on and off the ball along with improving his technical abilities. Additionally, he should work on developing his non-dominant foot, which will make him a more versatile player. He should also improve his communication skills. We look forward to see his further development in the coming months.'),
(683, 683, 'vedanth is a player who has the football sense. His ability to finish on the goal is good, but should work more on his strength and endurance. His defending transition needs to be improved.The behaviour and reaction when team loses the Ball is of paramount importance His work rate can be better but he should improve more on it. As a midfielder he should also improve more on his ability to find the space and create goal scoring opportunities, and work more on his positioning & Speed agility.', 'vedanth is a passionate and hardworking player who is constantly striving to improve his skills on the field. He needs to focus on improving his decision-making abilities both on and off the ball along with improving his fitness . Additionally, he should work on developing his non-dominant foot, which will make him a more versatile player. He should also improve his communication skills during matches. We look forward to see his further development in the coming months'),
(684, 684, 'Aidan has been training well, showing good discipline both on and off the field. He needs to improve in 1v1 defending and defending crosses. He has strong crossing ability and a good understanding of his role and responsibilities within the team. However, he needs to execute his roles more consistently. He works hard, and we hope to see further progress in the coming months.', 'Aidan has made great progress in the last few months. He played an important role in our DPDL Super Cup championship, logging many minutes in challenging games that have helped him improve. He is still developing and needs to enhance his skills in 1v1 defending situations. A good team player, he maintains a positive attitude in training and demonstrates discipline both on and off the field. He delivers excellent crosses and set-piece deliveries from corners. Additionally, he can further improve his composure with the ball and enhance his recovery runs.'),
(685, 685, 'Vishwak can also focus on his passing and distribution, particularly when building out from the back. His ability to link up with the midfield and make accurate passes under pressure will make him more effective. With improved decision-making and defensive positioning, he can become a solid full-back.', 'Vishwak is versatile but needs to work on his consistency, especially when defending against quick wingers. He tends to leave space behind him when he pushes forward. Improving his defensive awareness and timing will make him a more dependable full-back.');
INSERT INTO `ci_notes_from_coaching` (`id`, `forms_id`, `notes_frm_tech_dir`, `notes_frm_head_coach`) VALUES
(686, 686, 'Chinmay is in his development phase. He demonstrates a good attitude and discipline in training compared to last year. He shows promising glimpses in attacking play; however, he needs to be more consistent in negative transition play. Additionally, he needs to improve his strength and fitness. Overall, he is a good athlete with a lot of potential.', 'Chinmay has shown good improvement from last season to this season. He demonstrates good composure with the ball, but he still needs to improve his defensive work rate and fitness to last 90 minutes. He performed well in the DPDL Super Cup but needs to bring the same consistency to upcoming matches. We are closely monitoring his progress.'),
(687, 687, 'Gopi is currently in the development phase of his football skills. He needs to work on developing basic football skills and improving his defending. His positioning on and off the ball requires attention, and he should also concentrate on enhancing his speed, agility, and sprinting abilities.', 'Gopi is a passionate and hardworking player who is constantly striving to improve his skills on the field. He needs to focus on improving his decision-making abilities both on and off the ball, along with enhancing his technical abilities. Additionally, he should work on developing his non-dominant foot, which will make him a more versatile player. Improving his communication skills is also important. We look forward to seeing his further development in the coming months.\r\n** Player was either absent or injured during physical assessment.'),
(688, 688, 'Shivang is in his development phase. He should work on his basic football skills. He has to improve on his defending as well, Understanding of speed of thought & speed of play is very important towards game with good presense of mind is vital for decision making, with practice these football actions can be better.', 'Shivang has a good physical strength for his age and is very consistent with training. He should work more on his defending, scanning, defensive heading and long passes.  He should be more calm and composed in the defense. He has the ability to be a good winger and a midfielder for his age if he works hard and keeps pushing himself in the training ground. Shivang\'s communication skills should also be developed and try to lead the team. He is doing good and will surely improve more if he concentrates and follows coaching instructions and keeps working hard.'),
(689, 689, 'Armaan is in his development phase. He should work more on his physicality and sprinting technique. As a forward player he should also focus on his off the ball movement and find more space to attack and create goal scoring chances with quick change of direction with and without the ball', 'Armaan is a player who good football sense, his ability to finish on the goal is good, but needs to work more on his strength in his passes and long range shooting. His defending transition needs to be improved, the behaviour and reaction when team loses the ball is of paramount importance, Armaan\'s work rate can be better but he should improve more on it. As a striker and winger he should also improve more on his ability to find the space and create goal scoring opportunities, and work more on his positioning, speed and agility.'),
(690, 690, 'Ashwin is in his development phase. He should work on his passing accuracy from the back ( long & short ). He should work more on his communication, awareness during play, defensive organisation and defensive Communication verbal and non verbal are vital for a defender. Ashwin needs to work further on his sprints, agility and off the ball movements.', 'Ashwin is a smart and intelligent player with great potential. To further develop his skills and endurance, he needs more exposure to 9v9 football. Improving his fitness will be crucial, as well as learning how to perform under pressure. He should focus on refining his long passes and long shots. Additionally, working on his motor skills, agility, quality of first touch, and ability to turn and receive the ball will enhance his overall game. Increasing his spatial awareness will also be beneficial. Overall, Ashwin is a dedicated player with a positive attitude, and with targeted development, he has the potential to make a significant impact.'),
(691, 691, 'Renaud is in his development phase. He should work on his basic football skills and transition to defending. Understanding of Speed of thought & speed of play is very important towards game with good presense of mind is vital for decision making, with practice these football actions can be better and improved.', 'Renaud is a bright player with a lot of potential, but he needs to sync his skills with the timing of his actions. He showcases good physical strength, though there’s room for improvement in agility and quickness. His dribbling skills are impressive, particularly his feints and acceleration with the ball. However, he should focus on developing his weaker foot and overall strength. Renaud is receptive to coaching and makes a strong effort to follow instructions, demonstrating solid football techniques. To elevate his game, he needs to work on controlling his emotions and improving his awareness of space and decision-making under pressure. Additionally, he can be quicker both with and without the ball and adopt a more aggressive approach. Overall, Renaud is an enthusiastic and dedicated player, and with focused development, he has the potential to make a significant impact. '),
(692, 692, 'Siddhartha is in his development phase. He has to develop the basic football skills along with his quick movements, his positioning on and off the ball should be the areas he should work on, providing quick runs into spaces to receive the ball under pressure is vital for a forward player. He should also focus on his Speed,agility and Sprinting technique.', 'Siddhartha has a solid foundation, there are areas where he can further enhance his performance. Improving his speed with and without the ball will help him become a more dynamic player on the field. Additionally, adapting to a more aggressive playing style could make him a player with more impact during matches. He has good physical strength but should work a more on agility and quickness. Over all very enthusiastic and dedicated player.'),
(693, 693, 'Mridhul is in his development phase. He should work more on his physicality and sprinting technique. As a forward or midfield player he should also focus on his off the ball movement and find spaces to attack and create goal scoring chances. Finding spaces to receive the ball under pressure with awareness is vital for a player for better attacking, he needs to work on his long range passes and shooting skills.', 'Mridhul needs to focus on improving his fitness and learning to play effectively under pressure. He should also work on his long passes and long shots to enhance his game. As a coachable player, he has great potential for progress. To further develop, he should concentrate on his motor skills, agility, and the quality of his first touch, as well as improving his ability to turn and receive the ball. Increasing his spatial awareness will also be beneficial. Overall, Mridhul is a dedicated player with a positive attitude, and with continued effort, he can achieve significant growth. '),
(694, 694, '', ''),
(695, 695, 'Anish is in his development phase. He should work more on his physicality and sprinting with endurance. As a forward player he should also focus on his off the ball movement and find more space to attack and create goal scoring chances, his long range passes and shots can be improved with practice ', 'Anish is in his developing phase. He has a good left foot technique & he has a good understanding of the game. He needs\r\nto be exposed more to 9 V 9 football as he has good potential to develop his skills and endurance. However, he needs to work on his fitness, learn to play under pressure, and work on long passes and long shots. Overall a coachable player and has the potential to progress. '),
(696, 696, 'Abhishak is in his development phase. He should work on his basic football skills, also working on his defending skills. Understanding of Speed of thought & speed of play is very important towards game with good presense of mind and is vital for decision making, with practice these football actions can be better, Abhishak is a player with good attitude towards the game ', 'Abhishak is a highly coachable player who demonstrates a strong willingness to listen and follow instructions. He possesses solid football techniques and excels in his role as a defender. However, there are a few areas for development. At times, he commits to tackles that aren’t necessary, so focusing on better decision-making will be beneficial. Additionally, improving his awareness of space and emotional control under pressure will enhance his performance. To further his growth, Abhishak needs to gain a deeper understanding of the 9-a-side football format. He consistently shows a positive attitude and discipline during training, which sets a great example for his teammates. With continued effort and focus, Abhishak has the potential to become an even more effective player.'),
(697, 697, 'Reyansh is in his development phase. He should work on his passing accuracy  from the back (long & short). He should work more on his communication, awareness during play, defensive organisation and defensive Communication verbal and non verbal are vital to being a defender', 'Reyansh is a very good player with ability to be a defender. As a defender he should work more on his passing ability from the back under pressure (long & short passes). \r\nReading the game is highly significant, awareness and scanning on blind side has to be taken into consideration. His defensive heading should also be developed better. He should work more on his defensive organisation as well and take more responsibilities on organising the defence line off the ball. His leadership quality can be better and be more vocal in the game by communicating effectively among his team mates.'),
(698, 698, 'Abhinav is in his development phase. His negative transition should be improved and work on it. His 1 v 1 on the flank should be effective. He should also work more on his vision and play more forward, positive ( attacking ) passes in the match.\r\n\r\n', 'Abhinav is a progressing player. He should focus more on improving his finishing and crossing techniques, especially with aerial balls. Although he has good technical abilities to beat defenders in 1v1 duels, he needs to work on his decision-making skills regarding when to cross the ball and when to take on defenders. Additionally, he should focus on improving his negative transition. We are happy with his progress & look forward to see his further development in the coming months.'),
(699, 699, 'Tarun is a player who has the football sense. His ability to finish on the goal is good, but should work more on his strength and long range shooting. His defending transition needs to be improved. The behaviour and reaction when team loses the Ball is of paramount importance, His work rate can be better but he should improve more on it. As a striker he should also improve more on his ability to find the space and create goal scoring opportunities, and work more on his positioning & Speed agility.\r\n', 'Tarun is versatile player who can play as a winger and center-forward. He is player with good technical qualities, he has been a tremendous asset for the team after his recovery from injuries. He has given a big boost to the group, He is very coachable, disciplined and wants to improve. Key areas for him to improve are his physicality in 1v1 duels & speed of execution, and his leadership style. He also needs to be more imposing and should be able to convince his fellow teammates more. He can show more self-confidence when things are not going well in his own individual performances/team\'s performances are not up to the mark and lift his/team\'s morale. Overall, we are happy to see his improvement in all the areas of the game. Tarun has very good potential for the future. His strength in delivering set piece goals and assist to his team is highly appreciated.'),
(700, 700, 'Shreyas has a good physical and strength for his age. He should work more on his defending, scanning, defensive heading and long passes.\r\nHe should be more calm and composed in the defense line. He has the ability to be a good defender for his age if he works hard and keeps pushing himself in the training ground. His communication skills should also be developed and try to lead the team from behind. He is doing good and will improve more if he concentrates and follows coaching instructions and keeps working hard.\r\n', 'Shreyas is improving steadily and is often delivering very consistent performances for the team. He has shown good progress in defending without the ball. With the ball, he has shown good ability in his crosses and passing range. Shreyas needs to make sure that his performances are consistent, irrespective of the opponent\'s quality, and comes to training and games with a positive mindset to improve himself and the team. We look forward to see his further development in the coming months.'),
(701, 701, 'Nivaan is in his development phase. He has to develop the basic football skills and his defending. His positioning on and off the ball should be the areas he should work on. He should also focus on his Speed, agility and Sprints to make better runs and receive the ball for creating goal scoring chances.', 'Nivaan has a solid foundation, but there are several areas where he can enhance his performance. Improving his speed with and without the ball will help him become a more dynamic player. Adopting a more aggressive playing style could also increase his impact during matches. He should focus on developing his motor skills, agility, and the quality of his first touch, while also improving his ability to turn and receive the ball with greater spatial awareness. Overall, Nivaan , has the potential to become an even more influential presence in the field. '),
(702, 702, 'Namit is in his development phase. He has to develop the basic football skills of scanning and quick passes, his defending should also be improved along with positioning on and off the ball should be the areas he should work on as a mid-field or defensive player. He should also focus on his Speed agility and Sprints for quick runs and speed with the ball and without', 'Namit is a very good player with good ability. As a defender he should work more on his passing ability from the back under pressure (long & short passes). \r\nReading the game is highly significant, awareness and scanning on blind side has to be taken into consideration. His defensive heading should also be developed better. He should work more on his defensive organisation as well and take more responsibilities on organising the defence line off the ball. His leadership quality can be better and be more vocal in the game by  communicating effectively among his team mates.'),
(703, 703, 'Jai is in his development phase. He should work more on his physicality and sprints. As a forward player he should also focus on his off the ball movement and find more space to attack and create goal scoring changes.', 'Jai is a player who has good footballing sense, his ability to finish on the goal is good, but should work more on his strength and long range shooting. Jai\'s defending transition needs to be improved and worked on the behaviour and reaction when team loses the ball which is of paramount importance, his work rate can be better but he should improve more on it. As a striker he should also improve more on his ability to find the space and create goal scoring opportunities, and work more on his positioning & speed. Jai is hard working and is consistently improving.'),
(704, 704, 'Aarit is in his development phase. He should work on his basic football skills. He has to improve on his defending as well. Understanding of Speed of thought & speed of play is very important towards game with good presense of mind is vital for decision making as a defender, with practice these football actions can be better and mould him to be a better defender ahead', 'Aarit has a good physical strength for his age. He should work more on his defending, scanning, defensive heading and long passes. He should be more calm and composed in the defense line and not rush for the final tackle. He has the ability to be a good  defender for his age if he works hard and keeps pushing himself in the training ground. Aarit\'s communication skills should also be developed and try to lead the team from behind. He is doing good and will improve more if he concentrates and follows coaching instructions and keeps working hard further'),
(705, 705, 'Lokshith is in his development phase. He should work more on his physicality and sprinting. As a forward player he should also focus on his off the ball movement and find more space to attack and create goal scoring chances.', 'Lokshith is in his developing phase. He has a good left foot technique & he has a good understanding of the game. He needs to be exposed more to 9 V 9 football as he has good potential to develop his skills and endurance. He Needs to learn to play under pressure and work on long passes and long shots. However, he needs to work on his fitness, He needs to work on his motor skills, agility, quality of first touch, and turning/receiving needs more spatial awareness. He is overall a dedicated player with a good positive attitude. '),
(706, 706, 'Aedan consistently demonstrates exemplary behavior on and off the field and always puts in significant effort to improve during training. He possesses excellent leadership qualities and takes overall responsibility for the team as a captain. However, there is room for improvement in his positional awareness.', 'Aedan is a good athlete with good behaviour on & off the field. He works very hard and tries to improve in sessions. He is also able to take information from the coaches & execute it to best of his ability. He has also shown good maturity  in his game  and his decision making. He can still improve on his positional awareness .'),
(707, 707, 'Anuj is currently in the development phase of his football training. He needs to work on developing basic football skills and improving his defending abilities. His positioning on and off the ball should be his primary focus areas. Additionally, he should concentrate on improving his speed, agility, and sprinting capabilities.', 'Anuj is a passionate and hardworking player who is constantly striving to improve his skills on the field. He should focus on improving his decision-making abilities both on and off the ball, as well as his technical abilities. Additionally, he should work on developing his non-dominant foot to make him a more versatile player. Improving his communication skills is also important. We look forward to seeing his further development in the coming months.'),
(708, 708, 'kush consistently demonstrates exemplary behavior on and off the field and always puts in significant effort to improve during training. He possesses excellent leadership qualities . However, there is room for improvement in his positional awareness.', 'kush is a good athlete with good behaviour on & off the field. He works very hard and tries to improve in sessions. He is also able to take information from the coaches & execute it to best of his ability. He has also shown good maturity in his game and his decision making. He can still improve on his positional awareness .'),
(709, 709, 'Manu is currently in the development phase and recently rejoined the team. He needs to work on developing his fitness, especially endurance, for the ongoing tough matches. It\'s important for him to attend all upcoming sessions to improve himself.', 'Manu missed some sessions and recently joined the team. He needs to improve his fitness to prevent injuries.'),
(710, 710, 'Devarsh is a good athlete with good behaviour on & off the field. He works very hard and tries to improve in every session. He is also able to take information from the coaches & execute it to best of his ability. He has also shown good maturity in his game & his decision making. He can still improve on his finishing & heading. For Devarsh, the next step would to be consistent in his attendance for training so that he can improve further.', 'Devarsh is a a good player with the positive attitude in the team. His ability to read the game is very helpful for the team. He should work more on his defending communication and acceleration. His defensive clearances should also be improved with his non-dominant foot. He though having potential should exhibit leadership quality to lead the team from behind. \r\n\r\nHis Physical assessment tests are marked as zero or N/A since he was absent during the evalutions.'),
(711, 711, 'Sumair is a skilled player with outstanding game reading and vision. His shots on goal are quite impressive. Whether playing as a midfielder or striker, his reactions and behavior during transitions are of high significance. However, his decision making on when to pass and when to dribble can be improved. Overall, he is a valuable team player', 'Sumair is a good athlete with commendable behavior both on and off the field. He works very hard and strives to improve in each match. He is adept at absorbing information from the coaches and executing it to the best of his ability. Additionally, he has demonstrated maturity in his game and decision-making. However, he still has room for improvement in terms of his positional awareness'),
(712, 712, 'Ansh is a player with a positive attitude who shows good potential. To maximize his impact, he should focus on improving both his defending and attacking skills. Specifically, enhancing his attacking 1v1 abilities is essential. Additionally, he should keep improving his football basics, including technical skills and sprinting ability. ', 'Ansh demonstrates a good work ethic and a commitment to continual improvement. He possesses a good attacking sense, but we also focus on enhancing his defensive skills. His sprinting ability with the ball is good, to further develop, he needs to push himself harder in both training and matches. Additionally, he should focus on both on- and off-the-ball positioning and movement. He also showcases good crossing ability, which adds to his potential as a player. '),
(713, 713, 'Steve has been developing gradually, and we look forward to seeing more from him this season. As a defender, he should focus on enhancing his defensive communication, 1v1 defending, defensive stance, scanning, and defensive heading. Improving his communication is crucial. Additionally, he should work on his sprinting actions and build more confidence on the ball, especially during transitions. ', 'Steve displays a positive attitude both on and off the field. To further develop as a defender, he should focus on key skills such as 1v1 defending, scanning, maintaining defensive shape, communication, and defensive clearances, including heading clearances. Additionally, enhancing his sprinting abilities will be beneficial. He is improving his leadership qualities by effectively leading the backline and improving his communication skills. With continued effort, he has the potential to excel in his role.'),
(714, 714, 'Ved is in his development phase. He has to develop the basic football skills of scanning and quick passes, his defending should also be improved, positioning on and off the ball should be the areas he should work on as a forward player. He should also focus on his speed, agility and sprints for quick runs and speed with the ball to create better goal scoring chances', 'Ved is a hard working player with a positive attitude towards training. He should focus more on improving his finishing and ball receiving technique, especially with aerial passes from the midfield and wingers. Ved needs to work on his decision-making skills regarding when to pass the ball and when to take on defenders further distribute it to the best option available. Additionally, he should focus on improving his negative transition by working more on tracking back to help regain ball possession. We are happy with his progress and look forward to see his further development in the coming months'),
(715, 715, 'Abhinav is in the development phase and has shown steady progress over the past few months, demonstrating an increasing understanding of his role. To further enhance his game, he needs to improve his short and long passing, positioning, 1v1 defending, maintaining team shape, and on-field communication. Additionally, he should work on his speed, sprinting, and quick decision-making to sharpen his overall performance.', 'Abhinav displays a positive attitude and a strong willingness to learn and improve. He should concentrate more on the football aspects of the game, particularly his passing skills when playing out from the back. As a versatile player capable of contributing in both defense and midfield, he shows good potential. However, as a defensive player, he needs to enhance his defending skills, including 1v1 situations, scanning, maintaining defensive shape, communication, defensive clearances, and heading. Additionally, he should focus on developing his sprinting, body coordination, and balance.'),
(716, 716, 'Ahaan is in a key development phase, showing a great attitude and a strong desire to learn and improve. To elevate his game, he should prioritize refining his technical skills, deepening his tactical understanding, and enhancing his game reading and vision (scanning)—all crucial attributes for a midfielder.', 'Ahaan is in his development phase, actively working to understand his midfield role and the tactical demands of the position. His reactions and behavior during transitions are essential, and improving his field scanning will be critical to sharpening his decision-making. Overall, he is a good team player with a strong willingness to learn and continue improving.'),
(717, 717, 'Ranjiv is in a key development phase. He needs to focus on improving his physicality and sprinting ability. As a forward, he should work on his off-the-ball positional understanding and movement to find space and create more goal-scoring opportunities. Enhancing his 1v1 skills and long-range shooting will further elevate his game.', 'Ranjiv has been improving his football sense, and while his finishing ability is developing, he needs to get into more goal-scoring positions. He should focus on building strength and enhancing his long-range shooting power. His defensive transition, particularly his reaction and behavior after losing possession, needs attention. Although his work rate in matches is commendable, he should bring the same intensity to training. His attacking work rate and creativity are strengths, but he must develop a stronger defensive mindset while also improving his 1v1 dribbling ability and his decision-making. '),
(718, 718, 'Ryan is in his development phase and possesses strong physical attributes for his age. He demonstrates good leadership skills but needs to remain calmer and more composed on and off the ball. His effectiveness in both positive and negative transitions is promising, and he will benefit from time to grow and develop as a player.', 'Ryan is developing gradually and showing notable improvement in his positive and negative transitions. He is beginning to excel at getting into goal-scoring positions during attacking situations and can focus on enhancing his finishing skills. Although he displays confidence, he needs to work on controlling his emotions and remaining calm on and off the ball. He has leadership qualities that he should continue to cultivate. Overall, Ryan is a very coachable player with a strong willingness to learn.'),
(719, 719, 'Varun is in his development phase. He has to develop the basic football skills of scanning and quick passes. His defending should also be improved with positioning on and off the ball should be the areas he should work on as a mid-field player. Varun should also focus on his speed,agility and sprints for quick runs and speed with the ball to receive the ball under pressure and distribute it to the forward players or shoot to create better goal scoring chances.', 'Varun displays good attitude in training and matches. He should work more on his football aspect of the game, his basic football skills should needs to be developed which is scanning, receiving under pressure with good and effective movements off the ball with good and effective runs provided. As a mid-field player he should work on his ball distribution skills like receiving in 1 v 1, scanning , maintaining the ball possession, communication skills, defensive clearances, attacking with counter attacks. Varun\'s sprinting as well as his body coordination needs to be developed for improving his attacking gameplay through the midfield. '),
(720, 720, 'Vansh is in his development phase, his negative transition should be improved and needs work to his 1 v 1 defending which will help him be effective. He should also work more on his vision and play more forward during positive transition (attacking) with quick passes in the match pushing the team ahead for the counter attacks. Vansh nees to work on his communication as a defensive player', 'Vansh is in his development phase. He should work on his passing accuracy from the back (long & short range). He should work more on his communication, awareness during play, defensive organisation and defensive communication both verbal and non verbal are vital for optimal performance as a defender. Vansh has good work ethics and needs to develop more by adding more effort on it and concentrate more in the training and in matches to grow as a player. Vansh needs to work on leading the defensive line and keep the defending effective with confident commands and communicating with team mates '),
(721, 721, 'Eden is in his development phase. He should work on his basic football skills. He has to improve on his attacking and defending as well. Understanding of speed of thought and speed of play is very important in his game. His decision-making and football actions can be better.', 'Eden is a player with a positive attitude. He should focus on refining his technical skills and enhancing his tactical understanding, along with improving his speed of thought and play. He excels at long balls, a skill he should utilize more frequently. Additionally, he can benefit from working on set pieces and direct free kicks, which are key attributes in his development as a player.'),
(722, 722, 'Hashir is in his development phase. He has to develop the basic football skills of scanning and quick passes, his defending should also be improved, positioning on and off the ball should be the areas he should work on as a mid-field player. He should also focus on his speed, agility and sprints for quick runs and speed with the ball to create better goal scoring chances', 'Hashir is a hardworking player who is constantly striving to improve his skills on the field. He needs to focus on improving his decision-making abilities both on and off the ball along with improving his technical abilities. Additionally, he should work on developing his non-dominant foot, which will make him a more versatile player. He should also improve his communication skills. Hashir needs to work more on his speed, agility and sprints to have effective gameplay as a mid-field player. We look forward to see his further development in the coming months.'),
(723, 723, 'Saarthak is in his development phase. He should work more on his physicality and sprints. As a forward player he should also focus on his off the ball movement and find more space to attack and create goal scoring chances.', 'Saarthak is a player who has a good footballing sense, his ability to finish on the goal is good, but he should work more on his strength and long range shooting technique, his defending transition needs to be improved since the behaviour and reaction when team loses the ball is of paramount importance. Saarthaks\'s work rate can be better and he should improve by working  more on it. As a striker he should also improve more on his ability to find the space, create goal scoring opportunities and work more on his positioning & speed.'),
(724, 724, 'Prithvi has improved with training and match experience, he needs to further work in creating more power in his long range passing and shooting which is vital for his age and it comes with practice and development, he needs to work on his quick change of direction and he is on the right track of development ', 'Prithvi has been consistent in his performance, he is a strong defender with good aggression to win the ball possession, he can further improve in providing quick runs into the final third and create goal scoring chances through crosses, he can improve in developing more speed with and without the ball which will enhance his performance, he has been consistent and hardworking with his progress'),
(725, 725, 'Bishank is in his development phase and shows a positive attitude. To progress, he should focus on improving his basic football skills (passing, dribbling, and finishing) and enhance his physicality, particularly his sprinting ability, which is crucial for his role as a forward. He should also work on his off-the-ball movement to find space, time his runs effectively, and create more goal-scoring opportunities.', 'Bishank is currently in his development phase and shows a strong work ethic and a positive attitude. To continue progressing, he should focus on refining his fundamental skills, particularly passing, ball control, and quick shooting to finish under pressure and in tight spaces will be crucial for his development as a forward. He needs to keep working on his speed and strength, which will help him compete more effectively. Finally, improving his off-the-ball movement will allow him to create more space, make better attacking runs, and increase his goal-scoring opportunities.'),
(726, 726, 'Rishaan has been a tremendous asset to the team. His maturity in the game and football sense is evident, and it’s crucial that he continues to work hard on his techniques, decision-making, positioning, and game understanding which would elevate his performance even further. His leadership skills have always stood out; we are extremely pleased with his progress.', 'Rishaan has consistently demonstrated his skills as a player, displaying a positive attitude toward learning and improvement both in training and matches. He has a keen eye for goals and has shown versatility in his play. While he has made good strides in his crossing, he can further enhance his decision-making and positioning during offensive transitions. Additionally, he should focus on taking more long-range shots, as this is another area where he has potential. Overall, his development over the years has been commendable, and there is still much more to achieve. His winning mentality is a valuable asset to the team. \r\nPS: Rishaan was absent for the Yoyo testing.'),
(727, 727, '', ''),
(728, 728, '', ''),
(729, 729, '', ''),
(730, 730, 'Madhav is in his development phase, his negative transition should be improved and worked on, his 1v1 situations should be effective by working more on his vision and playing more forward or positive attacking passes in the matches. Madhav is a hard working and player with positive attitude.', 'Madhav is a hard working player with a positive attitude towards training. He should focus more on improving his finishing and ball receiving and distribution technique, especially with aerial passes in the midfield. Madhav needs to work on his decision-making skills regarding when to pass the ball\r\nand when to take on defenders and further distribute it to the best option available. Additionally, he should focus on improving his negative transition by working more on positive passing game play. We are happy with his progress and look forward to see his further development in the coming months'),
(731, 731, 'Soham is currently in his development phase and should put more effort into enhancing his technical and tactical abilities. He needs to concentrate on his attacking principles and improve his sprinting to effectively beat defenders in duels. Additionally, he should prioritize developing his passing—both long and short—and his receiving skills, ensuring he has a good first touch. Working on his strength and stamina is also crucial for improving his overall performance on the pitch. ', 'Soham is in a development phase and needs to improve his passing and receiving skills under pressure. To become more effective in attack, he should focus on improving his 1v1 dribbling, crossing, and shooting abilities. In addition, dedicating time to strengthening his technical fundamentals, body coordination, physical strength, and stamina will be vital to his overall growth as a player. These improvements will help him reach his full potential on the field.\r\nPS: Soham was absent for the Yoyo testing. '),
(732, 732, 'Abhishek is a hard working player, He should work on his 1 v 1 attacking and learn to use his sprinting ability to beat the defender/opponent during duels. He should work on his position off the ball while defending since the behaviour of player when losing possession is of paramount importance, Abhishek should work more on his speed, agility and sprinting to make the required runs to receive the ball under pressure to create chances on goal ', 'Abhishek and hardworking player who is constantly striving to improve his skills on the field. He needs to focus on improving his decision-making abilities both on and off the ball along with improving his technical abilities. Additionally, he should work on developing his non-dominant foot, which will make him a more versatile player. He should also improve his communication skills. Abhishek needs to work more on hi speed, agility and sprints to have effective gameplay as a winger. We look forward to see his further development in the coming months.'),
(733, 733, 'Jonah has a great personality and consistently strives to improve his game. To further elevate his performance, he should focus on building his physicality, enhancing his sprinting and 1v1 defending, and refining his defensive principles. Improving his speed of thought and speed of play will be crucial for his growth as a player.', 'Jonah has shown improvement, but he needs to focus on becoming stronger and more physical, both on and off the ball. While he understands the game well, he can further enhance his awareness of his roles and responsibilities in his position. Key areas for improvement include his 1v1 defending, scanning, defensive heading, and long passing when playing out from the back. \r\nPS: Absent for the Yoyo testing.'),
(734, 734, 'Kabir also needs to work on his technical skills, particularly dribbling and crossing under pressure. Improving his ability to beat defenders 1v1 and deliver accurate crosses will make him more dangerous on the wing. Fitness and technical refinement will be key to his development.', 'Kabir has a lot of potential, but his fitness level needs significant improvement. He tends to tire quickly, which limits his effectiveness in both attack and defense. A focus on endurance training will allow him to contribute more consistently throughout the match.'),
(735, 735, '', ''),
(736, 736, '', ''),
(737, 737, 'Agastya is progressing well in his development phase and should continue focusing on enhancing his foundational football skills. Emphasis should be placed on improving his short and long-passing accuracy and decision-making while on the ball. Additionally, working on his defensive heading and reinforcing his long-pass technique will be beneficial to his overall game. With consistent practice in these areas. ', 'Agastya is showing notable progress in becoming calmer and more composed in the defensive line with each game. His development suggests strong potential to be an effective defender for his age if he maintains his dedication and work ethic during training. To further his growth, he should focus on improving his communication skills to lead the team from the back, supporting his teammates and organizing the defense. Additionally enhancing his speed of thought and speed of play, refining his long passing, decision-making, and scanning abilities will further strengthen his defensive play.'),
(738, 738, 'Aaryaman is progressing steadily in his development phase, and his focus should remain on strengthening his basic football skills. As a defender, key areas for improvement include his short and long passing, as well as his defensive heading ability. Additionally, enhancing his speed, agility, and sprinting will greatly benefit his effectiveness on the field, allowing him to keep up with fast-paced play. His physicality and strength are notable for his age, providing a strong foundation for his defensive role.', 'Aaryaman has a positive attitude and a strong desire to improve, his steady progress as a defender shows promise, and with focused development, he can enhance his defensive skills further. He needs to keep working on his 1v1 defending, scanning, maintaining defensive shape, defensive clearances, particularly his heading and his communication in the back line.  Aaryaman\'s overall approach makes him a pleasure to coach. Additionally, focusing on sprinting will boost his agility and responsiveness on the field.\r\nPS: Absent for the assessment  testing'),
(739, 739, 'Ayansh is a player with a strong football sense. His finishing ability is solid, but he should focus on refining his long-range shooting to become a more versatile goal-scoring threat. Strengthening his physicality will also make him a more formidable presence on the field. With his excellent potential, continued hard work will help him reach new heights in his development.', 'Ayansh is a talented player who has been developing well, contributing significantly to the team, particularly with his finishing skills. His height gives him an advantage in aerial duels, enhancing his heading ability. However, he should improve his long-range shooting to become a well-rounded threat on goal. As a midfielder, Ayansh shows good reactions and behavior during transitions, which are vital to his role. He can also improve his decision-making and speed of play. Focusing on building physical strength will be key to his development. Overall, he is a valuable player with great potential.\r\nPS: Ayansh was injured or absent during the physical assessment.'),
(740, 740, 'Kahaan is in his development phase and should prioritize enhancing his technical and tactical skills. He needs to focus on his attacking principles and improve his sprinting to effectively challenge defenders in 1v1 situations with skills. While he possesses a good attacking mindset, boosting his physicality and overall sprinting ability will be crucial for his growth as a player.', 'Kaahaan is a passionate and hardworking player dedicated to enhancing his skills on the field. Currently, in his development phase, he should focus on improving his technical abilities while also deepening his tactical understanding. Additionally, developing his non-dominant foot will increase his versatility as a player. Improving his communication skills is also essential for his growth. We look forward to seeing his progress in the coming months.'),
(741, 741, 'Samarth is a player who has the football sense. His ability to finish on the goal is good, but should work more on his long range shooting.\r\nHis defending transition needs to be improved. As a forward player he should also focus on his off the ball movement and find more space to attack and create goal scoring changes.\r\n\r\n\r\n', 'Samarth is improving steadily and is often delivering very consistent performances for the team. He has shown good maturity in defending without the ball. With the ball, he has shown good ability in his crosses and passing range. He has shown a lot of promise for the future with his technical ability and tactical understanding, and he is one of our exciting homegrown talent to watch out for as long as he stays grounded and humble.\r\n\r\nHis Physical assessment tests are marked as zero or N/A since he was absent during the evalutions.'),
(742, 742, 'Yatharth has a good physical and strength for his age. He should work more on his defending, scanning, defensive heading and long passes.\r\nHe should be more calm and composed in the defense line. He has the ability to be a good defender for his age if he works hard and keeps pushing himself in the training ground. His communication skills should also be developed and try to lead the team from behind. Additionally, he should work on developing his non-dominant foot, which will make him a more versatile player. He should also improve his communication skills. We look forward to see his further development in the coming months.\r\n', 'Yatharth has a very good attitude, good team spirit, and a good attitude to learn & improve himself. He is a good example for the team. He has high endurance levels and can press the opponents effectively for long durations of the game. He still needs to improve his consistency in defending and needs to work to his non-dominant foot.\r\n\r\nHis Physical assessment tests are marked as zero or N/A since he was absent during the evalutions.'),
(743, 743, '', ''),
(744, 744, 'Shashank has a good physical and strength for his age. He should work more on his defending, scanning, defensive heading and long passes.\r\nHe should be more calm and composed in the defense line. He has the ability to be a good defender for his age if he works hard and keeps pushing himself in the training ground. His communication skills should also be developed and try to lead the team from behind. He is doing good and will improve more if he concentrates and follows coaching instructions and keeps working hard.\r\n', 'Shashank is improving steadily and is often delivering very consistent performances for the team. He has shown good maturity in defending without the ball. With the ball, he has shown good ability in his passing range. He has shown a lot of promise for the future with his technical ability and tactical understanding, and he is one of our exciting  talent to watch out for as long as he continue to work to get better.'),
(745, 745, 'Dhanin has a good physical and strength for his age. He should work more on his defending, scanning, defensive heading and long passes.\r\nHe should be more calm and composed in the mid defence line. He has the ability to be a good defender/mid for his age if he works hard and keeps pushing himself in the training ground. His communication skills should also be developed and try to lead the team from behind. He is doing good and will improve more if he concentrates and follows coaching instructions and keeps working hard.\r\n', 'Dhanin is versatile player who can play as a  Defender and center-mid. He is player with good technical qualities, In negative transition he is showing good mentality to win back the ball. He can improve his tackling  technique & quality of defending. We are happy with his progress & look forward to see his further development in the coming months.'),
(746, 746, 'Mehul is in his development phase. He should work more on his physicality and sprint. As a forward player he should also focus on his off the ball movement and find more space to attack and create goal scoring changes. With the ball, he has shown good ability in his crosses and passing range.', 'Mehul is versatile player who can play as a winger and attacking mid. He is player with good technical qualities, In negative transition he is showing good mentality to win back the ball. He can improve his crossing technique & quality of crosses. We are happy with his progress & look forward to see his further development in the coming months.'),
(747, 747, 'Sahanya is a a good player with the positive attitude in the team, His ability to finish on the goal is good, but should work more on his strength and long range shooting.\r\nThe behaviour and reaction when team loses the Ball is of paramount importance His work rate can be better but he should improve more on it. As a striker he should also improve more on his ability to find the space and create goal scoring opportunities, and work more on his positioning & anticipation.', 'Sahanya a very good attitude, good team spirit, and a good attitude to learn & improve himself. He is a good team player. He is player with good technical qualities, In negative transition he is showing good mentality to win back the ball. He has to improve his endurance level to press the opponents effectively for long durations of the game. He still needs to improve his consistency in finishing and needs to work to his non-dominant foot.\r\n\r\nHis Physical assessment tests are marked as zero or N/A since he was absent during the evalutions.');
INSERT INTO `ci_notes_from_coaching` (`id`, `forms_id`, `notes_frm_tech_dir`, `notes_frm_head_coach`) VALUES
(748, 748, 'Neerav is in his development phase. He has to develop the basic football skills of scanning and quick passes, His defending should also be improved, Positioning on and off the ball should be the areas he should work on as a mid-field player. He should also focus on his Speed agility and Sprints for quick runs and speed with the ball', 'Neerav displays a good attitude in training and matches. He should work more on the football aspect of the game. His basic football skills should need to be developed. As a mid-field player, he should work on his ball distribution skills like receiving in 1 v 1, Scanning, maintaining the ball possession, communication skills, defensive clearances, and attacking with counterattacks. His sprinting as well as his body coordination needs to be developed.'),
(749, 749, 'Joy is a talented athlete with excellent behavior both on and off the field. He works very hard and consistently strives to improve during training sessions. Joy is adept at receiving information from his coaches and implementing it to the best of his ability. Additionally, he has demonstrated great maturity in his game and decision-making. However, there is still room for improvement in terms of his positional awareness.', '\"Joy is a talented athlete with commendable behavior both on and off the field. He works very hard and strives to improve in each match. He is adept at absorbing information from the coaches and executing it to the best of his ability. Additionally, he has demonstrated maturity in his game and decision-making. However, he still has room for improvement in terms of his positional awareness.\"'),
(750, 750, 'Ashwin is currently in the development phase and needs to work on developing basic football skills. Specifically, he should focus on improving his ball control, crossing technique, and positioning both on and off the ball. Additionally, he should work on enhancing his speed, agility, and sprinting abilities.', 'Ashwin is a passionate and hardworking player who is constantly striving to improve his skills on the field. He needs to focus on improving his decision-making abilities both on and off the ball, along with enhancing his technical abilities. Additionally, he should work on developing his non-dominant foot, which will make him a more versatile player. He should also improve his communication skills. In addition, he should focus on his crossing technique. We look forward to seeing his further development in the coming months.'),
(751, 751, '', ''),
(752, 752, 'Anirudh is in his development phase. He has to develop the basic football skills, his defending should also needs to be improved. Anirudh\'s positioning on and off the ball should be the areas he should work on. He should also focus on his speed,agility and sprints with timing of the runs to receive the ball under pressure and create goal scoring chances', 'Anirudh displays good attitude in training and matches. He should work more on his football aspect of the game with developing basic football skills, as an attacker he should work on his attacking skills like 1 v 1, Scanning , receiving with good first touch and change of direction along with communication skills. Anirudh\'s sprinting should also be developed as well as his body coordination for better attacking to receive the ball under pressure and create chances. '),
(753, 753, 'Samvruth is in his development phase. He should work more on his defending communication, 1v1 defending, scanning and defensive heading. He should focus on his communication. He should also work on his sprinting actions during gameplay and his long range passing. ', 'Samvruth is a player with positive attitude in the team. His ability to read the game is very helpful for the team. He should work more on his defending  communication and acceleration when necessary. His defensive clearances should also be improved with his non-dominant foot. Having potential Samvruth should exhibit leadership quality to lead the team from behind. He should also work more on his defensive clearances and long range passing. Samvruth is also better goalkeeper and can play as a defender as well.'),
(754, 754, 'Achouba is in his development phase. He should work on his passing accuracy  from the back ( long & short ). He should work more on his communication, awareness during play, defensive organisation and defensive Communication verbal and non verbal are vital for a defender to enhance the overall skillset as a defender', 'Achouba is a smart and intelligent player with great potential. To further develop his skills and endurance, he needs more exposure to 9v9 football. Improving his fitness and learning how to perform under pressure will be crucial. He needs to control his emotions during the match.  He should focus on refining his long passes and long shots. Additionally, working on his motor skills, agility, quality of first touch, and ability to turn and receive the ball will enhance his overall game. Increasing his spatial awareness will also be beneficial. Overall, Achouba is a dedicated player. '),
(755, 755, 'Ritvick shows considerable potential as a player, but there are specific areas where he needs to focus on improvement. Developing his shooting ability is essential, as it will enhance his effectiveness in front of goal. Additionally, he must work on his transitional skills, particularly in moving from attack to defense, to contribute more effectively to the team\'s overall dynamics. By concentrating on these aspects of his game, Ritvick can unlock his potential and become a more well-rounded player.', 'Ritvick needs to enhance his understanding of the game, particularly regarding his role as a No. 8 or No. 10 midfielder. It’s important for him to recognize the versatility he possesses as a player. While he has good physical attributes, including strength, speed, and endurance, he must learn to utilize these qualities effectively on the field. Additionally, developing his technical skills in shooting and passing is crucial. Improving his creativity in play and making quicker decisions will significantly contribute to his overall performance and impact on the team. A more comprehensive approach to his education about the game will help him reach his full potential.'),
(756, 756, 'Akhilan is in his development phase. He should work on his passing accuracy from the back ( long & short ). He should work more on his communication, awareness during play, attacking organization, and attacking Communication verbal and nonverbal is vital for an attack to enhance the overall skillset of an attacker ', 'Akhilan needs to focus on improving his fitness and learning to play effectively under pressure. He should also work on enhancing his long passes and long shots. As a smart and intelligent player, he demonstrates strong dribbling skills, including feints and acceleration with the ball. To further his development, he should dedicate time to improving his weaker foot and overall strength. With targeted effort in these areas, Akhilan has the potential to become an even more impactful player on the field'),
(757, 757, 'Prithiviraj is in his development phase. He has to develop the basic football skills of scanning and quick passes, his defending should also be improved, positioning on and off the ball should be the areas he should work on as a wing back. He should also focus on his speed, agility and sprints for quick runs and speed with the ball for effectively providing runs for the attack and tracking back on losing ball possession \r\nbody coordination are the areas he should work on.', 'Prithiviraj  is a hard working player, He should work on his 1 v 1 attacking and learn to use his sprinting ability to track and defend against the opponent during duels. He should work on his position off the ball since the behaviour of player when losing possession is of paramount importance, Prithviraj should work more on his speed, agility and sprinting to make the required runs to receive the ball under pressure to create chances on goal. He is always striving hard and working on himself to get better during training and matches and carries a good potential '),
(758, 758, 'Rayansh is in his development phase. He has to develop the basic football skills of scanning and quick passes, his defending should also be improved, Positioning on and off the ball should be the areas he should work on as a mid-field player. He should also focus on his speed, agility and sprints for quick runs and speed with the ball to create more goal scoring chances.', 'Rayansh is a hard working player with a positive attitude towards training. He should focus more on improving his finishing, ball receiving and distribution technique, especially with aerial passes in the midfield. Rayansh needs to work on his decision-making skills regarding when to pass the ball and when to take on defenders and further distribute it to the best option available. Additionally, he should focus on improving his negative transition by working more on positive passing game play. We are happy with his progress and look forward to see his further development in the coming months. The values of hysical performance shows 0 or NA since Rayansh was absent for the physical assessments since he joined late.'),
(759, 759, 'Shlok is currently in his development phase and shows promise with his commitment to improvement. To progress further, he should focus on enhancing his defensive communication, 1v1 defending, scanning, and defensive heading skills. Improving his sprinting actions will boost his physical impact on the game, while refining his long-range passing will expand his versatility. Enhanced communication on the field will also strengthen his defensive presence.', 'Shlok consistently displays a positive attitude and strong game-reading skills. To maximize his impact, he should work on refining his defensive communication and acceleration. Improving his defensive clearances, especially with his non-dominant foot, will add reliability to his play under pressure. While he has significant potential, embracing a leadership role from the back would elevate his influence on the team. Additionally, focusing on his long-range passing will enhance his ability to initiate plays from defense.\r\nPS: Was injured during the assessment testing. '),
(760, 760, 'Aryan has been steadily improving this season and demonstrating excellent mentality and versatility. He is a key player for the team, and we hope to see further progress in the coming months. He plays a crucial role in the team\'s performances this season and is taking responsibility to ensure that both he and his teammates maintain high standards. We are closely monitoring his progress.', 'Aryan Vora has demonstrated excellent work both on and off the field. He is working hard and showing tremendous attitude to improve himself, which has been rewarded with him playing almost every game this season. He has been one of the key players for us in the DPDL Super Cup championship, delivering consistent performances. He is also showing versatility, able to play in multiple roles, making him a major contributor to the team. He can still improve his composure with the ball while playing from the back, along with better decision-making. Additionally, he can take on more leadership responsibilities within the team.'),
(761, 761, 'Viabhav demonstrates a good attitude and discipline in training. He shows promising glimpses in attacking play; however, he needs to be more consistent in his performances throughout the game. Overall, he has a lot of potential to improve.', 'Vaibhav\'s commitment is commendable. He is eager to improve and dedicated to doing so. We appreciate his positive attitude, but we would also like to see more consistency in his wing play & finishing. He works hard off the ball and is committed to the team\'s goals in every game. We hope to see his performance continue to improve in the coming months.'),
(762, 762, 'Nityam shows potential but needs to focus on refining his shooting technique to become more effective in front of goal. He demonstrates good tactical knowledge, making him a valuable asset in understanding game situations. As a core part of the U17 development team, his continued improvement will be essential for his growth and contribution to the squad.', 'Nityam needs to improve his crossing ability and develop more proficiency with his weaker foot. While he\'s still slowly grasping the tactical aspects of the game, his enthusiasm during training is commendable. He\'s a good learner, and with continued effort, he will enhance his overall performance.'),
(763, 763, 'In addition to fitness, Tushar should also improve his understanding of the game, particularly his positioning when attacking. Learning to time his runs and make himself available for passes in dangerous areas will make him a more effective winger. Combining fitness and game intelligence will elevate his performance.', 'Tushar needs to work on both his football fitness and technique. He tends to struggle with keeping up with the pace of the game, which affects his ability to get involved in attacks. Focused conditioning drills will help him stay sharp for longer periods.'),
(764, 764, 'Aarav has shown good development and continues to progress well, though he’s still in the developmental stage. He collaborates effectively with his teammates and has a solid grasp of footballing concepts. However, his physicality is an area that holds him back, and he needs to place greater emphasis on building his physique. Focusing more on nutrition will be key to his improvement.', 'Aarav has made remarkable strides in his game, particularly in developing his technical abilities and improving his shooting. His understanding of the game has also advanced significantly. In addition, he\'s been actively working on his physique, setting personal targets and diligently striving to achieve them. Though still in the developmental phase, his progress from where he started to where he is now is impressive.\r\n'),
(765, 765, 'Tushya should also work on his passing and ball control when under pressure, particularly during buildup play. As a right-back, he needs to contribute both defensively and in attack, so improving his technique will help him be more effective. Tactical awareness and ball skills are key areas for him to focus on.', 'Tushya needs to work on his defensive awareness, especially when dealing with fast wingers. He sometimes gets caught out of position, leaving the team vulnerable. Focusing on improving his positioning and defensive timing will make him more reliable.'),
(766, 766, 'Prathyush possesses good shooting ability; however, he rarely puts himself in positions to showcase this skill. He needs to focus on improving his crossing ability and should work on enhancing his understanding of the tactical elements of the game to become a more effective player.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPrathyush possesses good shooting ability; however, he rarely puts himself in positions to showcase this skill. He needs to focus on improving his crossing ability and should work on enhancing his understanding of the tactical elements of the game to become a more effective player.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPrathyush possesses good shooting ability; however, he rarely puts himself in positions to showcase this skill. He needs to focus on improving his crossing ability and should work on enhancing his understanding of the tactical elements of the game to become a more effective player.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n', 'Disciplining Prathyush has been a challenge, as he tends to adopt a carefree attitude, believing that everything, including his place on the team, will come easily. He needs to recognize the importance of hard work and demonstrate this through consistent effort. Furthermore, he has been tried in multiple positions—right winger, left winger, and right back—but is struggling to fully grasp the roles and responsibilities associated with each. He needs to sharpen his focus and take his training more seriously to improve his overall performance.'),
(767, 767, 'Dhanvin is on the right path as a footballer, demonstrating significant progress in his transition from an U15 player to an U17 player. He has developed physically, which enhances his performance on the field. Additionally, his tactical knowledge of the game has improved, allowing him to make better decisions during matches. This development indicates a commitment to growth and a willingness to learn. Continuing to build on these strengths will be essential for his future success in the sport. Encouraging him to maintain this trajectory will help him reach his full potential as a player.', 'Dhanvin possesses a notable strength as a great aerial presence in the box, contributing effectively in both attacking and defending situations. He has made significant improvements in his role as a defensive midfielder, showcasing his good shooting ability with both his left and right foot. While he is progressing well, there is still room for improvement in various aspects of his game. Dhanvin is gradually learning the responsibilities associated with being a No. 6 (Defensive Midfielder), and his development in this role is promising. With his continued effort and dedication, he has the potential to become a key player for the team.'),
(768, 768, 'Tactically, Aaron can improve by working on his positioning when the team is in possession. Finding spaces between the lines will allow him to receive the ball in more dangerous areas. By enhancing his movement off the ball and continuing to improve his shooting, Aaron will become a more complete attacking midfielder.', 'Aaron has shown excellent finishing from outside the box, but he needs to focus on his dribbling and creativity in the final third. He often looks for long-range efforts when a simpler play could create more chances. Working on his decision-making will help him link up better with teammates.'),
(769, 769, 'From a development perspective, Manvith has potential, but he is currently behind where he should be at his age. While he is technically improving, his overall game awareness needs to develop further. It\'s crucial for him to focus on his physical conditioning and work on his fitness levels to keep up with the demands of the game. Furthermore, he needs to foster creativity in his gameplay, as well as addressing any negative habits in the game that he needs to unlearn that may hinder his learning process. ', 'Manvith is showing gradual improvement in his understanding of the game and his technical skills. While he hasn\'t yet reached the expected level for his age, his ability to grasp key concepts is promising. There needs to be more  emphasis for him to be more proactive in his training sessions, particularly in applying what he learns in practice to match situations. Additionally, he should work on his decision-making under pressure and communicate more effectively with his teammates to enhance his on-field presence'),
(770, 770, 'Trinabh has to attend sessions regularly to give a detailed assessment. ', 'Trinabh has not attended enough sessions since the first month of our program. We expect him to rejoin our training sessions regularly. We saw good improvements in the previous season, but now he needs to attend sessions consistently to continue making progress. ** All the assessment results are N/A or 0 since Trinabh was absent during the evaluations & missed many months of training sessions **'),
(771, 771, 'Ayaan is in his development phase. He should work on his attacking ability, his 1 v 1 defending should also be improved and defending positioning off the ball needs to be better and worked on. Scanning is of paramount importance during gameplay and Ayaan\'s sprinting and agility should can be further be improved.', 'Ayaan is a player with a positive attitude during training and matches. He is a player who should work more on his defending as well as attacking, He should also work more on his positioning and communication, Ayaan\'s attacking ability has been improved, he is hard working and his work ethics are good but to develop, he needs to put more effort on it and concentrate more in training and matches being regular and consistent at it, He should also focus on & off the ball positioning & movements to receive the ball under pressure and create goal scoring chances. The perforance parameters show 0 or N/A since Ayaan was not present for the assessments.     '),
(772, 772, 'Paul is in his development phase and is showing good promise in the program. To develop further as a footballer, he needs to improve his speed of thought and decision-making while playing. He has strong ball skills and a good shot from outside the box. Overall, he is a coachable player.', 'Paul is a good athlete with commendable behavior both on and off the field. He works very hard and strives to improve in every session. He is also able to take feedback from the coaches and execute it to the best of his ability. He can enhance his game regarding his decision-making with the ball and still improve consistency in his finishing and heading. For Paul, the next step would be to maintain consistency in his attendance at training so that he can continue to improve.'),
(773, 773, 'Overall, Ujjwal has shown significant improvement since he started. He needs to enhance his composure with the ball and improve his speed, especially in recovery runs. Ujjwal is a coachable player who understands his role as a Centre-Defender on the team, and we expect him to be more consistent in attending training. We look forward to seeing him make good progress in all aspects of his game in the coming months.', 'Ujjwal is a valuable member of the team, and his hardworking attitude and performance in the U17 category are admirable. He is a fearless defender, and his off-the-ball aggression during games is particularly noteworthy. He has strong long-range defensive clearances, effective 1v1 defending, and good long-range headers; however, he has been inconsistent due to missing many training sessions because of his exams. Ujjwal also needs to improve his fitness and composure, as he tends to lose focus in the latter parts of the game. Overall, there has been a lot of improvement from how Ujjwal started. ***NOTE: Ujjwal has missed the \"Physical Overview\" assessments on multiple occasions; therefore, the values are recorded as 0.0 or N/A.***'),
(774, 774, 'Alvin is in his development phase. He has to develop the basic football skills, his defending should also be improved along with attacking. Alvin\'s positioning on and off the ball should be the areas he should work on. He should also focus on his speed, agility and quick sprints to receive the ball.', 'Alvin displays good attitude. He should work more on his football aspect of the game working on developing basic football skills.  As a winger and midfielder he should work on his attacking skills like 1 v 1, Scanning, making runs to provide support and communication skills. His sprinting should also be developed as well as his body coordination for quick off the ball movements to receive the ball better under pressure and create goal scoring chances. The perforance parameters show 0 or N/A since Alvin was not present for the assessments.'),
(775, 775, 'Auritro is in his development phase. He should work on his attacking ability, his 1 v 1 defending should also be improved and defending positioning off the ball needs to be better and work on it. Scanning is of paramount importance during gameplay and his sprinting and agility should can be further be improved.', 'Auritro is a player with a positive attitude during training and matches. He is a player who should work more on his defending as well as attacking, He should also work more on his defending positioning and communication, Auritro\'s attacking ability has been improved, he is hard working and his work ethics are good but to develop more he should put more effort on it and concentrate more in training and matches being regular and consistent at it, he should also focus on & off the ball positioning & movements. The performance parameters are 0 or N/A since Auritro was not present for the assessments.'),
(776, 776, 'Armaan is a player whos game reading and vision is outstanding, his change of direction after receiving the ball is impressive and has good ability to get the ball to the final third, As a winger and midfielder, reaction &  behaviour during transitions are of high significance. When to pass and when to dribble, decision making can be better.\r\nOverall a good team player.\r\n', 'Armaan is a very good player with good ability as an attacking winger or midfield player. As a winger or midfield player he should work more on his passing ability from the back underpressure (long & short passes). Reading the game is highly significant, awareness and scanning on blind side has to be taken into consideration. His defensive game should also be developed better during transitions working more on his defensive organisation as well and take more responsibilities on tracking bck and helping the team. His leadership quality can be better and be more vocal in the game by  communicating effectively'),
(777, 777, 'Satvik has the potential to play at a high level of football in the future if he trains regularly. He possesses a strong mentality, and we would like to see him attend more team training sessions. He also demonstrates good technical ability and a good tactical understanding of the game.', 'Satvik showed good performances in the DPDL Super Cup, playing as a right back and demonstrating versatility by adapting from his usual winger position. He exhibits a strong mentality and a team-first attitude. With good technical ability and a solid tactical understanding of the game, he needs to train more to continue improving. He has the potential to play at higher levels of football. ** His physical assessment tests are marked as zero or N/A since he was absent during the evaluations.**'),
(778, 778, 'Rishik is in his development phase. He should work more on his physicality and sprinting. As a forward player he should also focus on his off the ball movement and find more space to attack and create goal scoring chances manipulating the ball with quick change of direction', 'Rishik is a player who has good football sense, his ability to finish on the goal is good, but should work more on his strength and long range shooting. His defending transition needs to be improved where the behaviour and reaction when team loses the Ball is of paramount importance, Rishik\'s work rate can be better but he should improve more on it. As a striker he should also improve more on his ability to find the space and create goal scoring opportunities, and work more on his positioning & speed and agility for being an effecient forward'),
(779, 779, 'Hashir Manifhan is in his development phase. He should work more on his physicality and sprint. As a forward\r\nplayer he should also focus on his off the ball movement and find more space to attack and create goal\r\nscoring changes.', 'Hashir Manifhan is a hard working player. He should work on his 1 v 1 attacking and play\r\nmore forward. He should learn to use his sprinting ability to beat the defender/opponent during duels.\r\nHe should work on his position off the ball while defending. He should also work on his body\r\ncoordination. His passing ( long & short ) and receiving is still below average and should focus more on\r\ndeveloping the shortcomings.'),
(780, 780, 'Saarthakk has been making steady progress in his development and needs to keep focusing on enhancing key defensive skills like 1v1 situation, positioning, scanning the field, maintaining defensive shape, heading clearances and communication. He could benefit from improving his sprinting agility and speed. His positive attitude and eagerness to improve make him a promising player.', 'Saarthakk is improving well in game-reading and defensive positioning. To advance, he should focus on 1v1 defending, positioning, defensive communication, scanning, and using his non-dominant foot. His strong leadership potential should be expressed more often. Additionally sharpening his speed of thought, speed of play, and long-passing skills will make him a more effective player.\r\nPS: Absent for the assessment testing'),
(781, 781, 'prithiviraj is in his development phase.\r\nHis passing and receiving under pressure situations must be better.\r\nHis attacking 1 v 1 should be improved and need to work on it. His football basics- Technical and his\r\nbody coordination are the areas he should work on.', 'prithiviraj  is in his development phase. He should work on his basic football skills.\r\n He has to improve on his defending as well.\r\nUnderstanding of Speed of thought &amp; speed of play is very important towards game.\r\nFootball actions can be better.'),
(782, 782, 'Saud has been a good addition to our team, bringing a strong defensive mentality without the ball and good technical ability with it. He can still improve his awareness during receiving actions and enhance his shooting accuracy, as well as winning more aerial duels. Overall, we are happy with his progress and expect further improvements in the coming months.', 'Saud is a well-disciplined and hard-working player. He has adapted quickly to our style of play and demonstrates strong tactical understanding and technical ability. With a solid defensive attitude and a strong mentality, he is very responsible in his role on the team, both with and without the ball. He played a crucial role in our DPDL Super Cup championship run. He needs to continue working hard, as he has been doing, and can improve the percentage of forward passes in each game.\r\n\r\n*** NOTE : In the assessment, certain physical parameters like speed (20m, 40m), Arrowhead Agility are listed as N/A or 0.00 as Saud was recovering from injury. These values will be closely monitored in the second assessment cycle. ***'),
(783, 783, 'Advaith has just joined our squad. He demonstrates good technical ability for his age and a good tactical understanding of the game. We are closely monitoring his progress.', 'Advaith recently joined our U17 team, and we are slowly integrating him into the squad. He is showing good technical ability along with good physicality. We will be able to assess him better in the coming months. **His physical assessment tests and other parameters are marked as zero or N/A because he was absent during the evaluations, having just joined our team** .'),
(784, 784, 'ved is a player who has the football sense. His ability to finish on the goal is good, but should work\r\n\r\nmore on his strength and long range shooting.\r\nHis defending transition needs to be improved.\r\n\r\nThe behaviour and reaction when team loses the Ball is of paramount importance His work rate can be\r\nbetter but he should improve more on it. As a striker he should also improve more on his ability to find\r\nthe space and create goal scoring opportunities, and work more on his positioning &amp; Speed agility.', 'Ved is in his development phase. He should work more on his physicality and sprint. As a forward\r\nplayer he should also focus on his off the ball movement and find more space to attack and create goal\r\nscoring changes.'),
(785, 785, 'Saarthak is in his development phase. He should work more on his sprint. As a forward player he should also focus on his off the ball movement and find more space to attack and create goal scoring changes.', 'Saarthak is in his development phase. His attitude and discipline is Good in training. However, technically and tactically he has lot to catch up and comprehend reading the game. It is a development process, where different athletes grow at their own pace. He can improve on his decision making, speed of thought and speed of play. Communication can be better.'),
(786, 786, 'Sourav can also improve his off-the-ball movement, particularly when playing as a striker. Timing his runs and finding space behind the defense will allow him to get into more goal-scoring positions. With better movement and sharper finishing, he can become a key attacking player for the team.', 'Sourav has good speed and finishing ability, but he needs to work on his decision-making in the final third. He often hesitates when opportunities arise, leading to missed chances. Sharpening his finishing and decision-making under pressure will make him a more lethal forward.'),
(787, 787, 'From a technical standpoint, Alvin needs to focus on his defensive positioning and ball control when under pressure. Building confidence in his defensive abilities and improving his decision-making will help him become more reliable. Regular practice in tactical drills will help him develop these skills.', 'Alvin needs to work on both his fitness and his tactical understanding of the game. He often struggles to keep up with the pace of the game, which affects his positioning and decision-making. Improving his fitness levels will allow him to be more effective defensively.'),
(788, 788, 'Savya’s positioning off the ball can be fine-tuned, especially when his team is building out from the back. He needs to work on making himself more available to receive passes in space. Improving his understanding of spatial awareness will help him dictate play more effectively.', 'Savya reads the game well, but his decision-making under pressure needs work. He tends to hesitate in tight situations, which leads to missed opportunities for forward passes. By improving his composure in congested areas, he can better control the game in midfield.'),
(789, 789, 'Dhruvil possesses significant potential for further development. While he showcases great athleticism and finishing skills, there is an opportunity for improvement in his creativity on the field. Fostering this aspect of his game could enhance his overall contributions and effectiveness as a player.', 'Dhruvil is a top athlete who exhibits excellent physical presence during games. His speed and finishing ability are commendable, contributing positively to the team\'s performance. Additionally, he demonstrates strong leadership qualities, inspiring and motivating his teammates on and off the field.'),
(790, 790, 'Defensively, Lokk’s awareness needs improvement, especially in positioning himself correctly when defending against fast wingers. He must also work on tracking back more consistently to avoid leaving gaps. With better anticipation and technique, he will develop into a more reliable full-back.', 'Lokk needs to develop his first touch and passing to build confidence on the ball. His technique, particularly in tight spaces, is crucial for effective distribution from the back. More focused technical drills will help him contribute better in the team\'s build-up play.'),
(791, 791, 'Tejas consistently demonstrates exemplary behavior on and off the field and always puts in significant effort to improve during training. He always helps the team by giving 100% of his strength during matches. However, there is room for improvement in his positional awareness.', 'Tejas is a talented athlete with commendable behavior on and off the field. He works hard, absorbs information from coaches, and demonstrates maturity in his game and decision-making. However, he has room for improvement in positional awareness and his crossing technique'),
(792, 792, 'Gopichand is currently in a developmental phase and needs to work on improving his basic football skills, particularly his defending. He should focus on enhancing his positioning on and off the ball, as well as his speed, agility, and sprinting abilities.', 'Gopichand is a passionate and hardworking player who is constantly striving to improve his skills on the field. He needs to focus on improving his decision-making abilities, both on and off the ball, along with enhancing his technical abilities. Additionally, he should work on developing his non-dominant foot, which will make him a more versatile player. Moreover, he should also improve his communication skills. We look forward to seeing his further development in the coming months.'),
(793, 793, 'Mukunda is currently in the development phase and needs to focus on improving his basic football skills, particularly his defending. He should work on his positioning both on and off the ball. Additionally, he should concentrate on enhancing his speed, agility, and sprints.', 'Mukunda is currently in the development phase and needs to focus on improving his basic football skills. He should work on his positioning, both on and off the ball. Additionally, he should focus on improving his ability with his non-dominant foot and his shooting technique.'),
(794, 794, '', 'Shreeansh is a coachable player who shows a strong willingness to listen and follow instructions. To further enhance his game, he needs to improve both technically and tactically. Increasing his awareness of space and decision-making under pressure will be crucial, as will learning to release the ball faster when better options are available. He should focus on developing his motor skills, agility, and the quality of his first touch, along with improving his ability to turn and receive the ball with greater spatial awareness. Additionally, working on his weaker foot and overall strength will be beneficial for his overall development. With dedication and effort, Shreeansh has the potential to become a more effective player on the field. '),
(795, 795, 'Daksh has made significant improvements but still needs to work on his ball control and technical skills. His dribbling and crossing under pressure need to be more accurate to become an effective winger. Regular technical drills will help him become more confident on the ball.', 'Building up his fitness levels will also be key for Daksh, as this will help him maintain performance throughout the game. He should focus on his speed and endurance to compete at a higher level. With improved fitness and technical ability, he can take the next step in his development.'),
(796, 796, 'Tenzin should focus on building his endurance and physical strength. He often tires quickly, affecting his ability to cover space effectively. With targeted fitness training and more time working on tactical awareness, he can develop into a reliable center-back.', 'Tenzin needs significant improvement in his defensive technique and awareness. He struggles to position himself properly during key moments, leaving the defense vulnerable. Working on defensive drills, positioning, and one-on-one defending will boost his confidence.'),
(797, 797, 'To elevate his game, Gurudev should focus on his positioning when out of possession, ensuring he’s available for passing options. His tactical understanding can improve, particularly in transitioning from defense to attack. Enhanced anticipation will make him a more dynamic midfielder.', 'Gurudev demonstrates good control in midfield, but his awareness can be improved. He needs to scan his surroundings more often before receiving the ball to help with quicker decision-making. By doing so, he\'ll become more effective at dictating play and avoiding unnecessary pressure.'),
(798, 798, 'Daniel has good vision, but he can become even more impactful by improving his awareness of his surroundings. Developing a better understanding of when to switch the play or penetrate centrally will elevate his influence in midfield. His ability to control the pace of the game can be refined with more game-time experience.', 'Daniel is a strong presence in the middle, but his passing needs to be more direct and quicker. He tends to hold onto the ball too long, which slows down the team’s play. Focusing on one-touch passes in tight spaces will improve his ability to maintain tempo and spread the play effectively.'),
(799, 799, 'Technically, Samanyu needs to work on his ability to beat defenders 1v1. Improving his dribbling and crossing under pressure will make him more effective in wide areas. With enhanced technique and better decision-making in the final third, he can become a greater asset in attack.', 'Samanyu has potential, but his fitness levels need to improve to keep up with the demands of playing on the wing. He tends to tire out quickly, which affects his ability to track back and defend. A focus on stamina training will allow him to maintain energy throughout the game.\r\n'),
(800, 800, 'Shaurya should also focus on improving his fitness, particularly his speed and agility, to cope better with quicker forwards. Building up his endurance will help him maintain a high level of performance throughout the game. Improved tactical awareness and fitness will enhance his defensive contributions.', 'Shaurya is a solid presence in defense, but he needs to work on his positioning and timing when defending against fast attackers. He tends to rely on his physicality, which sometimes leads to late challenges. Sharpening his decision-making in one-on-one situations will make him more reliable.'),
(801, 801, 'Dhruv Needs to attend training more often to clear have a conclusive first cycle report on him.', ''),
(802, 802, 'Dhruv could also work on his positioning when defending, particularly in cutting off passing lanes. Improving his anticipation of opposition movements will help him break up attacks and recover the ball more frequently. With increased tactical awareness, he’ll become more reliable in central midfield.', 'Dhruv has shown determination, but he often lacks awareness of his surroundings when in possession. He should focus on developing a habit of scanning the field before receiving the ball to make quicker, smarter decisions. This will help him contribute more effectively to build-up play.'),
(803, 803, 'Tactically, Aashvik should work on his positioning when cutting inside to take shots or create chances. Timing his movements and reading the play better will allow him to be more involved in goal-scoring opportunities. With improved technical precision and tactical awareness, he’ll become a more dangerous winger.', 'Aashvik is quick and creative on the wing, but he needs to improve his final delivery when crossing the ball. His decision-making in the final third can be more precise, particularly when picking out teammates in dangerous areas. Focusing on his crossing technique will make him a more effective wide player.'),
(804, 804, 'Technically, Saptharshi should work on his ball control and distribution out from the back. Being more comfortable on the ball will help him contribute more effectively to the team’s buildup play. With better positioning and technical skills, he can become a more dependable defender.', 'Saptharshi has good physicality for a defender, but his positioning needs improvement, especially when defending against quicker players. He tends to get caught out of position, leaving space behind him. Focusing on his defensive timing will help him manage these situations better.'),
(805, 805, 'Technically, Garvit should focus on improving his crossing and passing under pressure. Being able to contribute both defensively and offensively will make him a more well-rounded player. Fitness and technical drills will be important for his development.', 'Garvit shows determination, but his fitness and tactical understanding need improvement. He tends to struggle with maintaining his defensive positioning over the course of a game. Working on his stamina and decision-making will help him stay more consistent defensively.'),
(806, 806, '', ''),
(807, 807, '', ''),
(808, 808, 'Wanshanbok has continued to show encouraging development and remains an important presence within the team environment. He consistently demonstrates a positive attitude, willingness to learn, and professionalism both on and off the field. His technical quality, tactical understanding, and composure in possession continue to stand out during matches and training sessions.\r\n\r\nHe has also shown good competitiveness in difficult games and continues to contribute positively to the group through his work ethic and overall influence within the squad. His ability to take coaching information and apply it effectively remains one of his key strengths as a developing player', 'anshanbok has shown steady progress in multiple areas of his development. Defensively, he has improved his understanding in 1v1 situations, positioning, awareness, and handling defensive responsibilities such as clearances and aerial challenges with greater confidence and consistency.\r\n\r\nThere has also been noticeable improvement in his physical attributes, including movement, agility, coordination, and overall mobility, allowing him to contribute more effectively during different phases of the game. His growing understanding of defensive transitions and game situations has helped him become a more reliable player for the team.'),
(809, 809, '', ''),
(810, 810, '', ''),
(811, 811, '', ''),
(812, 812, '', ''),
(813, 813, '', ''),
(814, 814, 'Agrim is in his development phase, he should work more on his physicality and sprints. As a forward player he should also focus on his off the ball movement and find more space to attack and create goal scoring chances. ', 'Agrim is a player who has a good footballing sense, his ability to finish on the goal is good, but should work more on his strength and long range shooting technique, His defending transition needs to be improved since the behaviour and reaction when team loses the Ball is of paramount importance. Agrim\'s work rate can be better but he should improve by working  more on it. As a striker he should also improve more on his ability to find the space and create goal scoring opportunities, and work more on his positioning & Speed. The physical assessment tests are marked as 0 or N/A since he was not present during the evaluations.'),
(815, 815, 'Jayant is in his development phase. He should work on his passing accuracy  from the back (long & short range). He should work more on his communication, awareness during play, defensive organisation and defensive Communication verbal and non verbal are vital for optimal performance as a defender. Jayant has good work ethics, he needs to develop more by adding more efforts on it and concentrate more in the training and in matches to grow as a player.', 'Jayant is a good player with ability as a defender, he should work more on his passing ability from the back under pressure (long & short passes).  Reading the game is highly significant, awareness and scanning on blind side has to be taken into consideration. Jayant\'s defensive heading should also be developed and he should work more on his defensive organisation as well and take more responsibilities on organising the defence line off the ball, his leadership quality can be better by being more vocal in the game by communicating effectively among his team mates with confidence to enhance his skillset as a defensive player. Jayant needs more work in his speed, agility and sprints for quick track backs and change of direction while defending. '),
(816, 816, 'Anand is in his development phase. He should work on his passing accuracy  from the back (long & short range). He should work more on his communication, awareness during play, defensive organisation and defensive Communication verbal and non verbal are vital for optimal performance as a defender. Anand has good work ethics, but to develop more he should put more effort on it and concentrate more in the training and in matches to grow as a player.', 'Anand is a good player with ability as a defender, he should work more on his passing ability from the back under pressure (long & short passes).  Reading the game is highly significant, awareness and scanning on blind side has to be taken into consideration. Anand\'s defensive heading should also be developed and he should work more on his defensive organisation as well and take more responsibilities on organising the defence line off the ball, his leadership quality can be better by being more vocal in the game by communicating effectively among his team mates with confidence to enhance his skillset as a defensive player.'),
(817, 817, 'Pavan is in his development phase. He should work on his passing accuracy  from the back (long & short range). He should work more on his communication, awareness during play, defensive organisation and defensive communication verbal and non verbal are vital for optimal performance as a defender. Pavan has good work ethics and needs to develop more by adding more effort on it and concentrate more in the training and in matches to grow as a player.', 'Pavan is a player with a good attitude in training and matches. He has to work on his defending transition which is his ability to take players 1v1 on the flank needs to improve by working more on his agility and sprinting. Pavan\'s long range passes needs to be improved where his vision on the pitch should be developed and awareness of the space, teammates and opponent should be observed by making many number of scans to find the team mates near and far from the ball as reference. Pavan needs to work on his communication skills to be an effective defender with added confidence. ');
INSERT INTO `ci_notes_from_coaching` (`id`, `forms_id`, `notes_frm_tech_dir`, `notes_frm_head_coach`) VALUES
(818, 818, 'Vivaan is a player who has good footballing sense, his ability to finish on the goal is good, but should work more on his strength and long range shooting, his defending transition needs to be improved where reading and tracking the ball after losing possession is of paramount importance. Vivaan needs to work on his speed, agility and sprints.', 'Vivaan is a hard working player. He should work on his 1 v 1 attacking and play more forward, he should learn to use his sprinting ability to beat the defender/opponent during duels to create chances to score. Vivaan should work on his position off the ball while defending, he should also work on his body coordination, passing (long & short range) which needs focused practice to improve the skillset required. '),
(819, 819, 'Preet is in his development phase. He should work more on his physicality and sprint. As a forward player he should also focus on his off the ball movement and find more space to attack and create goal scoring chances.', 'Preet is a player who has a good footballing sense, his ability to finish on the goal is good, but should work more on his strength and long range shooting technique, His defending transition needs to be improved since the behaviour and reaction when team loses the Ball is of paramount importance. Preet\'s work rate can be better but he should improve by working  more on it. As a striker he should also improve more on his ability to find the space and create goal scoring opportunities, and work more on his positioning & Speed. The physical assessment tests are marked as 0 or N/A since he was absent during the evaluations.'),
(820, 820, 'Shreyamsh is in his development phase. He should work on his basic football skills. He has to improve on his defending as well. Understanding of speed of thought & speed of play is very important towards game, having a good presense of mind is vital for decision making, with practice these football actions can be better.', 'Shreyamsh has a good physical and strength for his age. He should work more on his defending, scanning, defensive heading and long passes. He needs to be more calm and composed in the defense line. He has the ability to be a good  defender for his age if he works hard and keeps pushing himself in the training ground, Shreyamsh\'s communication skills should also be developed and try to lead the team from behind keeping the defense line compact. He is doing good and will improve more if he concentrates and follows coaching instructions with intent and hard work. '),
(821, 821, 'Dhyan is in his development phase. He has to develop the basic football skills of scanning and quick passes, his defending should also be improved, positioning on and off the ball should be the areas he should work on as a mid-field player. He should also focus on his speed, agility and sprints for quick runs and speed with the ball to create better goal scoring chances', 'Dhyan is a hard working player with a positive attitude towards training. He should focus more on improving his finishing and ball receiving technique, especially with aerial passes from the midfield and wingers. Dhyan needs to work on his decision-making skills regarding when to pass the ball and when to take on defenders, further distribute it to the best option available. Additionally, he should focus on improving his negative transition by working more on tracking back to help regain ball possession. We are happy with his progress and look forward to see his further development in the coming months'),
(822, 822, '', ''),
(823, 823, '', ''),
(824, 824, 'Shubh is a hard working player, He should work on his 1 v 1 attacking and learn to use his sprinting ability to beat the defender/opponent during duels. He should work on his position off the ball while defending since the behaviour of player when losing possession is of paramount importance, Shubh should work more on his speed, agility and sprinting to make the required runs to receive the ball under pressure to create chances on goal ', 'Shubh is a hardworking player who is constantly striving to improve his skills on the field. He needs to focus on improving his decision-making abilities both on and off the ball along with improving his technical abilities. Additionally, he should work on developing his non-dominant foot, which will make him a more versatile player. He should also improve his communication skills. Shubh needs to work more on his speed, agility and sprints to have effective gameplay as a winger. We look forward to see his further development in the coming months.'),
(825, 825, 'Narayan is in his development phase. He should work on his passing accuracy from the back ( long & short ). He should work more on his communication, awareness during play, defensive organization and defensive Communication verbal and non-verbal are vital.', 'Narayan has a great potential. He needs to improve his communication.  To further develop his skills and endurance, he needs more exposure to 9v9 football. Improving his fitness and learning how to perform under pressure will be crucial. He should focus on refining his long passes and long shots. Additionally, working on his motor skills, agility, quality of first touch, and ability to turn and receive the ball will enhance his overall game. Increasing his spatial awareness will also be beneficial. Overall, Naryan is a dedicated player with a positive attitude, and with targeted development, he has the potential to make a significant impact.'),
(826, 826, 'Harith is physically strong, but he needs more understanding of game situations, particularly when to step out or drop back. He tends to be reactive rather than proactive, which puts the defense under pressure. More experience and guidance will help sharpen his decision-making.', 'He should also focus on improving his communication with his defensive partners. A strong vocal presence can help organize the backline and prevent gaps from opening up. Developing his understanding of defensive positioning will make him more consistent in matches.'),
(827, 827, 'Swayam is in his development phase. He should work more on defending communication, 1v1 defending, scanning, and defensive heading. He should focus on his communication. He should also work on his sprinting actions and his long-range passing.', 'Swayam is in his developing phase. He has a good right foot technique & he has a good understanding of the game. He needs to be exposed more to 9 V 9 football as he has good potential to develop his skills and endurance. However, he needs to work on his fitness, needs to learn how to play under pressure, and work on his long passes and long shots. Overall a coachable player and has the potential to progress.'),
(828, 828, 'Karthikeya should be more calm and composed in the defense line. He can be a good defender for his age if he works hard and keeps pushing himself in the training ground. His communication skills should also be developed and try to lead the team from behind. He is doing good and will improve more if he concentrates follows coaching instructions and keeps working hard. ', 'Karthikeya must focus on improving his fitness and learning to play effectively under pressure. He should also work on his long passes and long shots to enhance his game. As a coachable player, he has great potential for progress. To further develop, he should concentrate on his motor skills, agility, and the quality of his first touch, as well as improving his ability to turn and receive the ball. Increasing his spatial awareness will also be beneficial. Overall, Karthikeya is a dedicated player with a positive attitude, and with continued effort, he can achieve significant growth. '),
(829, 829, 'Aaron is in his development phase. He should work more on his physicality and sprint. As a forward player he should also focus on his off the ball movement and find more space to attack and create goal scoring changes.', 'Aaron is in his developing phase. He has a good right foot technique & he has a good understanding of the game. He needs to be exposed more to 9 V 9 football as he has good potential to develop his skills and endurance. He Needs to learn to play under pressure and work on long passes and long shots. However, he needs to work on his fitness, He needs to work on his motor skills, agility, quality of first touch, and turning/receiving needs more spatial awareness. He is overall a dedicated player with a good positive attitude.'),
(830, 830, '', ''),
(831, 831, '', ''),
(832, 832, '', ''),
(833, 833, '', ''),
(834, 834, 'Divyam is in his development phase. He should work more on his defending communication, 1v1 defending, scanning and defensive heading. He should focus on his communication. He should also work on his sprinting actions and his long range passing.', 'Divyam is a player with good footballing sense. He should work on his passing accuracy  from the back (long & short ranges). Divyam should work more on his communication, awareness during play, defensive organisation and defensive communication verbal and non verbal which are vital for optimal performance as a defender. Divyam has good work ethics, but to develop more he should put more effort on it and concentrate more in the training and in matches to grow as a defensive player who can lead the team from the back. The Performance testing results show 0 or N/A since Divyam was not present during the assessments.'),
(835, 835, 'Prathyum is in his development phase. He has to work on his defending ability to take players 1v1 on the flank by working more on his agility and sprinting. Prathyum\'s long range passes needs to be improved where his vision of the pitch, awareness of the space, teammates and opponent should be observed by making many number of scans to find the team mates near and far from the ball as reference and it should be developed. ', 'Prathyum is a player with a good attitude in training and matches. He should work on his passing accuracy from the back (long & short range). He should work more on his communication, awareness during play, defensive organisation and defensive communication both verbal and non verbal which are vital for optimal performance as a defender, he has good work ethics and needs to develop more by adding more effort on it and concentrate more in the training and in matches to grow as a player. Prathyum needs to work on leading the defensive line and keep the defending effective with confident commands and communicating with team mates, he needs to work on his communication skills and be more confident in his abilities to be an effective defender with added confidence. The performance values show 0 or N/A since Prathyum was not present during the respective performance testing. '),
(836, 836, 'Vihaan is in his development phase, he is a promising player with a good attacking sense and needs to improve his dribbling, shooting, and sprinting to create more goal-scoring opportunities, but he must prioritize regular attendance, having missed 80% of sessions this season.', 'Vihaan is developing as a winger with potential, he is fast on the ball and should focus on improving his dribbling, chance creation, shooting, sprinting, and negative transitions, while prioritizing regular attendance, as he has been largely absent this season. \r\nPS: Vihaan was absent for the physical assessments. '),
(837, 837, 'Shlok has demonstrated significant commitment and focus during training, which has enhanced his performance in competitive games. He maintains a positive attitude and is eager to contribute to his team\'s defense or offense. Nevertheless, he is still in the process of developing and can improve in managing the runs and movements of speedy opponents in space. His defensive headers need refinement, as he should aim to make contact with the ball at its highest point. Overall a brilliant hard working athlete to work with.', 'Shlok has a Great tactical awareness and positioning make this wing-back a solid defensive asset, especially when reading the game and controlling spaces. However, when faced with fast wingers or long balls over the top, his pace and aerial challenges can sometimes fall short. With more focus on speed and timing, he could become an even more complete player. Shlok has contributed significantly to the attacking parts of the KSFA competition, making him quite effective.'),
(838, 838, 'Rishaan is a highly positive, hardworking &  a team player. His reading of the game has improved a lot in the 11v11 matches. He can be better in defensive transitions. However he is a big asset to the KSFA Squad team.', 'Rishaan is a highly creative and technically gifted attacking midfielder with an very good vision for unlocking defense. His ability to make decisive passes and dribble through tight spaces stands out. However, his physicality and defensive transitions could use improvement, as they sometimes struggle when tracking back or dealing with high-intensity situations. We also tried him as a winger, and he performed very well at the KSFA Games. The values for the assessment recordings show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(839, 839, 'Dhanin is in his development phase & is a quick learner of the game. His ability to play long balls & switch play gains him an advantage, however he can be more accurate with it as he progresses.He has to play with confidence & decision making under defensive transitions can be much effective. Overall a brilliant athlete to work with. ', 'Dhanin is a technically gifted center-back and can also play central midfielder with a strong ability to play long balls accurately, often initiating attacks with precision. However, he lacks confidence when under pressure in defensive situations and during defensive transitions. With more composure in high-stress moments, he could become more reliable and dominant in both phases of play.'),
(840, 840, 'Jonah has shown immense growth & improvement in his game. He is a team player, displaying strong will power & effort during his matches. He can be better in tracking speedy wingers & be more vocal & communicative towards his teammates.\r\n', 'Jonah is a right wing-back who consistently exceeds expectations both defensively and offensively, always offering support in attack and working hard to cover defensive gaps. While his effort and versatility are commendable, he can struggle when faced with fast players or dealing with long balls, often finding it tough to recover in those situations.'),
(841, 841, 'Sahanya is still in his early stages of development and is making good game progress. His signature move has been running with the ball, which he loves the most, and it is to his teams advantage as he demonstrates, cut backs, crosses very effectively. He can improve his defensive transitions and consistently show up for training.', 'Sahanya is a right winger with excellent technique, often surprising defenders with strong runs down the flanks, cutbacks, and powerful long shots. However, he struggles to anticipate defensive movements and need to improve his defensive transitions, ensuring his contribute more when the team is out of possession, he must maintain consistency in attending trainings which will help him to contribute more at a high level throughout the game. The values for the assessment recordings show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(842, 842, 'Mehul plays as a left winger and also has the ability to function as a left full back. His key strengths include his technical skills and goal-scoring ability. Nonetheless, he could enhance his game by improving his attacking and defensive transitions, recognizing key moments, and reading the game more quickly, which would undoubtedly raise his performance levels.', 'Mehul is a left winger with excellent technical skills and a knack for surprising opponents with long-range shots. However, he could improve in anticipating offensive movements and refining his first touch. Additionally, focusing on defensive transitions would make him a more complete player, contributing on both ends of the pitch.'),
(843, 843, 'Saarthak plays as a left center-back and has made significant progress since last season. His increasing confidence is evident in his performances. He could enhance his ability to handle aerial balls in open spaces and should focus on improving his speed and agility. Additionally, he should work on utilizing his right foot more during both training and matches.', 'Saarthak is a left center-back with a unique ability to find teammates in half spaces, often creating attacking opportunities with well-timed passes. He also surprise with occasional long-range shots. However, his defensive awareness could be improved, as he sometimes struggle to anticipate threats and position themselves effectively in high-pressure situations.'),
(844, 844, 'Karthik is an extremely crafty player we have in our team.He is technically &  tactically  sound, which gives him an edge over his opponents.He can be better in aerial duels & dealing with speedy wingers, though he manages a lot of time, through his brilliant sense of positioning.', 'Karthik is a skilled left-footed wing-back with excellent tactical awareness, often contributing both defensively and offensively. His understanding of positioning and game flow is impressive. However, he can struggle when dealing with long balls, especially when forced into aerial duels or dealing with direct, long-range attacks. He has to improve at maintaining a steady performance.'),
(845, 845, 'Tharun has been developing very effectively now as a Striker, with dribbling & shooting being his strength.He is very dominant with his left foot, in set piece situations & pose threat to opponent goal.However he can improve on his agility, quick turns & defensive transitions.', 'Tharun Having moved from winger to striker with ease, he brings technical skill and inventiveness to the game, especially in set-piece situations. his ability to craft chances and link up play is impressive. However, his defensive transitions and work rate can be improved, often leaving them more focused on offensive duties than contributing to defensive phases.'),
(846, 846, 'Shashank is a centre-back who through training has stepped his game level.He has to display leadership skills in defense, guiding his teammates through effective communication. His composure under pressure situation gives him an edge, his maturity towards the game decision making  has been improved.', 'Shashank is a center-back who excels in staying calm and composed under pressure, providing solid defensive stability. However, he needs to improve his communication on the field, taking more responsibility in organizing the defensive line. Being more vocal and maintaining consistent performance throughout the match will help elevate his impact and strengthen the defense.'),
(847, 847, 'Advik is an evolving defensive midfielder with a reasonable aons. Hobility to read the game. His technical and tactical skills could see considerable improvement if he consistently attends training sessiwever, he has significant potential if he focuses on his game awareness and communication to develop into a more formidable defensive midfielder.', 'Advik is a defensive midfielder with strong technical skills and a knack for surprising with attacking moments. his ability to anticipate offensive movements and manage defensive transitions is impressive. However, to become more effective, he must maintain consistency in attending trainings which will help him to  contribute more at a high level throughout the game.'),
(848, 848, 'Shreyas is in his development phase. Alchemy has exposed him to high-intensity football, where his ability to make snap decisions both with and without the ball is crucial.\r\nHe could advance to the next stage with optimal potential if he can control his emotions during practice sessions and competition. He could also be more consistent in his crossing deliveries & timing of tackle. He is on the right track.', 'Shreyas is a player who can play in the right wing with an exceptional work rate, consistently contributing both defensively and offensively. However, he does struggle in the final third, particularly with delivering balanced crosses. Working on his crossing technique and managing emotions during high-pressure moments will help him become more effective in key attacking situations. He is consistent and hardworking with positive attitude during training and matches.'),
(849, 849, 'Siddhartha is in the development phase and is a coachable player who is willing to listen and follow instructions. To further enhance his game, he must improve technically and tactically. Increasing his awareness of space and decision-making under pressure will be crucial, as will learning to release the ball faster when better options are available. He should focus on developing his motor skills, agility, and the quality of his first touch, along with improving his ability to turn and receive the ball with greater spatial awareness. Additionally, working on his weaker foot and overall strength will benefit his overall development. With dedication and effort,  Siddhartha has the potential to become a more effective player on the field.', 'Siddhartha displays a good attitude. He should work more on the football aspect of the game, his passing and receiving under pressure situations must be better. As a striker, he should work on his attacking skills, such as 1 v 1, shots on target, and finishing techniques. He should also work on scanning, maintaining the defending shape, and communication skills. He should also work more on his vision and play more forward, positive ( attacking ) passes in the match. Sprinting should also be developed, as should his body coordination.'),
(850, 850, 'Lokshith is in his development phase. He should work on his basics of quick passing, dribbling and decision making skills. He has to improve on his transitional gameplay where understanding of speed of thought & speed of play is very important towards game and player behavior in these situations is crucial in matches, he is hardworking and is progressing with consistency ', 'Lokshith is a player with good potential. Improving his fitness will be crucial, as well as learning how to perform under pressure. He should focus on refining his long passes and long shots. Additionally, working on his quickness, agility, quality of first touch with both dominant and non dominant foot is required. The ability to turn and receive the ball will enhance his overall game. Increasing his spatial awareness will also be beneficial. Overall, Lokshith is a dedicated player with a positive attitude, and with targeted development, he has the potential to make a significant impact.  '),
(851, 851, 'Anish is a player with good football sense, his ability to finish on the goal is good, he needs to work more on his power generation for long range passes and shots which will develop with practice and age, his defending transition needs to be improved where the behaviour and reaction of a player when team loses the ball is of paramount importance, as a winger Anish can improve more on his ability to find the space and create goal scoring opportunities, and work more on his positioning, speed and agility.', 'Anish is a player with good basics having a strong foundation of passing and movement ahead, good ability to shoot and finish on goal, Anish can further work in improving his speed with and without the ball, providing runs to attack with more aggression and quickly break the opponent\'s defense lines with faster pace, Anish can also improve in his communication for the runs made to demand the ball with confidence for the space created to make an attempt on goal, overall a player with good progress and eagerness to learn and improve, the performence values show 0.00 since he was not present for the performence testing '),
(852, 852, 'Renaud is in his development phase and is a player with positive mentality, he needs to work on the technical aspects of 1v1 attacking play and work on the transitions, since the behavior of player on losing ball possession is of great importance, he is hardworking and consistent, looking forward to seeing the progress in the forthcoming seasons', 'Renaud is a highly coachable player who demonstrates a strong willingness to listen and follow instructions. He possesses solid football techniques and excels in his role as a Winger. However, there are a few areas for development. At times, he commits to tackles that aren’t necessary, so focusing on better decision-making will be beneficial. Additionally, improving his awareness of space and emotional control under pressure will enhance his performance. To further his growth, Renaud needs to gain a deeper understanding of the 9-a-side football format. He consistently shows a positive attitude and discipline during training, which sets a great example for his teammates. His leadership quality can be better. With continued effort and focus, Renaud has the potential to become an efficient player. '),
(853, 853, 'Abhishak is in his development phase, he has been a consistent and a strong defender, he can further improve in refining his decision making as to when to take on a player and when to delay and time the tackles, not committing towards the approaching ball and reading the nature of the movement of the ball and the opponent is vital for a defensive player, he is consistent in his efforts and is on the right track ', 'Abhishak is a player with good vision and knowledge in his positional play, he has improved in strength in his tackles and playing the ball grounded or in aerial manner away from the goal, his aerial passes have been improved and he has good support play on making a pass, he can further improve his timing of tackles and having more involvement in communicating from the back and lead the team, he needs to work on his negative transition and quickly anticipating the moves of the opponent and tracking is vital to win the ball possession, he is hardworking and consistent in his efforts, overall a coachable player with positive attitude in training and matches, the performance values show 0.00 since he was not present during the testing  '),
(854, 854, 'Nivaan is in his development phase and is a player who displays positive attitude in training and matches, he needs to work on the technical aspects of developing quickness with and without the ball since change of direction is vital for keeping the ball possession and create goal scoring chances, he is on the right track towards development and is a player with good football knowledge', 'Nivaan has a great potential. He needs to improve his communication. To further develop his skills and endurance, he needs more exposure in 9v9 football. Improving his fitness is crucial at this age with highly intense matches which demands performance to be highly optimal. He should focus on refining his long passes and long shots. Additionally, working on his motor skills, agility, quality of first touch, and ability to turn and receive the ball will enhance his overall game. Overall, Nivaan is a dedicated player with a positive attitude, and with targeted development, he has the potential to make a significant impact.  '),
(855, 855, 'Mridhul is in his develpment phase and is a player with eagerness to learn more, he needs to work on the technical aspects of long range passing and shooting, he also needs to work on the physicality of the game where being strong footed and strength in shooting and passing is of vital importance for a defensive player, overall a player with good potential and is hard working ', 'Mridhul is a player with positive attitude & has better understanding of the game. He needs to be exposed more in 9 V 9 football as he has the potential to develop his skills and endurance. He can be a good defender for his age if he works hard and keeps pushing himself in the training ground. He needs to learn to play under pressure and work on long passes and long shots. His fitness in terms of quick motor skills, agility, quality of first touch, turning/receiving, and spatial awareness needs to be refined further to perform optimally. Overall, he is a dedicated and coachable player'),
(856, 856, 'Neerav is a player with good footballing sense and is a team player, he has good ability to make quick passes and move ahead with quick attacking play, he can further improve in more power generation in his long range passes and shots which will develop with time and practice, Neerav needs to work in his negative transition where the behavior of a player on losing the ball is of paramount importance, he is on the right track of development ', 'Neerav is a player with a good ability to pass and support, he is quick and decisive in making accurate passes to players in a better option, Neerav can further improve in providing quick runs into free spaces to enhance quick attacks to create goal scoring chances, he can also improve in taking more shots to have more aggressive approach to score goals, also he needs to be quick to track back and help in defense which is of great importance off the ball, overall a player who can play in more than one position and is hardworking and consistent '),
(857, 857, 'Ashwin is in his development phase, He has the potential to be a strong defender for his age and he continues to work hard and push himself in training, he needs to develop his communication skills to lead the team from behind; he needs to work on his sprinting ability and change of direction, with focus and adherence to coaching instructions, he will continue to improve and is on the right track ', 'Ashwin has good physical strength for his age and, with continued hard work, has the potential to become a strong defender. To improve, he should focus on refining his defending skills, scanning the field, defensive heading, and long passes. Additionally, he should work on staying calm and composed in the defense line, while also developing his communication skills to lead the team from behind. By concentrating on coaching instructions and consistently pushing himself in training, he will continue to improve. Overall, Ashwin is a player with the right mindset, and with the right support and training, he has a lot of potential to develop into an effecient player.'),
(858, 858, 'Akhilan is in his development phase, he has to develop the quick passing skills to pass and support further to create goal scoring chances, his defending should also be improved where his positioning on and off the ball should be the areas needs to be worked on. He can further improve on his quick sprints and provide support for the attacks to create chances on goal, he is on the right track of development ', 'Akhilan is a hard working player with a positive attitude towards training, he should focus more on improving his finishing and ball receiving technique, especially with aerial passes from the midfield and wingers. Akhilan needs to work on his decision-making skills regarding when to pass the ball and when to take on defenders further distribute it to the best option available. Additionally, he should focus on improving his negative transition by working more on tracking back to help regain ball possession. We are happy with his progress and look forward to see his further development in the coming seasons'),
(859, 859, 'Aaron is in his development phase, he has shown good improvement so far and has improved in being a good attacking player, he needs to work on his 1v1 further to take on players on the wings and create chances through crosses and take more shots on target, he needs to work on his negative transition where the behavior of player on losing ball possession is of great importance, Aaron is working consistently and progressing with hard work ', 'Aaron is a player with positive attitude to work hard and improve, he has improved in terms of being aggresssive and apply pressure to win the ball possession as a forward  and he has good power on his shots which has developed and he can further improve in building more accuracy with shooting and long range passing, he can further improve in providing quick runs and take on players 1v1 on the wings to create goal scoring chances, overall a player with consistent efforts and is a team player'),
(860, 860, 'Shreyas has good ability to play accurate passes, he needs to further improve in his quick receives away from the opponents and aerial ball control, he needs to work in his defensive transitions and be quick in getting back into shape, a player with good efforts during training and matches', 'Shreyas is a player with good football knowledge, he needs to work on his awareness of space and quickly move for support and distribute the ball to create goal scoring chances, he can further work in his aerial passing technique for better attacking gameplay through crosses and set-pieces, working on agility and change of direction will enhance his gameplay as a midfield or defensive player especially when losing ball possession and getting back into shape, a player with positive attitude in training and matches. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(861, 861, 'Tharun has shown promising qualities and has made a positive impact in competitive matches, particularly in attack, his development pathway will benefit from a stronger focus on defensive responsibilities and overall balance in his game. By improving his contribution in both attacking and defensive phases, and maintaining the right mindset to challenge himself consistently, he can develop into a well-rounded and complete player.', 'Tharun is a player with high potential and has performed well during the Junior League, contributing positively to the team’s progress, especially in attacking phases. To become a more complete player, he needs to take greater responsibility in his defensive duties and maintain consistency in both phases of the game. It’s important that he continues to push himself beyond his comfort zone and strive to play to his full potential. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments'),
(862, 862, 'Reyansh is in his development phase, he needs to work on his negative transition where the behavior of a player to close down the opponent\'s attack on losing ball possession is vital for a defensive player, Reyansh has shown significant improvement as compared to earlier and is more confident with matches, he is on the right track of player development ', 'Reyansh is a player with much eagerness to learn and grow, he has shown great improvement in terms of closing in on the opponent when off-possession and has good timing on his tackles, Reyansh can further improve in his positive transition where he can take the player on in 1v1 situations and move ahead for crosses to provide goal scoring chances, Reyansh has impoved in his long range passes and mainly set-pieces, he can further build more accuracy with practice to control the weight on the aerial passes, he needs to focus on his change of direction and quick sprints that help him in tracking back. Overall a coachable player with positive attitude in training and matches with great potential to be a defensive player and a midfielder.'),
(863, 863, 'Steve is showing signs of development this season, particularly in his understanding of the game. As a defender, he has to keep improving his defensive principles and communication from the backline. He has become more comfortable on the ball, especially when playing out from the back. However, there is still work to be done in terms of his defensive transition and reaction speed. Overall, he has made noticeable improvements, with room for further growth.', 'Steve continues to maintain a positive attitude towards learning and improvement, even in the face of mistakes. His strong mindset, self-belief, and commitment to progress have been evident throughout the season. He has made significant strides in his understanding of the game and his role as a defender. His 1v1 defending has improved, though consistency in these situations remains an area for growth. Steve has also shown promising leadership and communication skills in the field. However, he still needs to focus on improving his coordination and sprinting ability to further enhance his overall performance.'),
(864, 864, 'Ansh has consistently maintained a positive attitude and shown notable improvement in his positional role and responsibilities. He has made significant strides in both his positive and negative transitions. His sprinting ability, both with and without the ball, has improved, as has his technical execution. However, there is still room for further development in these areas.', 'Ansh continues to strive for improvement and a deeper understanding of the game. We\'ve seen significant progress in his grasp of his positional roles and responsibilities, and he works hard to execute them. His confidence has grown, and he has started to show leadership qualities. His attacking instincts are improving, along with his defending abilities. Overall, we are pleased with the progress he has made so far. He was not present for the assessment. '),
(865, 865, 'Abhinav has been gradually developing his understanding of his position and the game. He has shown progress in both his positive and negative transitions and demonstrates a good ability to get into favorable positions during the attacking phase. Additionally, his defending capabilities have improved. However, he still needs to focus on refining his long-range passing and building his physical strength, especially considering his age group.', 'Abhinav has been making steady progress and continues to demonstrate strong qualities as a team player. He maintains a positive attitude during training and matches and shows good adaptability across different situations. While there has been noticeable improvement in his technical ability, further development in his mental agility, physical attributes, and decision-making will help enhance his overall effectiveness on the pitch. He possesses good crossing ability and regularly positions himself well during attacking phases. Abhinav was not present for the assessments.'),
(866, 866, 'Kanishk is showing positive signs of improvement and is gradually gaining a better understanding of his roles and responsibilities, both with and without the ball in his position. His decision-making and link-up play with other attacking players need further development. While he regularly gets into good attacking positions, his finishing could also improve. Additionally, Kanishk needs to work on enhancing his sprinting abilities.', 'Kanishk is a player with a positive attitude, consistently demonstrating a strong desire to improve and maintaining a solid work ethic for his team. His 1v1 ability is progressing well, but he needs to enhance his decision-making after the action is complete. He should also focus on taking more long-range shots, improving the speed of his dribbles, and refining his finishing inside and also from outside the penalty area. Additionally, he can work on improving his aerial attacking abilities. Overall, Kanishk is a positive player with a strong attitude toward learning, and he is constantly making gradual progress.'),
(867, 867, 'Ranjiv has been developing well, showing improvement in his tactical, technical, and game understanding. He has a strong work ethic and a clear understanding of his roles and responsibilities as a striker. His 1v1 ability, shooting, and finishing skills have all improved. However, he still needs to focus on enhancing his sprinting ability. Overall, we are pleased with the progress he has made so far.', 'Ranjiv has shown improvement in his game understanding and positional awareness. He consistently strives to learn during training and matches and has made notable progress in emotional control, remaining more focused on the game. His technical abilities continue to improve, though he still needs to work on his sprinting ability. Significantly, his negative transitions have also improved.'),
(868, 868, 'Soham has shown signs of improvement in his tactical understanding and technical ability. He can enhance his performance with quicker execution in 1v1 situations, crossing from wide areas, and his decision-making. His stamina and endurance levels have also improved, and he consistently maintains a high work ethic during transitions. However, he still needs to focus on improving his sprinting and shooting ability.', 'Soham is showing positive signs of improvement in his technical and tactical understanding and demonstrates a strong work ethic, his endurance and stamina levels have improved. Although we have seen his 1v1 attacking, dribbling, and crossing ability improve, he still needs to focus on sharpening his speed of thought and speed of play in these situations.  Overall he shows a positive attitude to keep learning and improving.  '),
(869, 869, 'Vihaan is in his development stage and has shown promise. His attitude in both training and matches is commendable, and he consistently demonstrates a strong work rate and work ethic. To continue his growth, he should focus on enhancing his game knowledge, 1v1 dribbling ability, pace, speed of play, and decision-making. Regular attendance at training sessions will also be essential for his continued development.', 'Vihaan is a good player with potential. He has a strong attacking sense and ability, although consistency is an area for improvement. He has made progress in both his negative and positive transitions and should continue to refine his technical skills and stamina to improve decision-making and execution on the field. His work ethic and work rate during training and matches are commendable, he should focus on boosting his stamina and endurance for sustained performance. Additionally, regular attendance at training sessions will be crucial for his continued development. Vihaan was not present for assessment. '),
(870, 870, 'Anirudh is in his development phase, he has shown improvement in terms of his defensive transitions and has made impact in the matches, he can further improve in his speed off the ball to press for the ball and to provide runs to support which is vital for a forward player to perform optimally and create goal scoring chances, we are pleased with the progress he has made so far', 'Anirudh is a player with patience and has keen interest to learn and improve, he has shown good improvement in terms of protecting the ball while in possession and carry out the attacks further, his finishing and vision of passing the ball to set it for a shot to the midfield players has been improved which is an important role of a forward player to create goal scoring chances, Anirudh can further improve in his runs without the ball and improve in finishing with more power on the shots and have more effective shots to create goal scoring chances, overall a player with good attitude and progress with consistency  '),
(871, 871, 'Vihaan is in his development phase, he needs to work on his basics of quick dribbling, passing and shooting skills and have good and confident communication in terms of providing the runs and asking confidently for the ball to carry out the attacks to create goal scoring chances which is vital for a forward player his age, he is hardworking and consistent ', 'Vihaan is a player with patience and positive attitude in training, he has improved in terms of timing of tackles and winning ball possession while off the ball, he can further improve in quick passing and recieiving gameplay which is the most important to match the game intensity at his age, he can also improve in communicating for the ball while making a run towards the free space where the movement is utilised towards making an effective attack to create goal scoring chance, Vihaan is improving and we need to be patient and give him time to learn and improve '),
(872, 872, 'Jai is a player with good potential, he needs to work on the technical aspects of work on receiving away from the opponents and decide quickly to distribute the ball further which will dictate the match intensity, he needs to work hard on his runs towards free space and communicate to demand for the ball to create goal scoring chances, he is improving and is consistent in his efforts', 'Jai is a player with positive attitude in training, he has improved in quick movements with the ball and dribble into spaces to make a good attack, he can further improve in quick passing play and create chances on goal, he needs to work more on generating power on the shots and long range passes which will develop overtime with practice, he needs to work on quick tracking back which is of much importance, overall a coachable player with eagerness to grow and improve '),
(873, 873, 'Shivang is a player with good potential, he needs to work on the technical aspects of work on receiving away from the opponents and decide quickly to distribute the ball further which will dictate the match intensity, he needs to work hard on his quick runs towards free space and communicate to demand for the ball to create goal scoring chances, he is improving and is consistent in his efforts ', 'Shivang is a player with positive attitude in training and matches, he needs to improve his communication skills and demand the ball more often, he needs to work on the quick recieving and distribution of passing gameplay, he needs to work on the physicality of the game where being strong footed and strength in shooting and passing is of vital importance, overall a player with good potential and is hard working to improve with consistency, the body composition shows 0.00 since he was not present for the testing '),
(874, 874, 'Mahimna is currently in his development phase, and while he has shown dedication and enthusiasm, there are several areas he needs to focus on to progress further. His foundational football skills, especially in defending, need significant improvement. His positioning both on and off the ball requires better awareness and consistency, particularly in defensive transitions. Additionally, Mahimna should aim to enhance his speed, agility, and sprinting ability to cover more ground effectively. These aspects are critical for his growth as a well-rounded player', 'Mahimna is a committed and passionate player who consistently strives to improve his skills. His dedication on the training ground is commendable, but to take his game to the next level, he needs to refine his decision-making both on and off the ball. Advancing his technical skills will help him become more effective in tight situations. A key focus should be on improving his non-dominant foot, as this will increase his versatility and allow him to be more unpredictable in attack. The performance values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments '),
(875, 875, 'Vedant has the technical ability but needs to improve his ball control under pressure. He should focus on improving his passing consistency, particularly in tight spaces. His positioning defensively can be better, especially during counterattacks. Speed and agility should be a focus for him', 'Vedant is a dedicated and passionate player. His decision-making in key moments can be sharper, and he needs to improve his communication with teammates on the field. Developing his weaker foot will add versatility, and improving his positioning in defensive transitions will help him be more effective, the assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments '),
(876, 876, 'Tejas demonstrates good technical ability, but his ball control under pressure and passing accuracy need improvement. He needs to focus on his positioning, especially defensively, and his ability to track and intercept balls. Increasing his agility and sprinting capabilities will improve his overall game.', 'Tejas brings creativity to the field and shows a lot of potential. His decision-making in the attacking third is generally strong, but he must continue to focus on improving his defensive discipline. Increasing his physicality and resilience will help him compete at higher levels. We’re looking forward to seeing Tejas build on his strengths and evolve as a player, the assessment values show 0.00 since he was not prsent for the assessments  '),
(877, 877, 'Aarit is in his development phase, he has improved in his defending gameplay, he can further improve in his positive transition gaeplay by pushing the team up the field to create more pressure onto the build up, he can communicate further and organize the setpieces defending and lead the team, he is on the right track of development an d is a hardworking player', 'Aarit is a player with consistent efforts and hard work to perform for the team, he has shown great improvement in terms of his defending skills, he can further improve in confident delivery of passes on winning the ball where the behavior of a player on winning the ball possession is of great importance to carry out the attack which dictates the tempo of the gameplay, Aarit needs to be quick and decisive to release the ball and engage the team in a quick counter to create a goal scoring opportunity from the back, he is consistent and strives to improve, we are pleased to see his progress ');
INSERT INTO `ci_notes_from_coaching` (`id`, `forms_id`, `notes_frm_tech_dir`, `notes_frm_head_coach`) VALUES
(878, 878, 'Alvin is a player with good football sense and is with a good fundamental skillset of passing and dribbling, he can further improve in making quick runs into the free spaces and communicate for the ball where the creating of options for a forward and midfield player is vital during an attacking play, Alvin is good physically and has improved his defensive gameplay, he is on the right track of development ', 'Alvin is a player with consistent efforts and performance in training and matches, he has shown good improvement in terms of accurate passes in both long and short range, he has improved in handling intense match situations and can be quick to provide a positive outcome under pressure, he can further improve in communicating with his team by providing quick runs in attacking situations and create goal scoring chances, he can also improve in his consistency of taking more shots on target which tests the opponent goalkeeper, overall a coachable player with good understanding to the instructions given and is consistent in both training and matches '),
(879, 879, 'Ahaan is in the developmental stage and consistently demonstrates a positive attitude. He shows a strong willingness to learn and enhance his understanding of the game and his specific role. He desires to grow but needs to continue working on key technical aspects such as ball manipulation, scanning, passing, receiving in tight spaces, and shooting techniques. Overall, his attitude is positive, and he remains eager to improve.\r\n', 'Ahaan is in his development phase and is steadily gaining a solid understanding of his role and responsibilities within his position. We\'ve observed a noticeable increase in his confidence during both training sessions and matches. He demonstrates a strong work ethic, and his eagerness to learn—regularly asking questions and seeking guidance from the coach—is highly commendable. To sustain his progress, Ahaan should continue refining his technical skills, particularly in passing, receiving, shooting, scanning, and the speed of play.'),
(880, 880, 'Aaryaman is in his development phase and continues to show steady progress. He has improved his reading of the game and now needs to become more comfortable on the ball. While he demonstrates a solid understanding of his role, he should continue refining his technical abilities, including short and long passes, decision-making, and communication, to maintain his development. Overall, Aaryaman has a positive attitude toward learning and shows great potential for further growth.', 'Aaryaman continues to demonstrate a positive attitude in both training and matches. He has developed a stronger understanding of the game, his position, and his responsibilities. However, he still needs to refine his technical abilities to become more comfortable on the ball. As a wingback, he should focus on advancing into more attacking roles. In addition to improving his 1v1 defending, he needs to work on his attacking skills, particularly delivering more crosses and taking shots on goal.\r\nPS: Aarayman was absent for the yoyo testing. '),
(881, 881, 'Abhinav is in his development phase and is showing promising signs of progress. He needs to continue refining his technical abilities, particularly in 1v1 defending, defensive positioning, and communication. He possesses good sprinting and recovery when he is off the ball, and it’s important for him to keep building on this strength to enhance his overall game.', 'Abhinav is showing gradual progress in both training and matches. He needs to continue refining his technical abilities and understanding of the game. Specifically, he should focus on improving his defensive positioning, communication, and becoming more comfortable with the ball from the back line. His strong sprinting and recovery abilities are key strengths that will play an important role in his development and overall performance. He is striving hard and is consistent in his efforts both in training and matches'),
(882, 882, 'Eden is in his development phase and has shown steady improvement in his football skills. His work rate during training and matches has also increased, though he should aim to be more consistent in attending sessions. He possesses a strong attacking sense and is making progress in his negative transitions. Eden has a good long-range shooting ability and should look to take more opportunities to shoot. However, his decision-making, along with the speed of thought and play, still requires development to take his game to the next level.', 'Eden has consistently demonstrated a positive attitude in both training and matches, with noticeable improvements in his work ethic. His willingness to improve and perform better is evident. His technical skills, particularly in passing and ball manipulation, have been progressing well. However, there is still room for growth in his decision-making, as well as in the speed of his thought and speed of play. Eden possesses a strong long-range shooting ability and is also effective in set-piece situations, which are key strengths in his game.'),
(883, 883, 'Ayansh is in his development phase, and we’re seeing promising signs of progress. He has a lot of potential and has built a solid foundation, with plenty of room for further improvement. To continue his development, he should focus on refining his technical abilities, particularly his 1v1 dribbling skills, speed of thought, and speed of play. Overall, he maintains a positive attitude and a strong willingness to learn.', 'Ayansh is in his development phase and has shown notable progress. He is a talented player, but he needs to continue working hard to enhance his technical abilities and overall performance. He should work on becoming more aware of space and time during matches, as well as improving his 1v1 dribbling skills, speed of thought and speed of play. While he remains a good finisher, refining these areas will help him develop a more consistent approach. Ayansh has a strong understanding of the game and a positive attitude toward learning and continuous improvement.'),
(884, 884, 'Hashir has improve in terms of his ball manipulation and dribbling ability, he can further improve in taking first touch away from the opponents by protecting the ball which is vital for a midfield player and a winger, he is disciplined and consistent in his efforts and is improving ', 'Hashir is a player with positive attitude in training and matches, he has improved in his dribbling and pass deliveries, he needs to get used to dealing with the ball under pressure and he further improve in delivering long range passes with more accuracy which will develop overtime with practice, he can also improve in his shooting accuracy to create more goal scoring chances, he is a player with a positive attitude towards working hard and improving, we are pleased to see his progress '),
(885, 885, 'Saarthak is in his development phase, he has improved in his quick passing gameplay, he can further improve in his 1v1 game in both attacking and defending, since the behavior of a player on losing or winning the ball posession is of vital importance for a player his age, he needs to further work on his quick sprints onto the wings and demand for the ball to create goal scoring chances', 'Saarthak is a player with positive attitude in training and matches, he has shown good improvement in his passing and support play on the wings, he needs to further develop his shooting technique with more power and accuracy which will test the opponent keeper and create goal scoring chances, he needs to work on his crossing where playing the ball to the opponent\'s goal area to create chances is vital for a winger, he needs to demand for the ball and communicate whenever free during the attack, overall a player with eagerness to develop and works hard to improve'),
(886, 886, 'Jayant is in his development phase, he has improved in his physicality and has strong tackles, he needs to further improve in his quick change of direction in transitions and track back quickly which is a vital role of a defensive player, he needs to work on his speed and agility, he is on the right track ', 'Jayant has shown improvement in terms of confidently facing the opponents and has been good on the ball while attacking and distributing passes during the build up, he needs to further improve in his timing of the tackles by reading the ball, he needs to work on delivering aerial passes with accuracy and direction, he needs to work on his speed and agility by being consistent and improve his work rate which the games demand, he is willing to work hard and is positive towards improvement. The values for the assessment recordings show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(887, 887, 'Abhishek is in his development phase, he has improved in his quick gameplay of recieve and pass, he needs to work on his quick transitions from attacking to defence since the behavior of the players on losing ball possession is vital for his age, he needs to work on his speed and endurance which is required for high intensity games, he needs to further work on his change of direction with and without the ball ', 'Abhishek has shown improvement in his gameplay with quick dribbles away from the opponent, he needs to further work on his quick finishing by scanning the keeper position since the ability to finish quick in the goal area is vital for a forward player, he needs to work on his aerial ball control and long range passing which is most important for a winger, he needs to work on the mentioned aspects with consistency taking in the coaches guidence to enhance his performance '),
(888, 888, 'Varun is in his development phase, he has improved in his turning ability and delivering quick passes, he needs to work on his negative transition where the behavior of a player on losing ball possession is of great importance especially in high intensity situations, he needs to work on his quick runs and change of direction', 'Varun is a player with good footballing knowledge, his passing ability and distributions have improved, he can work more in quick pass and go movements to keep a faster match tempo, he can further work on taking more shots on target when near the goal area and try at a chance of scoring, he needs to work on his speed and agility to provide quick runs and reate goal scoring chances, he needs to be consistent and is a hardworking player '),
(889, 889, 'Vansh is in his development phase, he has improved in reading the ball in defending, he needs to work further in his defensive stance and keep a strong footing to delay the opponent with well timed tackles which is vital for a defensive player, he also needs to work on his speed and change of direction ', 'Vansh is a player with good football knowledge, he needs to work on his quick decision making to quickly play the passes or put the ball ahead away from the goal area in high pressure situations, he needs to work on his defensive stance to angle himself according to the ball movement which is vital for his age, he also needs to work on his consistency to be involved better in training sessions to improve his performance '),
(890, 890, 'Ved is in his development phase, he has improved in his quick dribbling and passing, he can further improve in his quick decision making as to pass or shoot near the goal area to create an effective goal scoring chance, he can further improve in his communication to demand for the ball in free space to improve his attacking optimally, he is on the right track of development  ', 'Ved is a consistent and hardworking player, he has improved in his quickness with the ball and is confident, he needs to further improve in his finishes to scan the goalkeeper position and take more shots to enhance his attacking play, he needs to work on power generation in his long range passing which is of much importance for a forward player, he needs to work on his quick runs into free space and create goal scoring chances with effective communication, he is a player with positive attitude in training and matches '),
(891, 891, 'Rayansh is in his development phase, he has improved in his speed with and without the ball and has develped good passing ability, he needs to work on his negative transition where quickly tracking back on losing ball possession is vital for a player his age, he has been consistent in his improvements and is hardworking ', 'Rayansh has shown good improvement, he has improved in his aerial ball distribution with good and accurate passes, he can further improve in his decision making while finishing as to when to take a shot with power and when to place the ball being aware of the goalkeeper position, he needs to be in control of his actions in high pressure and intense match situations to perform optimally benefitting the team, he is on the right track of development '),
(892, 892, 'Madhav is in his development phase, he has improved in his confidence with the ball, he can further improve in his deliveries of long range passing and shooting which is vital for his age, he needs to communicate confidently from the back and lead the team, he is consistent in his efforts and is on the right track of developing as an efficient player ', 'Madhav is a player with good positional knowledge, he can play in more than one position and is consistent in his performance, he can further improve in his quick deliveries of long range passes away from the goal on gaining ball possession, he can be more vocal and hold the defense line which is most important for a defensive player, overall he is a coachable player and will be an asset for the team, he is hardworking and is with positive attitude in training and matches  '),
(893, 893, 'Anand is in his development phase, he has improved in his passing gameplay, he needs to build more confidence in his 1V1 attacking and defending which is vital for a player his age,  he needs to provide quick runs and make an attacking attempt to create goal scoring chances, he needs to further work on his speed and agility ', 'Anand is a player with good potential, he needs to work on his quick decision making as to pass or dribble to take on the opponents on the wings, he needs to work on taking more shots on target which is required for an attacking player to create chances, he needs to be aware of the space around and provide runs into free spaces and be quick to finish on goal, he needs to work more in change of direction with and without the ball, he needs to be consistent and with practice he can be an effecient forward '),
(894, 894, 'Pavan is in his development phase, he has improved in his timing of tackles, he needs to work on his long range passes and shots which is vital for his age and it develops with practice and experience, he needs to communicate with his fellow defenders and goalkeeper for effective defending in intense matches and organise the defense line during set pieces and corners which is vital for a defensive player, he is on the right track of development ', 'Pavan has improved and is consistent in his performances, he needs to improve his tactical ability along with his technical ability to quickly decide and maintain the defensive shape according to the player position and gain offside advantage, he needs to communicate further with the team mates from the back and organise the shape for better defending, he needs to work on his change of direction and speed with the ball, he is positive and hardworking player '),
(895, 895, 'Auritro is in his development phase, he has shown good improvement in terms of confidently taking on players in a 1v1 situation and delivering crosses and taking shots on goal, he can further develop as an attacking player by refining his decision making skills as to when to release the ball and when to keep it in possession and try to create a better chance of scoring on goal, he is hardworking and consistent in his efforts ', 'Auritro is a hardworking and a player with good football knowledge, he has improved his attacking game play with quick dribbles and crosses in the goal area, he can further improve in his transition gameplay by anticipating the opponent\'s passes and quickly intercepting to break their ball possession, he has improved very much in his set pieces of corners and free kicks, he can further build accuracy by controlling the weight on the ball to find the team mates in the goal area for corners, he can further communicate more with his team mates and improve the footballing quality, he has been consistent in his efforts and performances and we are pleased to see his progress, the values for body composition shows 0.00 since he was not present for the testing  '),
(896, 896, 'Ayaan is in his development phase, he has shown good improvement in terms of confidently taking on players in a 1v1 situation and taking shots on goal or setting the shots for the midfield players, he can further develop as an attacking player by refining his decision making skills as to when to release the ball and when to keep it in possession and try to create a better chance of scoring on goal, he is hardworking and consistent in his efforts', 'Ayaan is a hardworking and a player with good football knowledge, he has improved his attacking game play with quick dribbles and shots in the goal area, he can further improve in his transition gameplay by anticipating the opponent\'s passes and quickly break their ball possession by pressing at an angle, he has improved much in his quick recieve and shooting, he can further build accuracy by adding more power onto the shots which will develop overtime and with practice, he can further communicate more with his team mates and improve the footballing quality, he has been consistent in his efforts and performances and a coachable intelligent player '),
(897, 897, 'Ryan is currently in the development phase and has made steady progress. He demonstrates a positive attitude and a strong willingness to learn and improve. While he has a solid physical presence in midfield, he would benefit from improving his scanning ability to better assess space, teammates, and make more effective decisions. Overall, Ryan\'s positive mindset and eagerness to develop are key strengths.', 'Ryan has been steadily progressing and gaining a better understanding of his role and responsibilities on the field. He has a strong and dominant presence in midfield but could benefit from being calmer and more composed, particularly when in possession of the ball. Improving his awareness of space and positioning will also help elevate his game. Ryan regularly finds himself in goal-scoring situations and is gradually refining his finishing ability. Overall, his development is on a positive trajectory.'),
(898, 898, 'Bishank is in his development phase and has made notable progress in his technical abilities, particularly in passing, ball manipulation, and shooting. He is also improving his tactical understanding of the game and his position on the field. His finishing ability has gotten better, and he consistently finds himself in good goal-scoring positions. However, there is still room for growth in his physicality and sprinting ability. Overall, he maintains a positive attitude and continues to show a strong commitment to his development.', 'Bishank is in his development phase and continues to maintain a positive attitude towards learning and improving. He has gained a stronger understanding of his roles and responsibilities on the field. His finishing ability, along with his technical skills such as passing, ball control, and shooting, has shown noticeable improvement, and he consistently positions himself in goal-scoring opportunities. However, his physicality and sprinting abilities still need further development.'),
(899, 899, 'Atul has shown significant promise in his ball control and passing accuracy. However, he needs to develop more consistency in his decision-making under pressure. Improving his defensive positioning, especially when tracking back, is an area for growth. A focus on his off-the-ball movement will also enhance his overall contribution to the team', 'Atul is a hard-working and disciplined player with a solid technical foundation. Moving forward, it’s important for him to refine his tactical awareness and enhance his positioning during transitions. Increasing his speed and sharpness in both attack and defense will make him an even more impactful player. His commitment to growth is evident, and we are excited to see his progress, the assessments values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments'),
(900, 900, 'Mukunda has a strong physical presence , but he needs to work on his footwork and ball control under pressure. He should focus on becoming more composed when distributing the ball and improve his decision-making during fast transitions', 'Mukunda is a good player , especially when it comes to his physicality and work rate. To take his game to the next level, he must enhance his technical abilities, particularly his first touch and passing. Working on his composure and awareness during fast breaks will further elevate his game'),
(901, 901, 'Kush is a talented and hardworking player who has good technical ability, but he needs to work on his off-the-ball movement to provide more options for his teammates. His defensive positioning and timing of tackles also need to be more consistent', 'Kush brings energy and tenacity to the pitch, showing good potential in his technical game. Moving forward, he should focus on improving his positioning and off-the-ball runs to offer more support to the attack. Strengthening his defensive awareness and tackling skills will further round out his game'),
(902, 902, 'Manu is a good player,but tends to struggle with consistency, especially under pressure. Improving his speed and agility, as well as his work off the ball, will help him contribute more to both attacking and defensive phases of the game', 'Manu is a  good player. However, to take the next step in his development, he needs to work on his physical conditioning, especially his agility and speed. Enhancing his decision-making during transitions and improving his consistency will make him an even more influential player, the assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments '),
(903, 903, 'Anuj is defender with good tackling ability, but his ball distribution under pressure needs improvement. He must also focus on improving his positioning in high-pressure situations and enhancing his communication with teammates.', 'Anuj is a committed and strong defender who possesses good  skills. To continue his growth, improving his ball distribution and decision-making when in possession will be important. Strengthening his positioning and communication with teammates will also help him become a more reliable player in defensive situations, the assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments '),
(904, 904, 'Dhruvil has stepped up as a leader, demonstrating greater composure and tactical intelligence on the field. His ball distribution and positional awareness have significantly improved, allowing him to dictate play more efficiently. Compared to Cycle 1, he has refined his decision-making under pressure, making him a more complete player.', 'Dhruvil\'s ability to read the game has improved immensely and his defensive transitions are much smoother. He has become more vocal on the pitch, guiding his teammates effectively. Breaking into the I-League team is a testament to his growth, and he continues to raise his technical and strategic level of gameplay. The values for the assessment recordings show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(905, 905, 'Kahaan is currently in his development phase, showcasing strong skills but still needing to focus on specific areas for growth. To reach his full potential, he should continue refining his 1v1 attacking, ball manipulation techniques, decision-making abilities, and physical attributes. While his tactical understanding and game knowledge are progressing, there is room for improvement in these areas. With consistent effort and focus on these aspects, Kahaan has the potential to elevate his game significantly. If he remains committed to his development. ', 'Kahaan has demonstrated resilience in his development and shows great potential as an attacking player. He possesses skill, but to reach his full capabilities, he needs to focus on improving the technical and tactical aspects of his game. Key areas for growth include his 1v1 ability, ball control and manipulation, decision-making, and physicality. However, he maintains a positive attitude both on and off the field, which is a valuable asset in his ongoing development. Kahaan wasn\'t present for the assessment. '),
(906, 906, 'Agastya is in his development phase and continues to show steady progress. To reach his full potential, he needs to focus on improving his 1v1 defending, defensive positioning, and heading ability in defensive situations. He possesses good speed for a defender and effectively uses his physicality when defending. Additionally, his positive transitions are showing promising signs. To continue his progress, Agastya should concentrate on further developing these key areas.', 'Agastya is in his development phase and continues to show progress. We’ve seen improvements in his defensive speed, as well as his quick thinking and play when building out from the back. He should focus on further refining his 1v1 defending, defensive communication, heading ability in defensive situations, and decision-making in tight defensive scenarios. Overall, Agastya consistently demonstrates a very positive attitude during both training and matches. Agastya was not present for the assessments  '),
(907, 907, 'Kenneth has good technical skills and a strong footballing IQ, but his physicality and stamina need to be developed further. Enhancing his ability to maintain concentration and consistency throughout matches will help him take his game to the next level', 'Kenneth is a smart and technically sound player who understands the game well. To reach the next level, he must focus on improving his physicality, he must do  weight training to develop his strength. His tactical awareness is strong, and further development of his physical attributes will allow him to fully capitalize on his technical abilities, the assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments '),
(908, 908, 'Gopi is a solid player with a good understanding of the game. However, he must work on increasing his speed and agility, particularly when transitioning between attack and defense. Improving his first touch and ball control under pressure will also be key for his development', 'Gopi is a disciplined player, but to elevate his game, he must focus on increasing his pace and quickness, especially in tight spaces. Enhancing his technical control and refining his decision-making under pressure will help him become a more dynamic contributor on the field, the body composition values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments '),
(909, 909, 'Vihaan is in his development, he has improved in his defensive gameplay with strong efforted tackles and has good reading of the ball, he can further improve in his 1v1 attacking gameplay where he can confidently take on an opponent in the wings and create a goal scoring opportunity, he needs to work oh his sprints into free spaces ', 'Vihaan is a player with good efforts in match and training sessions, he has improved defensively and can to further improve in his long range passing and shooting, he needs to work on his quick runs into free spaces and demand for the ball to create chances on goal, he is a coachable player with positive attitude in training and matches. The values for the assessment recordings show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(910, 910, 'Prathyum is in his development phase, he has improved in his passing ability, he needs to further improve in his quick decision making when to release the ball and when to protect it to maintain ball possession, he needs work on his speed and make quick runs during the attack which is vital for a defensive player, he needs to be persistent and work on the technial aspects ', 'Prathyum is a player who is regular for training and he has improved in his quick passing and support play, he needs to further improve in his reading of the ball and quickly deciding when to pass while keeping ball possession and when to play it across, he needs to work on his aerial passing with more power on the passes to have long range clearences, he needs to work on his physicality to be strong and take on players physically in 1v1 defending which is vital for his age, he is hardworking and consistent '),
(911, 911, 'Shubh is in his development phase, he has improved in his attacking gameplay with close range passing and support, he can further improve in his defensive transition where how a player behaves on losing ball possession is of much importance, he needs to work on his sprints and endurance, he is on the right track ', 'Shubh is a player with positive attitude towards learning and improvement, he has improved in his quick passing gameplay, he needs to remain consistent with his peformance in intense game situations and keep calm under pressure and have a physical gameplay when the game demands and he needs to work on being physical and win aerial duels, Shubh is hardworking and needs to be consistent for the training sessions. '),
(912, 912, 'Dhyan is in his development phase, he has improved in his passing ability and support play, he needs to further improve in his 1v1 attacking and defending where he can confidently take on players with and without the ball in duels, he needs to work in his quick change of direction, he is on the right track ', 'Dhyan is a player with good footballing sense, he needs to work further in his quick switch of play where he needs to switch the ball from a crowded area to a free area where there is both space and time created during the attack, he also needs to work on his physicality which is demanded by high intensity matches and long range shooting technique, overall he is a coachable player who is hardworking '),
(913, 913, 'Adithya is in the development phase and continues to make steady progress. He demonstrates good passing and receiving skills, but would benefit from further improvement in his dribbling and ball manipulation to enhance his decision-making and execution. He displays a strong work ethic and consistently contributes as a team player. Additionally, focusing on his fitness, sprinting ability, and the consistency of his long-range shooting will support his overall development.', 'Adithya is in his development phase and continues to show encouraging improvement. He has good attacking qualities, particularly with his dribbling skills, but would benefit from refining his decision-making and execution in these situations. He also possesses strong shooting ability and poses a threat in set-piece situations; however, he should focus on developing greater consistency in these areas. Overall, he maintains a positive attitude and demonstrates strong team spirit. Adithya was absent for the assessments. '),
(914, 914, 'Lokk is in his development phase, Injuries have been a challenge his progress, but his commitment to improving his technical abilities has not wavered. His first touch and close control remain strong, and he has maintained his ability to link up play well. When fully fit, he has the potential to regain his form and take a bigger role in the squad.', 'Despite setbacks, Lokk has remained focused on improving his positioning and game intelligence. His ability to anticipate defensive situations has sharpened, but he needs consistent game time to apply these skills effectively. With a strong recovery, he can get back on track. The values for the assessment recordings show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(915, 915, 'Harith is in his development phase, While his positioning and movement were previously strengths, he has struggled with consistency in this cycle. He needs to sharpen his technique, particularly in ball control and passing accuracy. If he can regain his intensity, he has the ability to make a strong comeback.', 'Harith’s performance has dipped slightly compared to Cycle 1, but his potential remains evident. He needs to refine his decision-making, especially under pressure, to avoid losing possession in key areas. His tactical awareness is strong, but he must maintain focus throughout the match. The values for the assessment recordings show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(916, 916, 'Daksh is in his development phase, He has developed a stronger work ethic, which is reflected in his ability to sustain high-intensity performances. His composure on the ball has improved, making him a more dependable option in midfield. If he can further refine his off-the-ball movement, he will elevate his game even more.', 'Daksh has made remarkable progress in both technique and football endurance, showing greater control in tight spaces. His dribbling and passing accuracy have improved from Cycle 1, making him more effective in build-up play. His defensive positioning has also become sharper, reducing errors in key moments. The values for the assessment recordings show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(917, 917, 'Manvith is in his development phase, His growth in tactical awareness has been evident, as he now positions himself more effectively in different game situations. His passing accuracy has improved, allowing him to contribute more efficiently in build-up play. With continued work on his first touch, he can develop into a key player.', 'Manvith has gained a much better tactical understanding, making smarter decisions in defensive and attacking transitions. His pressing and ability to read the opponent’s movements have improved since Cycle 1. His technique, while still a work in progress, has become more consistent.'),
(918, 918, 'Ritvick is in his development phase, His positioning has improved, allowing him to anticipate plays and react quicker. He has also developed a better sense of when to transition between attack and defense. If he keeps refining his technical skills, he will become a crucial component of the team’s tactical setup.', 'Ritvick has shown significant tactical growth, understanding team movements and defensive structures better. His decision-making in pressing situations has improved, making him a more effective presence in the midfield. Compared to Cycle 1, he is more composed under pressure and executes passes with better precision. The values for the assessment recordings show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments '),
(919, 919, 'Tenzin is in his development phase, he has improved in his physicality towards the game, showing better endurance and strength in duels. His tactical awareness has also grown, and he now understands how to adjust his positioning in different phases of play. His ability to track back and support defensively has been a highlight this cycle.', 'Tenzin\'s work rate and discipline has increased, making him a more reliable player across 90 minutes. He reads the game better than before, reacting faster to opponent movements. Continued work on his technical skills will help him become even more well-rounded. The values for the assessment recordings show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(920, 920, 'Dhanvin is in his development phase, His overall positioning and attacking awareness have improved from Cycle 1, but his final execution needs refinement. When he’s at his best, he is a major asset, but he must find ways to stay sharp across all matches. With better consistency, he can reach the next level.', 'Dhanvin started the cycle strongly but experienced challenges in consistency in his form towards the end. His technical ability remains high, but he needs to maintain consistency in decision-making. He has shown moments of brilliance but must work on sustaining his impact throughout games. The values for the assessment recordings show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(921, 921, 'Tushar is in his development phase, His ability to carry the ball forward and link up with teammates has seen great progress. His positioning and awareness in the final third have improved, allowing him to contribute more effectively. Continued work on defensive transitions will make him an even better all-around player.', 'Tushar has improved significantly in his technical execution, showing better ball control and passing precision. He has also gained confidence in one-on-one situations, making him a more dynamic player in attack. Compared to Cycle 1, he has reduced errors and plays with greater efficiency.'),
(922, 922, 'Nityam is in his developent phase, He has become more reliable in high-pressure situations, demonstrating improved positioning and decision-making. His passing and vision have taken a step forward, allowing him to control the tempo better. If he continues refining his ability to read the game, he will become an even bigger asset to the squad.', 'Nityam has broken into the team well, showing strong technical ability and an understanding of tactical situations. His ability to stay composed in key moments has improved, making him a valuable player in build-up play. His defensive awareness has also sharpened since Cycle 1. The values for the assessment recordings show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(923, 923, 'Aarav is in his development phase, His game intelligence has increased significantly, allowing him to read plays and react faster. He positions himself better to receive the ball and has improved his decision-making in build-up play. With continued focus on his off-the-ball movement, he can become an even more complete player.', 'Aarav has made great strides in his technical skills, especially his first touch and passing under pressure. His ability to execute tactical instructions has improved, making him a more reliable option in both offensive and defensive phases. Compared to Cycle 1, he has become more composed and confident on the ball. The values for the assessment recordings show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(924, 924, 'Tushya is in his development phase, His ability to anticipate plays has gotten better, allowing him to make quicker decisions. His endurance and defensive awareness have improved, making him a more well-rounded player. If he continues refining his composure in high-pressure moments, he will elevate his game further.', 'Tushya has improved his tactical understanding and adapts well to different formations. His technical consistency has also improved, with better ball control and accuracy in passing. Compared to Cycle 1, he now contributes more effectively in both attacking and defensive transitions.'),
(925, 925, 'Gurudev is in his development phase, His positioning and movements have become much more structured, helping him contribute better in both attack and defense. His work rate and discipline have increased, making him a more reliable player. If he continues refining his shooting accuracy, he will be even more dangerous in the final third.', 'Gurudev has made steady improvements in his technical execution, particularly in dribbling and ball control. His tactical knowledge has expanded, and he makes better decisions in pressing situations. Compared to Cycle 1, he has grown in confidence and plays with greater awareness.'),
(926, 926, 'Srutaan is in his development phase, His defensive positioning has improved, allowing him to anticipate opponent movements better. His ability to read the game has taken a step forward, making him more effective in breaking up opposition play. If he continues working on his passing accuracy, he will become even more influential.', 'Srutaan has taken significant strides in his tactical awareness, particularly in defensive transitions. His technical execution has also improved, making him more effective in tight spaces. Compared to Cycle 1, he now shows more confidence in taking on challenges and maintaining possession.'),
(927, 927, 'Daniel is in his development phase, His ability to position himself effectively in both attack and defense has improved. His composure on the ball has grown, allowing him to contribute more fluidly to team play. With continued work on his speed of play, he will become an even more dynamic player.', 'Daniel has continued to develop his technique, particularly in ball control and passing under pressure. His understanding of tactical instructions has improved, making him a more dependable presence on the field. Compared to Cycle 1, he is more assertive in his decision-making and movement.'),
(928, 928, 'Dhruv is in his development phase, His positioning has become more structured, enabling him to make better use of space. He has also improved his ability to anticipate opponent movements, making him stronger defensively. If he continues refining his attacking instincts, he will become a more well-rounded player.', 'Dhruv has improved his overall technical execution, particularly in passing and first touch. His tactical awareness has also developed, allowing him to contribute more effectively in build-up play. Compared to Cycle 1, he is more confident in his decision-making and plays with greater intent.'),
(929, 929, 'Samanyu is in his developnment phase, His understanding of team movements has grown, making him more effective in linking play. His defensive awareness and ability to recover possession have improved as well. With continued work on his decision-making in the final third, he can become a key playmaker.', 'Samanyu has developed a stronger sense of tactical discipline, adapting well to different game situations. His ball control and passing under pressure have improved significantly. Compared to Cycle 1, he is more involved in attacking plays and contributes defensively with greater intensity. The values for the assessment recordings show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(930, 930, 'Shaurya is in his development phase, His positioning has become more refined, making him a stronger presence in the midfield. His passing range has also improved, allowing for better link-up play. If he continues focusing on his defensive transitions, he will become a more complete player.', 'Shaurya has become more tactically aware, understanding team movements and formations better. His technical consistency has also improved, allowing him to execute passes and dribbles with greater accuracy. Compared to Cycle 1, he has become more confident in taking on challenges. The values for the assessment recordings show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(931, 931, 'Dhruv has demonstrated steady growth in his technical and tactical abilities. His composure on the ball has improved, and he makes smarter decisions in tight spaces. Compared to Cycle 1, he is more effective in offensive build-up and contributes well in defense.', 'Would have liked to see him more in training, although he has shown growth during the training sessions he\'s appeared in and the matches that he has played in.'),
(932, 932, 'Aashvik is in his development phase, His positioning and ability to find space have improved, allowing him to receive the ball in more dangerous areas. His pressing and defensive transitions have also become stronger. If he continues developing his passing accuracy, he will be a key link between midfield and attack.', 'Aashvik has made significant progress in his tactical knowledge, adapting well to different formations. His first touch and ball control have also improved, making him a more effective player in possession. Compared to Cycle 1, he plays with greater confidence and vision. The values for the assessment recordings show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(933, 933, 'Saptarshi is in his development phase, His reduced training attendance has impacted his technical and tactical sharpness. His reaction time and positioning, once reliable, have suffered as a result. If he can reestablish discipline in training and work on his conditioning, he has the ability to recover and contribute more effectively.', 'Saptharshi’s commitment has been inconsistent this cycle, with missed training sessions affecting his sharpness on the field. His pace has noticeably dropped, and his overall performance has declined compared to Cycle 1. He needs to regain focus, improve his fitness, and show greater dedication to return to his best level. The values for the assessment recordings show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(934, 934, 'Aaron is in his development phase and is a player with good potential. His tactical awareness and decision-making are lagging, and his fitness must improve to keep up with the demands of the game. With the right mindset and work ethic, he can turn things around, but it will require serious commitment.', 'Aaron’s progress has stalled this cycle, and he has a lot of ground to cover if he wants to compete at a higher level. His technical execution has been inconsistent, and his overall intensity in matches has dropped. He needs to put in significantly more effort in training and develop a stronger mentality to push himself forward. The values for the assessment recordings show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(935, 935, 'Kabir is in his development phase, he has shown improvement in technical execution, particularly in his first touch and passing. His tactical awareness has also grown, allowing him to contribute more effectively in structured team play. Compared to Cycle 1, he plays with greater confidence and awareness.', 'Kabir\'s positioning and decision-making under pressure have improved, making him a more effective player. His ability to read the game has also taken a step forward, allowing for better defensive transitions. If he continues working on his endurance, he will be a stronger presence in midfield. The values for the assessment recordings show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(936, 936, 'Vishwak is in his development phase, he has shown flashes of ability in the past, but his lack of training attendance is holding him back. His tactical understanding and decision-making need refinement, and without regular practice, he will struggle to reach his potential. If he rediscovers his focus and work ethic, he can make real progress.', 'Vishwak has not been regular in training, which has significantly affected his development. His technical ability and match fitness have suffered as a result, limiting his impact on the field. If he commits to consistent training and applies himself fully, he has the potential to improve and become a stronger player. The values for the assessment recordings show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(937, 937, 'Garvit is in his development phase, His positioning has become sharper, allowing him to contribute more effectively in both phases of play. His passing accuracy and defensive awareness have also progressed. If he keeps focusing on his movement in attacking positions, he will continue to grow.', 'Garvit has improved in his ability to handle pressure and make quicker decisions. His tactical discipline has developed, making him a more reliable player in structured play. Compared to Cycle 1, his composure and technical consistency have improved significantly. The values for the assessment recordings show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(938, 938, 'Sourav is in his development phase, His awareness on the pitch has improved, allowing him to position himself more effectively during key moments. His pressing and defensive transitions have also developed well. If he focuses on improving his passing accuracy, he will elevate his overall game further.', 'Sourav has become more composed in possession, improving his ability to retain the ball under pressure. His tactical understanding has grown, helping him adapt better to different formations. Compared to Cycle 1, he has shown greater decision-making maturity. The values for the assessment recordings show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(939, 939, 'Rishik is in his development phase, he has improved in terms of confidently taking on players 1V1 and is tracking back whenever necessary, he can further improve in his quick positive transition where the player quickly provides support in free spaces to carry out the attack upon winning the ball is vital for an attacking player, he needs to work on his sprints to imptrove his attacking gameplay, he is on the right track  ', 'Rishik is a confident player and is positive in pressured situations, he needs to work on his physicality where winning the ball with strong tackles and keeping a strong footing during duels is much necessary in intense match situations, he has improved in his dribbling and can manipulate the ball around the opponents quickly, he can further improve in his quick runs to provide support for the attacks to create goal scoring opportunities, he needs to be consistent with training and he has a potential to be an optimal attacking player. The values for the assessment recordings show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments');
INSERT INTO `ci_notes_from_coaching` (`id`, `forms_id`, `notes_frm_tech_dir`, `notes_frm_head_coach`) VALUES
(940, 940, 'Sai is in his development phase, he has improved in his positional gameplay and has good understanding of the game and match situations, he can further improve in his both positive and negative transitions where the behavior of the player when winning and losing ball possession is vital for a player his age, he needs to work on his quick sprints and change of direction', 'Sai is a player with calm and composed presense in training and matches and is a hardworking player, he is aware of his positional gameplay and has been working in different positions being introduced to 9v9 football recently, he can further improve in his confidence with the ball and play the passes confidently with accuracy, he can be more vocal and demand for the passes on providing support in free spaces to enhance his attacking gameplay, he needs to work on his speed with and without the ball which is much needed for levelling to match intensity, he is hardworking and consistent and has good potential. The values for the assessment recordings show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(941, 941, 'Jai is in his development phase, he has improved in his 1v1 attacking play and is confidently taking on players as an attacking player, he needs to work on his defensive transition and quickly tracking back to support defensively is vital for a player his age, he needs to provide quick runs onto free spaces and create goal scoring chances, he is on the right track ', 'Jai is a player with good football knowledge, he has good speed and is very quick without the ball, he has improved in his dribbling ability and is winning 1v1 duels while attacking, he can further improve in his long range passing and finishing where the ball played needs optimal weight and power to be accurate and provide good goal scoring opportunity, he needs to work on his communication to demand for the ball when free and providing support, he is hardworking and is a coachable player with positive attitude in training and matches. The values for the assessment recordings show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(942, 942, 'Divyam is in his developmant phase, he has shown improvement in his defensive gameplay and can confidently read the movements of the oncoming attackers, he can further improve in his quick decision making to guide the ball towards safety away from the goal by maintaining ball possession which is vital for a defensive player, he can further improve in quick sprints to recieve from the keeper and build up the attack from the back, he is hardworking and a dedicated player ', 'Divyam is a calm and composed player with good defensive gameplay, he has shown improvement in his long range passing with his ability in finding players with quick runs and starting the attack on winning the ball, he can further improve in his decision making as to read the ball and try to push it towards the lines or control it and build play, he can further communicate and lead the team from the back to provide support to his fellow defenders and the goalkeeper, Divyam needs to work on his non-dominant foot and also quickness with the ball, overall a coachable player with positive attitude in training and matches, The values for the assessment recordings show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(943, 943, 'Aryaman is in his development phase, he has improved in his quick passing gameplay, he can further improve in his timing fo the tackles, physicality of a player to win tackles with strong footing is vital for a player his age, he needs to work on his quick sprints to provide quick support in transition and work on his defensive headers  ', 'Aryaman is a player with good reading of the ball, he needs to further develop his strong tackles with good timing to decide to go in for the final tackle when the opponent is off balance and win the ball possession, he needs to work further in his aerial passing to play the ball away to the attacking players providing a quick counter and create goal scoring chances, he needs to work on his defensive headers to win aerial duels and guide the ball away from the goal, overall a player with positive approach towards hardwork and improvement. The values for the assessment recordings show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(944, 944, 'Praganya is in the development phase and consistently demonstrates a positive attitude toward learning and growth. He is building confidence on the ball and gaining a clearer understanding of his role and responsibilities. To continue his progression, he should focus on improving his passing and receiving under pressure, defensive organization, and communication. Additionally, refining his 1v1 attacking and defending skills will be key for his age group. His steady effort and ongoing improvement are encouraging.', 'Praganya is in the development phase, and we are seeing clear signs of improvement. He is gradually gaining a better understanding of his role, responsibilities, and positional awareness. To continue his progress, he should focus on refining his technical abilities, particularly short and long-range passing, ball control, and manipulation. These improvements will support his overall decision-making on the field. While he is becoming calmer on the ball, he should also work on staying composed and playing more freely under pressure during both training and matches.'),
(945, 945, 'Aayushman is in his development phase and consistently displays a positive attitude in both training and matches. To continue progressing, he should focus on improving his technical abilities—particularly 1v1 situations, shooting, crossing, and finishing, which are key for an attacking player. Additionally, enhancing his sprinting ability, physical strength, speed of thought, and speed of play will further elevate his performance. Overall, he has shown encouraging signs of improvement.', 'Aayushman is in his development phase and has shown encouraging signs of improvement in recent months. He has grown more confident on the ball and is committed to continuing his progress in both training sessions and matches. To build on this momentum, he should focus on refining his technical skills, including 1v1 dribbling, crossing, finishing, and long-range shooting. Additionally, improving his physical strength will enhance his effectiveness in 1v1 attacking situations. He also demonstrates a good understanding of negative transitions. He maintains a positive attitude and a strong willingness to keep improving.'),
(946, 946, 'Divyam is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to read the game and get an understanding of the positioning, he needs to further improve in quick reaction during the transitions and move according to the ball, communication is key for a defensive player to maintain the defense line and be consistent in the tackles, overall a player with good eagerness to improve', 'Divyam is a player with good ability to read the game and has become better at it with training, he can further improve in the anticipation of the opponent’s moves and provide support for the defense line by being more proactive and consistent throughout to maintain a steady defensive approach, he has good aerial ball distribution and needs to work more on communicating with the team mates to have more efficient gameplay with more connect and understanding, a coachable player with consistent efforts. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(947, 947, 'Dhruv continues to be a very coachable player who brings a consistently positive attitude both on and off the pitch. Over the past five months, he has shown steady growth and maturity in his approach to training and matches, which has been encouraging to see. His technical ability and tactical understanding—already strong for his age—have further developed. He’s become more confident in applying these strengths in high-pressure situations and has shown improved composure both in and out of possession. His ability to compete and make an impact in tough games has become more evident, which reflects his growing confidence and resilience. This has translated into more consistent performances during games, and he’s playing a more influential role within the team. Additionally, sustaining his concentration throughout the full 90 minutes is an area that still offers room for development, but he’s trending in the right direction.Overall, Dhruv is making the right strides in this crucial season and we’re confident he’ll continue to grow with the right mindset and dedication he’s already shown.', 'Over the past five months, Dhruv has shown noticeable improvement in several key areas highlighted during his initial assessment. His tactical understanding remains a strong asset, and his versatility continues to be a valuable part of our team structure. He has become more comfortable operating in multiple positions and has developed a more refined sense of his roles and responsibilities within different tactical setups. Dhruv has made progress in his leadership and mental aspects of the game. He is starting to show more self-confidence, especially in moments when the team or his own performances are not at their best. There’s a growing sense of responsibility in how he lifts himself and those around him during difficult spells. While there is still room to grow, especially in maintaining high standards across all games, we are pleased with Dhruv’s development and look forward to seeing continued progress in the coming months.'),
(948, 948, 'Since the previous assessment five months ago, Satvik has made encouraging progress both in his individual development and his overall commitment to the team. He continues to show the potential to play at a high level in the future, and it’s clear that his increased involvement in training sessions has played a key role in his growth.Satvik’s mentality remains one of his strongest assets. He has shown more consistency in his attendance and approach to team training, which has helped him better integrate into the squad and develop stronger chemistry with teammates. This improvement in his training habits has also translated into more confident and effective performances on the pitch.Technically, he continues to impress, with a cleaner touch and better control under pressure. Tactically, Satvik has taken a noticeable step forward—he reads the game more intelligently and is positioning himself more effectively during different phases of play. While there is still room for further development, especially in terms of maintaining high levels of intensity across all training sessions and matches, we are very pleased with the direction Satvik is heading. With continued focus and discipline, he remains on track to fulfil his potential in the seasons ahead.', 'Satvik has continued to develop well, showing clear signs of progress both in his individual qualities and in his contributions across multiple competitions. Building on his strong performances in the DPDL Super Cup, where he adapted impressively to the right back role from his usual position as a winger, Satvik has further solidified his reputation as a versatile and reliable player. He has grown more comfortable in defensive situations and is now reading the game more effectively from deeper positions.His strong mentality and team-first attitude remain standout traits. What’s particularly encouraging is how he has consistently brought these qualities into high-level competitions such as the KSFA State League, DPDL, and the AIFF U17 Youth League . In each of these, Satvik has demonstrated growing confidence, positional awareness, and an ability to perform under pressure. Technically, he continues to sharpen his skills, and tactically he is becoming more disciplined and effective in executing his role. His game intelligence has improved, allowing him to make better decisions on and off the ball. While regular and focused training remains essential for his continued growth, Satvik has clearly taken steps in the right direction. His commitment, adaptability, and steady development reinforce our belief that he has the potential to play at higher levels of football.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to seeing him build on this momentum in the coming months.\r\n\r\nNote: Assessment details are not available (N/A) as Satvik was absent on several occasions during the scheduled assessment periods.'),
(949, 949, 'Ujjwal has shown encouraging progress across several key areas of his development. His commitment and maturity have grown, and he has played an increasingly important role in both the KSFA YPL U17 and DPDL U17 campaigns.Ujjwal has become more composed on the ball and is starting to make better decisions under pressure. There is still room to refine this further, but the improvement is evident. His recovery speed has also improved, allowing him to cover ground more efficiently and make key defensive interventions, particularly during transitions. As a centre-defender, Ujjwal now shows a better understanding of positioning, timing in challenges, and communication with his defensive unit. His awareness and anticipation have contributed positively to the team’s overall defensive structure in both leagues. He continues to be a coachable player who responds well to feedback and is open to learning. His training attendance has become more consistent, which has played a big role in his improved match performances and confidence on the field. Ujjwal’s growing influence in competitive games and steady improvement in physical and tactical aspects of his role are strong indicators of his upward trajectory. With continued focus and consistent training, we believe he can take further strides in becoming a dependable and commanding presence at the back.', 'Ujjwal has continued to grow in confidence and consistency, becoming a key figure in both the KSFA YPL U17 and DPDL U17 Championship campaigns. His performances and commitment have improved significantly, making him an increasingly valuable member of the squad.Ujjwal\'s fearless approach to defending remains one of his strongest traits. He continues to show excellent aggression off the ball, and his ability to win 1v1 duels and make crucial long-range clearances has been instrumental in key matches. His aerial strength and long-range heading ability have also stood out in high-pressure situations, especially during set-pieces and defensive transitions. Since the last assessment, Ujjwal has made visible progress in his focus and fitness. While earlier he struggled with maintaining concentration toward the end of games, he is now showing better mental endurance and greater composure under pressure. His decision-making has matured, and he’s playing with more control and awareness, especially in crucial moments. Despite earlier inconsistency due to missed training sessions during exam periods, Ujjwal has shown greater commitment to team activities and a more balanced approach to managing his academics and football responsibilities. This improved dedication has directly impacted his match sharpness and reliability on the field. Overall, Ujjwal has made strong strides in becoming a more complete and dependable centre-back. With continued focus on physical conditioning and tactical sharpness, we believe he can play an even more pivotal role in the months ahead.\r\nNOTE : - Assessment details are not available(N/A) as Ujjwal was absent on multiple occasions during the scheduled testing periods.'),
(950, 950, 'Akshay has continued to show impressive development and has firmly established himself as a crucial member of the squad. His performances across the DPDL U17, KSFA U17, and AIFF Youth League Rounds reflect a player growing in both confidence and maturity. Akshay remains a very coachable player with a strong attitude both on and off the pitch. His technical quality and tactical understanding for his age continue to stand out, and he has consistently applied these strengths in high-stakes matches. His composure under pressure and ability to compete in tough games are matched by his growing influence as a leader on the field. As a captain, Akshay has taken on his role with responsibility and leads by example through his performances. However, one key area for further development is his on-field communication. We would like to see him become more vocal and assertive—organizing, motivating, and guiding his teammates throughout the game. This added layer of leadership will elevate not only his own impact but also the collective performance of the team. Physically, he has made strides in improving his speed, although continued focus on this area will benefit his all-round game, particularly in transitions and recovery. Overall, Akshay has embraced the demands of this crucial season with commitment and professionalism. With more consistent communication as a leader and continued training intensity, he is well on track to reach the next level in his football journey.', 'Akshay has made notable strides, further establishing himself as a crucial figure in the team. His performances in the DPDL U17 Championship, KSFA U17 State League, and AIFF Elite League Round have been central to his development and the team’s success. His presence in the defensive line continues to bring calmness and authority, and his contributions in key moments have been invaluable in these high-level competitions.Akshay remains coachable, consistently taking on tactical instructions from coaches and executing them with precision. His technical understanding of the game and his ability to implement coaching points during matches have become more consistent. He has also made improvements in his leadership qualities, becoming more influential in the team’s defensive structure. However, as a captain, communication remains an area for further growth. While he leads by example with his on-field performance, he needs to become more vocal in directing and organizing his teammates during matches. By improving this aspect of his leadership, Akshay can further elevate the team\'s defensive organization and ensure that key instructions are carried out more effectively throughout the match. Akshay’s ability to score from set-pieces has also seen improvement, but further focus on this will give him an additional tool to influence matches. Additionally, while his speed and recovery runs have improved, continuing to work on these areas will be crucial to his overall development, especially in transitions. In the KSFA U17 State League and AIFF Elite League Round, Akshay\'s consistency was key to the team\'s strong defensive performances. He showed great maturity in organizing the defense and ensuring defensive stability in crucial fixtures. Akshay played a pivotal role in the team\'s defensive resilience, showcasing his ability to control the backline and provide leadership when it mattered most. His calmness under pressure and his ability to read the game made him a standout performer throughout the tournament.Akshay has made significant progress over the last five months, particularly in his performances in key competitions like the DPDL U17 Championship, KSFA U17 State League, and AIFF Elite League Round. With continued focus on his leadership communication and physical conditioning, he is well on track to becoming an even more impactful player in the seasons to come.'),
(951, 951, 'Since the last assessment, Arjun has made strong progress and has shown that he is committed to improving. His mentality remains one of his standout qualities—he approaches both training and matches with a positive attitude, and it’s clear that he is enjoying his time on the field. During the DPDL U17 & KSFA U17 campaign, Arjun demonstrated a positive attitude in negative transitions and defending, showing his ability to track back and support the team defensively, which was a key development. His understanding of his defensive responsibilities has improved, and he is showing a better willingness to contribute to the team both in attack and defense.While there has been progress in his all-around game, Arjun still has room for improvement. His crossing quality and finishing consistency remain areas where he can make further strides. With more focused work in these aspects, he will become an even more dangerous player in wide areas and in the final third.Arjun has continued to show great self-reflection and an ability to understand the context of his performances. He is a great team player, always willing to contribute to team goals, and he understands the importance of improving in the areas that matter most. He remains on the right track, and with sustained effort, he has the potential to become a more influential player.', 'Arjun has made significant strides in his recovery and development, and we are extremely pleased with his progress. His mental strength and determination to recover from a major injury have been remarkable, and his work off the field has clearly contributed to his improvement. Arjun is back on track and showing positive signs in both his physical and technical aspects. While he has regained much of his fitness and confidence, Arjun is still working to regain his previous level of speed and match sharpness. His performances have been solid, but there is a need for greater consistency throughout the game. He has shown moments of quality, but we expect to see him perform at a high level more consistently, particularly in the latter stages of matches. His crossing and finishing have improved, but these areas still require refinement. With more focus and repetition, Arjun can become more consistent in delivering accurate crosses and finishing chances in front of goal, adding greater impact to the team’s offensive play. Arjun’s attitude has been exemplary. He is very coachable, and his self-assessment abilities have helped him identify areas for improvement and understand the context of his performances. He has embraced constructive feedback and continues to implement it on the field. His teamwork attributes are also strong—he is a valued team player and enjoys the camaraderie of playing alongside his teammates. We are confident that with regular training and continued focus on his development, Arjun will continue to improve and get closer to his previous level of performance. We look forward to seeing him make further strides in the coming months.'),
(952, 952, 'Aidan has shown solid commitment and discipline in training when present, demonstrating good behavior both on and off the field. Although he missed the last four months due to injury, his work ethic and dedication have been commendable, and we are hopeful for his speedy recovery. Before his injury, Aidan demonstrated a strong crossing ability and a clear understanding of his role within the team. His tactical awareness allowed him to contribute effectively, and he showed promise in delivering quality crosses from wide areas. However, he needs to focus on defending 1v1 situations and defending crosses more effectively. These are areas where further improvement is needed to help him become a more well-rounded defender.Given the setback caused by his injury, Aidan has shown a strong resolve to bounce back and continue his development. We are wishing him a speedy recovery and look forward to seeing him back on the field, where we are confident he will make a strong return and build on his previous progress.', 'Aidan is still developing as a player, and while he has shown improvement, he needs to continue working on his 1v1 defending skills. This is an area where further focus will help him become a more well-rounded defender. He has shown a strong work ethic and remains a good team player. His positive attitude in training and discipline both on and off the field have been admirable. His crossing and set-piece deliveries, especially from corners, have been a standout aspect of his game, and he has consistently delivered quality balls into dangerous areas. However, there is still room for improvement in his composure with the ball and his recovery runs. Focusing on these areas will further enhance his effectiveness, particularly in transition play. Unfortunately, Aidan has missed the last four months due to injury. We are all wishing him a speedy recovery, and we are confident that he will bounce back strongly. Once fully fit, we look forward to seeing him back on the field and continuing to develop and contribute to the team’s success.'),
(953, 953, 'Aryan has continued his steady development this season and remains a key contributor to the team. His mentality, versatility, and ability to step up in high-pressure situations have made him one of the most reliable players in the squad. His contribution has been crucial to our success in winning the DPDL U17 Championship, the KSFA U17 State League, and securing qualification to the U17 AIFF Elite League final rounds. His performances in these competitions have reflected his maturity and growing influence on the team. Aryan consistently demonstrates a great attitude on and off the pitch. He takes initiative, pushes teammates to maintain high standards, and holds himself accountable. His understanding of tactical demands and self-reflection are among his strongest qualities, making him a player who learns quickly and adapts well. Though he’s on a very promising trajectory, there’s still room for improvement—particularly in maintaining consistency across all phases of the game. We expect him to continue building on his strengths and refining areas that will take him to the next level.', 'Aryan Vora has demonstrated excellent commitment both on and off the field. His tremendous work ethic and positive attitude toward improvement have stood out throughout the season. As a result of his efforts, he has been trusted to play in almost every game, and his consistent performances have made him one of the core members of the team. Aryan’s contributions have been instrumental in our success this season. He played a key role in winning the DPDL U17 Championship, the KSFA U17 State League, and in helping the team qualify for the U17 AIFF Elite League final rounds. His performances in high-pressure situations have proven his reliability and importance to the team. His versatility has been another valuable asset—Aryan has adapted to multiple roles across the pitch and has executed them with maturity. However, to take his game to the next level, he must continue to work on his composure while playing out from the back and on making better in-game decisions, especially under pressure. Aryan also has the potential to take on greater leadership responsibilities within the group. He sets a strong example through his work ethic, and with a bit more vocal leadership and presence, he could influence the team even more. While Aryan has been one of our most dependable players, we now look to him for greater consistency throughout games and across the season. We believe he has the mentality and ability to meet those expectations and continue to grow into a top-level player.'),
(954, 954, 'Since joining the squad, Advaith has quickly become a valuable member of the team. He played an important role in our successful U17 DPDL Championship and made meaningful contributions to our campaign in the KSFA U17 State League Championship victory as well. Additionally, his involvement & major contributions with the U19 squad reflects his growing confidence and adaptability across age groups. Advaith displays strong technical ability for his age and is tactically sound, showing a good understanding of positional play and team structure. He reads the game well and contributes effectively in both attacking and defensive phases. To continue his upward trajectory, Advaith will need to focus on improving his fitness levels, particularly to sustain his performance for the full 90 minutes. With dedicated effort in this area, he can become a more complete and consistent presence on the pitch. Overall, Advaith has a bright future ahead. His work ethic, intelligence on the ball, and willingness to learn make him a standout talent in the squad. ', 'Advaith has made a strong impression since joining the squad and has quickly grown into a key contributor across multiple competitions. His performances have played a significant role in our success in the DPDL U17 Championship as well as the KSFA U17 State League Championship. In addition to his impact at the U17 level, Advaith has also earned opportunities with the U19 squad, showing his potential to perform in more competitive environments. Technically, Advaith is very solid for his age. He is comfortable on the ball, with good passing range, and has shown composure under pressure. Tactically, he demonstrates a clear understanding of his role within different systems and is able to adapt quickly depending on the game’s demands. His awareness and ability to read the game have allowed him to make meaningful contributions, both in possession and defensively. One of Advaith’s standout traits is his intelligence on the field—he often positions himself well and makes calculated decisions that benefit the team. His work ethic and willingness to listen and improve make him a coachable player who is progressing at a good pace. However, to compete consistently at a higher level, Advaith must focus on his fitness and physical endurance. At times, he struggles to maintain the same level of intensity across 90 minutes. With increased focus on strength and conditioning, he can become a more reliable presence throughout full matches. Improving this aspect will also allow him to increase his impact during the latter stages of games. Overall, Advaith has a promising future and is developing into a well-rounded, intelligent footballer. His contributions this season have been vital, and with continued work on his physical conditioning, he has the potential to become a top performer at both the youth and senior levels.\r\n\r\nNOTE : Assessment details are not available (N/A) as Advaith was absent on several occasions during the scheduled assessment periods.'),
(955, 955, 'Vaibhav has shown encouraging progress over the past five months, particularly after transitioning to the wingback position. He continues to demonstrate a good attitude and strong discipline in training. His performances have become more consistent, and he is now competing well against tougher opponents. It’s been positive to see his continued improvement, especially in both defensive positioning and attacking contributions from wide areas. While there\'s still room for growth, we remain patient with his development and are pleased with the steady strides he is making.', 'Vaibhav\'s commitment continues to stand out. Over the past five months, his transition to the wingback position has been a positive step—he has adapted well, performed consistently, and shown he can compete against tougher opponents. His work ethic and dedication to the team remain strong. While there\'s still room for improvement in consistency, his overall development is encouraging. It\'s important that we remain patient with his progress and ensure he enjoys football and training without any pressure from his support system, both within and outside the sport. We look forward to seeing his continued improvement in the wingback position.'),
(956, 956, 'Paul has shown significant improvement over the past five months and continues to make encouraging progress in his development. He remains a highly coachable player with strong ball skills and a powerful shot from outside the box. His decision-making and speed of thought on the field have also shown signs of growth, though there is still room to refine these aspects further. Paul’s attitude and commitment to training have been excellent, and it\'s clear he has genuine potential. We strongly encourage him to stay committed to football, as he is on a promising path and has much more to offer.', 'Paul has made steady progress over the past five months and is showing encouraging development. He continues to be a dedicated athlete with commendable behavior both on and off the field. His consistency in training has improved, which has contributed to noticeable growth in his overall game. Paul remains receptive to feedback and works hard to apply it effectively. While there\'s still room to develop his decision-making with the ball, as well as consistency in finishing and heading, he is on the right track. We hope to see him continue his journey in football and build on the positive momentum he\'s created.\r\nNOTE : Assessment details are not available (N/A) as Paul was absent on several occasions during the scheduled assessment periods.'),
(957, 957, 'Devarsh continues to be a good athlete with commendable behavior both on and off the field. Over the past few months, he has become more consistent in his training and has shown clear improvement in his overall game. He remains highly coachable, works hard, and applies feedback well. His maturity and decision-making on the field are strengths, and he continues to develop in these areas. To progress further, Devarsh should focus on improving his fitness and speed, which will enhance his overall effectiveness in matches. We’re encouraged by his development and look forward to seeing his continued growth.', 'Devarsh remains a valuable player with a positive attitude and a good understanding of the game, which contributes well to the team’s structure. Over the past five months, he has shown improvement, particularly in his consistency and decision-making. To continue his development, Devarsh should focus on improving his fitness, nutrition, and acceleration. Additionally, he needs to work on his defensive communication and the use of his non-dominant foot—especially for clearances and in high-pressure situations. Demonstrating stronger leadership from the back will also be important. With his potential and the right discipline on and off the field, Devarsh can continue to grow into a more complete player.\r\n\r\nNOTE : Assessment details are not available (N/A) as Devarsh was absent on several occasions during the scheduled assessment periods.'),
(958, 958, 'Rishaan is a player with good dribbling and can play quick passes, he can further work in his quick movement to receive away from the opponents and turn with the ball by protecting it to have better ball possession, he needs to quickly distribute the ball to the players giving runs ahead on gaining ball possession to create more goal scoring chances, a player with a positive attitude in training and matches ', 'Rishaan has shown strong progress in his overall game, particularly excelling in his creativity on the ball. He consistently demonstrates the ability to break defensive lines with clever ideas and quick execution. A key improvement has been in his long-range passing and switch of play, which has added greater variety and depth to his team’s build-up. His unpredictability when in possession makes him difficult to defend against and creates valuable opportunities for his teammates. With continued focus on decision-making in the final third, Rishaan has the potential to become a decisive playmaker for the team. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(959, 959, 'Sahanya ] is a player with good attitude in training, he has good ability to make quick combinations and create chances to score, he needs to further work in his ability to confidently take on defenders and create chances with crosses and quick passes in the goal area, he needs to further work in quickly applying pressure to the opponents on losing ball possession, working on change of direction and quickness with the ball will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with hardworking nature and is consistent in his efforts  ', 'Sahanya’s trademark quality is his ability to carry the ball effectively in wide areas, often creating dangerous situations with a high success rate. His ball-carrying strength adds directness and width to the team’s attack. He also shows excellent defensive work rate, consistently tracking back and contributing to the team’s shape. The key area for development is improving decision-making on when to drive forward with the ball versus when to release it earlier, which will make him even more effective and efficient in possession. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(960, 960, 'Vihaan is in development phase, he is good with his receiving technique and quick finishes, he needs to further work in his aerial passes to create goal scoring chances with crosses, he needs to work in his agility to take on players with good change of direction, overall a coachable player with good discipline   ', 'Vihaan is a player with good attitude in training, he has good ability to make quick combinations and create chances to score, he needs to further work in his ability to confidently take on defenders and create chances with crosses and quick passes in the goal area, he needs to further work in quickly applying pressure to the opponents on losing ball possession, working on change of direction and quickness with the ball will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with hardworking nature and is consistent in his efforts. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(961, 961, 'Shlok has returned strongly after his injury layoff, showing notable development in both his game understanding and positional awareness. He has become more composed in possession, making better decisions under pressure and demonstrating improved technical ability in 1v1 situations. His discipline in maintaining width and timing forward runs has added balance to our structure on both sides of the pitch. His progress reflects a strong work ethic during rehabilitation and training, and his reintegration into the squad provides greater depth and reliability in the right wing-back role. We are confident his continued development will positively impact overall team performance and strengthen our defensive and transitional play.', 'Shlok has shown remarkable progress since returning from injury. He is very composed on the ball and has demonstrated significant improvement in his positional understanding and individual technique. His ability to read the game has grown, making him more effective both defensively and in supporting the attack. We are excited to have him back, as his presence will undoubtedly strengthen the squad and add valuable balance to the team. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments '),
(962, 962, 'Tushar is in the development phase, he has improved in his quick receiving technique and can further improve in the pass and support movements when in possession and quickly track back into defensive shape when not in possession of the ball, working on agility and quickness will provide more optimal defensive gameplay, overall a player with consistent efforts to improve', 'Tushar is a player with good interest to learn and improve, he has improved in receiving on the run and is moving quickly with the ball, However is prone to injuries which is affecting his perfromance, he can further improve in quickly pass and move into free spaces where the next moment can be made to create a goal scoring opportunity, the awareness of space is much vital for a player his age and will enhance the gameplay, needs more work on change of direction with and without the ball, he is a player with discipline and is working consistently towards development. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(963, 963, 'Aarav is in the development phase, he has improved in his timing of the tackles and is more focused, he can further improve in the decision making to approach aerial balls and make sure it is away from the goal area, he can work in quick change of direction to have more optimal gameplay, overall a player with good mindset of a  attacking player. ', 'Aarav is a player with positive attitude in training,  he has improved in his reading of the opponent’s movements and has good final tackles, he can further improve in aerial ball control and decide when to control the ball and play it ahead and when to push the ball away when under pressure in the defense line, working more on change of direction will enhance the ability to quickly get back into shape and regain ball possession when under pressure, a player with consistent efforts to work hard and improve. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(964, 964, 'Tushya  is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to read the game and get an understanding of the positioning, he needs to further improve in quick reaction during the transitions and move according to the ball, communication is key for a defensive player to maintain the defense line and be consistent in the tackles, overall a player with good eagerness to improve. ', 'Tushya is a player with good ability to read the game and has become better at it with training, he can further improve in the anticipation of the opponent’s moves and provide support for the defense line by being more proactive and consistent throughout to maintain a steady defensive approach, he has good aerial ball distribution and needs to work more on communicating with the team mates to have more efficient gameplay with more connect and understanding, a coachable player with consistent efforts '),
(965, 965, 'Dhanvin is in development phase, he has improved in his receiving, he can further work in his quick passing ability for quick attacking gameplay and move the ball towards the opponent\'s goal with quick decisions, he needs to work on tracking back in transitions and keep up with the shape, overall a coach-able player with consistent efforts', 'Dhanvin is a player with good football knowledge, he needs to work on his awareness of space and quickly move for support and distribute the ball to create goal scoring chances, he can further work in his aerial passing technique for better attacking gameplay through crosses and set-pieces, working on agility and change of direction will enhance his gameplay as a midfield player especially when losing ball possession and getting back into shape, a player with positive attitude in training and matches. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(966, 966, 'Saptharshi is in the development phase, he has improved in his movement with the ball, he can further improve in his transitions which is a vital part for a player his age, he needs to work more in the physicality part of the game to have strong tackles and improve the defending techniques, overall a player with positive approach towards hard work ', ' Saptharshi is a player with positive attitude in training, he has improved in his quick passing and receiving gameplay according to the position and needs to further improve in the movements in and out of ball possession since the behavior of a player during transitions are of much importance for a player his age and he needs to focus more in having a strong footing and have the ability to withstand physical contact from the attacking players to keep up a strong defending nature, he is a disciplined player with consistent efforts . The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(967, 967, 'Manvit is in development phase, he has improved in his movement with the ball and needs to work on getting into free spaces for support, working more in positive transitions will improve his attacking gameplay, a disciplined player with consistent efforts in training sessions \r\n', 'Manvit is a player with good ball manipulation and has good ability to change direction with the ball, he needs to further work in his combination play to keep ball possession till the goal scoring chance is created, he needs to work on his off the ball movement on winning the ball possession to quickly attack and create chances on goal for faster attacking gameplay, overall a coach-able player with consistent efforts. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(968, 968, 'Shaurya is in the development phase, he has improved in understanding the positional gameplay, he needs to work more in reading the game and move according to the ball, he can further work on quick passing and support play the move ahead and speed to quickly track back into shape when not in possession, overall has good attitude to learn and progress', 'Shaurya is a player with confident approach in training, he can further work on positional movements on and off the ball which will develop the defensive gameplay, he needs to further work on quick passing and running into free space to move ahead with awareness of space to carry out the attack on winning ball possession, needs more work in speed training with and without the ball, he is disciplined and needs more focus in the areas to improve which will make his defensive gameplay more optimal and effective. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(969, 969, 'Advaith  is in development phase, he has improved in his movement with the ball and needs to work on getting into free spaces for support, working more in positive transitions will improve his attacking gameplay, a disciplined player with consistent efforts in training sessions ', 'Advaith is a player with good focus, he has the idea to get ahead for support and keep the ball possession, he needs to be quick in deciding and scanning for the next pass under pressure and switch the ball into space where the chances of scoring is more efficient, he needs to further work on his speed with and without the ball to enhance his gameplay. '),
(970, 970, ' Alvin is in the development phase, he has improved in his passing ability and needs to further improve in quick receiving and first touch, he needs to work more with the ball and aerial passes along with agility to enhance his defending skills, overall a player with good understanding of the position and good attitude in training ', 'Alvin is a player with good positional understanding, he needs to further improve in his quick movements into free space and receive the ball with right angles to progress the attack quickly, he needs to work on aerial ball control and his awareness of space ahead to decide to make right choices to create goal scoring chances, he needs to further work in quick change of direction to enhance the defensive gameplay to read the movements of the attacking player and make well-timed tackles, he is a player with good attitude towards working hard and is consistent in his efforts. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(971, 971, 'Abhishek is in the development phase and shows a good ability to read the game and make effective runs into free spaces. He should continue working on his quick dribbling to better manipulate the ball and create goal-scoring opportunities. Additionally, he needs to improve his speed in tracking back and develop his heading ability. Overall, he is a player with a positive attitude in training.', 'Abhishek is a player with a strong understanding of his position and role. He needs to further develop his dribbling skills to confidently take on opponents and either play the ball into dangerous areas or take a shot when necessary. He should also be prepared to track back quickly after losing possession and contribute defensively. Improving his vertical jump and heading technique will further enhance his attacking effectiveness. Overall, he demonstrates good discipline and a positive attitude toward improvement. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments '),
(972, 972, 'Soham is in the development phase and displays a positive attitude in training. He needs to improve his quick dribbling ability to take on players 1v1 and deliver effective crosses or shots on goal. Working on his speed will also help him make forward runs and create goal-scoring opportunities. Overall, he is a coachable player who puts in consistent effort.', 'Soham is a player with good passing ability and supportive play. He needs to work on his spatial awareness, receiving with a strong first touch, and improving his ball control to finish effectively on goal. Developing the habit of making quick runs into free spaces will help drive the attack forward and create scoring opportunities. Enhancing his speed, both with and without the ball, will further strengthen his attacking play. Overall, he is a hardworking player with a positive attitude and consistent effort. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(973, 973, 'Vihaan Sangani is in the development phase, he has good ability to make strong tackles, he needs to further work in his quick decision to pass the ball ahead and attack, he needs to work more in his long range passes and speed with the ball, overall a player with positive attitude in training  ', 'Vihaan Sangani is a player with good defending ability, he needs to work in passing and support gameplay on gaining all possession to quickly attack to create goal scoring chances, he needs to work in making quick runs into free spaces and communicate for the ball also quickly track back into shape on losing the ball possession, working on aerial passes both in long and short ranges will enhance his defending gameplay, a player with good attitude towards hard work and discipline ');
INSERT INTO `ci_notes_from_coaching` (`id`, `forms_id`, `notes_frm_tech_dir`, `notes_frm_head_coach`) VALUES
(974, 974, 'Ishan Chhangani is in the development phase, he has good ability to make strong tackles, he needs to further work in his quick decision to pass the ball ahead and attack, he needs to work more in his long range passes and speed with the ball, overall a player with positive attitude in training  ', 'Ishan Chhangani is a player with good defending ability, he needs to work in passing and support gameplay on gaining all possession to quickly attack to create goal scoring chances, he needs to work in making quick runs into free spaces and communicate for the ball also quickly track back into shape on losing the ball possession, working on aerial passes both in long and short ranges will enhance his defending gameplay, a player with good attitude towards hard work and discipline. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments   '),
(975, 975, 'Prithviraj is in the development phase. He has improved in his timing of the tackles and in quickly gaining ball possession. He needs to work on quick pass and support play to attack and create chances on goal with crosses and passes, overall, a player with good potential  ', 'Prithviraj is a player with a confident approach in training. He needs to improve his movement in relation to the ball to better anticipate and close down the passing options of attacking players. On regaining possession, he should focus on transitioning quickly into attack, making use of available passing options to create goal-scoring opportunities with effective crossing technique and by contributing in set-pieces. Further development in his attacking play can come from working on his speed with the ball. He is patient, adapts quickly, and follows instructions well, showing strong potential for growth'),
(976, 976, 'Bishank is in the development phase and demonstrates good receiving technique and quick finishing. He should further develop his aerial passing to create goal-scoring opportunities through crosses. Improving his agility and ability to change direction will help him take on opponents more effectively. Overall, he is a coachable player with strong discipline.', 'Bishank is a player with strong dribbling skills. He needs to further improve his decision-making by quickly taking a shot when in range or choosing to pass to create a better scoring opportunity. Making more runs into free spaces will help him create additional chances, while improving his speed will enhance his overall attacking play. He demonstrates a positive attitude in both training and matches.'),
(977, 977, 'Ved is in the development phase and shows confidence in his dribbling and taking on opponents. He needs to improve his scanning ability to better identify attacking options and create chances. Additionally, working on his defensive transitions and overall speed will be vital for his growth. Overall, he is a coachable player with strong potential.', 'Ved is a player with strong positioning and dribbling skills. He should further develop his spatial awareness and actively look for opportunities to create goal-scoring chances, whether by finishing, delivering crosses, or providing options when in shooting range. Improving his speed will enhance his attacking play, allowing him to make quicker runs when gaining possession. He also needs to communicate effectively when moving into free spaces and consistently demand the ball to optimize attacking opportunities. Overall, he is a disciplined player who demonstrates consistent effort.'),
(978, 978, 'Anand is in the development phase and has improved in both passing and receiving. He should further work on his first touch and ball protection, while also focusing on quick positive transitions upon gaining possession to release the ball forward and create chances. Improving his speed, both with and without the ball, will further enhance his overall play. Overall, he is a player with strong potential.', 'Anand is a player with strong potential, showing good positioning to receive the ball and the ability to play quick passes. He should further improve his movement to receive away from opponents and turn with the ball while protecting it to maintain possession. On regaining the ball, he needs to distribute it quickly to teammates making forward runs to create more goal-scoring opportunities. Overall, he is a player with a positive attitude in both training and matches. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(979, 979, 'Pavan is in the development phase and has shown improvement in his passing ability. He needs to further develop his quick receiving and first touch, as well as work on reading opponents’ movements and timing his tackles to regain possession. Overall, he is a coachable player with a positive attitude in training', 'Pavan is a player with good positional understanding. He should further develop his quick movements in free spaces and receive the ball at optimal angles to progress attacks efficiently. Improving his change of direction, physicality, and strong footing will help him time tackles better and defend more effectively. Additionally, working on speed with the ball during attacking phases, along with enhanced spatial awareness, will allow him to create goal-scoring opportunities through quick offensive play. Overall, he is a player with a positive attitude, eager to learn and implement improvements.'),
(980, 980, 'Vihaan is in the development phase and demonstrates a good ability to read the game and make effective runs into free spaces. He should further develop his quick dribbling to better manipulate the ball and create goal-scoring opportunities. Additionally, he needs to improve his speed in tracking back and work on his heading ability. Overall, he is a player with a positive attitude in training.', 'Vihaan is a player with a strong understanding of his position and role. He should further develop his dribbling skills to confidently take on opponents and either deliver the ball into the goal area or take a shot when appropriate. He also needs to be ready to track back after losing possession and contribute defensively. Improving his vertical jump and heading technique will enhance his attacking effectiveness. Overall, he demonstrates good discipline and a positive attitude toward improvement. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments '),
(981, 981, 'Shubh is in the development phase and demonstrates good ability in making quick dribbles and creating chances. He should further improve his decision-making in finishing and quick transitions. Enhancing his speed will allow him to make more effective runs. Overall, he is a player with strong potential.', 'Shubh is a player with strong dribbling skills. He should further develop his decision-making to quickly take a shot when in range or pass to create better scoring opportunities. Making more runs into free spaces will help him create additional chances, and improving his speed will enhance his overall attacking play. He demonstrates a positive attitude in both training and matches. '),
(982, 982, 'Prathym is in the development phase and has shown improvement in his passing ability. He should further develop his quick receiving and first touch, as well as work on reading opponents’ movements and timing his tackles to regain possession. Overall, he is a coachable player with a positive attitude in training.', 'Prathyum is a player with good positional understanding. He should further improve his quick movements into free spaces and receive the ball at optimal angles to progress attacks efficiently. Enhancing his change of direction, physicality, and strength will allow him to time tackles better and defend more effectively. Improving his speed with the ball during attacking phases, along with increased spatial awareness, will help him create goal-scoring opportunities through quick offensive play. Overall, he is a player with a positive attitude, eager to learn and implement improvements.\"'),
(983, 983, 'Shridula is in the development phase and should improve her ability to make quick passes. She should also work on her long-range passing to effectively switch play and enhance her speed with the ball. Overall, she is a coachable player who demonstrates consistent effort', 'Shridula is a player with strong focus in training sessions. She can further improve her close-range ball distribution and ability to maintain possession. Developing her skill in quickly switching play into free spaces to launch attacks, particularly through aerial passes, will enhance her effectiveness. Additionally, working on speed and quickness will optimize her gameplay. She is a player with a positive attitude in training and demonstrates consistent effort. The values show 0.00 or N/A since she was not present for the assessments  '),
(984, 984, 'Arjun Anand is in development phase, he has improved in his ability to quickly pass and support and is fast with the ball, he needs to further improve in his awareness of space by scanning and make confident dribbles to score on goal, overall a player with good potential ', 'Arjun Anand is a player with good ball manipulation and has good ability to change direction with the ball, he needs to further work in improving his vision through scanning to distribute quickly to the players making runs ahead to create goal scoring chances, he needs to work in taking more shots when near the goal and decide when to shoot with power and when to place the ball away from the keeper also working in set-pieces, working on speed with the ball will enhance his attacking gameplay, overall a coachable player with discipline to grow with consistent efforts. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments    '),
(985, 985, 'Dhruv Jaiveer is in development phase, he has good ability to play accurate passes, he needs to further improve in his quick receives away from the opponents and be strong when defending the ball, he needs to work in his speed and he is a player with good discipline', 'Dhruv Jaiveer is a player with good technique to pass in combination with his team mates to maintain ball possession, he can further improve in quick movements with effective receiving and first touch, he needs be firm in his defending and have a strong footing in his tackles, he needs to work in his peed to provide quick runs into free spaces and attack optimally, a layer with positive attitude to learn and improve with consistency. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(986, 986, 'Darsh Sachin Mapsekar is in the development phase, he has improved in his timing of the tackles and is more focused, he needs to further work in his attacking gameplay by making quick passes in short and long ranges, he needs to work in his agility and change of direction, overall a player with positive attitude  ', 'Darsh Sachin Mapsekar is a player with good ability to defend and has strong tackles, he needs to work on his quick dribbling and passing techniques to make quick attacks and create goal scoring chances, he needs to work more in his aerial passing and crossing to enhance his gameplay, he needs more agility and change of direction to read the opponent’s moves and defend effectively with optimal positioning, a player with discipline and consistent efforts '),
(987, 987, 'Leon Namikata is in development phase, he has improved in his ability to quickly pass and support and is fast with the ball, he needs to further improve in his awareness of space by scanning and make confident dribbles to score on goal, overall a player with good potential ', 'Leon Namikata is a player with good ball manipulation and has good ability to change direction with the ball, he needs to further work in improving his vision through scanning to distribute quickly to the players making runs ahead to create goal scoring chances, he needs to work in taking more shots when near the goal and decide when to shoot with power and when to place the ball away from the keeper also working in set-pieces, working on speed with the ball will enhance his attacking gameplay. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(988, 988, 'Karthick has improved in his ability to read the game and get an understanding of the positioning, he needs to further improve in quick reaction during the transitions and move according to the ball, communication is key for a defensive player to maintain the defense line and be consistent in the tackles, overall a player with good eagerness to improve. ', 'Kathick is a player with good focus in his gameplay and has become better at it with training, he can further improve in the anticipation of the opponent’s moves and provide support for the defense line by being more proactive and consistent throughout to maintain a steady defensive approach, he has good aerial ball distribution and needs to work more on communicating with the team mates to have more efficient gameplay with more connect and understanding, a coachable player with consistent efforts . The assessments show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments '),
(989, 989, 'Praganya is in the development phase, he has improved in understanding the positional gameplay, he needs to work more in reading the game and move according to the ball, he can further work on quick passing and support play the move ahead and speed to quickly track back into shape when not in possession, overall has good attitude to learn and progress', 'Praganya is a player with confident approach in training, he can further work on positional movements on and off the ball which will develop the defensive gameplay, he needs to further work on quick passing and running into free space to move ahead with awareness of space to carry out the attack on winning ball possession, needs more work in speed training with and without the ball, he is disciplined and needs more focus in the areas to improve which will make his defensive gameplay more optimal and effective '),
(990, 990, 'Jonah is in the development phase, he has improved in his passing ability and needs to further improve in quick receiving and first touch, he needs to work more with the ball and aerial passes along with agility to enhance his defending skills, overall a player with good understanding of the position and good attitude in training ', 'Jonah is a player with good positional understanding, he needs to further improve in his quick movements into free space and receive the ball with right angles to progress the attack quickly, he needs to work on aerial ball control and his awareness of space ahead to decide to make right choices to create goal scoring chances, he needs to further work in quick change of direction to enhance the defensive gameplay to read the movements of the attacking player and make well-timed tackles, he is a player with good attitude towards working hard and is consistent in his efforts. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(991, 991, 'Ranjiv is in development phase, he has good ability to make quick dribbles, he can further improve in his finishing technique and create goal scoring chances, he needs to further work on his quickness without the ball and approach the ball to score both aerially and on the ground, overall a player with good ability to coach and has potential', 'Ranjiv is a player with good technique of dribbling,  he needs to work on quick decision making as to when to shoot and when to pass by making quick attempts on the goal, he needs to work on receiving of aerial passes and take shots, working n his speed to receive quick passes will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with good efforts in training and matches. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(992, 992, 'Raunak is in development phase, he has good ability to pass and support his attacking play, he needs to further work in his scanning and awareness of space while finishing which is of much importance and he needs to work in his quick change of direction with and without the ball for enhancing attacking gameplay, overall a coachable player with good football knowledge', 'Raunak is a player with good positioning and understanding roles, he needs to further improve in his receiving technique by being more aware of his space and movements with quality first touch to move the ball quickly towards the goal creating chances to score, he needs to work on his finishing to quickly decide when to shoot and when to keep the ball possession by not forcing a shot, working on agility and change of direction will enhance his gameplay by creating space to make effective attacks, a player with consistent efforts in training and is disciplined. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(993, 993, ' Shreyas is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to read the game and get an understanding of the positioning, he needs to further improve in quick reaction during the transitions and move according to the ball, communication is key for a defensive player to maintain the defense line and be consistent in the tackles, overall a player with good eagerness to improve ', 'Shreyas  is a player with good ability to read the game and has become better at it with training, he can further improve in the anticipation of the opponent’s moves and provide support for the defense line by being more proactive and consistent throughout to maintain a steady defensive approach, he has good aerial ball distribution and needs to work more on communicating with the team mates to have more efficient gameplay with more connect and understanding, a coachable player with consistent efforts. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(994, 994, 'Rakshan is in development phase, he has good ability to pass and support, he needs to work on his awareness of space and quick scanning ability to improve the vision of the field for effective ball distributions, he needs to work on his speed for quick attacking play, a player with good potential  ', 'Rakshan is a player with good focus, he has the idea to get ahead for support and keep the ball possession, he needs to be quick in deciding and scanning for the next pass under pressure and switch the ball into space where the chances of scoring is more efficient, he needs to further work on his speed with and without the ball to enhance his gameplay'),
(995, 995, 'Vedant is in development phase, he has good ability to make quick dribbles, he can further improve in his finishing technique and create goal scoring chances, he needs to further work on his quickness without the ball and approach the ball to score both aerially and on the ground, overall a player with good ability to coach and has potential', 'Vedant is a player with good technique of dribbling,  he needs to work on quick decision making as to when to shoot and when to pass by making quick attempts on the goal, he needs to work on receiving of aerial passes and take shots, working n his speed to receive quick passes will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with good efforts in training and matches. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(996, 996, 'Aayush is in development phase, he has good ability to read the game and position himself, he needs to work more in his passing and support play for keeping the ball possession and create chances on goal, he needs to further work in his speed and agility for quick movements on and off the ball, overall a player with good attitude in training', 'Aayush is a player with good movement and communication to receive, he needs to improve his quick first touch to protect the ball and play it ahead to the supporting players, he needs to work in his quick pass and supporting movements to carry out the attacking play and create goal scoring chances, he needs to work on his speed with and without the ball to further enhance his gameplay, a player with good discipline and consistent efforts'),
(997, 997, 'Bhargav is in development phase, he has good ability to change the direction with the ball and is quick in his passes, he needs to work on his shielding and protecting the ball which is vital for a forward and finish the chances created with quick decisions under pressure, needs to work on his aerial receives and finishing with headers, overall a hardworking player with good discipline', 'Bhargav is a player with good attitude in training, he has good ability to make quick combinations and create chances to score, he needs to further improve in his ability to receive and take first touch away from the defenders and protect the ball to convert it into a cross or a shot towards the goal, he needs to further work in his Vertical Jump to meet the crosses for headers and finish, working on speed with the ball will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with good attitude towards training and working consistently. The values show N/A since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(998, 998, 'Reyansh is in development phase, he has good ability to read the game and position himself, he needs to work more in his passing and support play for keeping the ball possession and create chances on goal, he needs to further work in his speed and agility for quick movements on and off the ball, overall a player with good attitude in training', 'Reyansh  is a player with good movement and communication to receive, he needs to improve his quick first touch to protect the ball and play it ahead to the supporting players, he needs to work in his quick pass and supporting movements to carry out the attacking play and create goal scoring chances, he needs to work on his speed with and without the ball to further enhance his gameplay, a player with good discipline and consistent efforts. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(999, 999, 'Shlok is in development phase, he has improved in his receiving, he can further work in his quick passing ability for quick attacking gameplay and move the ball towards the opponent\'s goal with quick decisions, he needs to work on tracking back in transitions and keep up with the shape, overall a coachable player with consistent efforts. ', 'Shlok is a player with good football knowledge, he needs to work on his awareness of space and quickly move for support and distribute the ball to create goal scoring chances, he can further work in his aerial passing technique for better attacking gameplay through crosses and set-piecesssss, working on agility and change of direction will enhance his gameplay as a midfield player especially when losing ball possession and getting back into shape, a player with positive  attitude in training and matches. The assessment values show N/A since he was not present during the assessments'),
(1000, 1000, 'Felipe has good ability to change the direction with the ball and is quick in his passes, he needs to work on his shielding and protecting the ball which is vital for a forward and finish the chances created with quick decisions under pressure, needs to work on his aerial receives and finishing with headers, overall a hardworking player with good discipline', 'Felipe is a player with good attitude in training, he has good ability to make quick combinations and create chances to score, he needs to further improve in his ability to receive and take first touch away from the defenders and protect the ball to convert it into a cross or a shot towards the goal, he needs to further work in his Vertical Jump to meet the crosses for headers and finish, working on speed with the ball will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with good attitude towards training and working consistently. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1001, 1001, 'Aaryaman is in the development phase, he has improved in his quick receiving technique and can further improve in the pass and support movements when in possession and quickly track back into defensive shape when not in possession of the ball, working on agility and quickness will provide more optimal defensive gameplay, overall a player with consistent efforts to improve', 'Aaryaman is a player with good interest to learn and improve, he has improved in receiving on the run and is moving quickly with the ball, he can further improve in quickly pass and move into free spaces where the next moment can be made to create a goal scoring opportunity, the awareness of space is much vital for a player his age and will enhance the gameplay, needs more work on change of direction with and without the ball, he is a player with discipline and is working consistently towards development. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(1002, 1002, 'Priyam Singh is in development phase, he has good ability to change the direction with the ball and is quick in his passes, he needs to work on his shielding and protecting the ball which is vital for a forward and finish the chances created with quick decisions under pressure, needs to work on his aerial receives and finishing with headers, overall a hardworking player with good discipline', 'Priyam Singh is a player with good attitude in training, he has good ability to make quick combinations and create chances to score, he needs to further improve in his ability to receive and take first touch away from the defenders and protect the ball to convert it into a cross or a shot towards the goal, he needs to further work in his Vertical Jump to meet the crosses for headers and finish, working on speed with the ball will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with good attitude towards training and working consistently. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(1003, 1003, 'Yagya Bansal is in development phase, he has improved in his receiving, he can further work in his quick passing ability for quick attacking gameplay and move the ball towards the opponent\'s goal with quick decisions, he needs to work on tracking back in transitions and keep up with the shape, overall a coachable player with consistent efforts', 'Yagya Bansal is a player with good football knowledge, he needs to work on his awareness of space and quickly move for support and distribute the ball to create goal scoring chances, he can further work in his aerial passing technique for better attacking gameplay through crosses and set-piecesssss, working on agility and change of direction will enhance his gameplay as a midfield player especially when losing ball possession and getting back into shape, a player with positive  attitude in training and matches. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1004, 1004, 'Naitik is in development phase, he has good ability to pass and support, he needs to work on his awareness of space and quick scanning ability to improve the vision of the field for effective ball distributions, he needs to work on his speed for quick attacking play, a player with good potential  ', 'Naitik  is a player with good focus, he has the idea to get ahead for support and keep the ball possession, he needs to be quick in deciding and scanning for the next pass under pressure and switch the ball into space where the chances of scoring is more efficient, he needs to further work on his speed with and without the ball to enhance his gameplay. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(1005, 1005, ' Moses is in development phase, he has good attitude in training and needs to work on quick dribbling ability to take on players 1V1 and deliver a cross or a shot towards the goal, he needs to work on his speed to make more runs and create goal scoring chances, overall a coachable player with consistent efforts', 'Moses is a player with good ability to pass and support, he needs to work further in his ball manipulation and confident dribbling to take on players in a 1V1 and 2V1 situations which is vital for a forward, he needs to work on his crossing ability to make sure the aerial passes reach the goal area or the team mates with adequate weight and direction, he needs to work on his speed for providing runs into the wings and create more options to score on goal, a player with good efforts and can be an efficient forward. '),
(1006, 1006, 'Siddarth is progressing well with a positive attitude and good adaptability. Continued focus on quicker decision-making and defensive recovery will help him establish consistency at U-15 level. Encouraging development through transition phase. Needs structured work on defensive awareness and tempo control to match the demands of the older age group.', 'Siddarth has recently transitioned from the U-13s to the U-15 squad and is adapting positively to the higher level of play. He shows good understanding of his role as a right wing back and contributes effectively in both attacking and supporting phases. His technical ability and willingness to learn are evident, and he is coping well with the physical and tactical demands of the new age group. Key focus areas moving forward are improving his speed of play especially under pressure and enhancing his defensive transition to recover and organize more effectively when possession is lost. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(1007, 1007, 'Reyansh has shown steady improvement and adaptability in multiple defensive roles. Continued focus on quicker ball circulation and defensive recovery positioning will enhance his reliability in the back line.\r\nPositive signs of growth and tactical understanding. Further emphasis on game tempo and defensive transition awareness will support his long-term development as a modern, composed defender.', 'Reyansh has adapted well to playing across defensive roles, showing versatility as both a center back and a wing back. His understanding of positioning and reading of the game continues to improve, and he displays good composure in possession. Transitioning to the U-15 level, Reyansh is learning to handle the increased pace and physicality effectively. To progress further, he should focus on improving his speed of play in build-up situations and defensive decision-making during transitions, particularly in managing space behind him.'),
(1008, 1008, 'Divyansh is progressing well with consistent effort and focus. Continued emphasis on coordination, agility, and decision speed will help him perform more confidently under pressure. Shows encouraging potential as a developing defender. Structured physical development and game-speed training will be crucial in unlocking his next stage of growth and match-readiness.', 'Divyansh is a developing player with promising potential as a center back. He demonstrates good attitude, discipline, and willingness to learn, which supports his steady growth within the U-15 environment. His understanding of positioning and ball control is improving, and he is working on increasing his speed of play to cope with higher tempo demands. Key focus areas for his continued development include improving coordination, agility, and overall speed to enhance his effectiveness in defensive duels and recovery moments. '),
(1009, 1009, 'Vihaan is adapting well to the step up in level. Focus on executing training habits and decisions more effectively during matches will help him settle faster and perform with confidence. Positive attitude through the transition phase. Needs continued support to bridge training performance with game execution and adapt to the tempo of U-15 competition.', 'Vihaan is in the process of transitioning from the U-13s to the U-15 squad and is showing good attitude and effort in training. He has begun to understand the tactical and physical demands of the higher age group. While his technical foundation is solid, he needs to adapt to the increased speed of play and show greater match-day application of the work done during training sessions. With time and consistent exposure, Vihaan has the potential to become a reliable performer at this level. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(1010, 1010, 'Sourish has settled in well and shows good understanding of our game model. Continued work on transition speed and defensive recovery will strengthen his impact within the back line.\r\nEncouraging start with strong tactical awareness. Needs targeted development in defensive transition and reaction speed to align fully with the team’s defensive principles.', 'Sourish has recently joined the squad and is adapting well to the new system and playing style. He shows good game understanding, composure on the ball, and awareness in defensive organization. His willingness to learn and integrate into the team structure is evident. To further progress, Sourish should focus on improving his defensive transition, particularly in reacting quickly and recovering positions when possession is lost.'),
(1011, 1011, 'Renaud brings energy and commitment every session. Continued focus on game speed and consistent execution during matches will help him become more influential in attacking transitions.\r\nTechnically capable and mentally resilient. Needs to keep refining his adaptation to tempo and tactical awareness to maximize his impact across multiple roles.', 'Renaud is transitioning from the U-13s to the U-15 level and is showing positive adaptation to the increased speed and physical demands of the game. Technically, he is strong on the ball, demonstrates good 1v1 ability, and has the versatility to operate both as a winger and wing back. His fighting mindset and work ethic stand out, helping him compete well against older players. The main focus areas moving forward are adapting quicker to the game tempo and maintaining decision-making quality under pressure.'),
(1012, 1012, 'Ishaan shows good intelligence and adaptability in multiple roles. Emphasis on developing his speed and agility will help him cover ground quicker and contribute more dynamically in both phases of play.\r\nHighly versatile with a strong understanding of the game. Structured physical work on acceleration and agility will elevate his performance consistency across positions.', 'Ishaan is a versatile player who can operate effectively in both defensive and attacking roles. He demonstrates strong game understanding, tactical awareness, and a good sense of positioning, which allows him to adapt quickly to different situations on the pitch. His composure and decision-making are reliable for his age group. To progress further, Ishaan needs to focus on improving his speed and agility to enhance his overall mobility and effectiveness, especially in transitions and duels.'),
(1013, 1013, 'Abhyukt has shown positive adaptation and strong technical qualities. Continued focus on quicker and smarter decision-making in attacking moments will help him influence games more effectively. Technically proficient and progressing well through transition. Needs targeted work on transition awareness and decision speed to match the demands of U-15 competition.', 'Abhyukt is transitioning from the U-13s to the U-15 squad and is steadily adapting to the increased speed and physical demands of the game. He is technically sound, comfortable on the ball, and shows good creativity in possession. As he adjusts to the higher tempo, the key development area for him is decision-making during attacking transitions particularly in recognizing when to pass, drive forward, or retain possession. With consistent exposure and confidence, he has the potential to become a key attacking contributor. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(1014, 1014, 'Viaan is technically sharp and confident on the left side. Needs to focus on building endurance and physical strength to sustain intensity and impact across both halves.\r\nPromising winger with strong technical qualities. Continued emphasis on physical development and match fitness will help unlock his full potential in competitive games.', 'Viaan is a technically skilled left winger with strong control and quality on his left foot. He demonstrates good attacking instincts and the ability to create opportunities from wide areas. His technical foundation gives him a solid base to build on. The next step in his development is improving his endurance and physicality to maintain performance levels throughout the game and handle duels more effectively. With consistent effort and regular training, he shows good potential to grow into a reliable attacking option for the team. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(1015, 1015, 'Yash is in devlpoment stage, Needs targeted development in defensive transition and reaction speed to align fully with the team’s defensive principles.\r\nPositive attitude through the transition phase. Needs continued support to bridge training performance with game execution and adapt to the tempo of U-15 competition.', 'Yash has recently joined the squad and is adapting well to the new system and playing style. He is game understanding improving,  and awareness in defensive organization. His willingness to learn and integrate into the team structure is evident. To further progress, Yash should focus on improving his defensive transition, particularly in reacting quickly and recovering positions when possession is lost and develope his techincal level.'),
(1016, 1016, 'Ashwik Syamala Reddy is in the development phase, he has improved in his timing of the tackles and is more focused, he needs to further work in his attacking gameplay by making quick passes in short and long ranges, he needs to work in his agility and change of direction, overall a player with positive attitude  ', 'Ashwik Syamala Reddy is a player with good ability to defend and has strong tackles, he needs to work on his quick dribbling and passing techniques to make quick attacks and create goal scoring chances, he needs to work more in his aerial passing and crossing to enhance his gameplay, he needs more agility and change of direction to read the opponent’s moves and defend effectively with optimal positioning, a player with discipline and consistent efforts '),
(1017, 1017, '', 'Agrim is a player with good ball manipulation and has good ability to change direction with the ball, he needs to further work in improving his vision through scanning to distribute quickly to the players making runs ahead to create goal scoring chances, he needs to work in getting back quickly to defensive shape on losing ball possession, a player with significant improvements and is disciplined with consistent efforts'),
(1018, 1018, 'Siddhart Praveen Nair is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to make quick dribbles, he needs to work further in his passing and supporting movement, he needs to work in his agility, a player with good potential ', 'Siddhart Praveen Nair is a player with good ability to read the game and has good ability to dribble through in free spaces, he needs to work in his quick passing and support ahead for keeping ball possession and create goal scoring chances, he needs to work in his ability to shoot when near the goal area, working on his agility will enhance his gameplay, a player with good discipline and efforts to improve '),
(1019, 1019, 'Anish is developing into a premier talent within our U13 setup, showcasing a blend of technical brilliance and tactical maturity, his left-footed profile, combined with his finishing ability and transitional awareness, aligns perfectly with our attacking philosophy. We will continue to challenge him with complex scenarios to ensure his upward trajectory remains sharp and unimpeded.', 'Anish is technically brilliant for this age stage, utilizing his highly effective left foot to dictate play and act as a reliable goal scorer. Mentally, he is a very smart, hardworking player whose tactical intelligence has improved significantly, making him highly effective during transitional phases. His physiological conditioning allows him to sustain these high-intensity actions, translating his technical superiority into dominant match performances. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1020, 1020, 'Kiyan is in the development phase, he has improved in his timing of the tackles and is more focused, he needs to further work in his aerial duels which needs more practice, he needs to work on his speed to enhance his transitions, overall a player with good efforts in training ', 'Kiyan is a player with confident approach in training, he needs to work on his movement according to the ball to anticipate and cover the passing options of the attacking player, he needs to attack quickly on gaining the ball possession to pass with options present to create goal scoring chances with effective passing technique , he can further improve his attacking gameplay by working on speed with the ball, a player with patience and learns quick to adapt and follow the instructions. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1021, 1021, 'Aaryn George is in the development phase, he has good ability to make strong tackles, he needs to further work in his quick decision to pass the ball ahead and attack, he needs to work more in his long range passes and speed with the ball, overall a player with positive attitude in training  ', 'Aaryn George is a player with good defending ability, he needs to work in passing and support gameplay on gaining all possession to quickly attack to create goal scoring chances, he needs to work in making quick runs into free spaces and communicate for the ball also quickly track back into shape on losing the ball possession, working on aerial passes both in long and short ranges will enhance his defending gameplay, a player with good attitude towards hard work and discipline '),
(1022, 1022, 'Umang Prasad is in the development phase, he has improved in his timing of the tackles and is more focused, he needs to further work in his attacking gameplay by making quick passes in short and long ranges, he needs to work in his agility and change of direction, overall a player with positive attitude  ', 'Umang Prasad is a player with good ability to defend and has strong tackles, he needs to work on his quick dribbling and passing techniques to make quick attacks and create goal scoring chances, he needs to work more in his aerial passing and crossing to enhance his gameplay, he needs more agility and change of direction to read the opponent’s moves and defend effectively with optimal positioning, a player with discipline and consistent efforts '),
(1023, 1023, 'Avyan Lohiya is in development phase, he has improved in his ability to quickly pass and support and is fast with the ball, he needs to further improve in his awareness of space by scanning and make confident dribbles to score on goal, overall a player with good potential ', 'Avyan Lohiya is a player with good ball manipulation and has good ability to change direction with the ball, he needs to further work in improving his vision through scanning to distribute quickly to the players making runs ahead to create goal scoring chances, he needs to work in taking more shots when near the goal and decide when to shoot with power and when to place the ball away from the keeper also working in set-pieces, working on speed with the ball will enhance his attacking gameplay. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1024, 1024, 'Abishak\'s fearless psychology and technical bravery are fantastic traits that we want to encourage within our attacking framework. While we love his willingness to experiment, rounding out his tactical comprehension is the natural next step in his education. Balancing his creative risks with structural discipline will make him a highly effective and unpredictable asset.', 'Abishak has improved very well over the cycle, bringing a highly enthusiastic and fearless mental approach to his match experience. He is technically good and commendable for not being afraid to take risks and make mistakes, which accelerates his physical and cognitive learning process. To take the next step, he must focus on becoming more tactically sound, ensuring his adventurous play doesn\'t compromise our defensive transitions. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1025, 1025, 'Tanush Gowda is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to make quick dribbles, he needs to work further in his passing and supporting movement, he needs to work in his agility, a player with good potential ', 'Tanush Gowda is a player with good ability to read the game and has good ability to dribble through in free spaces, he needs to work in his quick passing and support ahead for keeping ball possession and create goal scoring chances, he needs to work in his ability to shoot when near the goal area, working on his agility will enhance his gameplay, a player with good discipline and efforts to improve. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments   '),
(1026, 1026, 'Arjun is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to understand the positioning and movement according to the ball, he can further improve in his quick decision making of when to delay and when to head for the tackle under pressure, he can further work in leading the team from the back with effective communication, player with good focus and physicality', 'Arjun is a player with good positional understanding, he needs to further improve in his quick movements into free space and receive the ball with right angles to progress the attack quickly, he needs to work on his change of direction to well time his tackles with more physicality that the game demands, he needs to work on his strong footing and strength for effective defending gameplay, he needs to improve his speed with the ball during the attacking moments with more awareness of space and create goal scoring chances with quick attacking, a player with positive attitude to learn and implement. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments   '),
(1027, 1027, 'Anirudh is in development phase, he has good ability to read the game and provide necessary runs into the free spaces, he needs to further work in is quick dribbling to manipulate the ball and create chances on goal,  he needs to be quick to track back and work in his heading ability, overall a player with positive attitude in training ', 'Anirudh  is a player with good positioning and dribbling skillset, he needs to further work in his awareness of space and look for options to create goal scoring chances with finishing with crosses and provide options to score when in range with the goal, working on speed will improve in his attacking gameplay to provide quick runs on gaining ball possession, he needs to communicate when moving into free spaces and demand for the ball for attacking optimally, a player with discipline and is consistent in his efforts. '),
(1028, 1028, 'Zehveer Kang is in the development phase, he has improved in his quick movements off the ball, he needs to work more in his attacking by making quick passes, he has good shooting ability and needs to take more shots, overall a player with good attitude in training and matches ', 'Zehveer Kang is a player with good reading of the game, he needs to work in taking more shots when in range of the goal and build accuracy, he needs to track back into position on losing ball possession to help in defending, working in communicating when free will increase his attacking gameplay, a coachable player with good focus and consistent efforts '),
(1029, 1029, 'Mihit\'s physiological profile and rapid overall development align well with the dynamic playstyle we foster at Alchemy, his transition into a more tactically mature player is an essential next step for his integration into the higher youth brackets. We look forward to seeing him apply structured game intelligence to his speed to maximize his impact on the pitch.', 'Mihit has utilized his natural quickness to develop remarkably well in his technical execution over the course of this season. While his physical speed is a great asset, he must prioritize his mental game to better understand our tactical concepts and spatial awareness. Translating this raw pace into structured match experience will be his primary objective going into the next cycle.'),
(1030, 1030, 'Eshaan is in development phase, he is confident in his dribbling and takes on players, he needs to work in his scanning ability to see the options ahead for the attack and create chances, he needs to work in his negative transitions which is vital and work in his speed, overall a coachable player with good potential   ', 'Eshaan is a player with good dribbling skillset, he needs to work further in quickly taking a shot when in range of the goal and when to pass and create a better chance at scoring, he needs to create more space by making runs into free spaces, working on speed will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with positive attitude in training and matches. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments ');
INSERT INTO `ci_notes_from_coaching` (`id`, `forms_id`, `notes_frm_tech_dir`, `notes_frm_head_coach`) VALUES
(1031, 1031, 'Atharva Rajesh is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to make quick dribbles, he needs to work further in his passing and supporting movement, he needs to work in his agility, a player with good potential ', 'Atharva Rajesh is a player with good ability to read the game and has good ability to dribble through in free spaces, he needs to work in his quick passing and support ahead for keeping ball possession and create goal scoring chances, he needs to work in his ability to shoot when near the goal area, working on his agility will enhance his gameplay, a player with good discipline and efforts to improve '),
(1032, 1032, 'Nongzinlen Akoijam is in development phase, he has improved in his first touch and receiving technique, he can further work in his aerial ball control and defending in transitions, he needs to work in his agility and positioning play, a player with good focus and discipline', 'Nongzinlen Akoijam is a player with a good ability to turn with the ball and has good first touch into space, he needs to work in getting back into defensive shape on losing ball possession since the positioning off the ball is vital for a player his age, he needs to work in his aerial ball control and heading technique, working in agility and change of direction will enhance his gameplay to attack and defend optimally, overall a coachable player with good efforts in training and matches. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments     '),
(1033, 1033, 'Kotaro Seki is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to make quick dribbles, he needs to work further in his passing and supporting movement, he needs to work in his agility, a player with good potential ', 'Kotaro Seki is a player with good ability to read the game and has good ability to dribble through in free spaces, he needs to work in his quick passing and support ahead for keeping ball possession and create goal scoring chances, he needs to work in his ability to shoot when near the goal area, working on his agility will enhance his gameplay, a player with good discipline and efforts to improve. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1034, 1034, 'Daran Majid is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to make quick dribbles, he needs to work further in his passing and supporting movement, he needs to work in his agility, a player with good potential ', 'Daran Majid is a player with good ability to read the game and has good ability to dribble through in free spaces, he needs to work in his quick passing and support ahead for keeping ball possession and create goal scoring chances, he needs to work in his ability to shoot when near the goal area, working on his agility will enhance his gameplay, a player with good discipline and efforts to improve. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments   '),
(1035, 1035, 'Anirudh Shenoy is in development phase, he has good ability to make quick passes, he needs to further work in his long range passing ability and switch the game, he needs to work more in speed with the ball, overall a coachable player with good efforts', 'Anirudh Shenoy is a player with good focus in training sessions, he has good ball distribution in close range and maintain ball possession, he needs to further work in his quick switching of ball possession into free spaces to quickly attack with aerial passes, crosses and set-pieces, working more on speed and quickness will enhance his gameplay optimally, a player with positive attitude in training and is consistent in his efforts '),
(1036, 1036, 'Avinn is in development phase, he has good ability to make quick dribbles, he can further improve in his finishing technique and create goal scoring chances, he needs to further work on his quickness without the ball and approach the ball to score both aerially and on the ground, overall a player with good ability to be coached and has potential', 'Avinn is a player with good technique of dribbling,  he needs to work on quick decision making as to when to shoot and when to pass by making quick attempts on the goal, he needs to work on receiving of aerial passes and take shots, working on his speed to receive quick passes will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with good efforts in training and matches with consistent efforts '),
(1037, 1037, 'Steve is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to read the game and get an understanding of the positioning, he needs to further improve in quick reaction during the transitions and move according to the ball, communication is key for a defensive player to maintain the defense line and be consistent in the tackles, overall a player with good eagerness to improve ', 'Steve is a player with good ability to read the game and has become better at it with training, he can further improve in the anticipation of the opponent’s moves and provide support for the defense line by being more proactive and consistent throughout to maintain a steady defensive approach, he has good aerial ball distribution and needs to work more on communicating with the team mates to have more efficient gameplay with more connect and understanding, a coachable player with consistent efforts. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(1038, 1038, 'Agastya is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to read the game and get an understanding of the positioning, he needs to further improve in quick reaction during the transitions and move according to the ball, communication is key for a defensive player to maintain the defense line and be consistent in the tackles, overall a player with good eagerness to improve ', 'Agastya is a player with good ability to read the game and has become better at it with training, he can further improve in the anticipation of the opponent’s moves and provide support for the defense line by being more proactive and consistent throughout to maintain a steady defensive approach, he has good aerial ball distribution and needs to work more on communicating with the team mates to have more efficient gameplay with more connect and understanding, a coachable player with consistent efforts, however Agastya needs to be regular for the training sessions for bettering his gameplay. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(1039, 1039, 'Aaryan  is in development phase, he has good ability to make quick dribbles, he can further improve in his finishing technique and create goal scoring chances, he needs to further work on his quickness without the ball and approach the ball to score both aerially and on the ground, overall a player with good ability to coach and has potential', 'Aaryan is a player with good technique of dribbling,  he needs to work on quick decision making as to when to shoot and when to pass by making quick attempts on the goal, he needs to work on receiving of aerial passes and take shots, working n his speed to receive quick passes will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with good efforts in training and matches. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1040, 1040, 'Kislay is in the development phase, he has improved in his timing of the tackles and is more focused, he can further improve in the decision making to approach aerial balls and make sure it is away from the goal area, he can work in quick change of direction to have more optimal gameplay, overall a player with good mindset of a defensive player \r\n', 'Kislay is a player with positive attitude in training,  he has improved in his reading of the opponent’s movements and has good final tackles, he can further improve in aerial ball control and decide when to control the ball and play it ahead and when to push the ball away when under pressure in the defense line, working more on change of direction will enhance the ability to quickly get back into shape and regain ball possession when under pressure, a player with consistent efforts to work hard and improve '),
(1041, 1041, 'Madhav is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to read the game and get an understanding of the positioning, he needs to further improve in quick reaction during the transitions and move according to the ball, communication is key for a defensive player to maintain the defense line and be consistent in the tackles, overall a player with good eagerness to improve ', 'Madhav is a player with good ability to read the game and has become better at it with training, he can further improve in the anticipation of the opponent’s moves and provide support for the defense line by being more proactive and consistent throughout to maintain a steady defensive approach, he has good aerial ball distribution and needs to work more on communicating with the team mates to have more efficient gameplay with more connect and understanding, a coachable player with consistent efforts, The Values for assessments show 0.00 or NA since he was not present for the assessments '),
(1042, 1042, 'Mikell is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to read the game and get an understanding of the positioning, he needs to further improve in quick reaction during the transitions and move according to the ball, communication is key for a defensive player to maintain the defense line and be consistent in the tackles, overall a player with good eagerness to improve ', 'Mikell is a player with good interest to learn and improve, he has improved in receiving on the run and is moving quickly with the ball, he can further improve in quickly pass and move into free spaces where the next moment can be made to create a goal scoring opportunity, the awareness of space is much vital for a player his age and will enhance the gameplay, needs more work on change of direction with and without the ball, he is a player with discipline and is working consistently towards development. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments '),
(1043, 1043, '', ''),
(1044, 1044, 'Akshit is in the development phase, he has improved in his passing ability and needs to further improve in quick receiving and first touch, he needs to work more with the ball and aerial passes along with agility to enhance his defending skills, overall a player with good understanding of the position and good attitude in training ', 'Akshit is a player with good positional understanding, he needs to further improve in his quick movements into free space and receive the ball with right angles to progress the attack quickly, he needs to work on aerial ball control and his awareness of space ahead to decide to make right choices to create goal scoring chances, he needs to further work in quick change of direction to enhance the defensive gameplay to read the movements of the attacking player and make well-timed tackles, he is a player with good attitude towards working hard and is consistent in his efforts. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments   '),
(1045, 1045, 'Ashok is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to read the game and get an understanding of the positioning, he needs to further improve in quick reaction during the transitions and move according to the ball, communication is key for a defensive player to maintain the defense line and be consistent in the tackles, overall a player with good eagerness to improve ', 'Ashok is a player with good ability to read the game and has become better at it with training, he can further improve in the anticipation of the opponent’s moves and provide support for the defense line by being more proactive and consistent throughout to maintain a steady defensive approach, he has good aerial ball distribution and needs to work more on communicating with the team mates to have more efficient gameplay with more connect and understanding, a coachable player with consistent efforts. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(1046, 1046, 'Ansh is in development phase, he has improved in his movement with the ball and needs to work on getting into free spaces for support, working more in positive transitions will improve his attacking gameplay, a disciplined player with consistent efforts in training sessions ', 'Ansh is a player with good ball manipulation and has good ability to change direction with the ball, he needs to further work in his combination play to keep ball possession till the goal scoring chance is created, he needs to work on his off the ball movement on winning the ball possession to quickly attack and create chances on goal for faster attacking gameplay, overall a coachable player with consistent efforts. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1047, 1047, 'Mihit is in development phase, he has good attitude in training and needs to work on quick dribbling ability to take on players 1V1 and deliver a cross or a shot towards the goal, he needs to work on his speed to provide runs and create goal scoring chances, overall a coachable player with consistent efforts', 'Mihit is a player with good ability to play in his position and understand the role, he needs to further work in his dribbling skillset and take on players to play the ball into the goal area or take a shot whenever necessary, he needs to be ready to track back on losing ball possession and help defensively, working on his vertical jump and heading technique will enhance his attacking gameplay optimally, a player with good discipline and attitude towards working to improve. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1048, 1048, 'Vivaan Ayyar is in the development phase, he has improved in his movement with the ball, he can further improve in his transitions which is a vital part for a player his age, he needs to work more in the attacking part of the defender\'s role which is with the ball and provide passes to enhance the quick attacks on gaining ball possession, overall a coachable player with consistent efforts ', 'Vivaan Ayyar is a player with good defending ability, he needs to work in passing and support gameplay on gaining all possession to quickly attack to create goal scoring chances, he needs to work in making quick runs into free spaces and communicate for the ball also quickly track back into shape on losing the ball possession, working on aerial passes both in long and short ranges will enhance his defending gameplay, a player with good attitude towards hard work and discipline. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(1049, 1049, 'Dhruv Rautela is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to understand the positioning and movement according to the ball, he can further improve in his quick decision making of when to delay and when to head for the tackle under pressure, he can further work in leading the team from the back with effective communication, player with good focus and physicality', 'Dhruv Rautela is a player with good defending ability, he needs to work in passing and support gameplay on gaining all possession to quickly attack to create goal scoring chances, he needs to work in making quick runs into free spaces and communicate for the ball also quickly track back into shape on losing the ball possession, working on aerial passes both in long and short ranges will enhance his defending gameplay, a player with good attitude towards hard work and discipline. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(1050, 1050, 'Anish is in his development phase and is developing well into a versatile player, showing strong understanding of the CDM role and good tactical sense. He now needs to refine his technical execution so that his intelligence translates into more effective actions on the pitch where he needs to further improve in his vision by scanning and communicate when supporting to have better ball possession, overall a player with good potential ', 'Anish is a player with good ball manipulation and has good ability to change direction with the ball, he needs to further work in improving his vision through scanning to distribute quickly to the players making runs ahead to create goal scoring chances, he needs to work in getting back quickly to defensive shape on losing ball possession, a player with significant improvements and is disciplined with consistent efforts. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1051, 1051, 'Abishak is in the development phase, he has improved in his timing of the tackles and is more focused, he needs to further work in his aerial duels which needs more practice, he needs to work on his speed to enhance his transitions, overall a player with good efforts in training', 'Abishak is a player with good ability to defend and has strong tackles, he needs to work on his movement according to the ball played aerially and grounded to position himself while defending, he shows excellent pace and consistently gets into goal-scoring positions, but he needs to improve his transitional discipline and defensive recovery, a player with consistent efforts in training and matches. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments  '),
