(1058, 1058, 'Kedar is in development phase, he has good ability to make quick dribbles, he can further improve in his finishing technique and create goal scoring chances, he needs to further work on his quickness without the ball and approach the ball to score both aerially and on the ground, overall a player with good ability to coach and has potential', 'Kedar is a player with good technique of dribbling,  he needs to work on quick decision making as to when to shoot and when to pass by making quick attempts on the goal, he needs to work on receiving of aerial passes and take shots, working in his speed to receive quick passes will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with good efforts in training and matches'),
