(1062, 1062, 'Aditya  is in development phase, he has good ability to play accurate passes, he needs to further improve in his quick receives away from the opponents and aerial ball control, he needs to work in his defensive transitions and be quick in getting back into shape, a player with good efforts during training and matches\r\n', 'Aditya is a player with good technique to pass and support in combination with his team mates to maintain ball possession, he can further improve in getting back into shape quickly on losing ball possession and defend, while also quickly move ahead on gaining ball possession to create goal scoring chances, he needs to work more in his aerial ball control and receiving technique where the ball needs to be protected, overall a player with good potential to be an effective midfield player. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments  '),
