(1075, 1075, 'Panav is in development phase, he has improved in his movement with the ball and needs to work on getting into free spaces for support, working more in positive transitions will improve his attacking gameplay, a disciplined player with consistent efforts in training sessions ', 'Panav is a player with good ball manipulation and has good ability to change direction with the ball, he needs to further work in his combination play to keep ball possession till the goal scoring chance is created, he needs to work on his off the ball movement on winning the ball possession to quickly attack and create chances on goal for faster attacking gameplay, overall a coachable player with consistent efforts'),
