(1079, 1079, 'Dhruva is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to read the game and get an understanding of the positioning, he needs to further improve in quick reaction during the transitions and move according to the ball, communication is key for a defensive player to maintain the defense line and be consistent in the tackles, overall a player with good eagerness to improve ', 'Dhruva  is a player with good ability to read the game and has become better at it with training, he can further improve in the anticipation of the opponent’s moves and provide support for the defense line by being more proactive and consistent throughout to maintain a steady defensive approach, he has good aerial ball distribution and needs to work more on communicating with the team mates to have more efficient gameplay with more connect and understanding, a coachable player with consistent efforts '),
(1080, 1080, 'Kritagya is a player with good ability to read the game and has become better at it with training, he can further improve in the anticipation of the opponent’s moves and provide support for the defense line by being more proactive and consistent throughout to maintain a steady defensive approach, he has good aerial ball distribution and needs to work more on communicating with the team mates to have more efficient gameplay with more connect and understanding, a coachable player with consistent efforts ', 'Kritagya s a player with good ball manipulation and has good ability to change direction with the ball, he needs to further work in his combination play to keep ball possession till the goal scoring chance is created, he needs to work on his off the ball movement on winning the ball possession to quickly attack and create chances on goal for faster attacking gameplay, overall a coachable player with consistent efforts'),
(1081, 1081, 'Murnal is in development phase, he has good attitude in training and needs to work on quick dribbling ability to take on players 1V1 and deliver a cross or a shot towards the goal, he needs to work on his speed to make more runs and create goal scoring chances, overall a coachable player with consistent efforts', 'Murnal is a player with good ability to pass and support, he needs to work further in his ball manipulation and confident dribbling to take on players in a 1V1 and 2V1 situations which is vital for a forward, he needs to work on his crossing ability to make sure the aerial passes reach the goal area or the team mates with adequate weight and direction, he needs to work on his speed for providing runs into the wings and create more options to score on goal, a player with good efforts and can be an efficient forward '),
(1082, 1082, 'Reyansh has shown decent improvement, particularly in his defending and reading of the game, his adaptability across defensive roles remains a strength, and there is progress in his use of the non-dominant foot. He should continue to improve his speed of play and focus on aerial ability to become more complete defensively. Overall, positive progress.', 'Reyansh has improved well in his defending and game awareness, showing better understanding in different defensive roles, his composure and use of the non-dominant foot have developed. He should focus on improving his aerial presence and decision-making in transition situations. Overall, good progress with areas to refine.'),
