(1084, 1084, 'Alakunta Guhaan Sai is in development phase, he has good ability to make quick dribbles and create chances, he can further improve in his decision making to finish and work in quick transitions, he needs to work on his speed for better runs, a player with good potential\r\n', 'Alakunta Guhaan Sai is a player with good dribbling skillset, he needs to work further in quickly taking a shot when in range of the goal and when to pass and create a batter chance at scoring, he needs to create more space by making runs into free spaces, working on speed will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with positive attitude in training and matches '),
(1085, 1085, 'Vidharth is in development phase, he has good attitude in training and needs to work on quick dribbling ability to take on players 1V1 and deliver a cross or a shot towards the goal, he needs to work on his speed to provide runs and create goal scoring chances, overall a coachable player with consistent efforts', 'Vidharth is a player with good ability to pass and support, he needs to work in his awareness of space and receive with good first touch and improve his ball control to finish on goal effectively, he needs to quickly run into free spaces to move the attack towards the goal and create chances, working on speed with and without the all will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with positive attitude towards hard work and consistency  '),
(1086, 1086, 'Vihaan Kukreja is in development phase, he has good ability to play accurate passes, he needs to further improve in his quick receives away from the opponents and take more shots when in range, he needs to work more in agility to provide quick support, a player with disciplined work ethic and is consistent   ', 'Vihaan Kukreja is a player with good technique to pass in combination with his team mates to maintain ball possession, he can further improve in quick movements with effective receiving and first touch, he needs to take more shots when near the goal and sees and opportunity to create chances of scoring, quickly moving into spaces with change of direction will enhance his gameplay optimally, a coachable player with positive attitude in training and matches\r\n\r\n'),
(1087, 1087, '', 'Ishaan has a strong positive mindset in training and consistently shows great work ethic. He understands his role in every position he plays, and it’s encouraging to see his continued progress and performance.'),
(1088, 1088, 'Kabir is in the development phase, he has improved in his quick movements off the ball, he needs to work more in his attacking by making quick passes, and he has good shooting ability and needs to take more shots, overall a player with good attitude in training ', 'Kabir is a player with good reading of the game, he needs to work in taking more shots when in range of the goal and build accuracy, he needs to track back into position on losing ball possession to help in defending, working in communicating when free will increase his gameplay, a coachable player with good focus and efforts. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments');
INSERT INTO `ci_notes_from_coaching` (`id`, `forms_id`, `notes_frm_tech_dir`, `notes_frm_head_coach`) VALUES
(1089, 1089, 'Neil is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to make accurate passes, he needs to work in his aerial passing and finishing technique, and he needs to work in his transitions and agility for better gameplay, overall a coachable player with discipline', 'Neil is a player with good focus and ability to follow instructions, he needs to further improve in his ball manipulation and create chances on goal with effective passes, he needs to work in his aerial passing to make quick attacks and finish with scanning the goalkeeper position to enhance his attacking gameplay, he needs to quickly track back on losing the ball and provide runs ahead when gaining ball possession which is vital for a player his age to implement, a player with positive attitude towards hard work and is consistent. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(1090, 1090, 'RIshaan is in the development phase, he has improved in his passing ability and needs to further improve in quick receiving and first touch with scanning and awareness of space, and he needs to work in change of direction with the ball for better attacking, a player with good potential ', 'Rishaan is a player with good positional understanding, he needs to further improve in his quick movements into free space with scanning and provide quick options to create chances to score, he needs to further work in his communication to receive passes, confidently taking on players in 1V1 situations and taking shots will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with discipline and is consistent in his efforts. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(1091, 1091, 'Anvith is in development phase, he has good ability to play accurate passes, he needs to further improve in his quick receives away from the opponents and be strong when defending the ball, he needs to work in his speed and he is a player with good discipline', 'Anvith is a player with good technique to pass in combination with his team mates to maintain ball possession, he can further improve in quick movements with effective receiving and first touch, he needs be firm in his defending and have a strong footing in his tackles, he needs to work in his peed to provide quick runs into free spaces and attack optimally, a layer with positive attitude to learn and improve with consistency. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(1092, 1092, 'Vivaan is in development phase, he needs to work in his basic skills of quick passing and support play, he needs to be ready for the next moment after the pass and create chances on goal, he needs to work in his agility and change of direction, a player with good focus and is coachable ', 'Vivaan is a player with good football knowledge, he has good ability to play the pass when required, he can further work in his passing technique in long ranges which is required for a player his age and will develop with more practice, he needs to work in quick scanning and support play after playing the passes and keep the ball possession to create goal scoring chances, working on change of direction with and without the ball will enhance his gameplay, a player with discipline and consistent efforts. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(1093, 1093, 'Ishank is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to make quick dribbles, he needs to work further in his passing and supporting movement, and he needs to work in his agility, a player with good potential ', 'Ishank is a player with good ability to read the game and has good ability to dribble through in free spaces, he needs to work in his quick passing and support ahead for keeping ball possession and create goal scoring chances, he needs to work in his ability to shoot when near the goal area, working on his agility will enhance his gameplay, a player with good discipline and efforts to improve '),
(1094, 1094, 'Choharadev Rajan is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to make quick dribbles, he needs to work further in his passing and supporting movement, and he needs to work in his agility, a player with good potential ', 'Choharadev Rajan is a player with good ability to read the game and has good ability to dribble through in free spaces, he needs to work in his quick passing and support ahead for keeping ball possession and create goal scoring chances, he needs to work in his ability to shoot when near the goal area, working on his agility will enhance his gameplay, a player with good discipline and efforts to improve. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(1095, 1095, 'Samarth is in the development phase, he has improved in his quick movements off the ball, he needs to work more in his attacking by making quick passes, and he has good shooting ability and needs to take more shots, overall a player with good attitude in training ', 'Samarth is a player with good reading of the game, he needs to work in taking more shots when in range of the goal and build accuracy, he needs to track back into position on losing ball possession to help in defending, working in communicating when free will increase his gameplay, a coachable player with good focus and efforts. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(1096, 1096, 'Ayaan is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to make accurate passes, he needs to work in his aerial passing and finishing technique, and he needs to work in his transitions and agility for better gameplay, overall a coachable player with discipline', 'Ayaan is a player with good focus and ability to follow instructions, he needs to further improve in his ball manipulation and create chances on goal with effective passes, he needs to work in his aerial passing to make quick attacks and finish with scanning the goalkeeper position to enhance his attacking gameplay, he needs to quickly track back on losing the ball and provide runs ahead when gaining ball possession which is vital for a player his age to implement, a player with positive attitude towards hard work and is consistent. '),
(1097, 1097, 'Mohammed Salah he has improved in his passing ability and needs to further improve in quick receiving and first touch with scanning and awareness of space, and he needs to work in change of direction with the ball for better attacking, a player with good potential ', 'Mohammed Salah is a player with good positional understanding, he needs to further improve in his quick movements into free space with scanning and provide quick options to create chances to score, he needs to further work in his communication to receive passes, confidently taking on players in 1V1 situations and taking shots will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with discipline and is consistent in his efforts. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments'),
(1098, 1098, 'Zavian  is in development phase, he has good ability to make quick passes, he needs to further work in his long range passing ability and switch the game, he needs to work more in speed with the ball, overall a coachable player with good efforts   ', 'Zavian is a player with good focus in training sessions, he has good ball distribution in close range and maintain ball possession, he needs to further work in his quick switching of ball possession into free spaces to quickly attack with aerial passes, crosses and set-pieces, working more on speed and quickness will enhance his gameplay optimally, a player with positive attitude in training and is consistent in his efforts '),
(1099, 1099, 'Taiyo Nakagaki is in development phase, he has improved in his ability to quickly pass and support and is fast with the ball, he needs to further improve in his vision by scanning and communicate when supporting to have better ball possession, overall a player with good potential ', 'Taiyo Nakagaki is a player with good technique to pass in combination with his team mates to maintain ball possession, he can further improve in quick movements with effective receiving and first touch, he needs to take more shots when near the goal and sees and opportunity to create chances of scoring, quickly moving into spaces with change of direction will enhance his gameplay optimally, a coachable player with positive attitude in training and matches\r\n\r\n'),
(1100, 1100, 'Shohei Okuyama is in development phase, he has good ability to make quick dribbles and create chances, he can further improve in his decision making to finish and work in quick transitions, he needs to work on his speed for better runs, a player with good potential \r\n\r\n', 'Shohei Okuyama  is a player with good dribbling skillset, he needs to work further in quickly taking a shot when in range of the goal and when to pass and create a better chance at scoring, he needs to create more space by making runs into free spaces, working on speed will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with positive attitude in training and matches \r\n\r\n'),
(1101, 1101, 'Ishaan is in the development phase, he has improved in his passing ability and needs to further improve in quick receiving and first touch with scanning and awareness of space, and he needs to work in change of direction with the ball for better attacking, a player with good potential ', 'Ishaan is a player with good positional understanding, he needs to further improve in his quick movements into free space with scanning and provide quick options to create chances to score, he needs to further work in his communication to receive passes, confidently taking on players in 1V1 situations and taking shots will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with discipline and is consistent in his efforts. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments      '),
(1102, 1102, 'Aarit is in the development phase, he has improved in his passing ability and needs to further improve in quick receiving and first touch, he needs to work more in reading the opponent’s movement and time the tackles to gain ball possession, he is developing steadily as a defender, but he needs to improve his technical fundamentals, especially distribution and supporting angles, his communication and defensive organization also require more confidence and consistency, a coachable player with positive attitude ', 'Aarit is a player with good positional understanding, he needs to further improve in his quick movements into free space and receive the ball with right angles to progress the attack quickly, he needs to work on his change of direction to well time his tackles with more physicality that the game demands, he needs to work on his strong footing and strength for effective defending gameplay, he needs to improve his speed with the ball during the attacking moments with more awareness of space and create goal scoring chances with quick attacking, a player with positive attitude to learn and implement in training and matches. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1103, 1103, 'Alvin is in development phase, he has improved in his movement with the ball with good decision making, he needs to further work in his quick passes in long and short ranges with awareness of space, he needs to work in his endurance which is vital for his age, a coachable player with positive attitude in training ', 'Alvin is a player with good football knowledge, he has good ability to play the pass when required and when to hold and dribble, he can further work in his passing technique in long ranges which is required for a player his age and will develop with more practice, working on match endurance will enhance his gameplay optimally to deal with pressure situations, a player with discipline and consistent efforts. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1104, 1104, 'Aaron is in development phase, he has good ability to read the game and provide necessary runs into the free spaces, he needs to further work in is quick dribbling to manipulate the ball and create chances on goal,  he needs to be quick to track back and work in his heading ability, overall a player with positive attitude in training', 'Aaron is a player with good ability to play in his position and understand the role, he needs to further work in his dribbling skillset and take on players to play the ball into the goal area or take a shot whenever necessary, he needs to be ready to track back on losing ball possession and help defensively, working on his vertical jump and heading technique will enhance his attacking gameplay optimally, a player with good discipline and attitude towards working to improve. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1105, 1105, 'Auritro is in development phase, he has good ability to play accurate passes, he needs to further improve in his quick receives away from the opponents and take more shots when in range, he needs to work more in agility to provide quick support, a player with disciplined work ethic and is consistent   ', 'Auritro is a player with good technique to pass in combination with his team mates to maintain ball possession, he can further improve in quick movements with effective receiving and first touch, he needs to take more shots when near the goal and maintain composure in an opportunity to create chances, quickly moving into spaces with change of direction will enhance his gameplay optimally, a coachable player with positive attitude in training and matches'),
(1106, 1106, 'Kiyan faced a big jump moving from U11 seven-a-side to U13 eleven-a-side football, and the increased spaces, distances, and physical demands made the adaptation difficult for him. He initially struggled to understand positional requirements, spatial awareness, and the technical challenges of longer passes and clearances. However, he is showing slow but steady progress, with signs of improved understanding and promise as he continues to adjust.', 'Kiyan needs to keep working on his physical strength, movement, and ability to handle the demands of the larger pitch, especially when operating as an LB or LCB. His decision-making and positional sense are improving, but he still needs to read the game quicker and be more assertive in duels. With continued guidance, he is gradually adapting and showing encouraging signs that he can grow into the role.'),
(1107, 1107, 'Eden is in his development phase, he has improved in his movement with the ball and needs to work on getting into free spaces for support, working more in positive transitions will improve his attacking gameplay, a disciplined player with consistent efforts in training sessions \r\n\r\n', 'Eden is a player with good ball manipulation and has good ability to change direction with the ball, he needs to further work in his combination play to keep ball possession till the goal scoring chance is created, he needs to work on his off the ball movement on winning the ball possession to quickly attack and create chances on goal for faster attacking gameplay, overall a coachable player with consistent efforts.  The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1108, 1108, 'Ashwin is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to understand the positioning and movement according to the ball, he can further improve in his quick decision making of when to delay and when to head for the tackle under pressure, he can further work in leading the team from the back with effective communication, player with good focus and physicality', 'Ashwin is a player with good ability to read the game and has become better at it with training, he can further improve in the anticipation of the opponent’s moves and quickly engage in the defensive stance to time the tackles with more accuracy, he needs to further improve in his decision making to keep the ball possession or play the ball ahead away from the goal, he needs to work in his acceleration and change of direction for enhancing his gameplay, overall a dependable player with good discipline and consistent efforts in training and matches. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments '),
(1109, 1109, 'Aadit is in the development phase and demonstrates good ability to play accurate passes. He should focus on improving quick ball reception under pressure and increasing his willingness to take shots when in range. Enhancing agility to provide faster support play will benefit his overall game. He is a disciplined player with a strong work ethic, but consistency remains an area for further development.', 'Aadit is a technically skilled player who is improving at passing in combination with teammates to maintain possession. He can further develop quick movements, effective receiving, and first touch. Increasing his frequency of shots near the goal and capitalising on opportunities to create scoring chances will enhance his impact. Improving his movement into spaces with rapid changes of direction will optimise his overall gameplay. He is a coachable player with a positive attitude in both training and matches.'),
(1110, 1110, 'Agatsyasinh is in the development phase and demonstrates strong receiving technique and quick finishing ability. He should focus on improving his aerial passing to create goal-scoring opportunities through crosses, as well as enhancing his agility and change of direction to take on opponents more effectively. Overall, he is a coachable player with good discipline.', 'Agatsyasinh is a player with a positive attitude in training and demonstrates strong ability in quick combinations and creating scoring opportunities. He should focus on confidently taking on defenders and generating chances through crosses and rapid passes in the attacking area. Further development in applying immediate pressure when possession is lost, as well as improving change of direction and quickness with the ball, will enhance his attacking gameplay. He is hardworking and consistent in his efforts, overall, a player with potential. '),
(1111, 1111, 'Arnav is in the development phase and has shown improvement in understanding positioning and movement relative to the ball. He should continue developing quick decision-making, particularly in knowing when to delay or commit to a tackle under pressure. Enhancing his ability to lead the team from the back through effective communication will further strengthen his game. He is a focused player with good physical presence.', 'Arnav has a strong ability to read the game, which has improved significantly with training. He can further enhance anticipation of opponents’ movements and react more quickly in defensive stances to time tackles accurately. Improving decision-making on when to retain possession or play the ball forward will increase his effectiveness. Developing acceleration and agility will further elevate his overall gameplay. He is a disciplined player who consistently gives his best in training and matches. Arnav was injured during the physical testing. '),
(1112, 1112, 'Zane is in the development phase and demonstrates good ability to read the game and make effective runs into free spaces. He should focus on improving quick dribbling to manipulate the ball and create goal-scoring opportunities. Additionally, developing speed in tracking back and enhancing heading ability will strengthen his overall play. He is a player with a positive attitude in training.', 'Zane is a player with a strong understanding of his position and role on the field. He should further develop his dribbling skills to take on opponents, create opportunities in the goal area, and take shots when appropriate. Being ready to track back upon losing possession and contribute defensively will enhance his overall game. Improving his vertical jump and heading technique will further strengthen his attacking effectiveness. He is a disciplined player with a positive attitude toward improving his skills. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1113, 1113, '', ''),
(1114, 1114, 'Abhinav is in the development phase and has shown improvement in passing and receiving. He can further develop his first touch and ball protection skills. Enhancing his ability to transition quickly upon gaining possession and play the ball forward to create chances will strengthen his impact. Further work on speed, both with and without the ball, will optimise his performance. He is a player with good potential.', 'Abhinav is a player with good dribbling skills and the ability to play quick passes. He can further develop quick movement to receive the ball away from opponents and improve turning with the ball while protecting in possession. Enhancing his ability to distribute the ball to teammates, making forward runs quickly will create more goal-scoring opportunities. He is a player with a positive attitude in both training and matches. Abhinav was absent for the Yo-Yo testing'),
(1115, 1115, 'Arjuunraj is in the development phase and has shown improvement in his movement with the ball. He should focus on enhancing decision-making and further developing quick passing, both short and long, with greater awareness of space. Improving endurance, which is vital for his age, will also benefit his performance. He is a coachable player with a positive attitude in training.', 'Arjuunraj is a player with strong football knowledge but needs to improve his decision-making regarding when to pass effectively or hold and dribble. He can further develop his long-range passing, which is important for a player of his age and will improve with continued practice. Enhancing match endurance will optimize his performance under pressure. He is a disciplined player who consistently puts forth effort.'),
(1116, 1116, 'Akshat is in the development phase and demonstrates a positive attitude in training. He should focus on improving his 1v1 dribbling ability to take on opponents and deliver effective crosses or shots on goal. Enhancing his speed will help him make forward runs and create more goal-scoring opportunities. Overall, he is a coachable player who consistently puts in effort.', 'Akshat is a player with strong passing ability and a good sense of supporting teammates. He should work on spatial awareness, first touch, and ball control to finish effectively on goal. Improving his ability to run into free spaces quickly will help advance attacks and create more scoring opportunities. Developing speed with and without the ball will further enhance his attacking gameplay. He is a player with a positive attitude, strong work ethic, and consistent effort. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1117, 1117, 'Vedant is in the development phase and has shown improvement in quick off-the-ball movements. He should focus on enhancing his attacking gameplay by quickly supporting in free spaces upon winning possession. Further development in aerial and long-range passing will strengthen his overall contribution. Overall, he is a player with good potential.', 'Vedant is a player with a strong desire to improve through hard work. He should focus on making quick runs into free spaces to support attacking play while communicating effectively with teammates, and be ready to regain defensive shape when possession is lost. Further development in short- and long-range passing accuracy, as well as improving change of direction with and without the ball, will optimise his overall gameplay. He is a player with a positive attitude towards hard work and learning. Vedant was absent for the Yo-Yo testing. '),
(1118, 1118, 'Divith is in the development phase and has shown improvement in passing ability. He should focus on enhancing quick receiving and first touch, as well as reading opponents’ movements to time tackles effectively and regain possession. He is a coachable player with a positive attitude in training.', 'Divith is a player with good positional understanding. He should focus on improving quick movements into free space and receiving the ball at optimal angles to progress attacks efficiently. Enhancing change of direction and physicality will help him time tackles more effectively. Developing a strong footing and strength will strengthen his defensive gameplay, while improving speed with the ball and spatial awareness will increase his ability to create goal-scoring opportunities during attacks. He is a player with a positive attitude toward learning and implementing feedback.'),
(1119, 1119, 'Arjun is in the development phase and has shown improvement in passing and receiving. He can further develop his first touch and ball protection skills. Enhancing quick transitions upon gaining possession to play the ball forward and create chances will strengthen his impact. Further work on speed, both with and without the ball, will optimise his performance. He is a player with good potential.', 'Arjun is in the development phase and has improved in quick off-the-ball movements. He should focus on enhancing his attacking play by quickly supporting in free spaces upon winning ball possession. Further development in aerial and long-range passing will strengthen his overall contribution. Overall, he is a player with good potential. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1120, 1120, 'Shivang is in the development phase and demonstrates strong dribbling ability. He should further develop quick passing and supporting play to create goal-scoring opportunities. Improving communication and spatial awareness will help him make effective runs and finish on goal. With consistent effort, he has the potential to become an efficient attacker.', 'Shivang is a player with strong game knowledge. He should focus on improving quick decision-making, knowing when to pass and maintain possession versus when to dribble into space. Enhancing finishing technique, with awareness of the goalkeeper’s position, will increase his effectiveness in front of goal. Developing change of direction, both with and without the ball, will further enhance his attacking gameplay. He is a player with a positive attitude in training and matches.'),
(1121, 1121, 'Akshaj is in the development phase and has shown improvement in tackle timing and overall focus. He should continue working on aerial duels, which requires further practice, he needs to enhance his speed to improve transitions. Overall, he is a player who demonstrates good effort in training.', 'Akshaj is a player with strong defensive ability and effective tackling. He should focus on improving his positioning both aerially and on the ground according to the ball. Enhancing his ability to quickly track back when possession is lost and anticipating opponents’ movements will strengthen his defensive impact. Increased communication with teammates will further improve team cohesion. He is a disciplined player who consistently puts forth effort in training and matches.'),
(1122, 1122, 'Mridhul is in the development phase and has shown improvement in tackle timing and quickly regaining possession. He should focus on developing quick passing and support play to initiate attacks and create goal-scoring opportunities through crosses and passes. Overall, he is a player with good potential.', 'Mridhul is a player with a confident approach in training. He should focus on improving his positioning to anticipate and cover passing options of the opposition. On gaining possession, he can enhance attacking play by quickly distributing the ball to create goal-scoring opportunities. Further development of speed with the ball will strengthen his attacking impact. He is a patient player who adapts quickly and follows instructions well. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1123, 1123, 'Sourish has settled in well and shows good understanding of our game model. Continued work on transition speed and defensive recovery will strengthen his impact within the back line.\r\nEncouraging start with strong tactical awareness. Needs targeted development in defensive transition and reaction speed to align fully with the team’s defensive principles.', 'Sourish has recently joined the squad and is adapting well to the new system and playing style. He shows good game understanding, composure on the ball, and awareness in defensive organization. His willingness to learn and integrate into the team structure is evident. To further progress, Sourish should focus on improving his defensive transition, particularly in reacting quickly and recovering positions when possession is lost.'),
(1124, 1124, 'Yagesh is in the development phase and demonstrates a positive attitude in training. He should focus on improving his 1v1 dribbling to take on opponents and deliver effective crosses or shots on goal. Enhancing his speed will help him make forward runs and create more goal-scoring opportunities. Overall, he is a coachable player who consistently puts in effort.', 'Yagyesh is a player with strong passing ability and a good sense of supporting teammates. He should focus on improving spatial awareness, first touch, and ball control to finish more effectively. Enhancing his ability to quickly move into free spaces will help advance attacks and create additional scoring opportunities. Developing speed, both with and without the ball, will further strengthen his attacking play. He is a disciplined player with a positive attitude and consistent effort.'),
(1125, 1125, 'Aarav has shown encouraging growth in his dual roles as wingback and winger. His physical output is a clear strength, and he contributes with consistency during training and match play. The next stage for him is to enhance his game intelligence, recognising space, anticipating opposition movements, and supporting play with better decision-making. Technically, he needs further repetition to improve execution under pressure, but the foundation is strong. With ongoing guidance and structured training, Aarav has the potential to develop into a dynamic and dependable wide player.', 'Aarav demonstrates a strong work rate and consistently supports both attacking and defensive phases. His energy and willingness to recover make him reliable in wide channels. To progress further, he needs to improve his tactical awareness and understanding when to press, when to hold width, and how to adjust his positioning in transitions. Technically, continued focus on first touch, crossing quality, and 1v1 actions will help him become more effective. His overall development is positive, and he is responding well to coaching feedback. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1126, 1126, 'Nivaan is progressing at a healthy rate. The transition from U-13 to U-15 is significant, His main areas of development lie in quicker decision-making and meeting the technical intensity required at this level. As the game becomes faster and more physically demanding, he must improve his ability to scan, anticipate, and execute actions earlier. With continued exposure, structured training, and confidence building, he is well-positioned to adapt fully and grow into a more assured and effective player in the U-15 environment.', 'Nivaan is adapting well to the increased pace and physicality of the U-15 age group. He shows good willingness to learn and compete, but he needs to keep improving his understanding of the current game demands, especially reacting quicker, releasing the ball earlier, and making better decisions under pressure. Technically, more consistency in first touch, passing speed, and ball control during tight moments will help him cope with the higher level. Positive attitude and steady improvement are visible as he adjusts to this age category. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1127, 1127, 'Neil’s transition into U-15 has been positive, though he must continue working on meeting the game’s intensity and technical speed. As a striker and attacking midfielder, quicker recognition of spaces, faster execution, and more decisive actions are essential for his role. The higher age group demands sharper technical control and faster scanning to stay effective. With continued training, confidence, and exposure to competitive situations, Neil has the potential to settle well and become a more impactful attacking player at this level.', 'Neil is adjusting to the higher tempo and physical demands of the U-15 level. He has good intent in his movement and positioning, but he needs to develop quicker decision-making and especially in final-third actions such as releasing the ball earlier, choosing the right option, and reacting faster to pressure. Technically, improving his first touch, combination play, and finishing under pressure will help him cope with the increased speed of the age category. He is showing steady progress and is gradually adapting to the demands. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1128, 1128, 'Rishik is in the development phase and has shown improvement in quick off-the-ball movements. He should focus on enhancing his attacking play by quickly supporting in free spaces upon winning possession. Further development in aerial and long-range passing will strengthen his overall contribution. Overall, he is a player with good potential.', 'Rishik is a player who can make significant improvements with consistent training. He should focus on making quick runs into free spaces to support attacking play, communicate effectively with teammates, and regain defensive shape promptly when possession is lost. Further development in short- and long-range passing, as well as improving change of direction with and without the ball, will enhance his overall gameplay. He is a player with a positive attitude toward learning and consistent effort. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1129, 1129, 'Karthikeya is in the development phase and has shown improvement in tackle timing and quickly regaining possession. He should focus on developing quick passing and support play to launch attacks and create goal-scoring opportunities through crosses and passes. Overall, he is a player with good potential.', 'Karthikeya is a player with a confident approach in training. He should focus on improving his positioning to anticipate and cover opponents’ passing options. On gaining possession, he can enhance attacking play by distributing the ball effectively to create goal-scoring opportunities, utilising strong crossing ability. Further development of speed with the ball will strengthen his attacking impact. He is a patient player who learns quickly, adapts well, and follows instructions effectively. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1130, 1130, 'Aidan is in the development phase and has shown improvement in passing and receiving. He can further develop his first touch and ball protection skills. Enhancing quick transitions upon gaining possession to play the ball forward and create chances will strengthen his impact. Further work on speed, both with and without the ball, will optimise his overall performance. He is a player with good potential.', 'Aidan is a player with strong ability in quick passing. He can further develop off-the-ball awareness and movement to receive the ball away from opponents and turn while maintaining possession. Improving his ability to quickly distribute the ball to teammates, making forward runs will create more goal-scoring opportunities. He is a player with a positive attitude in both training and matches. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1131, 1131, 'Neev is in the development phase and demonstrates a positive attitude in training. He should focus on improving his 1v1 dribbling to take on opponents and deliver effective crosses or shots on goal. Enhancing his speed will help him make forward runs and create more goal-scoring opportunities. Overall, he is a coachable player who consistently puts in effort.', 'Neev is a player with strong passing ability and a good sense of supporting teammates. He should work on spatial awareness, first touch, and ball control to finish effectively on goal. Improving his ability to quickly move into free spaces will help advance attacks and create more scoring opportunities. Developing speed, both with and without the ball, will further enhance his attacking play. He is a player with a positive attitude toward hard work and consistency. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1132, 1132, 'Advaith is in the development phase and has shown improvement in passing and receiving. He can further develop his first touch and ball protection skills. Enhancing quick transitions upon gaining possession to play the ball forward and create chances will strengthen his impact. Further work on speed, both with and without the ball, will optimise his overall performance. He is a player with good potential.', 'Avaith is a player with good dribbling skills and the ability to play quick passes. He can further develop off-the-ball movement to receive the ball away from opponents and turn while protecting possession. Improving his ability to distribute the ball to teammates, making forward runs quickly will create more goal-scoring opportunities. He is a player with a positive attitude in both training and matches. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1133, 1133, 'Lokshith is in the development phase and has shown improvement in tackle timing and focus. He should continue working on aerial duels, which require additional practice, and enhance his speed to improve transitions. Overall, he is a player who demonstrates good effort in training.', 'Lokshith is a player with strong defensive ability and effective tackling. He should focus on improving positioning both aerially and on the ground according to the ball. Enhancing his ability to quickly track back when possession is lost and anticipating opponents’ movements will strengthen his defensive impact. Increasing communication with teammates will further improve team cohesion. He is a disciplined player who consistently puts forth effort in training and matches. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1134, 1134, 'Shubham is in the development phase and shows confidence in dribbling and taking on opponents. He should work on improving his scanning ability to identify attacking options and create chances. Further development in defensive transitions and speed will enhance his overall impact. Overall, he is a coachable player with good potential.', 'Shubham is a player with good positioning and dribbling skills. He should further develop spatial awareness and look for options to create goal-scoring opportunities, whether through finishing, delivering crosses, or providing support in scoring positions. Improving speed will enhance his attacking play by enabling quicker runs upon gaining possession. He should also communicate effectively when moving into free spaces and actively request the ball to optimise attacking opportunities. He is a disciplined player who is consistent in his efforts. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments '),
(1135, 1135, 'Prajwal is in the development phase and has shown improvement in passing and receiving. He can further develop his first touch and ball protection skills. Enhancing quick transitions upon gaining possession to play the ball forward and create chances will strengthen his overall impact. Further work on speed, both with and without the ball, will optimise his performance. He is a player with good potential.', 'Prajwal is a player with strong passing and receiving skills and can further improve his ability to play quick passes. He should work on off-the-ball movement to receive the ball away from opponents and turn while protecting possession. Enhancing his ability to distribute the ball to teammates, making forward runs quickly will create more goal-scoring opportunities. He is a player with a positive attitude in both training and matches. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1136, 1136, 'Rayan is in the development phase and has shown improvement in tackle timing and focus. He should continue developing aerial duels and work on enhancing his speed to improve transitions. Overall, he is a player who demonstrates strong effort in training.', 'Rayan is a player with strong defensive ability and effective tackling. He should focus on improving positioning, both aerially and on the ground, according to the ball. Enhancing his ability to quickly track back when possession is lost and anticipating opponents’ movements will strengthen his defensive impact. Increased communication with teammates will further improve team cohesion. He is a disciplined player who consistently puts forth effort in training and matches. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1137, 1137, 'Jyotiraditya is in the development phase and demonstrates strong ability in quick dribbling and creating chances. He can further improve decision-making in finishing and enhance effectiveness in quick transitions. Developing speed will allow him to make better attacking runs. Overall, he is a player with good potential.', 'Jyotiraditya is a player with strong dribbling skills. He should work on making quick decisions to shoot when in range or pass to create better scoring opportunities. Improving off-the-ball movement to make runs into free spaces will help create space, and developing speed will further enhance his attacking play. He is a player with a positive attitude in both training and matches. Jyotiraditya wasn\'t present for physical testing. '),
(1138, 1138, '', ''),
(1139, 1139, 'Dhruv continues to be an exceptionally coachable player who brings a consistently positive attitude both on and off the pitch. Over the past six months, he has shown steady growth and increasing maturity in his approach to training and competition, which has been highly encouraging. His technical quality and tactical awareness—already strong for his age—have further developed, and he is now demonstrating these strengths with greater confidence in high-pressure situations. Dhruv’s composure in and out of possession has noticeably improved, and his ability to compete and influence challenging games has become more apparent. This growth has led to more consistent and impactful performances, reinforcing the important role he plays within our Elite League U18 squad. His presence on the pitch is becoming increasingly reliable, and he is contributing in ways that elevate both his own game and the performance of those around him. While maintaining full concentration across the entire 90 minutes remains an area for further improvement, he is progressing well and showing a clear upward trajectory. Overall, Dhruv is making the right strides in this crucial stage of his development, and with the mindset and dedication he continues to display, we are confident he will keep growing into an even more influential member of the team.', 'Dhruv has continued to build on the progress highlighted in his earlier review and has firmly established himself as an integral part of our Elite League U18 squad. His tactical understanding remains one of his standout qualities, and he consistently demonstrates the versatility that strengthens our overall team structure. Dhruv has become increasingly confident operating across multiple positions, showing a deeper awareness of his responsibilities within varied tactical systems.In addition to his on-field intelligence, Dhruv has shown commendable growth in his leadership and mental attributes. His self-belief has continued to develop, and he now responds to challenging moments with greater composure and maturity. Notably, he has taken on more responsibility during difficult phases of games, often setting the standard for his teammates through his attitude and work rate. While there is still scope for him to push for even greater consistency across all matches, his development over this period has been highly encouraging. Dhruv’s progression, adaptability, and strengthening mindset make him an important and reliable member of the squad. We look forward to supporting his continued growth as he takes on an even more influential role in the months ahead. \r\n**Note: Few assessment values are recorded as 0.00/ NA because the player was absent during the testing session.**'),
(1140, 1140, 'Dheer is in his development Phase. It is also important to note that Dheer has missed a significant number of sessions during this period. For his development to accelerate and for him to reach the standards expected at this stage, greater consistency in attendance and commitment to training is crucial. Regular participation will directly support improvements in both physical performance and tactical understanding.', 'To progress effectively, Dheer needs to further refine the technical components of his game and strive for greater consistency in his performances. However, a significant challenge in his development has been his inconsistent attendance. He has missed many sessions over the past months, which limits our ability to accurately evaluate his progress and slows down his overall improvement. For Dheer to fully benefit from the training programme and reach the standards expected at this stage, regular participation in sessions is essential. With improved consistency and continued focus, he has the potential to take important steps forward in the coming months. Key technical and physical areas—such as recovery speed, 1v1 defending, and the quality of his clearances—still require focused development, Composure on the ball. While progress has been evident, continued attention to these aspects will be essential for him to compete consistently at the required level.\r\n**Note: The YO-YO IR1 value is recorded as 0.00 because the player was absent during the testing session**'),
(1141, 1141, 'Satvik is in his development phase. It should be noted that Satvik has still missed several scheduled sessions and assessments during this period. These absences limit our ability to fully evaluate the consistency of his improvements across all areas. For a more complete and accurate assessment, regular attendance will be essential going forward. We are pleased with Satvik’s development trajectory, and with continued focus, discipline, and consistent participation, he remains on track to fulfil his potential in the seasons ahead.', 'Satvik has missed a number of training sessions and scheduled assessment periods. As a result, we are unable to fully evaluate the extent of his improvements or identify areas where progress may be lacking. To support his continued development, consistent attendance will be essential moving forward.Overall, Satvik has taken positive steps, and with regular training and commitment, he has the potential to advance to higher levels of football. **Note: Assessment values are recorded as 0.00/ NA because the player was absent during the testing session.**'),
(1142, 1142, 'Vishwak has shown commendable development over the past five months, attending training regularly and contributing positively to the team environment. He has demonstrated moments of excellence in the DPDL, highlighting his technical abilities and his understanding of the game.While his overall performance has been promising, there are still fluctuations that need to be addressed. Focusing on delivering consistent performances will be essential for him to maximize his potential.Overall, Vishwak’s commitment and progress are highly encouraging, and with sustained effort and discipline, he is well-positioned to continue advancing within the program.', 'Vishwak has maintained regular attendance in training and has shown very good progress over the past five months. He delivered some standout performances in the DPDL super cup, demonstrating his technical ability, game intelligence, and impact on the field. However, his performances have been somewhat inconsistent, and he now needs to focus on maintaining a high standard across all games. Developing greater consistency in his play will be key to maximizing his potential and becoming a more reliable contributor to the team. Overall, Vishwak’s growth over this period has been encouraging, and with continued focus, discipline, and consistency, he is well-positioned to build on this progress in the coming months. \r\n**Note: Assessment details were recorded as Not Available (N/A) / 0.00 due to the player’s absence during scheduled evaluation sessions**');
INSERT INTO `ci_notes_from_coaching` (`id`, `forms_id`, `notes_frm_tech_dir`, `notes_frm_head_coach`) VALUES
(1143, 1143, 'Over the past six months, Gurudev has continued to make steady and noticeable improvements in his game. His technical execution, particularly in dribbling and ball control, has become more refined, allowing him to maintain possession and create opportunities more effectively.Tactically, he has developed a better understanding of pressing situations and is making smarter decisions on the pitch.Gurudev has grown in confidence and demonstrates increased awareness in his play, contributing more effectively to team dynamics.Overall, his development over this period has been very encouraging, and with continued focus and commitment, he is well-placed to build on this progress in the months ahead.', 'Over the past six months, Gurudev has continued to develop well. His positioning and movement have become noticeably more structured, enabling him to contribute effectively in both attacking and defensive phases. His increased work rate, discipline, and reliability on the pitch have made him a more consistent performer for the team. Technically, he has shown progress, particularly in his overall play and decision-making. Continuing to refine his shooting accuracy will further enhance his impact in the final third. Additionally, developing leadership qualities and taking on a more vocal, guiding role within the team will be an important next step in his growth. Gurudev’s improvements over this period are encouraging, and with continued focus on technical refinement and leadership, he is well-positioned to make an even greater contribution to the squad in the coming months.\r\nNote: Some Assessment values were recorded as Not Available (N/A) / 0.00 due to the player’s absence during scheduled evaluation sessions.'),
(1144, 1144, 'Over the past six months, Yohann has demonstrated notable development within the program. His positive attitude and commitment in both training and matches have been instrumental in supporting his growth, and he has made visible improvements in key aspects of his game.From a defensive perspective, Yohann’s 1v1 defending, scanning, maintenance of defensive shape, and ability to execute clearances and defensive headers have all progressed. His sprinting, agility, and overall body coordination have also improved, enhancing his contribution during transitional phases of play. Yohann continues to show strong potential, and with sustained focus on refining his technical skills and tactical understanding, he is well-positioned to make an even greater impact for the team in upcoming competitions. His development trajectory reflects both his ability and his commitment to becoming a more complete defender in the coming years.', 'Over the past six months, Yohann has continued to make positive strides in his development, despite missing approximately six weeks due to injury. He remains a hard-working and disciplined athlete, demonstrating strong behaviour on and off the field. His ability to absorb coaching instructions and apply them effectively has continued to improve, and his maturity and productive communication on the pitch have been notable.Technically and tactically, Yohann has made progress in key areas, though continued focus on defending under pressure and handling aerial challenges will further strengthen his game. Consistency in performance, regardless of the opponent’s level, remains an important target as he continues to develop. Overall, Yohann’s resilience and growth over this period are commendable. With continued dedication, he is well-positioned to build on this momentum and further enhance his impact in the coming months.\r\n**Note: Assessment details were recorded as Not Available (N/A) / 0.00 due to the player’s absence during scheduled evaluation sessions**'),
(1145, 1145, 'Arvin is in development phase, he has good ability to read the game and position himself in free spaces, he needs to work in his communication and shooting technique which will enhance his finishing optimally, working on physicality will be a good approach to build overall attacking capability, a player with good attitude & good techinical quality - has good potential for the future.', 'Arvin continues to demonstrate strong potential with his good dribbling ability and impressive speed, which allow him to effectively take on defenders and create attacking opportunities. His attitude and commitment in matches have been positive, contributing well to the team environment.To further enhance his impact, Arvin should focus on improving his finishing , heading ability, leadership qualities. Strengthening these aspects of his game will make him a more complete attacking player and increase his effectiveness in the final third. Overall, Arvin shows very good potential for the future. With continued dedication, technical refinement, and focus on the areas highlighted, he is well-placed to progress further in his development and contribute significantly to the team. Note: **NOTE : Assessment details are not available (N/A) as Arvin was absent on several occasions during the scheduled assessment periods**'),
(1146, 1146, 'Dhruv remains in the development phase and continues to demonstrate strong potential as an attacking player. His dribbling ability is a key asset, allowing him to take on defenders and create opportunities in the final third. To further enhance his impact, Dhruv should focus on improving his quick passing, support play, and overall awareness of space. Strengthening his communication on the field will help him make better runs and finish goal-scoring opportunities more effectively. Additionally, improving his speed and stamina will allow him to sustain high-intensity efforts throughout matches and contribute consistently in both attacking and defensive phases. With continued dedication, consistent work, and focus on these areas, Dhruv has the potential to develop into a highly efficient and influential attacker within the team.', 'Dhruv is a technically gifted player, particularly strong in dribbling, and shows encouraging potential as an attacker. To elevate his game, he should focus on improving his quick decision-making—knowing when to shoot and when to pass—and taking more frequent, decisive attempts on goal. Additionally, working on receiving and defending aerial passes under pressure will strengthen his overall game impact. Enhancing his speed and agility to receive and execute quick passes will further improve his attacking effectiveness.Dhruv demonstrates good effort in both training(whenever he present for training)  and matches, and with continued focus on these areas, he has the potential to become a more consistent and influential attacking player for the team. We expect him to be free of injury so that he can contribute for the full game as well.\r\n**Note: Assessment details were recorded as Not Available (N/A) / 0.00 due to the player’s absence during scheduled evaluation sessions**'),
(1147, 1147, 'Aaron has shown strong development becoming a reliable and influential member of the U17 squad with his commitment & dedication. He has contributed consistently with goals and assists and has grown in confidence and decision-making on the pitch. To continue his progression, Aaron should focus on improving his aerial ability with & without the ball, maintaining overall fitness, and staying injury-free. With continued effort and focus on these areas, he has the potential to further elevate his impact and performance at higher levels.', 'Over the past six months, Aaron has shown significant improvement and has become a consistent performer within the U17 squad. He has contributed effectively to the team with goals and assists, demonstrating growing confidence, technical ability, and understanding of the game. His involvement has made him an integral part of the squad, and his presence on the pitch is increasingly impactful. To continue his development, Aaron should focus on maintaining overall fitness, managing his workload to remain injury-free, and further refining his technical and tactical skills. Sustained effort in these areas will allow him to compete at higher levels and maximize his potential.Overall, Aaron’s progress during this period is very encouraging, and with continued dedication, he is well-positioned to build on this momentum in the coming months.\r\n**Note: Some assessment details were recorded as Not Available (N/A) / 0.00 due to the player’s absence during evaluation sessions.**'),
(1148, 1148, 'Devarsh is a disciplined athlete who demonstrates professionalism both on and off the field. He approaches every training session with dedication and a clear desire to improve, consistently applying the instructions and feedback provided by the coaching staff. To enhance his effectiveness further, he should focus on refining his finishing and heading skills. A key area for development is consistent attendance at training sessions, as regular participation will allow him to build fitness, sharpen technical skills, and maximize his potential. With continued commitment and focus, Devarsh is well-positioned to take his game to the next level.', 'Devarsh has shown positive development over the past six months and continues to be a valuable team member, bringing a good attitude and strong game-reading ability that benefits the squad. He has performed well individually and contributed effectively in matches. Enhancing his effectiveness in aerial duels and further developing leadership qualities to guide the team from the back will significantly strengthen his impact on the field. It is important to note that his overall fitness levels and attendance in training have been lower than expected. Improving these aspects will be critical to maximize his potential, sustain performance, and take on a stronger leadership role. Overall, Devarsh has done well, and with focused effort on fitness, attendance, aerial duels, and leadership, he can further enhance his contribution to the team.\r\n**Note: Assessment details were recorded as Not Available (N/A) / 0.00 due to the player’s absence during scheduled evaluation sessions**'),
(1149, 1149, 'Kanishk is a player with a positive mindset and a good approach to training. To continue progressing, he needs to place greater emphasis on improving his defensive transitions, ensuring he recovers quickly and positions himself effectively when the team loses possession.On the attacking side, his effectiveness in 1v1 situations on the flank must develop further so he can consistently beat defenders and create danger. Kanishk would also benefit from improving his finishing & crossing quality. Developing sharper field awareness—understanding where space, teammates, and opponents are—will help him make more efficient decisions under pressure. With continued focus and dedication to these areas, Kanishk has the potential to become a more complete and impactful wide player.', 'Over the past six months, Kanishk has continued to show commitment and a consistently positive attitude in training and matches. He needs to gradually improvem his finishing and crossing, particularly when working with aerial deliveries. To progress further, Kanishk now needs to step up his overall impact in training and competition. Becoming more aggressive, demanding of himself, and willing to challenge players competing for the same position will be crucial for his next stage of development. Enhancing his decision-making—specifically knowing when to cross and when to take on defenders—will also increase his effectiveness in the final third. Additionally, improving his reactions and work rate during negative transitions will strengthen his overall contribution to the team. We are pleased with Kanishk’s progress, and with increased assertiveness and competitiveness in sessions, he has the potential to elevate his game to the next level in the coming months.\r\n**Note: Some assessment details were recorded as Not Available (N/A) / 0.00 due to the player’s absence during scheduled evaluation sessions**'),
(1150, 1150, 'Eshaan is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to understand the positioning and movement according to the ball, he can further improve in his quick decision making of when to delay and when to head for the tackle under pressure, he can further work in leading the team from the back with effective communication, player with good focus and physicality', 'Eshaan is a player with good ability to read the game and has become better at it with training, he can further improve in the anticipation of the opponent’s moves and quickly engage in the defensive stance to time the tackles with more accuracy, he needs to further improve in his decision making to keep the ball possession or play the ball ahead away from the goal, he needs to work in his acceleration and change of direction for enhancing his gameplay, overall a player with good discipline and consistent efforts in training and matches. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present for the Yo-Yo Testing '),
(1151, 1151, '', ''),
(1152, 1152, 'Renthlei is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to understand the positioning and movement according to the ball, he can further improve in his quick decision making of when to delay and when to head for the tackle under pressure, he can further work in leading the team from the back with effective communication, player with good focus and physicality', 'Renthlei is a player with good ability to read the game and has become better at it with training, he can further improve in the anticipation of the opponent’s moves and quickly engage in the defensive stance to time the tackles with more accuracy, he needs to further improve in his decision making to keep the ball possession or play the ball ahead away from the goal, he needs to work in his acceleration and change of direction for enhancing his gameplay, overall a dependable player with good discipline and consistent efforts in training and matches. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1153, 1153, 'Shashank is in the development phase, he has improved in his quick movements off the ball, he needs to work more in his attacking gameplay on winning ball possession as to support quickly in free spaces and move ahead, he needs to further work in his aerial and long range passes, overall a player with good potential ', 'Shashank is a player with good intent to improve with hard work, he needs to work in his quick runs into free spaces to support with effective communication during attacking play and be ready to get back in shape on losing the ball possession, he needs to work more in his passing accuracy in short and long ranges, he needs to work in his change of direction with and without the ball to enhance his gameplay optimally, a player with positive attitude towards hard work and learning. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1154, 1154, 'Dhanin is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to understand the positioning and movement according to the ball, he can further improve in his quick decision making of when to delay and when to head for the tackle under pressure, he can further work in leading the team from the back with effective communication, player with good focus and physicality', 'Dhanin is a player with good ability to read the game and has become better at it with training, he can further improve in the anticipation of the opponent’s moves and quickly engage in the defensive stance to time the tackles with more accuracy, he needs to further improve in his decision making to keep the ball possession or play the ball ahead away from the goal, he needs to work in his acceleration and change of direction for enhancing his gameplay, overall a player with good discipline and consistent efforts in training and matches. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1155, 1155, 'Tharun is in development phase, he has good ability to read the game and provide necessary runs into the free spaces, he needs to further work in is quick dribbling to manipulate the ball and create chances on goal,  he needs to be quick to track back and work in his heading ability, overall a player with positive attitude in training ', 'Tharun is a player with good ability to play in his position and understand the role, he needs to further work in his dribbling skillset and take on players to play the ball into the goal area or take a shot whenever necessary, he needs to be ready to track back on losing ball possession and help defensively, working on his vertical jump and heading technique will enhance his attacking gameplay optimally, a player with good discipline and attitude towards working to improve. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1156, 1156, 'Advaith is in development phase, he has good ability to play accurate passes, he needs to further improve in his quick receives away from the opponents and aerial ball control, he needs to work in his defensive transitions and be quick in getting back into shape, a player with good efforts during training and matches', 'Advaith is a player with good technique to pass and support in combination with his team mates to maintain ball possession, he can further improve in getting back into shape quickly on losing ball possession and defend, while also quickly move ahead on gaining ball possession to create goal scoring chances, he needs to work more in his aerial ball control and receiving technique where the ball needs to be protected, overall a player with good potential to be an effective midfield player. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1157, 1157, 'Aarov is in development phase, he has good ability to make quick dribbles, he can further improve in his finishing technique and create goal scoring chances, he needs to further work on his quickness without the ball and approach the ball to score both aerially and on the ground, overall a player with good ability to be coached and has potential', 'Aarov is a player with good technique of dribbling,  he needs to work on quick decision making as to when to shoot and when to pass by making quick attempts on the goal, he needs to work on receiving of aerial passes and take shots, working on his speed to receive quick passes will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with good efforts in training and matches.'),
(1158, 1158, 'Vedanth is in development phase, he has good ability to change the direction with the ball and is quick in his passes, he needs to work on his shielding and protecting the ball which is vital and finish the chances created with quick decisions under pressure, needs to work on his aerial receives and finishing with headers, overall a hardworking player with good discipline', 'Vedanth is a player with good attitude in training, he has good ability to make quick combinations and create chances to score, he needs to further improve in his ability to receive and take first touch away from the defenders and protect the ball to convert it into a cross or a shot towards the goal, he needs to further work in his Vertical Jump to meet the crosses for headers and finish, working on speed with the ball will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with good attitude towards training and working consistently. '),
(1159, 1159, 'Srutaan is in the development phase, he has improved in his movement with the ball, he can further improve in his transitions which is a vital part for a player his age, he needs to work more in the physicality part of the game to have strong tackles and improve the defending techniques, overall a player with positive approach towards hard work ', 'Srutaan is a player with positive attitude in training, he has improved in his quick passing and receiving gameplay according to the position and needs to further improve in the movements in and out of ball possession since the behavior of a player during transitions are of much importance for a player his age and he needs to focus more in having a strong footing and have the ability to withstand physical contact from the attacking players to keep up a strong defending nature, he is a disciplined player with consistent efforts. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1160, 1160, 'Rishi is in the development phase, he has improved in his timing of the tackles and is more focused, he can further improve in the decision making to approach aerial balls and make sure it is away from the goal area, he can work in quick change of direction to have more optimal gameplay, overall a player with good mindset of a defensive player ', 'Rishi is a player with positive attitude in training,  he has improved in his reading of the opponent’s movements and has good final tackles, he can further improve in aerial ball control and decide when to control the ball and play it ahead and when to push the ball away when under pressure in the defense line, working more on change of direction will enhance the ability to quickly get back into shape and regain ball possession when under pressure, a player with consistent efforts to work hard and improve.  The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments '),
(1161, 1161, 'Aarav is in the development phase, he has improved in understanding the positional gameplay, he needs to work more in reading the game and move according to the ball, he can further work on quick passing and support play the move ahead and speed to quickly track back into shape when not in possession, overall has good attitude to learn and progress', 'Aarav is a player with confident approach in training, he can further work on positional movements on and off the ball which will develop the defensive gameplay, he needs to further work on quick passing and running into free space to move ahead with awareness of space to carry out the attack on winning ball possession, needs more work in speed training with and without the ball, he is disciplined and needs more focus in the areas to improve which will make his defensive gameplay more optimal and effective. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments .'),
(1162, 1162, 'Anuj is in the development phase, he has improved in his timing of the tackles and is more focused, he can further improve in the decision making to approach aerial balls and make sure it is away from the goal area, he can work in quick change of direction to have more optimal gameplay, overall a player with good mindset of a defensive player ', 'Anuj is a player with positive attitude in training,  he has improved in his reading of the opponent’s movements and has good final tackles, he can further improve in aerial ball control and decide when to control the ball and play it ahead and when to push the ball away when under pressure in the defense line, working more on change of direction will enhance the ability to quickly get back into shape and regain ball possession when under pressure, a player with consistent efforts to work hard and improve. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments   '),
(1163, 1163, 'Aryan is in development phase, he has improved in his movement with the ball and needs to work on getting into free spaces for support, working more in positive transitions will improve his attacking gameplay, a disciplined player with consistent efforts in training sessions ', 'Aryan is a player with good ball manipulation and has good ability to change direction with the ball, he needs to further work in his combination play to keep ball possession till the goal scoring chance is created, he needs to work on his off the ball movement on winning the ball possession to quickly attack and create chances on goal for faster attacking gameplay, overall a coachable player with consistent efforts. The values appear 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments '),
(1164, 1164, 'Dhruvil is in development phase, he has good ability to change the direction with the ball and is quick in his passes, he needs to work on his shielding and protecting the ball which is vital for a forward and finish the chances created with quick decisions under pressure, needs to work on his aerial receives and finishing with headers, overall a hardworking player with good discipline', 'Dhruvil is a player with good attitude in training, he has good ability to make quick combinations and create chances to score, he needs to further improve in his ability to receive and take first touch away from the defenders and protect the ball to convert it into a cross or a shot towards the goal, he needs to further work in his Vertical Jump to meet the crosses for headers and finish, working on speed with the ball will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with good attitude towards training and working consistently. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1165, 1165, 'Mehul is in development phase, he has good ability to change the direction with the ball and is quick in his passes, he needs to work on his shielding and protecting the ball on receiving which is vital and finish the chances created with quick decisions under pressure, needs to work on his aerial receives and finishing with headers, overall a hardworking player with good discipline', 'Mehul is a player with good attitude in training, he has good ability to make quick combinations and create chances to score, he needs to further improve in his ability to receive and take first touch away from the defenders and protect the ball to convert it into a cross or a shot towards the goal, he needs to further work in his Vertical Jump to meet the crosses for headers and finish, working on speed with the ball will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with good attitude towards training and working consistently '),
(1166, 1166, 'Jonah is in the development phase, he has improved in understanding the positional gameplay, he needs to work more in reading the game and move according to the ball, he can further work on quick passing and support play the move ahead and speed to quickly track back into shape when not in possession, overall has good attitude to learn and progress', 'Jonah is a player with confident approach in training, he can further work on positional movements on and off the ball which will develop the defensive gameplay, he needs to further work on quick passing and running into free space to move ahead with awareness of space to carry out the attack on winning ball possession, overall a coachable player with persistent efforts in training and matches. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1167, 1167, 'Tushar is in development phase, he has improved in his movement with the ball and needs to work on getting into free spaces for support, working more in positive transitions will improve his attacking gameplay, a disciplined player with consistent efforts in training sessions', 'Tushar is a player with good focus, he has the idea to get ahead for support and keep the ball possession, he needs to be quick in deciding and scanning for the next pass under pressure and switch the ball into space where the chances of scoring is more efficient, he needs to further work on his speed with and without the ball to enhance his gameplay. Overall a coachable player with positive attitude in training and matches. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1168, 1168, 'Aarav is in development phase, he has good ability to make quick dribbles, he can further improve in his finishing technique and create goal scoring chances, he needs to further work on his quickness without the ball and approach the ball to score both aerially and on the ground, overall a player with good ability to be coached and has high potential', 'Aarav is a player with good technique of dribbling, he needs to work on quick decision making as to when to shoot and when to pass by making quick attempts on the goal, he needs to work on receiving of aerial passes and take shots creating effective goal scoring chances both in short and long ranges, working on his speed to receive quick passes will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with good efforts in training and matches. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1169, 1169, 'Tushya is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to read the game and get an understanding of the positioning, he needs to further improve in quick reaction during the transitions and move according to the ball, communication is key for adefensive player to maintain the defense line and be consistent in the tackles, overall a player with good eagerness to improve', 'Tushya is a player with good ability to read the game and has become better at it with training, he can further improve in the anticipation of the opponent’s moves and provide support for the defense line by being more proactive and consistent throughout to maintain a steady defensive approach, he has good aerial ball distribution and needs to work more on communicating with the team mates to have more efficient gameplay with more connect and understanding, a coachable player with consistent efforts. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1170, 1170, 'Dhanvin is in development phase, he has good ability to play accurate\r\npasses, he needs to further improve in his quick receives away from the opponents and aerial\r\nball control, he needs to work in his defensive transitions and be quick in getting back into\r\nshape, a player with good efforts during training and matches', 'Dhanvin is a player with good technique to pass and support in\r\ncombination with his team mates to maintain ball possession, he can further improve in getting\r\nback into shape quickly on losing ball possession and defend, while also quickly move ahead on\r\ngaining ball possession to create goal scoring chances, he needs to work more in his aerial ball\r\ncontrol and receiving technique where the ball needs to be protected, overall a player with\r\ngood potential to be an effective midfield player'),
(1171, 1171, 'Saptharshi is in the development phase, he has improved in his passing abilityb and needs to further improve in quick receiving and first touch, he needs to work more with the ball and aerial passes along with agility to enhance his defending skills, overall a player with good understanding of the position and good attitude in training', 'Saptharshi is a player with good positional understanding, he needs to further improve in his quick movements into free space and receive the ball with right angles to progress the attack quickly, he needs to work on aerial ball control and his awareness of space ahead to decide to make right choices to create goal scoring chances, he needs to further work in quick change of direction to enhance the defensive gameplay to read the movements of the\r\nattacking player and make well-timed tackles, he is a player with good attitude towards working hard and is consistent in his efforts. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1172, 1172, 'Vansh is in the development phase, he has improved in his quick receiving technique and can further improve in the pass and support movements when in possession and quickly track back into defensive shape when not in possession of the ball, working on agility and quickness will provide more optimal defensive gameplay, overall a player with consistent efforts to improve', 'Vansh is a player with good interest to learn and improve, he has improved in receiving on the run and is moving quickly with the ball, he can further improve in quickly pass and move into free spaces where the next moment can be made to create a goal scoring opportunity, the awareness of space is much vital for a player his age and will enhance the gameplay, needs more work on change of direction with and without the ball, he is a player with discipline and is working consistently towards development. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1173, 1173, 'Aaryaman is in the development phase, he has improved in his timing of the tackles and is more focused, he can further improve in the decision making to approach aerial balls and make sure it is away from the goal area, he can work in quick change of direction to have more optimal gameplay, overall a player with good mindset of a defensive player ', 'Aaryaman is a player with positive attitude in training, he has improved in his reading of the opponent’s movements and has good final tackles, he can further improve in aerial ball control and decide when to control the ball and play it ahead and when to push the ball away when under pressure in the defense line, working more on change of direction will enhance the ability to quickly get back into shape and regain ball possession when under pressure, a player with consistent efforts to work hard and improve. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1174, 1174, 'Abhishek continues to show a good understanding of his role and has improved his game awareness, passing, and finishing, his dribbling still needs development, particularly in terms of confidence and effectiveness in 1v1 situations. He should continue to work on tracking back with greater urgency and improving his heading ability. Overall, he maintains a positive attitude and is showing gradual progress.', 'Abhishek shows good discipline and understanding of his position. There is clear improvement in his awareness, passing, and finishing. However, he needs to develop more confidence and quality in his dribbling to take on defenders. His defensive transition has improved slightly but still requires consistency. Heading remains an area to improve. Overall, steady progress.'),
(1175, 1175, 'Agrim is in development phase, he has improved in his passing and receiving, he can further work in his first touch and protecting the ball, he needs to work in his quick positive transition on gaining ball possession to quickly play the ball to players ahead to create chances, he needs to further work on speed with and without the ball, a player with good potential ', 'Agrim is a player with good dribbling technique and can play quick passes, he can further work in his quick movement to receive away from the opponents and turn with the ball by protecting it to have better ball possession, he needs to quickly distribute the ball to the players giving runs ahead on gaining ball possession to create more goal scoring chances, a player with a positive attitude in training and matches '),
(1176, 1176, 'Lokshith has shown significant improvement in his defensive ability, particularly in tackling and decision making. He is more consistent in his actions and continues to show good focus in training. There is slight improvement in the use of his non-dominant foot. He should continue working on aerial duels and improving his speed in transition. Overall, he is progressing well.', 'Lokshith has improved strongly in his defending, with solid tackling and better decision making, his consistency has increased, and he shows good discipline in his role. There is slight improvement in his use of the non-dominant foot. He should continue to develop his positioning, especially in aerial situations, and improve his speed when pushing up and tracking back. Overall, very good progress. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1177, 1177, 'Kabir shah is in development phase, he has improved in his ability to quickly pass and support and is fast with the ball, he needs to further improve in his awareness of apace by scanning and make confident dribbles to score on goal, overall a player with good potential', 'Kabir shah is a player with good ball manipulation and has good ability to change direction with the ball, he needs to further work in improving his vision through scanning to distribute quickly to the players making runs ahead to create goal scoring chances, he needs to work in taking more shots when near the goal and decide when to shoot with power and when to place the ball away from the keeper also working in set-pieces, working on speed with the ball will enhance his attacking gameplay.'),
(1178, 1178, 'Shlok is showing a positive developmental trajectory, particularly in his ability to transfer training concepts into competitive match situations, his understanding of the game is improving, and he is beginning to make better decisions under pressure. Continued focus on tactical awareness and consistency will be key to reaching the next level in his development pathway.', 'Shlok has demonstrated strong competitive progress, performing effectively in high-intensity matches across both attacking and defensive phases. He has shown a clear ability to translate training-ground work into game situations, which reflects his growing understanding of the game. This development is a direct result of his commitment during training sessions and his consistent willingness to learn and improve. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1179, 1179, 'Prajwal continues to show good ability in passing and receiving, and still needs to improve his first touch and ball protection. Quicker transitions after gaining possession and improving his speed with and without the ball remain key areas for development. He is a player with potential but needs to show more consistent progress.', 'Prajwal maintains his strength in passing and receiving. He needs to focus on improving his off-the-ball movement, ball protection, and ability to play quicker forward passes. Increasing his intent to make forward runs and impact attacking play is important. Overall, he has a positive attitude. '),
(1180, 1180, 'Rishaan has shown promising qualities as a player who can impact the team in demanding match situations, his ability to handle high-intensity environments and maintain a positive influence both on and off the pitch reflects good character and potential. Continued focus on refining his technical execution and decision-making will help him maximize his contribution and progress further in his development pathway.', 'Rishaan has been an important addition to the squad, consistently demonstrating his ability to perform in high-intensity matches. He brings a strong presence on the pitch, contributing positively to the team’s overall performance, his attitude, work ethic, and influence off the field are equally commendable. Moving forward, we would like him to continue building consistency and take greater responsibility in key moments of the game. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1181, 1181, 'Ishaan ayyar is in development phase, he has improved in his passing and receiving, he can further work in his first touch and turning with the ball, he needs to work in his decision making to finish and quickly shoot the ball, he needs to work in using more skills while dribbling and attack effectively, a player with good potential .', 'Ishaan ayyar is a player with good receiving technique, he needs to further work in his first touch away from the opponent and turn with the ball by protecting it when keeping the ball possession and use skills to take on defenders confidently while attacking, he needs to work in deciding when to shoot and when the place the ball seeing the keeper position, he is a coachable player eagerness to improve with practice and is disciplined.'),
(1182, 1182, 'Soham is in development phase, he is a good dribbling player, he needs to further work in his quick pass and support gameplay to create chances on goal, he needs to work in his communication and awareness of space to make runs and finish on goal, a player with good potential and with consistent work can be an efficient attacker', 'Soham is a player with good knowledge about the game, he needs to work in his quick decision making as to when to pass and maintain possession and when to dribble into spaces, he needs to work in his finishing technique to finish on scanning the keeper position, working on change of direction with and without the ball will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with positive attitude in training and matches '),
(1183, 1183, 'Neil is in the development phase, he has improved in his passing ability and needs to further improve in quick receiving and first touch with scanning and awareness of space, and he needs to work in change of direction with the ball for better attacking, a player with good potential.', 'Neil is a player with good positional understanding, he needs to further improve in his quick movements into free space with scanning and provide quick options to create chances to score, he needs to further work in his communication to receive passes, confidently taking on players in 1V1 situations and taking shots will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with discipline and is consistent in his efforts. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1184, 1184, 'Vuhaan ] is in development phase, he has good ability to read the game and provide necessary runs into the free spaces, he needs to further work in is quick dribbling to manipulate the ball and create chances on goal,  he needs to be quick to track back and work in his heading ability, overall a player with positive attitude in training ', 'Vihaan is a player with good ability to play in his position and understand the role, he needs to further work in his dribbling skillset and take on players to play the ball into the goal area or take a shot whenever necessary, he needs to be ready to track back on losing ball possession and help defensively, working on his vertical jump and heading technique will enhance his attacking gameplay optimally, a player with good discipline and attitude towards working to improve. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1185, 1185, 'Aiden is in development phase, he is a good dribbling player, he needs to further work in his quick pass and support gameplay to create chances on goal, he needs to work in his communication and awareness of space to make runs and finish on goal, a player with good potential and with consistent work can be an efficient attacker', 'Aiden is a player with good ability to play in his position and understand the role, he needs to further work in his dribbling skillset and take on players to play the ball into the goal area or take a shot whenever necessary, he needs to be ready to track back on losing ball possession and help defensively, working on his vertical jump and heading technique will enhance his attacking gameplay optimally, a player with good discipline and attitude towards working to improve. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1186, 1186, 'Shubh is in development phase, he has good ability to read the game and provide necessary runs into the free spaces, he needs to further work in is quick dribbling to manipulate the ball and create chances on goal,  he needs to be quick to track back and work in his heading ability, overall a player with positive attitude in training ', 'Shubh is a player with good ability to play in his position and understand the role, he needs to further work in his dribbling skillset and take on players to play the ball into the goal area or take a shot whenever necessary, he needs to be ready to track back on losing ball possession and help defensively, working on his vertical jump and heading technique will enhance his attacking gameplay optimally, a player with good discipline and attitude towards working to improve. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments '),
(1187, 1187, 'Rishaan khan is in development phase, he has good ability to play accurate passes, he needs to further improve in his quick receives away from the opponents and be strong when defending the ball, he needs to work in his speed and he is a player with good discipline.', 'Rishaan khan is a player with good technique to pass in combination with his team mates to maintain ball possession, he can further improve in quick movements with effective receiving and first touch, he needs be firm in his defending and have a strong footing in his tackles, he needs to work in his speed to provide quick runs into free spaces and attack optimally, a layer with positive attitude to learn and improve with consistency . The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1188, 1188, 'Anirudh is in development phase, he has good ability to play accurate passes, he needs to further improve in his quick receives away from the opponents and take more shots when in range, he needs to work more in agility to provide quick support, a player with disciplined work ethic and is consistent   ', 'Anirudh is a player with good technique to pass in combination with his team mates to maintain ball possession, he can further improve in quick movements with effective receiving and first touch, he needs to take more shots when near the goal and sees and opportunity to create chances of scoring, quickly moving into spaces with change of direction will enhance his gameplay optimally, a coachable player with positive attitude in training and matches. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1189, 1189, 'Sourish is progressing well and showing encouraging signs in his overall development, his consistency in defensive actions, especially in aerial situations and marking, reflects a solid understanding of his role. He has demonstrated good potential during competitive matches. To take the next step, he should work on improving the speed of his decision-making and ball circulation, which will enhance his impact within the team’s playing model.', 'Sourish has shown very good improvement across all aspects of the game, his defending has been consistent, particularly in dealing with long balls and maintaining tight man-marking, which he demonstrated well during the Junior League matches. He is a very promising player with a strong defensive foundation. Moving forward, he should focus on quicker ball release to improve his effectiveness in possession and support team transitions. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1190, 1190, 'Anvith is in development phase, he has improved in his ability to quickly pass and support , he needs to further improve in his awareness of space by scanning and make confident dribbles to score on goal, overall a player with good potential.', 'Anvith is a player with good ability to change direction with the ball, he needs to further work in improving his vision through scanning to distribute quickly to the players making runs ahead to create goal scoring chances, he needs to work in taking more shots when near the goal and decide when to shoot with power and when to place the ball away from the keeper also working in set-pieces, working on speed with the ball will enhance his attacking gameplay .'),
(1191, 1191, 'Vivaan is in the development phase, he has improved in his timing of the tackles and is more focused, he needs to further work in his aerial duels which needs more practice, he needs to work on his speed to enhance his transitions, overall a player with good efforts in training ', 'Vivaan is a player with good ability to defend and has strong tackles, he needs to work on his movement according to the ball player aerially and grounded to position while defending, he needs to quickly track back into shape on losing the ball possession and anticipate the movements of the opponents to effectively defend the ball with more communication with his team mates, a player with discipline and consistent efforts in training and matches '),
(1192, 1192, 'Ishan’s versatility and commitment make him a valuable asset to the team, his ability to adapt to different roles and contribute effectively, especially during defensive transitions, highlights a good understanding of the game, his positive attitude and professionalism, both on and off the pitch, reflect strong character. Continued focus on refining his positional awareness and decision-making will support his progression to the next level.', 'Ishan has been a very versatile and reliable player for the team, always stepping up whenever needed. He has delivered impressive performances across all aspects of the game, with particularly effective defensive transitions that have helped the team maintain balance, his positive presence on and off the pitch is commendable. We also appreciate the strong support from his parents in ensuring his regular participation in training. Moving forward, we encourage him to continue building consistency and take more leadership responsibility within the squad. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments');
INSERT INTO `ci_notes_from_coaching` (`id`, `forms_id`, `notes_frm_tech_dir`, `notes_frm_head_coach`) VALUES
(1193, 1193, 'Sahanya has demonstrated good positional flexibility and the right mindset to adapt to multiple roles on the field. His contributions in wide areas, especially during attacking phases, have been valuable to the team. His exposure to competitive matches has supported his development and ability to handle intensity. To progress further, he should continue refining his decision-making in pressured situations, which will help him maximize his influence in both attacking and defensive phases.', 'Sahanya is a versatile player capable of performing effectively as both a winger and a wing-back. He has the mentality and work rate to handle these roles well, and he is particularly strong in wide areas where he can contribute in attacking phases. His impact during the Junior League has been significant, and he has shown the ability to perform in high-intensity matches. Moving forward, he should focus on improving his decision-making under pressure to further enhance his overall effectiveness. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1194, 1194, 'Dhruv is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to understand the positioning and movement according to the ball, he can further improve in his quick decision making of when to delay and when to head for the tackle under pressure, he can further work in leading the team from the back with effective communication, player with good focus and physicality', 'Dhruv is a player with good ability to read the game and has become better at it with training, he can further improve in the anticipation of the opponent’s moves and quickly engage in the defensive stance to time the tackles with more accuracy, he needs to further improve in his decision making to keep the ball possession or play the ball ahead away from the goal, he needs to work in his acceleration and change of direction for enhancing his gameplay, overall a player with good discipline and consistent efforts in training and matches. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments '),
(1195, 1195, 'Divyansh has shown encouraging development and possesses physical attributes that benefit his role, particularly in aerial situations, his progress in matches reflects his growing confidence and understanding of the game. To reach the next level, he should prioritize enhancing his speed of decision-making in high-pressure moments and work on his athletic development during the off-season. These areas will be key to maximizing his potential moving forward.', 'Divyansh is a player with strong potential, and we have seen clear improvements in his performances during matches, his height gives him a clear advantage in aerial duels, which he uses effectively. To continue progressing, he needs to focus on quicker decision-making under pressure and improving his overall athletic movements during the off-season. With consistent effort, he can further strengthen his impact on the game. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1196, 1196, 'Dhruv has continued to build impressively on his recent progress, showing clear signs of refinement and consistency in his overall game, his approach to training remains highly professional, and he has embraced feedback with the same openness and determination that make him such a coachable player. This period has seen him take another step forward in his decision-making, particularly under pressure, where he is now displaying greater clarity and confidence.\r\nTechnically, he is executing with increased precision, and his tactical understanding is translating more effectively into match situations. His concentration levels have improved, allowing him to stay engaged and influential for longer periods throughout games. Dhruv is also beginning to take on more responsibility within the squad, communicating well and leading by example through his work rate and attitude.\r\nOverall, his upward trajectory remains very strong. If he continues with this level of commitment and focus, he is well on track to establish himself as a key and dependable presence within the team.', 'Dhruv has continued to build strongly on the progress highlighted in his previous review and has further cemented his place as an integral member of our Elite League U18 squad. Over the past three months, he has shown clear improvements in both consistency and confidence, applying his strengths more effectively in competitive match situations, his tactical understanding remains a key asset, and he is now demonstrating even greater awareness and discipline within different systems. Dhruv’s versatility continues to benefit the team, as he performs reliably across multiple positions while maintaining clarity in his roles and responsibilities.\r\nEncouragingly, his leadership and mental attributes have taken another step forward. He is showing increased self-belief, communicates more confidently, and leads by example through his work rate and commitment. In challenging moments, Dhruv is displaying improved composure and resilience, often helping to steady the team and set a positive tone on the pitch.\r\nWhile there is still an opportunity to strive for complete consistency across all matches, his overall trajectory remains very positive. Dhruv’s continued growth, adaptability, and mindset make him a highly valuable member of the squad, and we are confident he will keep progressing into an even more influential role in the coming months.\r\nNote: Some assessment values are recorded as 0.00/NA as the player was absent during the testing session.'),
(1197, 1197, 'Over the past few months, Vishwak has continued to build positively on his earlier progress, maintaining good training attendance and contributing well to the team environment. He has shown increasing confidence in his play, with more frequent moments where his technical ability and understanding of the game are clearly evident during matches. Encouragingly, he is beginning to apply his strengths with greater intent, and his involvement in games has become more noticeable. His attitude and willingness to work continue to support his development in a positive way.\r\nTo take the next step, Vishwak should focus on improving his consistency, ensuring that he can maintain a high level of performance throughout entire matches. Developing this aspect will be key to helping him maximise his potential and become a more reliable contributor to the team. Overall, his progress over this period has been encouraging. With continued commitment, focus, and discipline, he is well placed to keep improving and make an even stronger impact in the months ahead.', 'Over the past three months, Vishwak has continued to make positive strides in his development, maintaining a strong attitude in training and showing growing confidence in his overall game. He has demonstrated his technical quality and game intelligence more consistently in phases, with several impactful moments that underline his ability to influence matches. His work rate and engagement have been encouraging, and he is beginning to translate his training performances more effectively into competitive situations. When at his best, Vishwak adds real value to the team with his composure and decision-making. The next key step in his progression is to develop greater consistency across full matches, ensuring that his performance levels remain high regardless of the situation. Achieving this will help him become a more dependable presence within the squad.Overall, his progress over this period has been positive, and with continued focus and commitment, he is well positioned to take another step forward in the coming months. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1198, 1198, 'Gurudev’s extended absence during the last assessment cycle has made it difficult to evaluate his development and track his progress accurately. Consistent participation in training and matches will be essential for him to get back into rhythm and continue improving. We look forward to seeing him return with regularity and focus in the upcoming phase. With sustained commitment and involvement, he will have a good opportunity to rebuild his momentum and work towards becoming a reliable member of the squad once again.', 'Gurudev was absent for a significant portion of the last assessment cycle, which has limited our ability to accurately measure his progress during this period. Regular attendance will be important for him to regain momentum and continue his development within the program. We are hopeful that he will return with consistency and commitment in the coming phase, allowing him to fully engage in training and matches. With regular involvement, he has the potential to build on his previous progress and re-establish himself as a valuable contributor to the team. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1199, 1199, 'Devarsh has had very limited involvement during the current assessment cycle due to a combination of injuries and academic examinations, which has significantly affected his attendance in both training and matches. As a result, a proper assessment of his progress during this period has not been possible.\r\n\r\nFrom previous cycles, he has shown clear potential and the ability to perform effectively when regularly engaged with the group. His defensive awareness and understanding of the game remain positive attributes.\r\n\r\nLooking ahead, it will be important for Devarsh to prioritise consistent attendance and full commitment to the programme. Establishing regular training participation will be key for him to rebuild fitness, regain match sharpness, and make the most of his potential moving forward.', 'Devarsh’s involvement during the current assessment cycle has been limited due to injuries and academic exams, resulting in low attendance across training and match sessions. As a result, it has not been possible to make a clear evaluation of his development or performance during this period. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments\r\n\r\nDespite this, he has previously shown good potential and the ability to contribute positively when consistently involved with the group. His understanding of the game and natural defensive qualities remain evident from earlier observations.\r\n\r\nMoving forward, consistent commitment to the programme will be essential for him to regain rhythm, build fitness, and fully demonstrate his capabilities. Regular attendance and sustained availability will be key for him to progress and make the most of his potential within the squad. \r\nNote: Some assessment values are recorded as 0.00/NA as the player was absent during the testing session.'),
(1200, 1200, 'Karthick has demonstrated strong impact and importance within the team structure, contributing significantly on both ends of the pitch, his delivery from wide areas and effectiveness in set-play situations, particularly long throw-ins, add a valuable dimension to the team’s play. As he continues to develop, improving his anticipation and reading of long balls during defensive transitions will be key to elevating his overall performance and consistency.', 'Karthick has been a key player for the squad, and his contribution to the team has been massive in both attacking and defensive phases, his crosses have been very effective, and his long throw-ins have consistently created opportunities, playing an important role in our progress during the Junior League. To further improve, he should focus on better reading of long balls during defensive transitions, which will strengthen his overall defensive reliability.'),
(1201, 1201, 'Rishaan is in the development phase, he has improved in his movement with the ball, he can further improve in his transitions which is a vital part for a player his age, he needs to work more in the attacking part of the defense which is with the ball and provide passes to enhance the quick attacks on gaining ball possession, overall a coachable player with consistent efforts ', 'Rishaan is a player with good defending ability, he needs to work in passing and support gameplay on gaining all possession to quickly attack to create goal scoring chances, he needs to work in making quick runs into free spaces and communicate for the ball also quickly track back into shape on losing the ball possession, working on aerial passes both in long and short ranges will enhance his defending gameplay, a player with good attitude towards hard work and discipline. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments '),
(1202, 1202, 'Kahaan has shown encouraging progress and versatility, with the ability to influence the game in both attacking and defensive situations, his left-footed quality adds value, and his defensive transition work reflects a good understanding of the game. As he develops further, improving his speed of thought and decision-making in high-pressure situations will be key to elevating his performance to the next level.', 'Kahaan is a player with a strong left foot who can contribute effectively in both attacking and defensive roles. We have seen good development during the Junior League matches, where he demonstrated his ability in both phases of the game, his defensive transitions, especially his recovery runs, have been very effective. To continue improving, he should focus on quicker decision-making under pressure to enhance his overall impact. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1203, 1203, 'Rayansh has demonstrated strong qualities in his role as a defensive midfielder, particularly through his work rate, resilience, and willingness to compete, his ability to break up play and support the team defensively has been valuable. Moving forward, developing his attacking involvement and making quicker decisions in transition after winning the ball will be key areas for his continued progression.', 'Rayansh has been a key defensive midfielder for the squad, consistently contributing when the team needs him most, his work rate has been outstanding, and he shows a brave and committed mindset in his performances. To further enhance his game, he should focus on his attacking contribution and improve his speed of decision-making after regaining possession. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments\r\n'),
(1204, 1204, 'Naitik has demonstrated solid defensive qualities and a good understanding of his responsibilities within the team structure, his consistency in marking and defensive positioning is encouraging. To progress to the next level, he should work on his transition play, particularly improving his awareness and decision-making in possession after regaining the ball, which will enhance his overall impact on the game.', 'Naitik has been a valuable addition to the squad, with a strong defensive contribution, his man-marking and understanding of his defensive role have been very good, and he has shown reliability in key moments. To further improve, he should focus on his attacking contribution especially his decision-making after winning the ball, in terms of when and where to play.'),
(1205, 1205, 'Yagya has demonstrated strong character and a positive approach to his development, his ability to read the game and manage tempo is a valuable quality for the team, his attitude and work ethic, both on and off the pitch, are commendable. To continue progressing, he should work on making quicker and more effective decisions in high-pressure situations, which will enhance his overall impact in competitive matches.', 'Yagya has been a great addition to the squad, his calm and hardworking mindset has helped him develop well across all aspects of the game. He shows good understanding in controlling the tempo, knowing when to slow the game down and manage pressure. We are very pleased with his attitude on and off the pitch. Moving forward, he should focus on improving his speed of decision-making under pressure to further elevate his performance.'),
(1206, 1206, 'Mehul has shown strong attacking qualities and has contributed well from wide areas, particularly with his ability to create and finish opportunities, his positive attitude and approach to the game are commendable. Moving forward, improving his defensive contribution and off-the-ball movement will be key areas of development, helping him enhance his overall effectiveness and consistency within the team structure.', 'Mehul has been a very effective left winger for the squad, his sharp turns, long-range shots, and quality of crosses have made a strong impact during the Junior League games, his attitude on and off the pitch has also been very positive. To continue improving, he should focus on his defensive transitions and work on his movement off the ball to become a more complete player. I wish Mehul a wonderful football journey in Ireland. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments\r\n'),
(1207, 1207, 'Vedant has shown promising qualities, particularly in his attacking play, where his creativity and close control stand out, his ability to be unpredictable adds value to the team’s offensive approach. For continued development, he needs to refine his decision-making in possession and improve his defensive transition work. These areas will be key to becoming a more consistent and complete player.', 'Vedant has good potential, which has been clearly evident in training sessions, his attacking movements are unpredictable, and his close ball control makes it difficult for opponents to defend against him. To take the next step, he should focus on improving his decision-making on the ball and work on his defensive transitions to contribute more effectively in all phases of the game. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1208, 1208, 'Rooshik is in the development phase, he has improved in his movement with the ball, he can further improve in his transitions which is a vital part for a player his age, he needs to work more in the attacking part of the defense which is with the ball and provide passes to enhance the quick attacks on gaining ball possession, overall a coachable player with consistent efforts ', 'Rooshik is a player with good defending ability, he needs to work in passing and support gameplay on gaining all possession to quickly attack to create goal scoring chances, he needs to work in making quick runs into free spaces and communicate for the ball also quickly track back into shape on losing the ball possession, working on aerial passes both in long and short ranges will enhance his defending gameplay, a player with good attitude towards hard work and discipline. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1209, 1209, 'Nivaan continues to adapt to the demands of the U-15 level and is progressing steadily, his attitude and willingness to learn remain positive. He still needs to improve his decision-making speed, scanning, and ability to execute actions earlier under pressure. With continued exposure and training, he is expected to grow more confident and effective at this level. ', 'Nivaan is showing a consistent attitude and continues to adapt to the pace and physicality of the U-15 level. There are no major changes, but he remains committed in training. He should continue focusing on quicker reactions, faster ball release, and improving consistency in his first touch and passing under pressure. Overall, steady and positive adaptation. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1210, 1210, 'Shivang continues to show strong dribbling ability and has made slight improvements in his overall play, his decision-making and involvement in attacking phases have improved marginally. He should continue to develop his quick passing, communication, and spatial awareness to create more goal-scoring opportunities. Overall, he maintains a positive attitude and is progressing gradually.', 'Shivang shows good game understanding and has made progress in his decision-making. There is some improvement in knowing when to pass and when to dribble. He should continue working on his finishing, awareness in front of goal, and change of direction to become more effective in attacking situations. Overall, steady improvement with a positive attitude. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1211, 1211, 'Karthikeya has shown noticeable improvement in his defending, particularly in tackling and regaining possession. His confidence and technical ability have also improved during this period. He should continue to develop his passing and support play to contribute more effectively in attacking phases. Improving his overall fitness will be important to sustain his performance. Overall, he is progressing well.', 'Karthikeya has improved well in his defending and shows increased confidence in his overall play. His technical ability has developed, and he is more comfortable in possession. He should continue working on his positioning and distribution to support attacking play. Fitness remains a key area to improve to maintain consistency and intensity. Overall, good progress. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1212, 1212, 'Mridhul has shown improvement in his tackling and ability to regain possession. He continues to show good potential and a positive approach in training. He should further develop his passing and support play to contribute more effectively in attacking phases. Overall, steady progress.', 'Mridhul has improved in his tackling and defensive actions. He maintains a confident and disciplined approach in training. He should continue working on his positioning and distribution to support attacking play more effectively. Overall, gradual improvement. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1213, 1213, 'Hashir is in development phase, he has improved in his movement with the ball with good decision making, he needs to further work in his quick passes in long and short ranges with awareness of space, he needs to work in his endurance which is vital for his age, a coachable player with positive attitude in training', 'Hashir is a player with good focus in training sessions, he has good ball distribution in close range and maintain ball possession, he needs to further work in his quick switching of ball possession into free spaces to quickly attack with aerial passes, crosses and set-pieces, working more on speed and quickness will enhance his gameplay optimally, a player with positive attitude in training and is consistent in his efforts. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1214, 1214, 'Eshaan has shown very good improvement in his defending and overall technical ability, his understanding of positioning and game awareness have developed well, and he uses his physicality effectively, his versatility across defensive roles is a strong asset. He should continue to improve his decision-making under pressure and work on his crossing. Overall, very positive progress.', 'Eshaan has improved significantly in his defending, showing strong physical presence and aggression in duels, his technical ability and versatility across positions have developed well. There is progress in his heading and long-range play. He should continue working on his crossing and consistency in decision-making. Overall, very good improvement with a strong impact on the game.'),
(1215, 1215, 'Prithviraj has shown good development and maintains a steady level of performance. His defending, particularly tackling and regaining possession, remains consistent. He should continue to improve his speed and technical ability to contribute more effectively in attacking phases. Overall, a player with good potential showing steady progress.', 'Prithviraj shows consistent performance and a confident approach in training. His defensive work remains solid, and he continues to follow instructions well. He should focus on improving his speed with the ball and overall technical quality to enhance his impact in transitions and attacking play. Overall, steady and positive development. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1216, 1216, 'Bishank continues to show good receiving technique and finishing ability. He should continue to develop his aerial passing, agility, and ability to change direction to improve his attacking impact. Overall, he remains a disciplined and coachable player.', 'Bishank maintains his strengths in dribbling and attacking play. He should focus on improving his decision-making, especially in choosing when to shoot or pass, and making more effective runs into space. Increasing his speed and movement will help enhance his performance. Overall, consistent but needs more development. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1217, 1217, 'Ved has shown significant improvement in his technical ability and overall game understanding, his confidence on the ball has developed well, and his versatility across attacking positions is a strong asset. He should continue to improve his scanning and defensive transitions to further enhance his impact. Overall, very positive progress.', 'Ved has improved strongly in his technical ability and understanding of the game, his versatility across wings, midfield, and attacking roles adds great value to the team. He is more effective in possession and shows better awareness in attacking situations. He should continue to work on his speed and communication to further develop his overall play. Overall, very good improvement.'),
(1218, 1218, 'Anand has shown steady improvement, particularly in his passing and receiving, his aggresiveness to win the ball back has improved during this period. He should continue to develop a better understanding of his role and positioning, along with improving consistency in his overall performance. Speed and ball protection remain key areas for development. Overall, positive progress.', 'Anand shows steady improvement and maintains a positive attitude in training and matches, his aggression and involvement in play have improved. He needs to develop a clearer understanding of his role and positioning, along with improving consistency in his actions. Continued work on movement, ball protection, and quick distribution will enhance his impact. Overall, gradual progress. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1219, 1219, 'Alakunta Guhan Sai is in development phase, he is a good dribbling player, he needs to further work in his quick pass and support gameplay to create chances on goal, he needs to work in his communication and awareness of space to make runs and finish on goal, a player with good potential and with consistent work can be an efficient attacker', 'Alakunta Guhan Sai is a player with good knowledge about the game, he needs to work in his quick decision making as to when to pass and maintain possession and when to dribble into spaces, he needs to work in his finishing technique to finish on scanning the keeper position, working on change of direction with and without the ball will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with positive attitude in training and matches. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1220, 1220, 'Pavan has shown noticeable improvement in his game understanding, positioning, passing, and defending, his ability to read the game has developed well, contributing to his overall performance. He should continue to improve his aerial duels and long ball distribution to become more effective. Overall, very good progress.', 'Pavan has improved well in his positioning, defending, and passing, with better understanding of the game, his reading of situations has become more consistent. He should focus on improving his aerial duels and long ball distribution to enhance his overall impact. Overall, good progress with a positive attitude. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1221, 1221, 'Vidharth Praveen is in development phase, he has good ability to make quick dribbles and create chances, he can further improve in his decision making to finish and work in quick transitions, he needs to work on his speed for better runs, a player with good potential ', 'Vidharth Praveen is a player with good dribbling skillset, he needs to work further in quickly taking a shot when in range of the goal and when to pass and create a batter chance at scoring, he needs to create more space by making runs into free spaces, working on speed will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with positive attitude in training and matches. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1222, 1222, 'Vihaan Kukreja is in development phase, he has improved in his movement with the ball with good decision making, he needs to further work in his quick passes in long and short ranges with awareness of space, he needs to work in his endurance which is vital for his age, a coachable player with positive attitude in training ', 'Vihaan Kukreja is a player with good football knowledge, he has good ability to play the pass when required and when to hold and dribble, he can further work in his passing technique in long ranges which is required for a player his age and will develop with more practice, working on match endurance will enhance his gameplay optimally to deal with pressure situations, a player with discipline and consistent efforts. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments\r\n'),
(1223, 1223, 'Mano Abhiram is in the development phase, he has improved in his passing ability and needs to further improve in quick receiving and first touch, he needs to work more in reading the opponent’s movement and time the tackles to gain ball possession, a coachable player with positive attitude in training  ', 'Mano Abhiram is a player with good defending ability, he needs to work in passing and support gameplay on gaining all possession to quickly attack to create goal scoring chances, he needs to work in making quick runs into free spaces and communicate for the ball also quickly track back into shape on losing the ball possession, working on aerial passes both in long and short ranges will enhance his defending gameplay, a player with good attitude towards hard work and discipline. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1224, 1224, ' Snithik is in development phase, he is a good dribbling player, he needs to further work in his quick pass and support gameplay to create chances on goal, he needs to work in his communication and awareness of space to make runs and finish on goal, a player with good potential and with consistent work can be an efficient attacker\r\n\r\n', 'Snithik is in development phase, he is confident in his dribbling and takes on players, he needs to work in his scanning ability to see the options ahead for the attack and create chances, he needs to work in his negative transitions which is vital and work in his speed ,overall a coachable layer with good potential. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments\r\n\r\n'),
(1225, 1225, 'Neel Mysorekar is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to understand the positioning and movement according to the ball, he can further improve in his quick decision making of when to delay and when to head for the tackle under pressure, he can further work in leading the team from the back with effective communication, player with good focus and physicality', 'Neel Mysorekar is a player with good ability to read the game and has become better at it with training, he can further improve in the anticipation of the opponent’s moves and quickly engage in the defensive stance to time the tackles with more accuracy, he needs to further improve in his decision making to keep the ball possession or play the ball ahead away from the goal, he needs to work in his acceleration and change of direction for enhancing his gameplay, overall a player with good discipline and consistent efforts in training and matches'),
(1226, 1226, 'Yuvaan Samarth is in the development phase, he has improved in his quick movements off the ball, he needs to work more in his attacking gameplay on winning ball possession as to support quickly in free spaces and move ahead, he needs to further work in his aerial and long range passes, overall a player with good potential ', 'Yuvaan Samarth is a player with good intent to improve with hard work, he needs to work in his quick runs into free spaces to support with effective communication during attacking play and be ready to get back in shape on losing the ball possession, he needs to work more in his passing accuracy in short and long ranges, he needs to work in his change of direction with and without the ball to enhance his gameplay optimally, a player with positive attitude towards hard work and learning. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1227, 1227, 'Ronav Mahure is in the development phase, he has improved in his passing ability and needs to further improve in quick receiving and first touch, he needs to work more in reading the opponent’s movement and time the tackles to gain ball possession, a coachable player with positive attitude in training  ', 'Ronav Mahure is a player with good positional understanding, he needs to further improve in his quick movements into free space and receive the ball with right angles to progress the attack quickly, he needs to work on his change of direction to well time his tackles with more physicality that the game demands, he needs to work on his strong footing and strength for effective defending gameplay, he needs to improve his speed with the ball during the attacking moments with more awareness of space and create goal scoring chances with quick attacking, a player with positive attitude to learn and implement. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments    '),
(1228, 1228, 'Aaron Ajay is in development phase, he has good attitude in training and needs to work on quick dribbling ability to take on players 1V1 and deliver a cross or a shot towards the goal, he needs to work on his speed to provide runs and create goal scoring chances, overall a coachable player with consistent efforts', 'Aaron Ajay is a player with good ability to pass and support, he needs to work in his awareness of space and receive with good first touch and improve his ball control to finish on goal effectively, he needs to quickly run into free spaces to move the attack towards the goal and create chances, working on speed with and without the all will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with positive attitude towards hard work and consistency. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments  \r\n\r\n'),
(1229, 1229, '', ''),
(1230, 1230, 'Rivaan Kambattais in development phase, he is a good dribbling player, he needs to further work in his quick pass and support gameplay to create chances on goal, he needs to work in his communication and awareness of space to make runs and finish on goal, a player with good potential and with consistent work he can be an efficient attacker', 'Rivaan Kambatta is a player with good knowledge about the game, he needs to work in his quick decision making as to when to pass and maintain possession and when to dribble into spaces, he needs to work in his finishing technique to finish on scanning the keeper position, working on change of direction with and without the ball will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with positive attitude in training and matches '),
(1231, 1231, 'Zavian  is in development phase, he has improved in his ability to quickly pass and support and is fast with the ball, he needs to further improve in his vision by scanning and communicate when supporting to have better ball possession, overall a player with good potential ', 'Zavian is a player with good focus in training sessions, he has good ball distribution in close range and maintain ball possession, he needs to further work in his quick switching of ball possession into free spaces to quickly attack with aerial passes, crosses and set-pieces, working more on speed and quickness will enhance his gameplay optimally, a player with positive attitude in training and is consistent in his efforts '),
(1232, 1232, 'Kundan Raj is a player with good focus in training sessions, he has good ball distribution in close range and maintain ball possession, he needs to further work in his quick switching of ball possession into free spaces to quickly attack with aerial passes, crosses and set-pieces, working more on speed and quickness will enhance his gameplay optimally, a player with positive attitude in training and is consistent in his efforts \r\n\r\n', 'Kundan Raj is a player with good focus in training sessions, he has good ball distribution in close range and maintain ball possession, he needs to further work in his quick switching of ball possession into free spaces to quickly attack with aerial passes, crosses and set-pieces, working more on speed and quickness will enhance his gameplay optimally, a player with positive attitude in training and is consistent in his efforts. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1233, 1233, 'Vihaan continues to show a good understanding of his role and movement into free spaces. There is steady progression in his overall attacking play. He should continue to develop his dribbling to be more effective in 1v1 situations, along with improving his defensive transition and heading ability. Overall, positive and encouraging progress.', 'Vihaan shows good discipline and understanding of his position. There is steady improvement in his attacking involvement and presence in goal-scoring areas. He should continue working on his dribbling, defensive contribution, and aerial ability to become more effective overall. Positive attitude and consistent effort. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1234, 1234, 'Prathym continues to show a positive attitude in training. He should focus on improving his physical speed and timing of tackles to be more effective defensively. Development in first touch and game reading remains important. ', 'Prathym maintains a good attitude and understanding of his position. He needs to work on his physical speed, timing of tackles, and overall defensive effectiveness. Improving movement and consistency in his actions will be key for his development. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1235, 1235, 'Yagyesh has shown good improvement in his overall attacking play, particularly in his speed on the ball and 1v1 ability, his positioning and decision-making have also developed positively. He should continue to refine his crossing and overall execution in the final third. Overall, encouraging progress with a positive attitude.', 'Yagyesh has improved well in his attacking involvement, showing better movement, positioning, and decision-making, his confidence in 1v1 situations and progression with the ball has increased. He should continue working on consistency in crossing and final actions to be more effective in creating chances. Overall, good development and effort. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1236, 1236, 'Aadit has shown good improvement in his midfield positioning and passing, with better involvement in build-up play. There is positive development in his ability to impact the game from outside the box. He should continue to build confidence in attacking situations and improve consistency in his overall play. Overall, encouraging progress.', 'Aadit has improved well in his positioning and passing, showing better understanding in midfield roles. His attacking intent has developed, with increased willingness to contribute in advanced areas. He should continue to build confidence in front of goal and improve his movement and consistency. Overall, positive development with good attitude.'),
(1237, 1237, 'Agatsyasinh has shown good improvement in his work rate and overall attacking involvement, his movement and ability to contribute in the final third have developed positively. He is becoming more effective in attacking situations and shows strong mentality. He should continue to refine his finishing and agility to further enhance his impact. Overall, very encouraging progress.', 'Agatsyasinh has improved well in his effort and willingness to contribute, showing strong work rate and positive mentality, his involvement in attacking play and ability to create chances has developed. He is becoming more comfortable in attacking areas and shows versatility. He should continue working on his finishing and quickness to be more effective in front of goal. Overall, good progress with strong attitude. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1238, 1238, 'Arnav has shown steady improvement in his overall play, with better work rate and increased contribution in attacking situations, his understanding of positioning remains strong. He should continue to develop his decision-making, especially under pressure, and improve consistency in his actions. Overall, positive progress.', 'Arnav has improved in his work rate and involvement in the game, showing better impact in attacking areas., his reading of the game remains a strength. He should focus on improving his decision-making, particularly in choosing the right actions under pressure. Continued development in agility and reaction speed will support his overall performance. Overall, steady progress. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1239, 1239, 'Shohei is in development phase, he is good with his receiving technique and quick finishes, he needs to further work in his aerial passes to create goal scoring chances with crosses, he needs to work in his agility to take on players with good change of direction, overall a coachable player with good discipline   ', 'Shohei is a player with good attitude in training, he has good ability to make quick combinations and create chances to score, he needs to further work in his ability to confidently take on defenders and create chances with crosses and quick passes in the goal area, he needs to further work in quickly applying pressure to the opponents on losing ball possession, working on change of direction and quickness with the ball will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with hardworking nature and is consistent in  his efforts. The values show 0.00 since he was not present for the assessments  \r\n\r\n'),
(1240, 1240, 'Arjuunraj has shown very good development in his overall play, with improved tempo and greater impact in attacking situations, his involvement on the ball has increased, and he continues to show a positive attitude in training. He should continue to refine his decision-making and passing awareness, along with improving endurance to maintain performance levels. Overall, very encouraging progress.', 'Arjuunraj has improved strongly in his overall gameplay, showing better tempo and contribution in attacking phases, his effort and attitude remain positive, and he is more effective in possession. He should continue working on his decision-making and long-range passing, while improving endurance for consistency. Overall, very good progress. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1241, 1241, 'Akshat has shown improvement in his dribbling and overall attacking play, his confidence on the ball is developing, and he continues to show a positive attitude in training. He should focus on improving his decision-making, particularly in choosing when to dribble or pass, and continue working on his defensive transitions. Overall, encouraging progress with areas to refine.', 'Akshat has improved in his attacking involvement, showing better dribbling and intent in forward play, his shooting is developing, and he contributes positively in possession. He should focus on improving decision-making in the final third and work on his defensive transition. Continued training will help him become more consistent. Overall, decent progress.'),
(1242, 1242, 'Jyotiraditya has shown good and steady improvement, particularly in his attacking play and ability to carry the ball forward, his overall involvement in creating chances has developed well. He should continue to refine his decision-making in the final third and improve his speed to enhance his attacking impact. Overall, a player with good potential showing positive progress.', 'Jyotiraditya has improved well in his attacking play, showing better control when carrying the ball and contributing more effectively in forward areas, his decision-making is developing, and he continues to show a positive attitude. He should keep working on his movement and speed to further strengthen his impact. Overall, steady and encouraging progress. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1243, 1243, 'Divith has shown notable improvement in his defending, tackling, and overall game understanding, his positioning and reading of the game have developed well, contributing positively to his performance. He should continue to work on his physical strength and sprinting ability to support his abilities and maintain consistency. Overall, good progress.', 'Divith has improved well in his defensive actions, showing better tackling, positioning, and awareness, his understanding of the game has become more consistent. He should focus on developing his overall physical fitness to match his technical and tactical improvements. Overall, positive progress with clear areas to develop. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1244, 1244, 'Arjun has shown steady improvement in his game understanding and ability to carry the ball, his involvement in play has developed positively. He should continue to improve his decision-making, particularly in choosing when to pass or dribble, along with refining his first touch and speed. Overall, a player with good potential showing encouraging progress.', 'Arjun has improved in his overall gameplay, showing better understanding and confidence when carrying the ball forward, his attacking contribution is developing gradually. He should focus on improving his decision-making and consistency in the final third. Continued work on his shooting and movement will further enhance his impact. Overall, positive progress. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments\r\n'),
(1245, 1245, 'Akshaj has shown steady improvement in his defensive actions, particularly in tackling and focus. He continues to demonstrate good effort in training. He should work on improving his speed, decision-making, and aerial defending to enhance his overall performance. Overall, gradual progress.', 'Akshaj shows steady progress in his defending, with good tackling ability and discipline, his overall understanding of defensive play is developing. He should focus on improving his speed, decision-making, and aerial positioning to become more effective. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1246, 1246, 'Aidan has shown good improvement, particularly in his role as a defensive midfielder, his reading of the game is developing well, and he continues to show good potential. He should focus on improving his ball distribution, positioning, and timing of defensive actions. Overall, positive progress.', 'Aidan has improved well in his defensive midfield role, showing better understanding and awareness in reading the game, his contribution in defensive phases has developed. He should continue to work on his distribution, positioning, and timing of pressing and tackles to become more effective. Overall, good progress with a positive attitude.'),
(1247, 1247, 'Neev has shown good improvement in his overall play and continues to demonstrate a positive attitude in training, his versatility across defensive and attacking roles is a strong asset. He should continue to work on improving his speed and long-range shooting to enhance his impact in attacking situations. Overall, encouraging progress.', 'Neev has improved well in his overall involvement, showing better understanding in different roles on the field, his ability to contribute in both defensive and attacking phases adds value to the team. He should focus on improving his speed and developing his long-range shooting to become more effective. Overall, good progress with consistent effort. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments');
INSERT INTO `ci_notes_from_coaching` (`id`, `forms_id`, `notes_frm_tech_dir`, `notes_frm_head_coach`) VALUES
(1248, 1248, 'Advaith has shown improvement in his midfield understanding, work rate, and overall involvement, his attitude and effort remain positive. He should continue to develop his first touch, ball protection, and speed to enhance his overall impact. Overall, a player with good potential showing gradual progress.', 'Advaith has improved in his work rate and understanding of his role in midfield. He shows good effort and maintains a positive attitude in training and matches. He should continue to work on his movement, ball control, and distribution to become more effective in play. Overall, steady progress with good potential. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1249, 1249, 'Zane has shown very good improvement in his overall play, with strong development in his attacking contribution and work rate, his understanding of the game and movement off the ball continue to be strengths. He should focus on improving his 1v1 ability and dribbling to become more effective in attacking situations. Overall, very positive progress.', 'Zane has improved significantly in his overall performance, showing better involvement and impact in attacking phases, his work rate and understanding of his role have developed well. He should continue to work on his dribbling and 1v1 ability to enhance his effectiveness in the final third. Overall, very good progress with a positive attitude.'),
(1250, 1250, 'Abhinav has shown good improvement in his positioning, receiving, and overall work rate, his involvement in play has developed positively, and he continues to show good potential. He should focus on improving his scanning and long passing, including switching play, to enhance his overall impact. Overall, encouraging progress.', 'Abhinav has improved well in his positioning and ability to receive the ball, along with increased work rate in matches, his contribution in possession has developed, including better delivery in wide areas. He should continue to work on his scanning and long-range distribution to become more effective in build-up play. Overall, good progress with a positive attitude.'),
(1251, 1251, 'Vedant has developed a better understanding of his defensive role and transitions. He continues to show good potential and a positive attitude. He should focus on improving his fitness and overall consistency to enhance his performance. Overall, gradual progress.', 'Vedant shows a better understanding of his defensive responsibilities and positive transitions, his effort and attitude remain positive. He should work on improving his fitness, passing consistency, and overall involvement to become more effective. Overall encouraging progress. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1252, 1252, 'Aarav has shown good improvement, particularly in his defending and overall contribution in wide areas, his physical output and work rate remain strong, and his versatility, including roles in midfield, adds value to the team. He should continue to develop his decision-making and technical execution under pressure. Overall, positive progress.', 'Aarav has improved well in his defensive ability and continues to show strong work rate in both attacking and defensive phases, his versatility across wide and midfield roles is a positive aspect of his development. He should focus on improving his tactical awareness, positioning in transitions, and technical consistency to become more effective. Overall, good progress with a strong attitude. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1253, 1253, 'Rishik show good potential with his off-the-ball movement and willingness to support play. There has been no significant change in his overall development during this period. He should continue to focus on improving his attacking support, along with developing his aerial and long-range passing. Overall, maintains a positive attitude.', 'Rishik maintains a positive attitude and willingness to learn, his movement to support play remains a key aspect of his game. He should continue working on his positioning, communication, and passing range to improve his overall contribution. Overall, consistent level with areas to develop. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1254, 1254, 'Shubham continues to show good potential in his attacking play, particularly in dribbling and movement in wide areas. He should continue to improve his scanning, defensive transitions, and speed to enhance his impact. Overall, maintains good potential.', 'Shubham shows good attacking and wing play potential, with confidence in possession. He should focus on improving his spatial awareness, communication, and speed to become more effective in attacking situations. Overall, consistent level with areas to develop. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1255, 1255, 'Rayan has shown good defensive ability, particularly in tackling. He should continue to develop his aerial duels and improve his speed to be more effective in transitions. Overall, a player with good potential.', 'Rayan has demonstrated strong defensive qualities with effective tackling and discipline. He should focus on improving his positioning, aerial ability, and speed in recovery runs to strengthen his defensive impact. Overall, retains potential with areas to develop. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1256, 1256, 'Vivaan CK is in development phase, he has improved in his passing and receiving, he can further work in his first touch and turning with the ball, he needs to work in his decision making to finish and quickly shoot the ball, he needs to work in using more skills while dribbling and attack effectively, a player with good potential', 'Vivaan CK is a player with good receiving technique, he needs to further work in his first touch away from the opponent and turn with the ball by protecting it when keeping the ball possession and use skills to take on defenders confidently while attacking, he needs to work in deciding when to shoot and when to  place the ball seeing the keeper position, he is a coachable player eagerness to improve with practice and is disciplined.'),
(1257, 1257, 'Ishank is in development phase, he has improved in his first touch and receiving technique, he can further work in his aerial ball control and defending in transitions, he needs to work in his agility and positioning play, a player with good focus and discipline', 'Ishank is a player with a god ability to turn with the ball and has good first touch into space, he needs to work in getting back into defensive shape on losing ball possession since the positioning off the ball is vital for a player his age, he needs to work in his aerial ball control and heading technique, working in agility and change in direction will enhance his gameplay to attack and defend optimally, overall a coachable player with good efforts in training and matches.'),
(1258, 1258, 'Samarth Disan is in the development phase, he has improved in his timing of the tackles and is more focused, he needs to further work in his attacking gameplay by making quick passes in short and long ranges, he needs to work in his agility and change of direction, overall a player with positive attitude.', 'Samarth Disan is a player with good ability to defend and has strong tackles, he needs to work on his quick dribbling and passing techniques to make quick attacks and create goal scoring chances, he needs to work more in his aerial passing and crossing to enhance his gameplay, he needs more agility and change of direction to read the opponent’s moves and defend effectively with optimal positioning, a player with discipline and consistent efforts.'),
(1259, 1259, 'Ayaan pramod das is in development phase, he has good ability to read the game and position himself, he has good tackling ability to time the tackles reading the opponent, he needs to work in his quick passing when gaining ball possession, he needs to work in his agility and change of direction effectively to make tackles further, overall a player with good focus and positive attitude', 'Ayaan pramod das is a player with good movement off the ball and track back in defending, he needs to communicate with his team mates and lead the team from the back, he needs to build confidence during matches, he needs to quickly pass and support to attack on gaining ball possession, working on aerial passing will improve his attacking gameplay, a player with eagerness to work hard and improve with consistent efforts.'),
(1260, 1260, 'Mohammed salah  is in development phase, he needs to work in his basic skills of quick passing and support play, he needs to be ready for the next moment after the pass and create chances on goal, he needs to work in his attacking and defensive transitions , overall a player with positive attitude.', 'Mohammed salah is a player with good football knowledge, he has good ability to dribble , he can further work in quick passing and supporting , which is required for a player his age and will develop with more practice, he needs to work in quick scanning and support play after playing the passes, he needs to be more focussed during training session and help team in both attacking and defensive  trainsitions ,overall a coachable player with positive attitude.'),
(1261, 1261, 'Yatharth\'s dedication and technical baseline make him a highly valued prospect within our youth setup. Overcoming his recent injury setbacks with a dedicated return-to-play protocol is our top priority for his continued development. Once he achieves sustained football fitness, we expect him to become a reliable, core contributor to the squad\'s tactical system.', 'Yatharth is an incredibly hardworking kid who shows excellent mental discipline in training and maintains a technically good standard on the ball. It is unfortunate that injuries limited his match experience this quarter, as we would have liked to see him tested in more competitive tactical scenarios. Our immediate physiological focus is to build his robustness so he can consistently translate his strong training habits into matchdays. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1262, 1262, 'Arjun is at a critical juncture in his academy journey where self-belief and tactical adherence must become his primary focus. We need to see a stronger psychological commitment to the methodology and a willingness to step out of his comfort zone. With dedicated application, we are hopeful he can bridge the technical gap and better integrate into the team\'s structure.', 'Arjun is currently operating at a technically average level and needs to challenge himself more mentally to elevate his overall impact during sessions. Developing his tactical discipline is a crucial priority, as he frequently loses defensive shape and positional awareness during match-play. Building his confidence on the ball will naturally follow as he commits to improving his physiological work rate and foundational technique.'),
(1263, 1263, 'Eshaan displays the physical work ethic and technical tools we value in our development pipeline. His next developmental hurdle is strictly cognitive, requiring him to better read the game and understand collective tactical movements. We are confident that with targeted video analysis and positional coaching, his game intelligence will catch up to his technical ability.', 'Eshaan is a very hardworking player whose technically good foundation allows him to comfortably execute core actions during training. However, his match experience is currently hindered by a noticeable need for greater tactical discipline and spatial awareness off the ball. Bridging the gap between his strong technical execution and his mental processing of the game\'s tactical demands will be his main objective next quarter.'),
(1264, 1264, 'Anirudh\'s progression requires a supportive environment to help him build the psychological resilience needed for competitive football. Improving his technical consistency is important, but unlocking his confidence and communication skills is paramount for his growth. We will focus on encouraging his self-expression to help him become a more assertive and integrated member of the squad.', 'Anirudh has room to improve his fundamental technique and the consistency of his execution during high-pressure match scenarios. A major factor holding him back is a lack of confidence, which mentally prevents him from taking initiative and expressing himself on the ball. He also needs to significantly improve his vocal communication, as being a quiet presence limits his tactical integration with his teammates.'),
(1265, 1265, 'Auritro\'s leadership qualities and rapid development have been a major positive for the U13 squad this season. His technical and tactical ceilings are high, but he must prioritize specific football conditioning to meet the academy\'s physiological standards. If he commits to improving his physical robustness, he has the profile to become a standout player in our system.', 'Auritro has improved tremendously this year, showing great mental strength to step up and lead the U13 team by example during matches. He possesses very good technical potential and tactical understanding, but his match experience is sometimes limited by late-game fatigue. He needs to work significantly harder on his physiological football fitness to sustain his high-intensity actions for the full duration of play. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1266, 1266, 'Aarit\'s dramatic improvement is a testament to his unmatched work ethic and resilience over the past twelve months. The next phase of his development is purely psychological, focusing on building his self-belief to match his adventurous playing style. Providing him with targeted pressure scenarios in training will help him develop the composure needed for advanced competition.', 'Aarit is an exceptionally hardworking kid who has improved dramatically from last season, showing a highly adventurous spirit in his match play. Despite this growth, he still battles mentally with confidence issues and needs to learn to remain calm on the ball when put under tactical pressure. Bridging his technical ambition with emotional composure will be key to making his executions more physiologically efficient during intense moments. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1267, 1267, 'Alvin’s progress across technical and defensive metrics highlights a player with a very high ceiling in our system. To unlock his tremendous potential, we must implement a targeted physical development plan to enhance his agility and match stamina. We are highly optimistic about his future once his physiological profile aligns with his promising footballing abilities.', 'Alvin has shown good overall improvement, specifically enhancing his technical crossing, tactical transitions, and 1v1 defending during match scenarios. He possesses tremendous potential but is currently limited physiologically, needing dedicated work on his SAQ and specific football fitness. Once his physical conditioning catches up to his growing mental awareness and technical ability, he will be a highly complete player. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1268, 1268, 'Aaron is experiencing a common developmental plateau where the desire to impact the game is overriding his tactical discipline. Our focus must be on psychological support and stripping back his responsibilities to rebuild his foundational confidence. By guiding him back to the basics of collaborative play, we are confident he will rediscover his form and technical rhythm.', 'Aaron\'s technical execution has become a little choppy since last season, leading to a noticeable dip in his mental confidence and match form. Because he desperately wants to make a difference, his tactical decision-making suffers as he often takes on too much individually rather than utilizing the team. Our immediate goal is to simplify his role physiologically and tactically, helping him regain his confidence and re-integrate into our collective structure. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1269, 1269, 'Ashwin exemplifies the complete, modern profile we aim to develop at Alchemy, blending technical proficiency with immense work rate and leadership, his drastic improvements in football fitness and attacking intent make him a standout, reliable performer in our system. He is a cornerstone of this age group and is tracking perfectly for advanced integration into our senior youth methodology.', 'Ashwin is a terrific player and the unsung hero of the team, showcasing excellent technical ability and highly effective 1v1 defending. Mentally, he provides superb leadership qualities and couples his defensive solidity with very good tactical attacking intent during match play. Furthermore, he has improved his physiological football fitness drastically, allowing him to dominate his flank for the full duration of the game. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1270, 1270, 'Tomas brings an excellent blend of technical adventure, physical strength, and tactical intelligence to the squad, his goal contributions and transitional play prove he is adapting well to competitive league environments. Unlocking his vocal leadership is the final piece of the puzzle to make him an authoritative figure in the center of the pitch.', 'Tomas is a very smart tactical player with good technique who gained valuable match experience this season, rewarding us with a few important league goals. He is physiologically strong and adventurous with the ball, while also demonstrating excellent awareness during defensive transitions. To elevate his game further, he needs to overcome his mental quietness and communicate much more effectively to organize the players around him.'),
(1271, 1271, 'Avighna\'s technical improvements and transitional intelligence are very encouraging signs for his attacking potential. To truly capitalize on these traits, he must commit strictly to our physical conditioning protocols to raise his baseline football fitness. Enhancing his on-pitch communication will also be vital for his progression into a cohesive attacking unit.', 'Avighna has noticeably improved his technique this quarter and shows good tactical awareness during our attacking transitions in matches. However, his physiological football fitness is a limiting factor that prevents him from executing these transitions at a high intensity for the full game. Additionally, he must improve his mental engagement and communication to better synchronize with his teammates during fast breaks. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1272, 1272, 'Ayaan’s exceptional work ethic and coachability make him an absolute pleasure to have within the development system. Refining his biomechanical running technique will yield significant dividends in his physical performance and match longevity. Coupling this physical refinement with psychological exercises to boost his finishing confidence will round out his attacking profile.', 'Ayaan is a technically improved player who possesses a fantastic mental attitude, always willing to learn and working incredibly hard for the team. In match scenarios, he struggles with confidence in front of goal, missing tactical opportunities due to overthinking rather than a lack of ability. Physiologically, we need to correct his running mechanics to improve his efficiency and speed during his attacking movements. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1273, 1273, 'Jai\'s major year-on-year improvement demonstrates his underlying technical potential and dedication to his craft. Our developmental focus for him is primarily psychological and physical, aiming to instill assertiveness and improve his overall conditioning. As he builds his physical presence and mental aggression, we expect him to become a much more dominant force on the pitch', 'Jai has improved majorly since last season in his technical application, but as a very quiet kid, he mentally needs to open up more to connect with the team. Tactically and physically, he needs to add a healthy level of aggression to his duels in both training and match environments. Improving his baseline football fitness will also give him the physiological foundation needed to compete with higher intensity across the pitch.'),
(1274, 1274, 'Dhruv is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to make accurate passes, he needs to work in his aerial passing and finishing technique, and he needs to work in his transitions and agility for better gameplay, overall a coachable player with discipline', 'Dhruv is a player with good focus and ability to follow instructions, he needs to further improve in his quick 1V1 and create chances on goal with effective passes, he needs to work in his aerial passing to make quick attacks and finish with scanning the goalkeeper position to enhance his attacking gameplay, he needs to quickly track back on losing the ball and provide runs ahead when gaining ball possession which is vital for a player his age to implement, a player with positive attitude towards hard work and is consistent '),
(1275, 1275, 'Haridh is in the development phase, he has improved in his quick movements off the ball, he needs to work more in his attacking by making quick passes, and he has good shooting ability and needs to take more shots, overall a player with good attitude in training .', 'Haridh is a player with good reading of the game, he needs to work in taking more shots when in range of the goal and build accuracy, he needs to track back into position on losing ball possession to help in defending, working in communicating when free will increase his gameplay, a coachable player with good focus and efforts. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1276, 1276, 'Avyan is in the development phase, he has improved in his passing ability and needs to further improve in quick receiving and first touch with scanning and awareness of space, and he needs to work in change of direction with the ball for better attacking, a player with good potential ', 'Avyan is a player with good positional understanding, he needs to further improve in his quick movements into free space with scanning and provide quick options to create chances to score, he needs to further work in his communication to receive passes, confidently taking on players in 1V1 situations and taking shots will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with discipline and is consistent in his efforts     '),
(1277, 1277, 'Aiden alexander is in the development phase, he has improved in his quick movements off the ball, he needs to work more in his attacking by making quick passes, and he has good shooting ability and needs to take more shots, overall a player with good attitude in training .', 'Aiden alexander is a player with good reading of the game, he needs to work in taking more shots when in range of the goal and build accuracy,  working in communicating when free will increase his gameplay, a coachable player with good focus and efforts. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1278, 1278, 'Darsh is in development phase, he has improved in his ability to quickly pass and support and is fast with the ball, he needs to further improve in his awareness of space by scanning and make confident dribbles to score on goal, overall a player with good potential ', 'Darsh is a player with good ball manipulation and has good ability to change direction with the ball, he needs to further work in improving his vision through scanning to distribute quickly to the players making runs ahead to create goal scoring chances, he needs to work in taking more shots when near the goal and decide when to shoot with power and when to place the ball away from the keeper also working in set-pieces, working on speed with the ball will enhance his attacking gameplay. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1279, 1279, 'Kanishk has good ability to make quick dribbles, he can further improve in his finishing technique and create goal scoring chances, he needs to further work on his quickness without the ball and approach the ball to score both aerially and on the ground, overall a player with good ability to be coached and has potential', 'Kanishk is a player with good technique of dribbling, he needs to work on quick decision making as to when to shoot and when to pass by making quick attempts on the goal, he needs to work on receiving of aerial passes and take shots in both close and long range building the accuracy, working on his speed to receive quick passes will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with good efforts in training and matches. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1280, 1280, 'Manvith has improved in understanding the positional gameplay, he needs to work more in reading the game and move according to the ball, he can further work on quick passing and support play the move ahead and speed to quickly track back into shape when not in possession, overall has good attitude to learn and progress', 'Manvith is a player with good positional understanding, he needs to further improve in his quick movements into free space and receive the ball with right angles to progress the attack quickly, he needs to work on aerial ball control and his awareness of space ahead to decide to make right choices to create goal scoring chances, he needs to further work in quick change of direction to enhance the defensive gameplay to read the movements of the attacking player and make well-timed tackles, he is a player with good attitude towards working. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments\r\nhard and is consistent in his efforts'),
(1281, 1281, 'Daksh is in development phase, he has good attitude in training and needs to work on quick dribbling ability to take on players 1V1 and deliver a cross or a shot towards the goal, he needs to work on his speed to make more runs and create goal scoring chances, overall a coachable player with consistent efforts', 'Daksh is a player with good ability to pass and support, he needs to work further in his ball manipulation and confident dribbling to take on players in a 1V1 and 2V1 situations which is vital for a forward, he needs to work on his crossing ability to make sure the aerial passes reach the goal area or the team mates with adequate weight and direction, he needs to work on his speed for providing runs into the wings and create more options to score on goal, a player with good efforts and can be an efficient forward. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1282, 1282, 'Raunak he has good ability to read the game and position himself in free spaces, he needs to work in his communication and shooting technique which will enhance his finishing optimally, working on physicality will be a good approach to build overall attacking capability, a player with good attitude in training', 'Raunak is a player with good ability to play quick passes, he needs to work on his communication to receive the ball to create goal scoring chances after providing runs into free spaces and deliver a cross or a shot, he needs to work on his shooting technique to build more power and direction which will develop with practice, he needs to work on his physicality to be strong in protecting the ball from the defenders, a player with consistent efforts and is having a potential to be an effective forward player. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1283, 1283, 'Ayush is a player with good ability to play quick passes, he needs to work on his communication to receive the ball to create goal scoring chances after providing runs into free spaces and deliver a cross or a shot, he needs to work on his shooting technique to build more power and direction which will develop with practice, he needs to work on his physicality to be strong in protecting the ball from the opponents, a player with consistent efforts and is having a potential to be an effective forward player', 'Ayush  is a player with good focus, he has the idea to get ahead for support and keep the ball possession, he needs to be quick in deciding and scanning for the next pass under pressure and switch the ball into space where the chances of scoring is more efficient, he needs to further work on his speed with and without the ball to enhance his gameplay. Overall a coachable player with positive attitude in training and matches. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1284, 1284, 'Rakshan has good ability to play accurate passes, he needs to further improve in his quick receives away from the opponents and aerial ball control, he needs to work in his defensive transitions and be quick in getting back into shape, a player with good efforts during training and matches', 'Rakshan is a player with good technique to pass and support in combination with his team mates to maintain ball possession, he can further improve in getting back into shape quickly on losing ball possession and defend, while also quickly move ahead on gaining ball possession to create goal scoring chances, he needs to work more in his aerial ball control and receiving technique where the ball needs to be protected, overall a player with good potential to be an effective midfield player. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1285, 1285, 'Bhargav has good ability to make quick dribbles, he can further improve in his finishing technique and create goal scoring chances, he needs to further work on his quickness without the ball and approach the ball to score both aerially and on the ground, overall a player with good ability to be coached and has potential', 'Bhargav is a player with good technique of dribbling, he needs to work on quick decision making as to when to shoot and when to pass by making quick attempts on the goal, he needs to work on receiving of aerial passes and take shots, working on his speed to receive quick passes will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with good efforts in training and matches. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1286, 1286, 'Avinn has good ability to read the game and position himself in free spaces, he needs to work in his communication and shooting technique which will enhance his finishing optimally, working on physicality will be a good  approach to build overall attacking capability, a player with good attitude in training', 'Avinn is a player with good ability to play quick passes, he needs to work on his communication to receive the ball to create goal scoring chances after providing runs into free spaces and deliver a cross or a shot, he needs to work on his shooting technique to build more power and direction which will develop with practice, he needs to work on his physicality to be strong in protecting the ball from the defenders, a player with consistent efforts and is having a potential to be an effective forward player. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1287, 1287, 'Dheeraj has good ability to change the direction with the ball and is quick in his passes, he needs to work on his shielding and protecting the ball which is vital for a forward and finish the chances created with quick decisions under pressure, needs to work on his aerial receives and finishing with headers, overall a hardworking player with good discipline', 'Dheeraj is a player with good attitude in training, he has good ability to make quick combinations and create chances to score, he needs to further improve in his ability to receive and take first touch away from the defenders and protect the ball to convert it into a cross or a shot towards the goal, he needs to further work in his Vertical Jump to meet the crosses for headers and finish, working on speed with the ball will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with good attitude towards training and working consistently. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1288, 1288, 'Rishan is in the development phase, he has improved in his passing ability and needs to further improve in quick receiving and first touch with scanning and awareness of space, and he needs to work in change of direction with the ball for better attacking, a player with good potential ', 'Rishan is a player with good positional understanding, he needs to further improve in his quick movements into free space with scanning and provide quick options to create chances to score, he needs to further work in his communication to receive passes, confidently taking on players in 1V1 situations and taking shots will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with discipline and is consistent in his efforts. The assessment values show 0.00 since he was not present during the assessments      '),
(1289, 1289, 'Chirayu is in development phase, he has good ability to read the game and provide necessary runs into the free spaces, he needs to further work in is quick dribbling to manipulate the ball and create chances on goal,  he needs to be quick to track back and work in his heading ability, overall a player with positive attitude in training \r\n\r\n', 'Chirayu is a player with good ability to play in his position and understand the role, he needs to further work in his dribbling skillset and take on players to play the ball into the goal area or take a shot whenever necessary, he needs to be ready to track back on losing ball possession and help defensively, working on his vertical jump and heading technique will enhance his attacking gameplay optimally, a player with good discipline and attitude towards working to improve. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1290, 1290, 'Daivik is in development phase, he has improved in his passing and receiving, he can further work in his first touch and protecting the ball, he needs to work in his quick positive transition on gaining ball possession to quickly play the ball to players ahead to create chances, he needs to further work on speed with and without the ball, a player with good potential \r\n\r\n', 'Daivik is a player with good football knowledge, he has good ability to play the pass when required and when to hold and dribble, he can further work in his passing technique in long ranges which is required for a player his age and will develop with more practice, working on match endurance will enhance his gameplay optimally to deal with pressure situations, a player with discipline and consistent efforts. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments  '),
(1291, 1291, 'Prachet is in development phase, he has good ability to make quick dribbles towards free spaces, he can further improve in his decision making to finish and work in quick transitions, he needs to work on his speed for better runs, a player with good potential \r\n\r\n', 'Prachet is a player with good ability to play in his position and understand the role, he needs to further work in his dribbling skillset and confidently take on players to play the ball into the goal area or take a shot whenever necessary, he needs to be ready to track back on losing ball possession and help defensively, working on his vertical jump and heading technique will enhance his attacking gameplay optimally, a player with good discipline and attitude towards working to improve. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments '),
(1292, 1292, 'Satvik is in development phase, he is confident in his dribbling and takes on players, he needs to work in his scanning ability to see the options ahead for the attack and create chances, he needs to work in his negative transitions which is vital and work in his speed ,overall a coachable layer with good potential   ', 'Satvik is a player with good positioning and dribbling skillset, he needs to further work in his awareness of space and look for options to create goal scoring chances with finishing with crosses and provide options to score when in range with the goal, working on speed will improve in his attacking gameplay to provide quick runs on gaining ball possession, he needs to communicate when moving into free spaces and demand for the ball for attacking optimally, a player with discipline and is consistent in his efforts. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments  \r\n\r\n'),
(1293, 1293, 'Shreyansh is in development phase, he has good attitude in training and needs to work on quick dribbling ability to take on players 1V1 and deliver a cross or a shot towards the goal, he needs to work on his speed to provide runs and create goal scoring chances, overall a coachable player with consistent efforts', 'Shreyansh is a player with good ability to pass and support, he needs to work in his awareness of space and receive with good first touch and improve his ball control to finish on goal effectively, he needs to quickly run into free spaces to move the attack towards the goal and create chances, working on speed with and without the all will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with positive attitude towards hard work and consistency. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments  \r\n\r\n'),
(1294, 1294, 'Akshay is a very coachable player with good attitude on & off the field . He has very good technical ability & tactical understanding for his age. He has good composure on & off the ball and his ability to compete in tough games both as a player & as a captain. He needs to keep training & keep working hard during this crucial season for him & his team. He can still improve his speed.', 'Akshay  has been a tremendous asset for the team. He has given a big boost to the defensive line in all the games he has played by bringing calmness & authority to the defensive line. We are extremely happy with his progress. He is extremely coachable :- he takes critical tactical information from the coaches and executes it very well in the game. He also has improved his leadership qualities. Furthermore, he can still improve his goal scoring from set-pieces. He can still improve his speed and recovery runs.'),
(1295, 1295, 'Akshay continues to show strong potential with his technical quality, tactical understanding, and composure on and off the ball. He remains a very valuable player for the team and continues to influence games positively with his decision-making and leadership qualities when fully focused. His ability to handle pressure situations and compete in difficult matches is still one of his strengths.\r\n\r\nOver the past few months, there have been periods of inconsistency in training intensity and application, which has affected his overall progression at times. Improving consistency in daily training habits, focus, and work rate will be important for his next stage of development. Despite this, he continues to be an important player for the squad and contributes positively both as a player and within the group environment.\r\n\r\nAkshay should continue working hard during this important phase of his development. Physical improvement, especially in speed and explosiveness, remains an area that can further elevate his overall game and help him perform more consistently at a higher level.', 'Akshay continues to be a very important player for the team and remains a strong presence in the defensive line. His calmness, composure, and authority at the back continue to positively influence the team during matches. He has maintained his ability to understand tactical instructions well and apply them effectively in game situations, which makes him a highly coachable player. His leadership qualities have also continued to develop, and he remains a positive influence within the squad.\r\n\r\nOver the last few months, there have been some inconsistencies in his training intensity and overall application, which has affected the consistency of his performances and progression at times. Despite this, he continues to be a valuable player for the team because of his experience, defensive qualities, and ability to perform in important moments.\r\n\r\nMoving forward, improving consistency in daily training habits and maintaining high standards throughout the week will be important for his development. He can further improve his impact during attacking set-pieces by contributing more goals, while physical areas such as speed and recovery runs remain key development points that can help elevate his overall performance level.'),
(1296, 1296, 'Over the past year, Aidan has continued to show a good attitude and discipline whenever involved with the team environment. He maintains a good understanding of his role and responsibilities on the pitch, and his crossing ability remains one of his key strengths. He also continues to show positive character traits both on and off the field.\r\n\r\nHowever, his overall football development has slowed due to irregular attendance and reduced involvement on the ground over the past months, with a greater focus being placed on academics and studies. As a result, consistency in training, match sharpness, and execution of his responsibilities during games have been affected.\r\n\r\nDefensively, areas such as 1v1 defending and defending crosses still require improvement, especially through regular training exposure and game practice. If Aidan is able to increase his consistency in attendance and maintain a stronger balance between academics and football, he has the potential to continue progressing well in the future.', 'Over the past year, Aidan has continued to show positive qualities as a player and teammate. His attitude towards the team environment remains good, and he continues to display discipline and professionalism whenever involved. His crossing ability and quality on set-piece deliveries remain strong aspects of his game.\r\nHowever, his development and consistency on the field have been affected due to irregular attendance and reduced training involvement over the past months, as he has been more focused on academics and studies. This has limited his match rhythm and overall progression compared to the strong progress he had shown previously. Despite this, he remains a valued member of the squad and continues to contribute positively whenever available.\r\nFrom a development perspective, areas such as 1v1 defending, composure on the ball, and recovery runs still require further improvement. Regular training exposure and consistent game time will be important for him to continue progressing and regain momentum in his football development.'),
(1297, 1297, 'Due to very limited training attendance and reduced involvement with the squad, it has been difficult to properly assess his overall development and current performance level during this period. His lack of regular training exposure has affected his match sharpness, consistency, and opportunity for improvement in key development areas.\r\n\r\nDefensively, aspects such as 1v1 defending and defending crosses remain areas that require continued work and regular practice. Increased consistency in attendance and involvement on the ground will be important for him to regain momentum in his football development and allow for a clearer assessment of his progress moving forward.', 'his very limited attendance and reduced participation in training sessions have made it difficult to accurately evaluate his current level of development and overall progress. The lack of regular involvement on the field has impacted continuity in his performances and limited opportunities for assessment by the coaching staff.\r\n\r\nKey improvement areas such as 1v1 defending, composure under pressure, and recovery runs still require attention and consistent practice. Going forward, regular attendance and sustained involvement in training and matches will be important for his development and for monitoring his progress more effectively.'),
(1298, 1298, 'Over the past six months, Yohann has continued to improve well and has shown good progress in his overall development. His attitude, commitment, and consistency in training have helped him make positive strides in both defensive and physical aspects of his game.\r\n\r\nHe has shown improvement in areas such as 1v1 defending, defensive positioning, scanning, and dealing with defensive actions like clearances and headers. Physically, his speed, agility, and coordination have also developed further, helping him contribute more effectively during transitions.\r\nYohann continues to show strong potential, and if he maintains his focus and work ethic, he can continue progressing into a more complete and impactful defender for the team.', 'Over the past six months, Yohann has continued to show good progress in his overall development. Despite a period out due to injury, he maintained a positive attitude and remained committed whenever involved with the team. His discipline, work ethic, and willingness to take coaching information on board continue to be strong qualities.\r\nHe has shown improvement in his communication, maturity, and understanding of the game, while continuing to develop defensively in challenging situations. Areas such as defending under pressure and aerial duels can still improve further with continued exposure and consistent training.\r\nOverall, Yohann has had a positive period of development, and with continued hard work and consistency, he is capable of making an even greater impact for the team moving forward.'),
(1299, 1299, 'Over the past six months, Wanshanbok has continued to show good qualities both as a player and as an individual within the team environment. He remains a coachable player with good technical ability, tactical understanding, and composure on and off the ball. His ability to compete in difficult matches and positively influence the group continues to make him a valuable member of the squad.', 'Wanshanbok has continued to make progress in several areas of his game. Defensively, he has shown improvement in 1v1 situations, defensive positioning, scanning, and managing defensive actions such as clearances and aerial duels more effectively.\r\n\r\nPhysically, there has also been positive development in his speed, agility, and coordination, which has helped him contribute better during defensive and attacking transitions. With greater consistency in training and continued focus on his development, he has the potential to further strengthen his overall impact for the team.'),
(1300, 1300, 'During the past six months, Wanshanbok has continued to demonstrate positive qualities both on and off the field. He remains a highly coachable player with strong technical ability, good tactical awareness, and calmness in possession as well as in challenging match situations. His competitiveness and influence within the group continue to make him a valuable part of the team.\r\nAt the same time, inconsistency in training attendance and daily application has impacted the rhythm of his development during this period. Despite these challenges, he still contributes well whenever available and continues to play an important role within the squad environment.\r\nTo continue progressing, greater consistency in training habits and maintaining strong intensity levels throughout the week will be important. Further improvement in physical areas such as speed and explosiveness can also help raise his overall level and effectiveness during matches.', 'During the last six months, Wanshanbok has shown steady improvement in multiple aspects of his performance. His defensive understanding has progressed, particularly in areas such as 1v1 defending, positioning, awareness through scanning, and handling defensive situations including clearances and headers.\r\n\r\nHe has also developed physically, with noticeable improvement in his movement, agility, speed, and overall coordination, allowing him to be more effective during transition phases of the game. Continued commitment to training and consistent application will help him build further on this progress and enhance his overall contribution to the team.'),
(1301, 1301, 'Wanshanbok has shown clear improvement in several important aspects of his game. His defensive awareness has developed well, especially in situations involving 1v1 defending, positioning, reading the game, and reacting to defensive actions such as headers and clearances. He is becoming more confident and composed in dealing with challenging moments during matches.', 'His physical development has also progressed well, with improvements in agility, coordination, speed, and movement during transitions. These improvements have helped him perform with greater confidence and contribute more consistently in both defensive and overall team phases.\r\n\r\nWanshanbok continues to show strong potential, and with consistent effort and commitment to training, he can continue building on his progress and further improve his impact for the team in the coming period.');
INSERT INTO `ci_notes_from_coaching` (`id`, `forms_id`, `notes_frm_tech_dir`, `notes_frm_head_coach`) VALUES
(1302, 1302, 'Wanshanbok is in a key phase of his growth as a centre back and continues to display good potential for his age. He is a player who is open to learning, takes feedback positively, and works well with coaching guidance. With another year remaining in the U-18 category, there is still good time for his development to progress steadily.\r\n\r\nHe shows a positive mindset and willingness to improve, but there are still areas of his game that need continued attention. Communication with teammates, decision-making in pressure situations, and the quality of his defensive clearances are aspects he can further develop. Building more confidence to lead and take responsibility during games will also support his progression as a defender.\r\n\r\nOverall, Wanshanbok is a promising player who continues to develop well and has the right attitude to improve further in the coming years.', 'Wanshanbok is a developing centre back with good potential and a positive attitude towards learning. He is highly receptive to coaching and continues to improve steadily with guidance and experience.\r\nAs he progresses through this stage of development, he should continue working on communication, defensive clearances, and decision-making under pressure. Improving leadership and taking more responsibility on the field will also help his overall growth as a player.\r\nOverall, he is a committed and hardworking athlete who is progressing in the right direction.'),
(1303, 1303, 'Wanshanbok is a developing centre back with good potential and a strong attitude towards learning. He responds well to coaching and continues to progress steadily within the team environment.\r\n\r\nAreas such as communication, decision-making under pressure, and defensive clearances still need improvement, while developing greater confidence and leadership on the field will further support his growth.\r\n\r\nOverall, he is a hardworking and coachable player who is progressing positively for his age.', 'Wanshanbok is a promising centre back who continues to develop well for his age. He has a strong willingness to learn, responds positively to coaching, and shows good potential within the team environment.\r\n\r\nTo continue improving, he should focus on becoming more vocal on the field, improving his decision-making in difficult situations, and being more effective with his defensive clearances. As he gains more experience, developing confidence and leadership qualities will further strengthen his game.\r\n\r\nOverall, he is a dedicated player with a good attitude and the ability to continue progressing positively in the coming years.'),
(1304, 1304, 'Umang is in the development phase, he has improved in his passing ability and needs to further improve in quick receiving and first touch with scanning and awareness of space, and he needs to work in change of direction with the ball for better attacking, a player with good potential ', 'Umang is a player with good positional understanding, he needs to further improve in his quick movements into free space with scanning and provide quick options to create chances to score, he needs to further work in his communication to receive passes, confidently taking on players in 1V1 situations and taking shots will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with discipline and is consistent in his efforts.'),
(1305, 1305, 'Arjun is in the development phase, he has improved in his passing ability and needs to further improve in quick receiving and first touch with scanning and awareness of space, and he needs to work in change of direction with the ball for better attacking, a player with good potential ', 'Arjun is a player with good positional understanding, he needs to further improve in his quick movements into free space with scanning and provide quick options to create chances to score, he needs to further work in his communication to receive passes, confidently taking on players in 1V1 situations and taking shots will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with discipline and is consistent in his efforts.'),
(1306, 1306, 'Vihaan is in the development phase, he has improved in his timing of the tackles and is more focused, he needs to further work in his attacking gameplay by making quick passes in short and long ranges, he needs to work in his agility and change of direction, overall a player with positive attitude  ', 'Vihaan is a player with good ability to defend and has strong tackles, he needs to work on his quick dribbling and passing techniques to make quick attacks and create goal scoring chances, he needs to work more in his aerial passing and crossing to enhance his gameplay, he needs more agility and change of direction to read the opponent’s moves and defend effectively with optimal positioning, a player with discipline and consistent efforts. '),
(1307, 1307, 'Ishan is in the development phase, he has improved in his timing of the tackles and is more focused, he needs to further work in his attacking gameplay by making quick passes in short and long ranges, he needs to work in his agility and change of direction, overall a player with positive attitude ', 'Ishan is a player with good ability to defend and has strong tackles, he needs to work on his quick dribbling and passing techniques to make quick attacks and create goal scoring chances, he needs to work more in his aerial passing and crossing to enhance his gameplay, he needs more agility and change of direction to read the opponent’s moves and defend effectively with optimal positioning, a player with discipline and consistent efforts '),
(1308, 1308, 'Ashwik is in the development phase, he has improved in his quick movements off the ball, he needs to work more in his attacking by making quick passes, and he has good shooting ability and needs to take more shots, overall a player with good attitude in training ', 'Ashwik is a player with good reading of the game, he needs to work in taking more shots when in range of the goal and build accuracy, he needs to track back into position on losing ball possession to help in defending, working in communicating when free will increase his gameplay, a coachable player with good focus and efforts '),
(1309, 1309, 'Aaryn is in the development phase, he has improved in his timing of the tackles and is more focused, he needs to further work in his attacking gameplay by making quick passes in short and long ranges, he needs to work in his agility and change of direction, overall a player with positive attitude  ', 'Aaryn is a player with good ability to defend and has strong tackles, he needs to work on his quick dribbling and passing techniques to make quick attacks and create goal scoring chances, he needs to work more in his aerial passing and crossing to enhance his gameplay, he needs more agility and change of direction to read the opponent’s moves and defend effectively with optimal positioning, a player with discipline and consistent efforts '),
(1310, 1310, 'Leon is in development phase, he has good ability to read the game and position himself, he has good tackling ability to time the tackles reading the opponent, he needs to work in his quick passing when gaining ball possession, he needs to work in his agility and change of direction the effectively make tackles further, overall a player with good focus and positive attitude ', 'Leon is a player with good movement off the ball and track back in defending, he needs to communicate with his team mates and lead the team, he needs to quickly pass and support to attack on gaining ball possession, working on aerial passing will improve his attacking gameplay, a player with eagerness to work hard and improve with consistent efforts   '),
(1311, 1311, 'Kotaro is in development phase, he has good ability to play accurate passes, he needs to further improve in his quick receives away from the opponents and be strong when defending the ball, he needs to work in his speed and he is a player with good discipline', 'Kotaro is a player with good technique to pass in combination with his team mates to maintain ball possession, he can further improve in quick movements with effective receiving and first touch, he needs be firm in his defending and have a strong footing in his tackles, he needs to work in his peed to provide quick runs into free spaces and attack optimally, a layer with positive attitude to learn and improve with consistency '),
(1312, 1312, 'Siddharth is in the development phase, he has improved in his passing ability and needs to further improve in quick receiving and first touch with scanning and awareness of space, and he needs to work in change of direction with the ball for better attacking, a player with good potential ', 'Siddharth is a player with good positional understanding, he needs to further improve in his quick movements into free space with scanning and provide quick options to create chances to score, he needs to further work in his communication to receive passes, confidently taking on players in 1V1 situations and taking shots will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with discipline and is consistent in his efforts. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments    '),
(1313, 1313, 'Sidd is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to make quick dribbles, he needs to work further in his passing and supporting movement, and he needs to work in his agility, a player with good potential ', 'Sidd is a player with good ability to read the game and has good ability to dribble through in free spaces, he needs to work in his quick passing and support ahead for keeping ball possession and create goal scoring chances, he needs to work in his ability to shoot when near the goal area, working on his agility will enhance his gameplay, a player with good discipline and efforts to improve '),
(1314, 1314, 'Tanush is in the development phase, he has improved in his quick movements off the ball, he needs to work more in his attacking by making quick passes, and he has good shooting ability and needs to take more shots, overall a player with positive attitude in training and matches ', 'Tanush is a player with good reading of the game, he needs to work in taking more shots when in range of the goal and build accuracy, he needs to track back into position on losing ball possession to help in defending, working in communicating when free will increase his gameplay, a coachable player with good focus and efforts. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1315, 1315, 'Marios is in development phase, he has improved in his first touch and receiving technique, he can further work in his aerial ball control and defending in transitions, he needs to work in his agility and positioning play, a player with good focus and discipline', 'Marios is a player with a good ability to turn with the ball and has good first touch into space, he needs to work in getting back into defensive shape on losing ball possession since the positioning off the ball is vital for a player his age, he needs to work in his aerial ball control and heading technique, working in agility and change of direction will enhance his gameplay to attack and defend optimally, overall a coachable player with good efforts in training and matches. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments    '),
(1316, 1316, 'Daran is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to make quick dribbles, he needs to work further in his passing and supporting movement, and he needs to work in his agility, a player with good potential ', 'Daran is a player with good ability to read the game and has good ability to dribble through in free spaces, he needs to work in his quick passing and support ahead for keeping ball possession and create goal scoring chances, he needs to work in his ability to shoot when near the goal area, working on his agility will enhance his gameplay, a player with good discipline and efforts to improve. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1317, 1317, 'Steve is in the development phase, he has improved in his ability to read the game and get an understanding of the positioning, he needs to further improve in quick reaction during the transitions and move according to the ball, communication is key for a defensive player to maintain the defense line and be consistent in the tackles, overall a player with good eagerness to improve', 'Steve is a player with good ability to read the game and has become better at it with training, he can further improve in the anticipation of the opponent’s moves and provide support for the defense line by being more proactive and consistent throughout to maintain a steady defensive approach, he has good aerial ball distribution and needs to work more on communicating with the team mates to have more efficient gameplay with more connect and understanding, a coachable player with consistent efforts. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1318, 1318, 'Ansh is a player with good positioning and understanding roles, he needs to further improve in his receiving technique by being more aware of his space and movements with quality first touch to move the ball quickly towards the goal creating chances to score, he needs to work on his finishing to quickly decide when to shoot and when to keep the ball possession by not forcing a shot, working on agility and change of direction will enhance his gameplay by creating space to make effective attacks, a player with consistent\r\nefforts in training and is disciplined', 'Ansh has good ability to pass and support his attacking play, he needs to further work in his scanning and awareness of space while finishing which is of much importance and he needs to work in his quick change of direction with and without the ball for enhancing attacking gameplay, overall a coachable player with good football knowledge. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1319, 1319, '', ''),
(1320, 1320, 'Ranjiv has improved in his movement with the ball and needs to work on getting into free spaces for support, working more in positive transitions will improve his attacking gameplay, overall a player with good eye to information and he can further work in his speed with and without the ball ', 'Ranjiv has good ability to change direction with the ball, he needs to further work in his combination play to keep ball possession till the goal scoring chance is created, he needs to work on his off the ball movement on winning the ball possession to quickly attack and create chances on goal for faster attacking gameplay, overall a coachable player with positive attitude in training and matches. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1321, 1321, 'Shlok has improved in his movement with\r\nthe ball and needs to work on getting into free spaces for support, working more in positive\r\ntransitions will improve his attacking gameplay, a disciplined player with consistent efforts in\r\ntraining sessions', 'Shlok has good ability to\r\nchange direction with the ball, he needs to further work in his combination play to keep ball\r\npossession till the goal scoring chance is created, he needs to work on his off the ball\r\nmovement on winning the ball possession to quickly attack and create chances on goal for\r\nfaster attacking gameplay, overall a coachable player with consistent efforts'),
(1322, 1322, 'Moses has good ability to make quick dribbles, he can further improve in his finishing technique and create goal scoring chances, he needs to further work on his quickness without the ball and approach the ball to score both aerially and on the ground, overall a player with good ability to be coached and has potential', 'Moses is a player with good dribbling ability, he needs to work on quick decision making as to when to shoot and when to pass by making quick attempts on the goal, he needs to work on receiving of aerial passes and take shots, working on his speed to receive quick passes will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with good efforts in training and matches. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1323, 1323, 'Felipe has good ability to change the direction with the ball and is quick in his passes, he needs to work on his shielding and protecting the ball which is vital for a forward and finish the chances created with quick decisions under pressure, needs to work on his aerial receives and finishing with headers, overall a hardworking player with good discipline', 'Felipe has good ability to make quick combinations and create chances to score, he needs to further improve in his ability to receive and take first touch away from the defenders and protect the ball to convert it into a cross or a shot towards the goal, he needs to further work in his Vertical Jump to meet the crosses for headers and finish, working on speed with the ball will enhance his attacking gameplay, a player with good attitude towards training and working consistently. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1324, 1324, 'Aayushman has good ability to read the game and position himself in free spaces, he needs to work in his communication and shooting technique which will enhance his finishing optimally, working on physicality will be a good approach to build overall attacking capability, a player with good attitude in training', 'Aayushman needs to work on his communication to receive the ball to create goal scoring chances after providing runs into free spaces and deliver a cross or a shot, he needs to work on his shooting technique to build more power and direction which will develop with practice, he needs to work on his physicality to be strong in protecting the ball from the opponents, a player with consistent efforts and is having a potential to be an effective forward player. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments'),
(1325, 1325, 'Rayn is in development phase, he has good ability to read the game and position himself in free spaces, he needs to work in his communication and shooting technique which will enhance his finishing optimally, working on physicality will be a good approach to build overall attacking capability, a player with good attitude in training ', 'Rayn is a player with good ability to play quick passes, he needs to work on his communication to receive the ball to create goal scoring chances after providing runs into free spaces and deliver a cross or a shot, he needs to work on his shooting technique to build more power and direction which will develop with practice, he needs to work on his physicality to be strong in protecting the ball from the defenders, a player with consistent efforts and is having a potential to be an effective forward player. The values show 0.00 or N/A since he was not present for the assessments');
