(755, 755, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Ritvick has the potential to perform better academically but currently needs to dedicate more time to his studies. His occasional absences from class suggest a need for greater responsibility in managing his education. To improve his performance, it is essential for Ritvick to prioritize his academic commitments and establish a more disciplined approach to his studies. By doing so, he can enhance his understanding of the material and achieve better results.'),
