(762, 762, 4, 3, 4, 4, 5, 5, 'Nityam has been displaying a noticeable lack of interest, often allowing himself to be distracted by his roommates. His attendance at school is irregular, and he seems to lack enthusiasm in academic  activities.'),
(763, 763, 4, 4, 3, 3, 4, 5, 'Tushar needs to handle tasks with more care and focus, particularly in his academic performance. He has the potential to excel but must avoid distractions that could hinder his progress. With more dedication, he can achieve much better results.'),
(764, 764, 5, 5, 4, 4, 3, 5, 'Aarav demonstrates strong discipline and excels academically. However, he needs to improve his meal patterns to support his overall well-being. While he treats others with respect, it would benefit him to maintain some distance from seniors to stay focused on his personal goals.'),
(765, 765, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Tushya is a diligent and well-behaved student who consistently demonstrates a positive attitude. His focus on his studies is commendable, and he carries himself with respect and responsibility in all interactions. A role model for others, his positivity contributes to a constructive environment.'),
(766, 766, 4, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Prathyush needs to work on improving his discipline, as he currently exhibits a casual attitude. He should take on more responsibility and show greater maturity in his behavior. Additionally, he has a habit of disturbing others by entering their rooms at night, which needs to be addressed.'),
(767, 767, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Dhanvin is an enthusiastic and confident individual who brings a strong will to his endeavors. His positive attitude contributes to a motivating environment for his teammates and peers. He demonstrates excellent organizational skills, allowing him to manage his responsibilities effectively. With his proactive approach and determination, Dhanvin has the potential to excel further and make a significant impact in both his academic and athletic pursuits. Encouraging him to channel his enthusiasm into continuous improvement will serve him well in achieving his goals.'),
